window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df09"]={"id": "df09", "title": "Score Function：Fisher 几何与统计估计", "focus": "把 score 定义为对数密度的梯度场，建立 Fisher 信息、得分恒等式与奇异性分析；说明 score 在低密度区的爆炸与参数化策略。", "claims": ["s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)", "\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0,\\ \\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)\\ \\text{（Fisher 信息）}", "\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0\\ \\text{（在边界项消失时）}"], "topics": ["Score 的定义", "Score 与对数密度的梯度", "Fisher 信息", "Score 的几何：对数密度梯度场", "Score 的积分恒等式", "Score 的奇异性", "Score 与热力学", "Score 的参数化", "Score 的估计误差", "反例：低密度区 score 爆炸", "Score 与速度场", "Score 与能量模型", "代码：score 的数值计算", "代码：score 场的可视化", "与得分匹配章的接口", "本章推导链：score = 密度的梯度"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的定义\">Score 的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节固定如下记号。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B,\\lambda)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 测度空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为 Lebesgue 测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p:\\mathbb R^d\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为概率密度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=1$</span>。记概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=p\\cdot\\lambda$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)=\\int_A p\\,d\\lambda$</span>。随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim P$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节需要以下正则性假设，逐条编号并在命题中引用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(H1) 绝对连续性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll\\lambda$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 存在且可测。</li>\n<li><strong>(H2) 正性与局部可积对数</strong>：存在开集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus U)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>；并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(H3) 弱可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>，即其分布导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\log p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>）为局部可积函数。</li>\n<li><strong>(H4) 平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla\\log p(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Euclidean 范数。</li>\n<li><strong>(H5) 边界通量消失</strong>：对任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset U$</span> 及光滑截断函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(U)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,\\nabla\\log p)\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>，等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,\\nabla\\log p\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>。此条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,\\nabla\\log p$</span> 具有紧支撑或足够快的衰减时成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1.1（Score 函数）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 score 函数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s:\\ U\\to\\mathbb R^d,\\qquad s(x):=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\frac{\\nabla_x p(x)}{p(x)},\\quad x\\in U.$$</div>\n<p>此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Euclidean 梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是向量场，分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=\\partial_i\\log p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 的点上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 无定义；由 (H2)，这样的点构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-零测集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处定义的随机向量有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> 第一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的梯度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 依赖密度的绝对尺度，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正标量倍不变：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p=c\\,p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s=s$</span>。第二，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不是得分匹配中的回归目标本身，而是其被估计的对象；得分匹配构造一个参数化向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 去逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，二者的关系在第 15 节展开。第三，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 不同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 生成测度的传输，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是静态密度的一阶对数导数；二者在扩散模型中的联系由连续性方程与 Fokker–Planck 方程给出，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.2（Score 的坐标无关表述与变换律）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:U\\to V\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 上的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=q(\\Phi(y))\\,|\\det D\\Phi(y)|$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in U$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_p(y)=D\\Phi(y)^{\\top}\\,s_q(\\Phi(y))+\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\Phi(y)|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi$</span> 处处可逆。<strong>证明</strong>：由变量替换公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(y)=\\log q(\\Phi(y))+\\log|\\det D\\Phi(y)|$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求梯度，第一项由链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi(y)^{\\top}\\nabla q(\\Phi(y))/q(\\Phi(y))=D\\Phi(y)^{\\top}s_q(\\Phi(y))$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\Phi(y)|$</span>。逐分量写出即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不是无坐标意义的向量场，而是依赖坐标选取的余切向量场（1-形式）经度量识别后的结果；在第 4 节将以 Fisher 度量讨论其几何含义，本节只作定义层面的区分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-定义的必要性与良定性\">定义的必要性与良定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-定义的必要性与良定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.3（Score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处良定性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上有定义，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,s'$</span> 为两个满足定义的版本，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s'$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)。<strong>证明</strong>：由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p=0\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-零测集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\{p=0\\})=0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处有定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,s'$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的弱导数版本，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s-s'\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且作为分布等于零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s'$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-几乎处处于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>良定性依赖于 (H2) 的正性条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在某个正测度集上为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在该集上无定义，但该集为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-零测集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 仍可作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处定义的随机向量使用；然而若要以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为基准讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的可积性（如 (H4)），则必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 延拓为可测函数并在零集上任意取值，此时 (H4) 的期望只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处的值，不受影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-基本恒等式-零均值与-Fisher-信息\">基本恒等式：零均值与 Fisher 信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-基本恒等式-零均值与-Fisher-信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.4（Score 的零均值）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\int_U s\\,dP=0\\in\\mathbb R^d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H5)。<strong>证明</strong>：取任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset U$</span> 及截断函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(U)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。由 (H3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=\\partial_i\\log p\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s_i\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>。由 (H5) 的等价形式，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的分量为测试函数，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,s_i\\,d\\lambda=\\int_U \\varphi\\,\\partial_i p\\,d\\lambda=-\\int_U p\\,\\partial_i\\varphi\\,d\\lambda.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\uparrow 1_U$</span>（取一列截断函数单调上升），右端由控制收敛定理趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_U p\\,\\partial_i 1_U\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1_U$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内为常数），左端由单调收敛定理趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,s_i\\,d\\lambda$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,s_i\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)]=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 逐分量成立，故向量期望为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此处交换积分与极限用了单调收敛定理（左端）与控制收敛定理（右端，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,|\\partial_i\\varphi|\\le \\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|_\\infty\\,p\\in L^1$</span>）。若 (H5) 失效，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial U$</span> 上有非零通量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]$</span> 可以非零；具体边界情形在第 10 节的反例中处理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.5（Fisher 信息的 score 表示）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H5) 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\big]=\\int_U p(x)\\,\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2\\,\\lambda(dx)=:I(X)&lt;\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）的 Fisher 信息。<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H5)，其中 (H4) 保证右端有限。<strong>证明</strong>：由 (H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2\\in L^1(P)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\int_U p\\,\\|s\\|^2\\,d\\lambda$</span> 由定义直接给出，无需交换极限。右端即 Fisher 信息的标准定义（对平移族而言）；本节只把它作为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 诱导的量记录下来，其估计性质在第 3、9 节展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.1.6（Score 的协方差即 Fisher 信息矩阵）</strong> 在命题 9.1.4、9.1.5 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s(X))=\\mathbb E_p\\big[s(X)s(X)^{\\top}\\big]=\\int_U p(x)\\,s(x)s(x)^{\\top}\\,\\lambda(dx),$$</div>\n<p>其迹等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.1.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>，故协方差等于二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[ss^{\\top}]$</span>；迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{tr}(ss^{\\top})]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：对任意密度，score 的二阶矩矩阵的迹等于 Fisher 信息；它是第 3 节 Fisher 信息矩阵的入口，本节只作为定义的直接后果陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-一维-Gaussian-与-Laplace\">具体例子：一维 Gaussian 与 Laplace<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-一维-Gaussian-与-Laplace\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 9.1.7（一维 Gaussian）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp\\!\\big(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\mathbb R$</span>，(H1)–(H5) 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 指数衰减，边界通量消失）。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\frac{d}{dx}\\log p(x)=-\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n<p>验证命题 9.1.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[X-\\mu]/\\sigma^2=0$</span>。验证命题 9.1.5：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)^2]=\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)^2]/\\sigma^4=\\sigma^2/\\sigma^4=1/\\sigma^2$</span>，即 Gaussian 的 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span>。验证推论 9.1.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s(X))=1/\\sigma^2=I(X)$</span>（一维时协方差即方差）。</p>\n<p><strong>例 9.1.8（一维 Laplace）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{2b}\\exp(-|x-\\mu|/b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\mu$</span> 处不可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 处有尖点，故 (H3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{\\mu\\}$</span> 上成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\operatorname{sgn}(x-\\mu)/b$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 处无定义但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-零测集，命题 9.1.3 仍适用。验证命题 9.1.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 由对称性。验证命题 9.1.5：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)^2]=1/b^2$</span>，即 Laplace 的 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b^2$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\mu$</span> 处不连续且有界跳跃，这说明 (H3) 的弱可微性足以支撑上述恒等式，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的连续性并非必要；奇异性问题在第 6 节与第 10 节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只完成了三件事：给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 的定义及其坐标变换律；证明零均值恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 与 Fisher 信息恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>；用一个 Gaussian 与一个 Laplace 例子验证公式。以下内容不在本节展开，仅指明接口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第 2 节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的梯度关系系统化，并讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的零点附近的定义延拓。</li>\n<li>第 3 节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[ss^{\\top}]$</span> 提升为 Fisher 信息矩阵并给出其估计性质。</li>\n<li>第 4 节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 视为对数密度梯度场，讨论其在 Fisher 度量下的几何。</li>\n<li>第 5 节将证明积分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>（在边界项消失时），本节 (H5) 已为其预备。</li>\n<li>第 6、10 节将处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在低密度区的爆炸与奇异性；本节 (H2) 的正性条件正是为了避免在定义层面遇到该问题。</li>\n<li>第 8 节将讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的参数化；本节不涉及任何参数化形式。</li>\n<li>第 13、14 节给出数值计算与可视化代码；本节不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-定义在零密度集上的延拓与可测性\">定义在零密度集上的延拓与可测性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-定义在零密度集上的延拓与可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(H2) 只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上有定义，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 的补集是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-零测集。当我们需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的可测函数（例如在数值实现中构造数组、或在第 13 节做蒙特卡洛估计）时，必须显式规定零密度集上的取值。下面说明这种延拓不改变任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处的性质。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.1.9（Score 的规范延拓）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar s(x)=\\begin{cases}s(x), &amp; x\\in U,\\\\ 0, &amp; x\\in\\mathbb R^d\\setminus U.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.10（延拓的可测性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-等价性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s$</span> 为 Borel 可测，且对任意满足定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s=s'$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处。进而，若 (H4) 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\bar s(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)；(H4) 仅用于最后一句。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 为开集故 Borel，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\setminus U$</span> 亦然；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上由 (H3) 为弱导数版本，可取为 Borel 可测的代表（弱导数类中总存在 Borel 代表），在补集上取常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 不破坏可测性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s$</span> 可测。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus U)=0$</span> 因该集为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-零测集，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s=s$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处；再由命题 9.1.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s'$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s=s'$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处。最后一句：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\bar s\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2$</span> 仅在一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-零测集上不同，故二者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-积分相等，而后者等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 由命题 9.1.5。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：零密度集上的取值是任意的，任何延拓都给出同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-等价类。因此下文凡涉及期望，一律用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s$</span> 书写而不损失一般性；凡涉及逐点性质（如连续性、可微性），则必须回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-与梯度算子-散度算子的交换-一个预备引理\">与梯度算子、散度算子的交换：一个预备引理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-与梯度算子-散度算子的交换-一个预备引理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节要证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>，其核心是一次分部积分。本节先把该分部积分的技术条件抽出来，作为独立引理陈述，以便第 5 节直接引用而不重复验证。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 9.1.11（散度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-积分恒等式）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H3)、(H5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(U)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_U \\varphi(x)\\,p(x)\\,\\nabla\\cdot s(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=-\\int_U \\nabla\\varphi(x)\\cdot p(x)\\,s(x)\\,\\lambda(dx).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3)、(H5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi\\,p\\,s)=\\varphi\\,p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s+\\nabla(\\varphi\\,p)\\cdot s$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\varphi\\,p)=\\varphi\\,\\nabla p+p\\,\\nabla\\varphi=\\varphi\\,p\\,s+p\\,\\nabla\\varphi$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi\\,p\\,s)=\\varphi\\,p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s+\\varphi\\,p\\,\\|s\\|^2+p\\,\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot s.$$</div>\n<p>两端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上积分。左端由散度定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\,p\\,s$</span> 具紧支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>）为零。右端第一、二项之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,(\\nabla\\cdot s+\\|s\\|^2)\\,d\\lambda$</span>，第三项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot s\\,d\\lambda$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,(\\nabla\\cdot s+\\|s\\|^2)\\,d\\lambda=-\\int_U p\\,\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot s\\,d\\lambda.$$</div>\n<p>再由 (H5) 的等价形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,s\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>，右端为零，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,(\\nabla\\cdot s+\\|s\\|^2)\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>。另一方面，把 (H5) 用于测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 与向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的每个分量，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,\\|s\\|^2\\,d\\lambda=-\\int_U p\\,\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot s\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>。两式相减即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U \\varphi\\,p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>，而所证等式右端亦为零，故等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此处用到两次 (H5)：一次作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\varphi\\,p\\,\\|s\\|^2=0$</span>，一次作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,s$</span> 得到右端为零。若 (H5) 失效，则引理给出的两个积分一般不为零，其差恰为边界通量项；这正是第 10 节反例的出发点。注意引理的结论比第 5 节所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 更强：它对每个测试函数成立，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\uparrow 1_U$</span> 即得期望形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-尺度不变性与仿射变换下的显式公式\">尺度不变性与仿射变换下的显式公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-尺度不变性与仿射变换下的显式公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.12（仿射变换下的 score）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=AX+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim P$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)=p(A^{-1}(y-b))\\,|\\det A|^{-1}$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=A^{-\\top}\\,s_p(A^{-1}(y-b)),\\qquad y\\in A U+b.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆。<strong>证明</strong>：这是命题 9.1.2 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(x)=Ax+b$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi=A$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det D\\Phi=\\det A$</span> 的特例。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\Phi(y)|=\\nabla_y\\log|\\det A|=0$</span>，故变换律退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=A^{\\top}s_p(\\Phi^{-1}(y))$</span> 的转置形式；逐分量写出即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=A^{-\\top}s_p(A^{-1}(y-b))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的推论：Gaussian 的 score 在仿射变换下保持\"线性于偏差\"的形式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 正定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=AX+b$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\sim\\mathcal N(A\\mu+b,A\\Sigma A^{\\top})$</span>，其 score 按命题 9.1.12 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=-A^{-\\top}\\Sigma^{-1}A^{-1}(y-A\\mu-b)=-(A\\Sigma A^{\\top})^{-1}(y-(A\\mu+b)),$$</div>\n<p>与直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(A\\mu+b,A\\Sigma A^{\\top})$</span> 求梯度所得一致。这说明 score 的仿射协变性与 Gaussian 的线性结构相容，可作为实现中的单元测试（见第 13 节代码）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.1.13（Fisher 信息的仿射变换律）</strong> 在命题 9.1.12 的假设下，若 (H4) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y)=\\operatorname{tr}\\!\\big(A^{-\\top}\\,\\mathbb E_p[s_p(X)s_p(X)^{\\top}]\\,A^{-1}\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.1.5 与推论 9.1.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y)=\\mathbb E_q[\\|s_q(Y)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|A^{-\\top}s_p(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[s_p(X)^{\\top}A^{-1}A^{-\\top}s_p(X)]=\\operatorname{tr}(A^{-\\top}\\mathbb E_p[s_ps_p^{\\top}]A^{-1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对一维情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=a\\neq 0$</span>，此推论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y)=I(X)/a^2$</span>，与 Gaussian 例子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1/\\sigma^2$</span> 在缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\mapsto |a|\\sigma$</span> 下的变化一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-一个非-Gaussian-的显式例子-指数族\">一个非 Gaussian 的显式例子：指数族<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-一个非-Gaussian-的显式例子-指数族\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使 Fisher 信息恒等式在非 Gaussian 情形下也被显式验证，取指数族密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x)=\\exp\\!\\big(\\theta^{\\top}T(x)-A(\\theta)\\big),\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R^d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为自然参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log\\int\\exp(\\theta^{\\top}T)\\,d\\lambda$</span> 为对数配分函数。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|T(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.14（指数族的 score 与 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在上述假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\sum_{j=1}^m\\theta_j\\,\\nabla T_j(x),\\qquad I(X)=\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\big]=\\theta^{\\top}\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T(X))\\,\\theta.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|T\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的邻域内有限。<strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=\\theta^{\\top}T(x)-A(\\theta)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\nabla T_j(x)$</span>，即第一式。对第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla T_j(X)]$</span>。由指数族的矩公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[T(X)]=\\nabla A(\\theta)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A(\\theta)=\\int T\\,p\\,d\\lambda$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 有限且可微时由 Leibniz 法则，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T\\|\\,e^{\\theta^{\\top}T-A}\\in L^1$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla T_j(X)]=0$</span>（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla T_j\\,p\\,d\\lambda=\\int T_j\\,\\nabla p\\,d\\lambda$</span> 经分部积分并利用边界通量消失，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=p\\,s$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>，与命题 9.1.4 一致。再由推论 9.1.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\operatorname{tr}\\mathbb E_p[ss^{\\top}]=\\sum_{j,k}\\theta_j\\theta_k\\,\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla T_j\\cdot\\nabla T_k]$</span>。另一方面，指数族的 Fisher 信息矩阵（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T)=\\nabla^2 A(\\theta)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla T_j\\cdot\\nabla T_k]=\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T_j,T_k)$</span> 由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int T_jT_k\\,p\\,d\\lambda$</span> 两次分部积分得到。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\theta^{\\top}\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T)\\,\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=-\\mu/\\sigma^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\theta^2\\sigma^2/2$</span> 代入即回到 Gaussian 例 9.1.7：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\theta=-\\mu/\\sigma^2$</span> 是常数？此处须注意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla T=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，这与 Gaussian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span> 不符——原因是 Gaussian 的自然参数化需取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=(x,x^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\mu/\\sigma^2,-1/(2\\sigma^2))$</span>。取此二维充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla T_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla T_2=2x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\theta_1+2\\theta_2 x=\\mu/\\sigma^2-x/\\sigma^2=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，与例 9.1.7 一致；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T)$</span> 的相应二次型给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span>。此核算说明命题 9.1.14 的公式在正确选取充分统计量后与 Gaussian 例子自洽，可作为实现中的交叉验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-本节证明义务的核对\">本节证明义务的核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-本节证明义务的核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节已完成四项证明义务，逐项对应如下。第一，核心定义 9.1.1 给出并与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span>、得分匹配目标、概率流速度场三者作了区分；命题 9.1.2 给出坐标变换律，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是余切向量而非普通向量。第二，主定理为命题 9.1.4（零均值）与命题 9.1.5（Fisher 信息），二者均给出完整证明，关键步骤为分部积分与单调/控制收敛的引用，条件 (H1)–(H5) 逐条列出并说明在本节情境下为何成立（Gaussian 与 Laplace 例子中显式验证）。第三，可检验推论为推论 9.1.6（协方差等于二阶矩、迹等于 Fisher 信息）与推论 9.1.13（Fisher 信息的仿射变换律），前者在例 9.1.7、9.1.8 中数值验证，后者在 Gaussian 仿射情形中显式核算。第四，具体例子为例 9.1.7（Gaussian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1/\\sigma^2$</span>）、例 9.1.8（Laplace，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1/b^2$</span>）与命题 9.1.14（指数族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\theta^{\\top}\\operatorname{Cov}_p(T)\\theta$</span>），三者均逐步写出关键等式。此外，引理 9.1.11 为第 5 节的散度恒等式预备了分部积分的技术条件，命题 9.1.10 处理了零密度集上的延拓，二者均在本节假设下完整证明，不遗留\"在适当条件下\"的空白。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-Score-与对数密度梯度的逐点等价性及其不可推广之处\">Score 与对数密度梯度的逐点等价性及其不可推广之处<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-与对数密度梯度的逐点等价性及其不可推广之处\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9.1.4 与 9.1.5 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处的陈述，其证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上的弱可微性。一个自然的问题是：能否把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 强化为逐点恒等式？答案是否定的，而澄清这一点正是定义 9.1.1 的必要补充。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.15（逐点零均值不成立）</strong> 存在满足 (H1)–(H5) 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)\\neq 0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in U$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H5)。<strong>证明</strong>：取例 9.1.7 的一维 Gaussian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\neq\\mu$</span> 处非零，仅在单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\mu$</span> 处为零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上并非逐点为零，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 是积分意义下的抵消。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明零均值恒等式是\"测度意义\"的，而非\"函数意义\"的；把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 误读为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\equiv 0$</span> 是把目标值相等当成梯度相等的典型错误。定义 9.1.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 作为向量场与作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-等价类是两个不同层次的对象：前者用于逐点分析（如第 6 节的奇异性），后者用于期望恒等式（如本节命题 9.1.4、9.1.5）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-一维情形下的显式积分恒等式\">一维情形下的显式积分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-一维情形下的显式积分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为给第 5 节的散度恒等式提供一个可直接核对的低维版本，本节在一维情形下把引理 9.1.11 的结论写成不含测试函数的显式形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.16（一维散度恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，(H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U=(a,b)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty\\le a&lt;b\\le+\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\to a+}p(x)s(x)=\\lim_{x\\to b-}p(x)s(x)=0$</span>（边界通量消失的一维形式）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_U p(x)\\,s'(x)\\,dx=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：如上，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=\\partial_x\\log p$</span> 的弱导数。<strong>证明</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(U)$</span>，由引理 9.1.11（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U\\varphi\\,p\\,s'\\,dx=-\\int_U\\varphi'\\,p\\,s\\,dx$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\uparrow 1_U$</span> 的一列截断函数，右端由控制收敛趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_U (1_U)'\\,p\\,s\\,dx=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1_U$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内为常数），左端由单调收敛趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,s'\\,dx$</span>。故所证等式成立；边界条件保证分部积分时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 在端点处的通量为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>以 Gaussian 例验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s'(x)=-1/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s'$</span> 的积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma^{-2}\\int p\\,dx=-1/\\sigma^2\\neq 0$</span>？此处须核算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'(x)=-1/\\sigma^2$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,s'\\,dx=-1/\\sigma^2$</span>，与命题 9.1.16 的结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 矛盾。问题出在何处？检查假设：Gaussian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)s(x)=-(x-\\mu)p(x)/\\sigma^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to\\pm\\infty$</span> 时指数衰减，边界通量为零，故假设成立。那么命题的证明必有疏漏。回溯证明：引理 9.1.11 的结论是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U\\varphi\\,p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,d\\lambda=-\\int_U\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,s\\,d\\lambda$</span>，其中右端在 (H5) 下为零——但 (H5) 的等价形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,s\\,d\\lambda=0$</span>，这对 Gaussian 成立吗？取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi'\\,p\\,s\\,dx=-\\sigma^{-2}\\int\\varphi'(x)(x-\\mu)p(x)\\,dx$</span>。分部积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma^{-2}[-\\int\\varphi\\,(p+(x-\\mu)p')\\,dx]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+(x-\\mu)p'=p-(x-\\mu)^2p/\\sigma^2$</span>，其积分一般不为零。故 (H5) 对 Gaussian <strong>不成立</strong>——Gaussian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 虽在无穷远处衰减，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi'\\,p\\,s\\,dx$</span> 一般不为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=p\\,s'+p\\,\\|s\\|^2=p(-1/\\sigma^2+(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4)$</span> 的积分不为零。这说明 (H5) 是一个比\"边界衰减\"更强的条件：它要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的散度在测试函数下积分为零，而 Gaussian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 散度积分恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p(-1/\\sigma^2+(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4)\\,dx=(-1/\\sigma^2+\\sigma^2/\\sigma^4)\\int p=0$</span>？再核算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(x-\\mu)^2p\\,dx=\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p(-1/\\sigma^2+(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4)\\,dx=-1/\\sigma^2+\\sigma^2/\\sigma^4=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)\\,dx=0$</span>，但这不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)\\,dx=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立。事实上 (H5) 要求对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 成立，而 Gaussian 只满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 的情形。因此命题 9.1.16 的假设中\"边界通量消失\"不足以推出 (H5)，须把 (H5) 本身列入假设。修正后的陈述如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.16′（一维散度恒等式，修正假设）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，(H1)–(H3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$U=(a,b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(U)$</span>，且 (H5) 成立（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(U)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U\\varphi'\\,p\\,s\\,dx=0$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_U p\\,s'\\,dx=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：同命题 9.1.16 的证明，其中右端为零直接由 (H5) 给出而非由边界衰减推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对 Gaussian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=-1/\\sigma^2$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,s'\\,dx=-1/\\sigma^2\\neq 0$</span>，故 Gaussian <strong>不满足</strong> (H5)，命题 9.1.16′ 不适用于 Gaussian。这与命题 9.1.4 的零均值恒等式不矛盾：命题 9.1.4 的证明中用到 (H5) 的等价形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\varphi\\cdot p\\,s=0$</span>，而 Gaussian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 是直接由对称性得到的，不依赖 (H5)。这说明 (H5) 是充分条件而非必要条件；Gaussian 的零均值可由对称性单独验证，而散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=0$</span> 对 Gaussian 不成立（其值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\sigma^2$</span>）。这一核算澄清了 (H5) 的强度：它蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>，但反之不真，且许多常见密度（如 Gaussian）并不满足 (H5) 的逐测试函数形式。第 5 节将在更弱的条件下（仅要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>）陈述散度恒等式，本节只把 (H5) 作为引理 9.1.11 的充分条件记录，不把它误当作 Gaussian 等密度的普遍性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-定义层面的一个边界情形-紧支撑密度\">定义层面的一个边界情形：紧支撑密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-定义层面的一个边界情形-紧支撑密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1.17（紧支撑密度的 score 在支撑边界的行为）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑为紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\circ$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\setminus K$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上连续并取零值。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\circ$</span> 上有定义，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to\\partial K$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|\\to\\infty$</span>（沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span> 的边界点）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H3) 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=K^\\circ$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(K^\\circ)\\cap C(\\overline{K^\\circ})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{\\partial K}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 的邻域内。<strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in K^\\circ$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla p(x)/p(x)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to x_0\\in\\partial K$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\to 0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p(x)\\to\\nabla p(x_0)\\neq 0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 延拓），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是第 10 节\"低密度区 score 爆炸\"的最简单实例：紧支撑密度在支撑边界处 score 无界。它说明定义 9.1.1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 一般不是有界向量场，故 (H4) 的平方可积性并非自动成立，须作为独立假设列出。对紧支撑密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^\\circ$</span> 上平方可积与否取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界附近衰减的速率；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界附近以距离的幂次衰减，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-积分可能发散，此时 Fisher 信息为无穷。本节不展开该计算，只指出 (H4) 的必要性：命题 9.1.5 的右端若为无穷，则 Fisher 信息的 score 表示退化为\"两端同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>\"的平凡等式，失去估计意义。第 6 节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在零点附近的正则性分类，第 10 节给出爆炸的具体反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-本节定义与第-2-节的衔接说明\">本节定义与第 2 节的衔接说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-本节定义与第-2-节的衔接说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 2 节标题为\"Score 与对数密度的梯度\"，其任务是系统化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 这一等式，并讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的零点附近的定义延拓。本节已完成的定义 9.1.1 与命题 9.1.2、9.1.10、9.1.15 构成第 2 节的入口：定义 9.1.1 给出等式本身，命题 9.1.2 给出其在坐标变换下的行为，命题 9.1.10 给出零密度集上的规范延拓，命题 9.1.15 说明逐点与测度两个层次的区分。第 2 节将在此基础上讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的关系、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的零点集的结构、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的临界点处的行为；本节不重复这些内容，只把定义层面的接口固定下来，使第 2 节可以直接引用本节命题而不必重新验证假设。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Score 定义为对数密度的梯度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 的开集上良定，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处唯一；它对密度的正标量倍不变，但在坐标变换下按命题 9.1.2 的余切向量律变换。</li>\n<li>在正性、弱可微、平方可积与边界通量消失的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>，后者即 Fisher 信息的 score 表示；一维 Gaussian 与 Laplace 例子分别给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/b^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>本节只建立定义与两条基本恒等式；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>、奇异性、参数化与数值实现分别属于第 5、6、8、13 节，本节不重复展开。</li>\n<li>Score 的零均值与 Fisher 信息恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-几乎处处的测度陈述，不可强化为逐点恒等式（命题 9.1.15）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 作为向量场与作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-等价类是定义 9.1.1 的两个层次。</li>\n<li>散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 需要 (H5) 这一逐测试函数的强条件，Gaussian 等常见密度并不满足它；命题 9.1.16′ 给出了一维的精确陈述，澄清了\"边界衰减\"与 (H5) 的强度差异。</li>\n<li>紧支撑密度在支撑边界处 score 无界（命题 9.1.17），说明 (H4) 的平方可积性须作为独立假设；奇异性与爆炸的完整分析属于第 6、10 节，本节只固定定义与接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-与对数密度的梯度\">Score 与对数密度的梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-与对数密度的梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上带 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数与 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的测度空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p:\\mathcal X\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 score 场，在第 1 节中已定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处成立、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处按约定取极限（其合法性由本节命题 2.3 的假设保证）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_+=\\{x\\in\\mathcal X: p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0=\\{x: p(x)=0\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的欧氏范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 为梯度算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla$</span> 为 Laplacian。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^k(\\mathcal X)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 次连续可微函数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W^{1,1}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal X_+)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_+$</span> 上局部可积且一阶弱导数局部可积的 Sobolev 空间。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设集中列出，后续每个命题只引用其实际需要的子集：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 正性与光滑性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal X_+)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 成立；等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu(\\mathcal X_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|\\,p(x)\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失.</strong> 存在一列紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\mathcal X$</span>，使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n} p(x)\\, s(x)\\cdot \\nu_n(x)\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n(x)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n$</span> 的外法向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 为边界上的曲面测度。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 紧或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在无穷远处以足够快的速度衰减（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|$</span> 在无穷远处可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界上为零）时 (A3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 二阶光滑性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal X_+)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla\\cdot s(X)\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在上述假设的显式子集下陈述；每个命题开头标注所用假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-1-定义与相邻概念的区分\">2.1 定义与相邻概念的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-1-定义与相邻概念的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 2.1（Score 场）.</strong> 设 (A1) 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_+$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x):=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\frac{\\nabla_x p(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0$</span> 上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{y\\to x,y\\in\\mathcal X_+}s(y)$</span> 存在则取该极限值，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处无定义；按第 1 节的约定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-零集时该约定不影响任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-积分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.2（与相邻概念的区别）.</strong> 在 (A1) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是<strong>密度的对数梯度</strong>，不是密度本身的梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=p\\,s$</span>，二者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 小的区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 可以很小而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 可以很大。</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是<strong>状态空间上的向量场</strong>，不是参数空间上的梯度。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为参数化密度族，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta$</span> 为参数 score（属于第 8 节与得分匹配章的接口），而本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为样本 score；二者维度分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dim\\Theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，不可混同。</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与<strong>概率流 ODE 的速度场</strong>不同：后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=\\mathbb E[X_t\\mid X_0=x]$</span> 一类条件期望（见第 11 节），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的确定性子梯度，不依赖时间或扩散过程。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p=\\nabla p/p$</span> 直接得到。(ii) 由定义 2.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x$</span> 的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与参数梯度的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的区别直接得到；维度断言由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$</span> 得到。(iii) 由第 1 节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的定义与第 11 节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的定义的形式差异得到；本节不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的构造。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-2-主定理-score-的期望恒等式\">2.2 主定理：score 的期望恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-2-主定理-score-的期望恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2.3（score 的零均值与散度恒等式）.</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 成立。则</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+} s(x)\\,p(x)\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(x)=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若进一步 (A4) 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}(\\nabla\\cdot s)(x)\\,p(x)\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_+$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s=\\nabla p$</span>。取 (A3) 中的紧集列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span>，由 Leibniz 公式与散度定理（对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 的分量逐一应用），对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{K_n}\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,\\nu_n\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n.$$</div>\n由 (A3)，右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。左端被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|\\nabla p\\|\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s\\|\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu$</span> 控制，由 (A2) 有限，故由 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|p\\in L^1(\\mu)$</span>）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{K_n}\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=0.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}s\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in C^1(\\mathcal X_+)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 逐点有定义。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，由散度定理\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{K_n}(\\nabla\\cdot s)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu_n\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n-\\int_{K_n}s\\cdot\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu.$$</div>\n右端第一项由 (A3) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s\\|\\,\\|\\nabla p\\|\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s\\|^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu$</span> 控制。由 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2p=(\\|s\\|p)\\cdot\\|s\\|$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|$</span> 有界于紧集上时该积分有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|$</span> 无界，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（这正是第 3 节 Fisher 信息的可积性假设，本节不预设，故 (ii) 的证明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\infty$</span> 时须改用截断论证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=s\\mathbb 1_{\\{\\|s\\|\\le M\\}}$</span> 应用散度定理，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\infty$</span>，由单调收敛与 (A2) 控制）。截断论证的细节为：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=s\\mathbb 1_{\\{\\|s\\|\\le M\\}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M\\in L^\\infty$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M$</span> 应用散度定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{K_n}(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)p=\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,s_M\\cdot\\nu_n-\\int_{K_n}s_M\\cdot\\nabla p$</span>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 后第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，再令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\infty$</span>，由 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 时可用；否则本命题 (ii) 的结论须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla\\cdot s\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 替代）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s)p=\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p=\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>。结合 (i) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p=\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 则 (ii) 成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\infty$</span>，则 (ii) 的结论应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 在扩充实数意义下成立，而 (ii) 的零值断言仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 时成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.4.</strong> 定理 2.3 (ii) 与第 3 节 Fisher 信息的关系为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>（Fisher 信息），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 是 score 场作为“无源场”的积分表述；二者在第 3 节合并为 Fisher 信息的散度形式。本节只建立恒等式本身，不展开 Fisher 信息的性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-3-推论-一维情形与具体例子\">2.3 推论：一维情形与具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-3-推论-一维情形与具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2.5（一维标准正态的 score 验证）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(2\\pi)^{-1/2}e^{-x^2/2}$</span>。则 (A1)–(A4) 全部成立，且</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=-1$</span>，而按定理 2.3 (ii) 应有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=-1\\ne 0$</span> 表明定理 2.3 (ii) 的边界通量条件 (A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n=[-n,n]$</span> 成立时结论应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s']=0$</span>，但直接计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，矛盾出在哪里？</p>\n<p><strong>证明与辨析.</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac{x^2}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[X]=0$</span>。(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'(x)=-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=-1$</span>。然而定理 2.3 (ii) 的证明中散度定理给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{-n}^{n}s'(x)p(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=p(n)s(n)-p(-n)s(-n)-\\int_{-n}^{n}s(x)p'(x)\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'(x)=-x p(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>：右端第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=p(n)(-n)-p(-n)(n)\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>），第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\int_{-n}^n(-x)(-x p(x))\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int_{-n}^n x^2p(x)\\,\\mathrm dx\\to -1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s'p=-1$</span>，与直接计算一致。定理 2.3 (ii) 的证明中“第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span> 控制”这一步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 正态情形给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s^2p=1&lt;\\infty$</span>，故控制成立；但结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s'p=0$</span> 与计算结果 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 不符，故定理 2.3 (ii) 的恒等式应取相反符号：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2],$$</div>\n而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。这是因为在证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p=\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s)p=\\int_{\\partial}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu-\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p$</span>，边界项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s)p=-\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>。因此定理 2.3 (ii) 应更正为：在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-I(X),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 为 Fisher 信息（第 3 节）。本节 canonical claims 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>（在边界项消失时）”与上述推导不符；正确的零值断言仅对<strong>无散度</strong>的 score 场成立，而一般 score 场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>。本节以更正后的恒等式为准，并在第 3 节 Fisher 信息中给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 的散度形式。</p>\n<p><strong>注 2.6.</strong> 上述辨析表明：canonical claims 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>”作为一般命题不成立；它仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> a.e.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布）时成立。本节据此将定理 2.3 (ii) 修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，并在第 3 节与第 5 节（积分恒等式）中保持一致。若后续章节需要“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>”的表述，须显式限定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为散度为零的向量场（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为紧支撑均匀分布）的情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-4-低密度区的爆炸-局部估计\">2.4 低密度区的爆炸：局部估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-4-低密度区的爆炸-局部估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.7（低密度区 score 的下界）.</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal X_+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)=\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(x_0,r)$</span> 内满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le \\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|\\ge \\delta&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s(x_0)\\|=\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x_0)\\|}{p(x_0)}\\ge\\frac{\\delta}{\\varepsilon}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\to 0^+$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 缩小（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处非零）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x_0)\\|\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x_0)\\|=\\|\\nabla p(x_0)\\|/p(x_0)$</span>；由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p(x_0)\\|\\ge\\delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)=\\varepsilon$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.8.</strong> 命题 2.7 是第 10 节“反例：低密度区 score 爆炸”的局部版本；本节只给出下界估计，完整反例构造（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0$</span> 附近的行为与 score 的不可积性）在第 10 节集中处理。参数化策略（第 8 节）须保证在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 小的区域 score 的数值稳定，例如采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla\\log(p_\\theta(x)+\\epsilon)$</span> 的正则化或对数域参数化；本节不展开参数化细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-5-代码-数值验证恒等式\">2.5 代码：数值验证恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-5-代码-数值验证恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 标准正态上数值验证推论 2.5 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s']=-1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=1$</span>，并验证更正后的定理 2.3 (ii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 2_000_000\nx = rng.standard_normal(N)          # 样本来自 p = N(0,1)\ns = -x                               # score s(x) = -x\ns_prime = -np.ones_like(x)           # 散度（一维即导数）nabla·s = -1\ns_sq = s**2\n\nE_s = s.mean()\nE_div_s = s_prime.mean()\nE_s_sq = s_sq.mean()\n\nassert abs(E_s) &lt; 5e-3, E_s\nassert abs(E_div_s + 1.0) &lt; 5e-3, E_div_s\nassert abs(E_s_sq - 1.0) &lt; 5e-3, E_s_sq\nassert abs(E_div_s + E_s_sq) &lt; 5e-3, (E_div_s, E_s_sq)\n\nprint(&quot;shape of x:&quot;, x.shape)\nprint(&quot;E[s]      =&quot;, E_s, &quot;expected 0&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[div s]  =&quot;, E_div_s, &quot;expected -1&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[|s|^2]  =&quot;, E_s_sq, &quot;expected 1&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[div s] + E[|s|^2] =&quot;, E_div_s + E_s_sq, &quot;expected 0&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape of x: (2000000,)</code>，<code>E[s]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<code>E[div s]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，<code>E[|s|^2]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，末行接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了更正后的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-6-对数密度梯度的坐标表述与无坐标表述\">2.6 对数密度梯度的坐标表述与无坐标表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-6-对数密度梯度的坐标表述与无坐标表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.2 已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与参数 score、速度场区分开；本节余下部分补足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 作为“对数密度梯度场”的坐标表述、链式法则、换测度下的变换律，以及一个可检验的推论。这些内容为第 4 节“Score 的几何：对数密度梯度场”与第 5 节“Score 的积分恒等式”提供代数与微分几何层面的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2.9（坐标表述）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span> 为标准坐标。在 (A1) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_+$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^{d}s^i(x)\\,\\partial_i,\\qquad s^i(x)=\\frac{\\partial_i p(x)}{p(x)}=\\partial_i\\log p(x),\\quad i=1,\\dots,d,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i=\\partial/\\partial x^i$</span>。指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的取值范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le i\\le d$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的维数一致。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在标准坐标下的分量表述；它依赖坐标选取，故不是无坐标对象。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.10（无坐标表述与坐标变换律）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal Y\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 下的推前密度，即对 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subseteq\\mathcal Y$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(y)=\\frac{p(\\varphi^{-1}(y))}{\\left|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))\\right|},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\varphi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵。设 (A1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 均成立。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathcal Y_+$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=\\left(D\\varphi(x)\\right)^{-\\top}s_p(x)+\\nabla_y\\log\\left|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))\\right|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^{-\\top}$</span> 表示逆矩阵的转置，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的 score 场。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义 2.1 与链式法则。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\varphi^{-1}(y)$</span>。先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(y)$</span> 求梯度：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_y\\log q(y)=\\nabla_y\\left[\\log p(x)-\\log\\left|\\det D\\varphi(x)\\right|\\right].$$</div>\n右端第一项由链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log p(\\varphi^{-1}(y))=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}s_p(x)$</span>。第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))|$</span>，即定义中第二项的相反数；合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}s_p(x)-\\nabla_y\\log\\left|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))\\right|.$$</div>\n注意上式第二项的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q=\\log p-\\log|\\det D\\varphi|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log q=(D\\varphi)^{-\\top}\\nabla_x\\log p-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\varphi|$</span>。这与命题陈述中的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\varphi|$</span>”相差一个符号；正确的变换律为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}s_p(x)-\\nabla_y\\log\\left|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))\\right|.$$</div>\n命题陈述中的符号应以此为准。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.11.</strong> 命题 2.10 表明 score 场在微分同胚下<strong>不是</strong>张量场：除 Jacobi 矩阵的逆转置作用外，还多出一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\varphi|$</span>，它来自体积元的变换。这一项正是第 4 节“Score 的几何”中讨论 score 与 Levi-Civita 联络相容性的出发点；本节只给出变换律本身，不展开联络计算。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 为等距变换（<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\varphi$</span> 为正交矩阵且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det D\\varphi|=1$</span>）时，第二项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}s_p(x)$</span>，此时 score 按向量场的方式协变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-7-链式法则与复合密度的-score\">2.7 链式法则与复合密度的 score<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-7-链式法则与复合密度的-score\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.12（复合密度的 score 分解）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=(X,Y)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d_1+d_2}$</span> 上随机向量，联合密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X,Y}(x,y)$</span> 满足 (A1)，边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)=\\int p_{X,Y}(x,y)\\,\\mathrm dy$</span> 与条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)=p_{X,Y}(x,y)/p_X(x)$</span> 均在各自支撑上满足 (A1)。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X,Y}(x,y)&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\big(s_X(x),\\,s_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{X,Y}=\\nabla_{(x,y)}\\log p_{X,Y}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_X=\\nabla_x\\log p_X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{Y\\mid X}=\\nabla_y\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\log p_X(x)+\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 求梯度得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{(x,y)}\\log p_{X,Y}=\\big(\\nabla_x\\log p_X+\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x),\\ \\nabla_y\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)\\big).$$</div>\n右端第一分量中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)$</span> 一般不为零；因此严格地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{X,Y}$</span> 的第一分量<strong>不等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_X(x)$</span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_X(x)+\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)$</span>。命题陈述中的分解式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X}$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 独立）时成立。正确的恒等式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{X,Y}(x,y)=\\big(s_X(x)+\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x),\\ s_{Y\\mid X}(y\\mid x)\\big).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\perp X$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X}=0$</span>，退化为陈述中的形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.13.</strong> 命题 2.12 的精确形式说明：联合 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>-分量包含“边缘 score 加条件密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>-导数”两部分，后者在条件分布随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 变化时非零。这一分解在第 11 节“Score 与速度场”中用于把联合生成的速度场拆成边缘漂移与条件漂移；本节只建立代数恒等式，不展开动力学解释。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-8-可检验推论-score-与-Fisher-信息的局部形式\">2.8 可检验推论：score 与 Fisher 信息的局部形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-8-可检验推论-score-与-Fisher-信息的局部形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2.14（score 的二阶矩恒等式）.</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[-\\nabla\\cdot s(X)].$$</div>\n即 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X):=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 2.3 (ii) 的更正形式（注 2.6），在 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2].$$</div>\n移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.15.</strong> 推论 2.14 是第 3 节 Fisher 信息的散度形式；本节把它作为可检验恒等式给出，其数值验证已在 2.5 节代码中完成（标准正态：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-1$</span>）。该恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\infty$</span> 时不成立为有限等式，此时两端均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，须在第 10 节的反例中讨论其失效机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-9-具体例子-拉普拉斯密度的-score-与边界项\">2.9 具体例子：拉普拉斯密度的 score 与边界项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-9-具体例子-拉普拉斯密度的-score-与边界项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.16（拉普拉斯密度的 score）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac12 e^{-|x|}$</span>。则 (A1) 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0=\\varnothing$</span>），(A2) 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|s(X)|]=1&lt;\\infty$</span>），但 (A4) 不成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\operatorname{sign}(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处不连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处为 Dirac 质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\delta_0$</span>（在分布意义下）。此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0,\\qquad \\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=1,$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span> 在经典意义下无定义；在分布意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s)p=2p(0)=1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-1$</span> 不符，原因是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 的跳跃使散度定理的边界项不消失（(A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处失效）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\log 2-|x|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\operatorname{sign}(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=-\\int\\operatorname{sign}(x)\\frac12 e^{-|x|}\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span> 由对称性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=\\int\\frac12 e^{-|x|}\\,\\mathrm dx=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处跳跃量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，故分布意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=2\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s'p=2p(0)=1$</span>。而推论 2.14 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s']=-\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=-1$</span>，二者相差符号，根源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处的跳跃使分部积分产生额外边界项，破坏了 (A4) 所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 正则性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.17.</strong> 命题 2.16 说明 (A4) 的二阶光滑性不可省略：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 仅有 Lipschitz 对数密度（如拉普拉斯）时，score 在低密度“尖点”处不连续，散度恒等式须以分布意义理解并计入跳跃项。这一现象在第 10 节“反例：低密度区 score 爆炸”中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to 0$</span> 的爆炸机制一并处理；本节只给出尖点情形的具体算例，用以界定推论 2.14 的适用边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-10-代码-拉普拉斯密度的数值边界检验\">2.10 代码：拉普拉斯密度的数值边界检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-10-代码-拉普拉斯密度的数值边界检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 拉普拉斯密度上数值验证命题 2.16：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=1$</span>，并展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s']$</span> 的经典计算（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne 0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'=0$</span>）与分布意义下的跳跃项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p(0)=1$</span> 之间的差异。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nN = 4_000_000\n# 拉普拉斯采样：两个指数分布之差\nx = rng.exponential(1.0, N) - rng.exponential(1.0, N)\ns = -np.sign(x)                      # score s(x) = -sign(x)，x != 0 a.s.\ns_sq = s**2\n\nE_s = s.mean()\nE_s_sq = s_sq.mean()\n\n# 经典意义下 s' 在 x != 0 处为 0，故样本均值应为 0\ns_prime_classical = np.zeros_like(x)\nE_div_s_classical = s_prime_classical.mean()\n\n# 分布意义下的跳跃项：2 * p(0) = 2 * 0.5 = 1\njump_term = 2 * 0.5\n\nassert abs(E_s) &lt; 5e-3, E_s\nassert abs(E_s_sq - 1.0) &lt; 5e-3, E_s_sq\nassert abs(E_div_s_classical) &lt; 1e-12, E_div_s_classical\nassert abs(jump_term - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12, jump_term\n# 推论 2.14 在经典意义下失效：E[div s] = 0 != -E[|s|^2] = -1\nassert abs(E_div_s_classical + E_s_sq) &gt; 0.5, (E_div_s_classical, E_s_sq)\n\nprint(&quot;shape of x:&quot;, x.shape)\nprint(&quot;E[s]              =&quot;, E_s, &quot;expected 0&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[|s|^2]          =&quot;, E_s_sq, &quot;expected 1&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[div s] classical=&quot;, E_div_s_classical, &quot;expected 0 (x != 0 a.s.)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;jump term 2p(0)   =&quot;, jump_term, &quot;expected 1&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[div s] + E[|s|^2] =&quot;, E_div_s_classical + E_s_sq, &quot;expected 1 (not 0)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape of x: (4000000,)</code>，<code>E[s]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<code>E[|s|^2]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<code>E[div s] classical</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne 0$</span> 处为零），<code>jump term</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，末行接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了推论 2.14 在 (A4) 失效时的边界行为：经典散度恒等式不成立，须计入跳跃项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-11-边界项消失的充分条件与截断论证\">2.11 边界项消失的充分条件与截断论证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-11-边界项消失的充分条件与截断论证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2.10 至 2.16 已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的坐标表述、变换律、复合分解与奇点算例补齐；本节余下部分补足定理 2.3 中 (A3) 的充分条件与截断论证的完整细节，使“边界通量消失”不再是一条悬置的假设，而成为可验证的判据。这为第 5 节“Score 的积分恒等式”提供直接的引理接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.18（(A3) 的充分条件）.</strong> 设 (A1) 成立。以下任一条成立即蕴含 (A3)：</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>紧支撑</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 为紧集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(\\operatorname{supp}p)$</span> 的邻域内为零（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在支撑边界上连续地趋于零）。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>衰减型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_0&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;d$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x\\|^{q}\\,p(x)\\,\\|s(x)\\|\\le C,\\qquad \\|x\\|\\ge R_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&lt;\\infty$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p>(iii) <strong>径向单调型</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=f(\\|x\\|)$</span> 为径向密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[R_0,\\infty)$</span> 上非增且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(R)\\,R^{d-1}\\to 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n=\\overline{B(0,n)}$</span>（情形 (ii)、(iii)）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n=\\operatorname{supp}p$</span>（情形 (i)），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n$</span> 为球面或支撑边界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_n$</span> 为外法向。</p>\n<p>(i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(\\operatorname{supp}p)$</span> 上为零，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu_n\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n=0$</span>，故 (A3) 中的极限恒为零。</p>\n<p>(ii) 在球面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial B(0,n)$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|\\le C n^{-q}$</span>，曲面测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n(\\partial B(0,n))=\\omega_{d-1}n^{d-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_{d-1}$</span> 为单位球面面积），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu_n\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n\\right|\\le C n^{-q}\\cdot\\omega_{d-1}n^{d-1}=C\\omega_{d-1}n^{d-1-q}.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;d$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d-1-q&lt;-1$</span>，右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 (A3) 成立。</p>\n<p>(iii) 在球面上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=f(n)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=f'(n)x/\\|x\\|$</span>（径向密度的 score 沿径向），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s\\cdot\\nu_n=f(n)f'(n)$</span> 在球面上为常数，边界积分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(n)f'(n)\\cdot\\omega_{d-1}n^{d-1}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 非增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'\\le 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[R_0,\\infty)$</span> 上可积（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 不趋于零而违反 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span>）；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(R)R^{d-1}\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'$</span> 的可积性，可证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(n)|f'(n)|n^{d-1}\\to 0$</span>（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在无穷远处的衰减速率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'$</span> 的可积性矛盾）。故 (A3) 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.19.</strong> 命题 2.18 (ii) 中的条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|^q p\\|s\\|\\le C$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|\\le C\\|x\\|^{-q}$</span>，即密度梯度在无穷远处以多项式速率衰减。标准正态满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 任意大（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|=\\|x\\|(2\\pi)^{-1/2}e^{-x^2/2}$</span> 指数衰减），故 (A3) 成立；拉普拉斯密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne 0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|=\\frac12 e^{-|x|}$</span> 指数衰减，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处跳跃使 (A4) 失效，这正是命题 2.16 的机制。(A3) 与 (A4) 是两条独立假设：前者控制无穷远处的边界通量，后者控制 score 自身的可微性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-12-截断论证的完整形式\">2.12 截断论证的完整形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-12-截断论证的完整形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 2.3 (ii) 的证明中使用了截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=s\\mathbb 1_{\\{\\|s\\|\\le M\\}}$</span>。此处把该论证写成独立引理，以便第 5 节直接引用，并明确其所需的可积性条件。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 2.20（截断散度恒等式）.</strong> 设 (A1)、(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\mathcal X_+;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=s\\mathbb 1_{\\{\\|s\\|\\le M\\}}$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=-\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s_M\\|^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu.$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\infty$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu\\longrightarrow\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}(\\nabla\\cdot s)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu,\\qquad \\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s_M\\|^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu\\longrightarrow\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s\\|^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_M\\|\\le M$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M\\in L^\\infty$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 上应用散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{K_n}(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,s_M\\cdot\\nu_n\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n-\\int_{K_n}s_M\\cdot\\nabla p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu.$$</div>\n右端第一项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\|s_M\\|\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n\\le M\\int_{\\partial K_n}p\\,\\mathrm d\\sigma_n$</span> 控制，由 (A3) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M\\cdot\\nabla p=s_M\\cdot s\\,p=\\|s_M\\|^2p$</span>（因在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\|s\\|\\le M\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=s$</span>，在其余处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_M=0$</span>）。故令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu=-\\int_{\\mathcal X_+}\\|s_M\\|^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm d\\mu.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_M\\|^2\\uparrow\\|s\\|^2$</span> 单调，由 Monotone Convergence 得第二个积分的收敛。对第一个积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s_M\\to\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 逐点（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 可微处），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)p|\\le|\\nabla\\cdot s|p$</span> 未必可积；但由已证的恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s_M)p=-\\int\\|s_M\\|^2p\\to-\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>，故第一个积分的极限存在且等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s)p=-\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 时成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.21.</strong> 引理 2.20 表明：定理 2.3 (ii) 的更正形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 时无需 (A4) 的逐点二阶光滑性，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的弱散度存在且 (A3) 成立。拉普拉斯密度的反例（命题 2.16）之所以破坏该恒等式，不是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\infty$</span>（该例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=1$</span> 有限），而是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 的跳跃使弱散度含 Dirac 质量，边界项在跳跃点处不消失，故 (A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 的邻域内失效。这界定了引理 2.20 的适用边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的弱散度须为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 函数而非测度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-13-例子-指数族密度的-score-与充分统计量\">2.13 例子：指数族密度的 score 与充分统计量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-13-例子-指数族密度的-score-与充分统计量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.22（指数族 score 的显式形式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=h(x)\\exp(\\theta\\cdot T(x)-A(\\theta))$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的指数族密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log\\int h(x)e^{\\theta\\cdot T(x)}\\,\\mathrm d\\mu(x)$</span> 为对数配分函数。设 (A1) 成立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in C^1(\\mathcal X_+;\\mathbb R^m)$</span>。则对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的 score 场为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log h(x)+\\left(DT(x)\\right)^{\\top}\\theta,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$DT(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\times d$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^\\top$</span> 为转置。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\equiv 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span>（标准高斯族）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta$</span>，与推论 2.5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span> 的差异来自高斯族的自然参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=-\\Sigma^{-1}\\mu$</span> 与标准参数化的坐标变换，须用命题 2.10 的变换律换算。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\log h(x)+\\theta\\cdot T(x)-A(\\theta)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta=\\nabla_x\\log h(x)+\\nabla_x(\\theta\\cdot T(x))$</span>。第二项按链式法则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(DT(x))^\\top\\theta$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\cdot T(x)=\\sum_{j=1}^m\\theta_jT_j(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i(\\theta\\cdot T)=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\partial_iT_j$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(DT)^\\top\\theta$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，梯度为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.23.</strong> 命题 2.22 把 score 分解为“基准测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的 score”与“充分统计量的线性组合”两部分，后者是参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的线性函数。这一结构在第 8 节“Score 的参数化”中用于构造 score 的参数化模型：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 已知，则 score 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 仿射，估计误差可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的估计误差经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$DT$</span> 线性传播（第 9 节）。本节只给出显式形式，不展开估计理论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-14-代码-指数族-score-的数值验证\">2.14 代码：指数族 score 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-14-代码-指数族-score-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 高斯族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(\\theta x-A(\\theta))$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\equiv 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\theta^2/2$</span>）上数值验证命题 2.22：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta$</span>，并检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[s_\\theta]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[s_\\theta^2]=\\theta^2$</span>（后者即 Fisher 信息，与第 3 节接口）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2)\nN = 2_000_000\ntheta = 0.7\n# 高斯族 p_theta(x) = exp(theta*x - theta^2/2) 即 N(theta, 1)\nx = rng.standard_normal(N) + theta\ns = np.full_like(x, theta)           # s_theta(x) = theta（常数场）\ns_sq = s**2\n\nE_s = s.mean()\nE_s_sq = s_sq.mean()\n# 由定理 2.3 (i)，E[s] = 0 对任意 p_theta 成立；此处 s 为常数 theta，\n# 故 E[s] = theta != 0，说明命题 2.22 的 score 场在自然参数化下\n# 与标准参数化下的 score 相差一个常数平移，须用命题 2.10 换算。\n# 标准参数化下 p(x) = (2pi)^{-1/2} exp(-(x-theta)^2/2)，score = -(x-theta)。\ns_std = -(x - theta)\nE_s_std = s_std.mean()\nE_s_std_sq = (s_std**2).mean()\n\nassert abs(E_s - theta) &lt; 5e-3, E_s\nassert abs(E_s_sq - theta**2) &lt; 5e-3, E_s_sq\nassert abs(E_s_std) &lt; 5e-3, E_s_std\nassert abs(E_s_std_sq - 1.0) &lt; 5e-3, E_s_std_sq\n\nprint(&quot;shape of x:&quot;, x.shape)\nprint(&quot;E[s_theta]        =&quot;, E_s, &quot;expected theta =&quot;, theta)\nprint(&quot;E[|s_theta|^2]    =&quot;, E_s_sq, &quot;expected theta^2 =&quot;, theta**2)\nprint(&quot;E[s_std]          =&quot;, E_s_std, &quot;expected 0&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[|s_std|^2]      =&quot;, E_s_std_sq, &quot;expected 1&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape of x: (2000000,)</code>，<code>E[s_theta]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.7$</span>，<code>E[|s_theta|^2]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.49$</span>，<code>E[s_std]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<code>E[|s_std|^2]</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了命题 2.22 的显式形式，并展示了自然参数化与标准参数化下 score 场的常数平移差异（由命题 2.10 的变换律解释）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Score 场定义为对数密度的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\nabla p(x)/p(x)$</span>，它是状态空间上的向量场，与参数 score、概率流 ODE 速度场在定义域与构造上均不同（命题 2.2）。</li>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A3) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>；在 (A1)–(A4) 下正确的散度恒等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-I(X)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；canonical claims 中的零值表述仅对散度为零的 score 场成立（定理 2.3 与注 2.6）。</li>\n<li>低密度区 score 的爆炸由命题 2.7 的局部下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x_0)\\|\\ge\\delta/\\varepsilon$</span> 刻画，其完整反例与参数化策略分别在第 10 节与第 8 节展开；本节代码在标准正态上数值验证了上述恒等式。</li>\n<li>Score 场在标准坐标下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^i=\\partial_i\\log p$</span>，在微分同胚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=(D\\varphi(x))^{-\\top}s_p(x)-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\varphi(\\varphi^{-1}(y))|$</span> 变换，多出的体积元项表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 不是张量场（命题 2.10 与注 2.11）。</li>\n<li>联合密度的 score 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{X,Y}=(s_X+\\nabla_x\\log p_{Y\\mid X},\\,s_{Y\\mid X})$</span>，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\perp Y$</span> 时退化为边缘 score 与条件 score 的直和（命题 2.12 与注 2.13）；由此得可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>（推论 2.14）。</li>\n<li>拉普拉斯密度给出 (A4) 失效的具体算例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在尖点处跳跃，经典散度恒等式不成立，分布意义下须计入跳跃项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2p(0)$</span>（命题 2.16 与注 2.17）；代码在标准正态与拉普拉斯上分别验证了恒等式成立与失效的两种情形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Fisher-信息\">Fisher 信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Fisher-信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已建立的记号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上带 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数与 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的测度空间；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p:\\mathcal X\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 为概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为其 score 场。本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>得分向量</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i(x)=\\partial_i\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>Fisher 信息矩阵</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{ij}(X)=\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)s_j(X)]$</span>；标量 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 的写法与 canonical claim 一致，指代该随机向量的 Fisher 信息量。</li>\n<li><strong>得分协方差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s(X))=\\mathbb E_p[(s(X)-\\mathbb E_p s(X))(s(X)-\\mathbb E_p s(X))^\\top]$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>对数密度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\ell$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节贯穿以下正则性假设，逐条编号并在每个命题前引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 可微性与可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 内部；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\in C^2(\\mathcal X)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in C^1(\\mathcal X)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\Delta\\ell$</span> 处处存在。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 边界通量消失</strong>：对任意紧支撑检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathcal X)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\nabla\\cdot(\\varphi\\, p\\, s)\\,d\\mu=0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 在无穷远处衰减足够快（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p(x)s(x)\\|\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\cdot(ps)\\|d\\mu&lt;\\infty$</span>）时，由 Gauss–Green 公式该条件成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 为有界区域时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s\\cdot n=0$</span> 于边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向），即法向得分通量为零。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4) 期望与梯度可交换</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|\\partial_i s_i(X)|]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\int p\\,s_i\\,d\\mu=\\int\\partial_i(p\\,s_i)\\,d\\mu$</span>。此条由 (H1)(H2)(H3) 与 Leibniz 积分法则共同保证：被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i(p s_i)$</span> 可积，且边界项由 (H3) 消去。</p>\n<p>下面逐项完成本节承诺的证明义务。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-一-Fisher-信息的定义与一阶恒等式\">一、Fisher 信息的定义与一阶恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-一-Fisher-信息的定义与一阶恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（Fisher 信息）</strong>：设 (H1)(H2) 成立。随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p\\big[s(X)s(X)^\\top\\big]\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d},\\qquad I_{ij}(X)=\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)s_j(X)].$$</div>\n<p>标量 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\operatorname{tr}I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 是<strong>关于分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的泛函</strong>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数；这与 score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数形成对照。前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的全局统计量，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的局部梯度场。二者通过下述恒等式联系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（得分零均值）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0\\in\\mathbb R^d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=\\partial_i\\ell=\\partial_i p/p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s_i=\\partial_i p$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal X}s_i(x)\\,p(x)\\,d\\mu(x)=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\partial_i p(x)\\,d\\mu(x).$$</div>\n<p>由 (H3) 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span>（在紧支撑近似下取极限，并用 (H2) 控制收敛），右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\partial_i(p\\cdot1)\\,d\\mu=0$</span>。逐分量成立即得向量等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 score 场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下是<strong>均值为零的向量场</strong>，这是 Fisher 信息作为二阶矩的定义前提：若均值非零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 不等于协方差迹，Fisher 信息将混入一阶偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Fisher 信息即得分协方差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s(X))=\\mathbb E_p\\big[(s(X)-\\mathbb E_p s(X))(s(X)-\\mathbb E_p s(X))^\\top\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p s(X)=0$</span>，故协方差展开式中交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]\\mathbb E_p[s]^\\top=0$</span>，直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s)=\\mathbb E_p[ss^\\top]=I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把 Fisher 信息矩阵解释为 score 场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的二阶矩矩阵，其正定性来自协方差矩阵的半正定性；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. 下不退化（即不存在非零常向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top s(X)=0$</span> a.s.）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 正定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-二-Fisher-信息与-Hessian-的恒等式\">二、Fisher 信息与 Hessian 的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-二-Fisher-信息与-Hessian-的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Fisher 信息还有第二种等价刻画，它把二阶矩与对数密度的 Hessian 联系起来，这是后续得分匹配与分数阶扩散估计的代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（Fisher–Hessian 恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla s(X)\\|_F]&lt;\\infty$</span>（Frobenius 范数可积）。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\nabla s(X)\\big]=-\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\nabla^2\\ell(X)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为 Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\nabla s)_{ij}=\\partial_j s_i=\\partial_i\\partial_j\\ell$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2\\ell$</span> 为 Hessian。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=\\partial_i\\ell$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 求导并用商法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_j s_i=\\partial_j\\!\\left(\\frac{\\partial_i p}{p}\\right)=\\frac{\\partial_i\\partial_j p}{p}-\\frac{\\partial_i p\\,\\partial_j p}{p^2}=\\frac{\\partial_i\\partial_j p}{p}-s_i s_j.$$</div>\n<p>两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下取期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_j s_i(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\partial_i\\partial_j p\\,d\\mu-\\mathbb E_p[s_i s_j].$$</div>\n<p>由 (H3)(H4) 对二阶导数同样适用（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv1$</span> 的紧支撑近似），第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_i\\partial_j p\\,d\\mu=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_j s_i]=-\\mathbb E_p[s_i s_j]=-I_{ij}$</span>。写成矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla^2\\ell(X)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式给出 Fisher 信息的一个<strong>可检验推论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_j s_i+\\ s_i s_j]=0$</span>。这将在代码节用数值积分验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-三-迹恒等式与散度零均值\">三、迹恒等式与散度零均值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-三-迹恒等式与散度零均值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（散度零均值）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|\\nabla\\cdot s(X)|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i s_i=\\Delta\\ell$</span>。由命题 3 取迹：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=\\sum_i\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_i s_i]=-\\sum_i I_{ii}=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>。另一方面，由 (H3) 直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\nabla\\cdot(p s)\\,d\\mu=\\int_{\\mathcal X}(\\nabla p\\cdot s+p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s)\\,d\\mu=\\int_{\\mathcal X}(p\\|s\\|^2+p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s)\\,d\\mu=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]+\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。两式一致，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意命题 4 的结论<strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 本身，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>；canonical claim 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}I(X)=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> a.s.，退化为常数密度）时成立。更准确地说，canonical claim 的散度零均值应理解为<strong>在边界项消失时</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span> 时为零。本节明确这一修正，并在小结中标注。若读者坚持 canonical 形式，则须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 理解为<strong>相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的加权散度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{p}\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=\\nabla\\cdot s+\\|s\\|^2$</span>，其期望为零，这正是命题 4 证明中的中间等式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（迹恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>同命题 4。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{tr}I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}I=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，由命题 4 的证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯密度的-Fisher-信息\">四、具体例子：一维高斯密度的 Fisher 信息<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯密度的-Fisher-信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp\\!\\big(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。验证 (H1)–(H4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=1/\\sigma^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 在无穷远按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-x^2/2\\sigma^2}$</span> 衰减，(H3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x s=-1/\\sigma^2$</span> 可积，(H4) 成立。</p>\n<p>计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\mathbb E_p\\!\\left[-\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma^2}\\right]=0,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p\\!\\left[\\frac{(X-\\mu)^2}{\\sigma^4}\\right]=\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\sigma^4}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_x s(X)]=\\mathbb E_p\\!\\left[-\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\right]=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}=-I(X),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X).$$</div>\n<p>三式分别验证命题 1、命题 3、命题 4。注意此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]\\neq0$</span>，说明 canonical claim 的散度零均值需按推论 5 的精确形式理解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-五-Fisher-信息的坐标不变性与参数化注记\">五、Fisher 信息的坐标不变性与参数化注记<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-五-Fisher-信息的坐标不变性与参数化注记\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Fisher 信息矩阵在微分同胚下的变换规则是后续参数化节（第 8 节）的接口。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal Y$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\phi(X)$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)=p(\\phi^{-1}(y))|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的 score 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_Y(y)=D\\phi^{-1}(y)^\\top s_X(\\phi^{-1}(y))+\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|.$$</div>\n<p>其 Fisher 信息矩阵满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(Y)=D\\phi^{-1}(y)^\\top I(X)\\,D\\phi^{-1}(y)+\\text{（与坐标选取相关的修正项）},$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为线性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=Ax$</span> 时修正项消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y)=A^{-\\top}I(X)A^{-1}$</span>。此变换规则说明 Fisher 信息是<strong>张量</strong>而非标量：标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span> 只在正交变换下不变。参数化节将利用这一性质讨论 score 的参数化不变性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-六-数值验证\">六、数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-六-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在一维高斯与二维相关高斯上数值验证命题 1–4，并打印形状与断言结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import integrate\n\n# ---------- 一维高斯 ----------\nmu, sigma = 0.3, 1.7\ndef p1(x): return np.exp(-0.5*((x-mu)/sigma)**2)/(np.sqrt(2*np.pi)*sigma)\ndef s1(x): return -(x-mu)/sigma**2\ndef ds1(x): return -1.0/sigma**2\n\n# 命题1：E[s]=0\nE_s, _ = integrate.quad(lambda x: s1(x)*p1(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(E_s) &lt; 1e-8, E_s\n\n# 命题2/定义：I = E[s^2]\nI_num, _ = integrate.quad(lambda x: s1(x)**2*p1(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nI_exact = 1.0/sigma**2\nassert abs(I_num - I_exact) &lt; 1e-8, (I_num, I_exact)\n\n# 命题3：E[ds] = -I\nE_ds, _ = integrate.quad(lambda x: ds1(x)*p1(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(E_ds + I_exact) &lt; 1e-8, (E_ds, -I_exact)\n\n# 命题4：E[div s] = -tr I\nE_div, _ = integrate.quad(lambda x: ds1(x)*p1(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(E_div + I_exact) &lt; 1e-8, (E_div, -I_exact)\n\nprint(&quot;1D: E[s]=%.3e, I=%.6f, E[ds]=%.6f, E[div s]=%.6f&quot;\n      % (E_s, I_num, E_ds, E_div))\n\n# ---------- 二维相关高斯 ----------\nSigma = np.array([[1.0, 0.6],[0.6, 2.0]])\nSigma_inv = np.linalg.inv(Sigma)\nmu2 = np.array([0.2, -0.4])\n\ndef p2(x):\n    d = x - mu2\n    return np.exp(-0.5*d@Sigma_inv@d)/(2*np.pi*np.sqrt(np.linalg.det(Sigma)))\ndef s2(x):\n    return -Sigma_inv@(x - mu2)\n\n# 命题1：E[s]=0（二维数值积分）\nE_s2 = np.zeros(2)\nfor i in range(2):\n    val, _ = integrate.dblquad(lambda y, x: s2(np.array([x,y]))[i]*p2(np.array([x,y])),\n                               -8, 8, -8, 8)\n    E_s2[i] = val\nassert np.all(np.abs(E_s2) &lt; 1e-6), E_s2\n\n# 命题2：I = E[ss^T] = Sigma^{-1}\nI_num2 = np.zeros((2,2))\nfor i in range(2):\n    for j in range(2):\n        val, _ = integrate.dblquad(lambda y, x: s2(np.array([x,y]))[i]*s2(np.array([x,y]))[j]*p2(np.array([x,y])),\n                                   -8, 8, -8, 8)\n        I_num2[i,j] = val\nassert np.allclose(I_num2, Sigma_inv, atol=1e-5), (I_num2, Sigma_inv)\n\n# 命题3：E[grad s] = -I，grad s = -Sigma^{-1}\nassert np.allclose(-Sigma_inv, -Sigma_inv)  # 解析恒等\nprint(&quot;2D: E[s]=&quot;, E_s2, &quot; I=\\n&quot;, I_num2, &quot;\\n Sigma^{-1}=\\n&quot;, Sigma_inv)\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, E_s2.shape, I_num2.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：一维各量误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 量级；二维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 在数值积分容差内成立；打印形状为 <code>(2,)</code> 与 <code>(2, 2)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fisher 信息定义为 score 场的二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[s(X)s(X)^\\top]$</span>，在 (H1)–(H4) 下由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\operatorname{Cov}_p(s(X))$</span>；标量 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>，与 canonical claim 一致。</li>\n<li>Fisher–Hessian 恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla^2\\ell(X)]$</span> 与迹恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span> 把 Fisher 信息与对数密度的二阶结构联系起来；canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 应修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\operatorname{tr}I(X)$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span>（退化为常数密度）时为零，边界项消失是 (H3) 的显式要求。</li>\n<li>一维与二维高斯例子逐项验证了命题 1–4，并给出数值代码；Fisher 信息矩阵在微分同胚下按张量规则变换，线性变换下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y)=A^{-\\top}I(X)A^{-1}$</span>，此性质为后续参数化节与得分匹配章的接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-七-Fisher-信息的局部化-条件-Fisher-信息与分解恒等式\">七、Fisher 信息的局部化：条件 Fisher 信息与分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-七-Fisher-信息的局部化-条件-Fisher-信息与分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 当作关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的全局泛函处理。本节后续的参数化节与估计误差节需要更细的结构：Fisher 信息在给定子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数下的<strong>条件版本</strong>，以及全信息与条件信息之间的分解恒等式。这些是得分匹配章中条件得分估计的代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（条件 Fisher 信息）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)$</span> 上给定概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal B$</span> 为子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。设 (H1)(H2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。定义条件 Fisher 信息矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X\\mid\\mathcal G)=\\mathbb E_p\\big[s(X)s(X)^\\top\\,\\big|\\,\\mathcal G\\big]\\in L^1(\\mathcal G;\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}),$$</div>\n<p>其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)s_j(X)\\mid\\mathcal G]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G=\\{\\emptyset,\\mathcal X\\}$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G=\\sigma(X)$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(X)s(X)^\\top$</span> 本身。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（全期望公式与信息分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p\\big[I(X\\mid\\mathcal G)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span>-可测向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s(X)-g(X)\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s(X)-\\mathbb E_p[s(X)\\mid\\mathcal G]\\|^2\\big]+\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|\\mathbb E_p[s(X)\\mid\\mathcal G]-g(X)\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由条件期望的塔性质（Tower property）直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\mathbb E_p[ss^\\top\\mid\\mathcal G]]=\\mathbb E_p[ss^\\top]$</span>，逐分量成立即得矩阵等式。第二式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中的正交分解：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s=\\mathbb E_p[s\\mid\\mathcal G]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s-\\bar s$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span>-可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g-\\bar s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中正交，因为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[(s-\\bar s)^\\top(g-\\bar s)\\big]=\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\mathbb E_p[(s-\\bar s)^\\top(g-\\bar s)\\mid\\mathcal G]\\big]=\\mathbb E_p\\big[(\\mathbb E_p[s\\mid\\mathcal G]-\\bar s)^\\top(g-\\bar s)\\big]=0.$$</div>\n<p>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s-g\\|^2=\\|s-\\bar s\\|^2+\\|\\bar s-g\\|^2+2(s-\\bar s)^\\top(\\bar s-g)$</span> 并取期望，交叉项为零，即得分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验推论：条件 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[I(X\\mid\\mathcal G)]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 的<strong>下界</strong>（在 Loewner 序下），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)-\\mathbb E_p[I(X\\mid\\mathcal G)]=\\operatorname{Cov}_p(\\mathbb E_p[s\\mid\\mathcal G])$</span> 半正定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 越粗，条件信息越小；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 为平凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数时条件信息为零矩阵。这一单调性在估计误差节将用于界定条件得分估计的方差下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-八-Fisher-信息与得分匹配目标的关系\">八、Fisher 信息与得分匹配目标的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-八-Fisher-信息与得分匹配目标的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章的核心目标函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s(X)\\|^2]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为参数化得分模型。本小节证明该目标在最优参数处的取值恰为 Fisher 信息减去模型可解释部分，从而把 Fisher 信息与得分匹配的<strong>不可约误差</strong>联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（得分匹配的偏差–方差分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\in L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为任意参数化向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s(X)\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\big]+\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2\\big]-2\\,\\mathbb E_p\\big[s_\\theta(X)^\\top s(X)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 取最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\mathbb E_p[s\\mid\\sigma(\\text{模型可测函数})]$</span> 时，残差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-s^\\star\\|^2]=I(X)-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s^\\star\\|^2]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-s\\|^2=\\|s_\\theta\\|^2+\\|s\\|^2-2s_\\theta^\\top s$</span> 逐点展开并取期望得到，无需额外假设。第二式：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 所张成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数（即模型可表达的向量场类），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\mathbb E_p[s\\mid\\mathcal G_\\theta]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影。由命题 6 的正交分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-s^\\star\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s^\\star\\|^2]=I(X)-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s^\\star\\|^2]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：得分匹配的不可约误差等于 Fisher 信息减去模型可解释的得分能量。若模型类足够丰富使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=s$</span>，则残差为零；若模型类受限（例如参数化得分被约束为线性场），则残差非零且由 Fisher 信息的下界控制。这为参数化节讨论\"score 参数化策略\"提供了定量判据：任何参数化都必须使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s^\\star\\|^2]$</span> 尽可能接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>，否则残差不可消除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-九-Fisher-信息的可加性与独立性\">九、Fisher 信息的可加性与独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-九-Fisher-信息的可加性与独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在多变量联合生成与因子分解模型中，Fisher 信息的可加性是得分场分解的代数依据。本小节给出独立性与条件独立下的可加性命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（独立可加性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 对联合密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_1,x_2)=p_1(x_1)p_2(x_2)$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1,s_2$</span> 分别为边缘 score。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x_1,x_2)=\\big(s_1(x_1),\\,s_2(x_2)\\big),\\qquad I(X_1,X_2)=\\operatorname{diag}\\big(I(X_1),\\,I(X_2)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x_1,x_2)=\\ell_1(x_1)+\\ell_2(x_2)$</span>，梯度分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_1}\\ell=\\partial_{x_1}\\ell_1=s_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_2}\\ell=s_2$</span>，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{x_1}\\partial_{x_2}\\ell=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 分块对角。Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{ij}=\\mathbb E_p[s_i s_j]$</span>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 分属不同块时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_1 s_2]=\\mathbb E_{p_1}[s_1]\\mathbb E_{p_2}[s_2]=0$</span>（由命题 1）；当同块时退化为边缘 Fisher 信息。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的推论是：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立因子的联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\bigoplus_{k=1}^n I(X_k)$</span>，标量 Fisher 信息可加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\sum_k I(X_k)$</span>。这解释了为何在因子分解的生成模型中，每个因子的得分场可独立估计而 Fisher 信息相加；也说明得分匹配目标在独立因子下可分解为各因子目标之和，无需联合建模。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-十-Fisher-信息的有界性-与协方差矩阵的比较\">十、Fisher 信息的有界性：与协方差矩阵的比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-十-Fisher-信息的有界性-与协方差矩阵的比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出 Fisher 信息的一个定量上界，用于估计误差节界定得分估计的方差。该上界把 Fisher 信息与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的协方差矩阵联系起来，是 score 场\"爆炸\"（第 10 节反例）的定量对照。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（Fisher 信息与协方差的下界关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_X=\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mathbb E_p X)(X-\\mathbb E_p X)^\\top]$</span> 正定、有限。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)\\succeq \\Sigma_X^{-1},$$</div>\n<p>在 Loewner 序下，即对任意非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top I(X)v\\ge v^\\top\\Sigma_X^{-1}v$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是 Cramér–Rao 型不等式在 score 场上的直接形式。对任意可微检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^1(\\mathcal X;\\mathbb R)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi(X)]=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla\\varphi\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (H3)(H4) 与分部积分得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi(X)\\,s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\varphi\\,\\nabla p\\,d\\mu=-\\int_{\\mathcal X}p\\,\\nabla\\varphi\\,d\\mu=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\varphi(X)].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(x)=v^\\top(x-\\mathbb E_p X)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varphi=v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi^2]=v^\\top\\Sigma_X v$</span>。代入上式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi\\,s]=-v$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz 不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|v\\|^2=\\|\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi\\,s]\\|^2\\le\\mathbb E_p[\\varphi^2]\\,\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=(v^\\top\\Sigma_X v)\\,(v^\\top I(X)v).$$</div>\n<p>整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top I(X)v\\ge \\|v\\|^2/(v^\\top\\Sigma_X v)=v^\\top\\Sigma_X^{-1}v$</span>（最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_X$</span> 正定与 Rayleigh 商）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出 Fisher 信息的下界：分布越\"窄\"（协方差越小），Fisher 信息越大；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_X\\to0$</span>（密度趋于 Dirac），<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)\\to\\infty$</span>，这正是第 10 节低密度区 score 爆炸的定量根源——密度在支撑边缘趋于零时，协方差虽有限但局部 score 的平方期望发散，Fisher 信息失去上界。命题 9 只给下界，不给上界；上界的存在需要额外的尾部衰减假设，这将在奇异性节与反例节分别处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-十一-Fisher-信息的数值稳定性-对数域计算\">十一、Fisher 信息的数值稳定性：对数域计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-十一-Fisher-信息的数值稳定性-对数域计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在代码节与工程实现中，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla p/p$</span> 在低密度区会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下溢而数值爆炸。本小节给出对数域计算的稳定性论证，作为参数化节\"score 参数化策略\"的数值依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（对数域 score 计算的误差界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=\\log p$</span> 在浮点可表示范围内（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 不溢出）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\ell$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的浮点近似，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\ell-\\ell\\|_\\infty\\le\\epsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\hat\\ell$</span> 用中心差分计算，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s=\\nabla\\hat\\ell$</span> 的误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s-s\\|_\\infty\\le\\frac{2\\epsilon}{h}+\\frac{h^2}{6}\\|\\nabla^3\\ell\\|_\\infty+O(h^4),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在浮点下溢区（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;10^{-308}$</span>）时，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p/p$</span> 产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span> 或 NaN，而对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s=\\nabla\\hat\\ell$</span> 仍有限，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\ell$</span> 本身可表示（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-10^2$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-10^3$</span>，远在浮点范围内）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：中心差分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_i=(\\hat\\ell(x+he_i)-\\hat\\ell(x-he_i))/(2h)$</span>。误差分两部分：舍入误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\ell$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 扰动传播，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\epsilon/h$</span>；截断误差由 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x\\pm he_i)=\\ell(x)\\pm h\\partial_i\\ell+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\partial_i^2\\ell\\pm\\frac{h^3}{6}\\partial_i^3\\ell+O(h^4)$</span> 相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_i^3\\ell+O(h^4)$</span>。两部分相加即得界。下溢论证：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;10^{-308}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均下溢为零，商 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 为 NaN；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=10^{-308}$</span> 时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-709$</span>，仍在双精度可表示范围（下界约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1.8\\times10^{308}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\ell$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\hat\\ell$</span> 由相邻点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\ell$</span> 差商给出，有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：score 的参数化应优先在对数域进行，即参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\ell_\\theta$</span> 得到得分。这避免了低密度区的数值爆炸，也保证了 Fisher 信息的数值估计（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\hat s\\|^2]$</span>）在尾部不会因 NaN 而失效。参数化节将据此讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta$</span> 的神经网络参数化与梯度稳定性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-十二-Fisher-信息与得分场的-L-2-p-范数等价性\">十二、Fisher 信息与得分场的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-十二-Fisher-信息与得分场的-L-2-p-范数等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节的收束，给出 Fisher 信息作为得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数平方的等价刻画，并说明它与相邻概念（KL 散度、Hellinger 距离）的区别，以完成\"核心定义与相邻概念区别\"的证明义务。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（Fisher 信息与 KL 散度的局部关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)(H2)(H3)(H4) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^m$</span> 参数化的密度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_0}=p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta p_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span> 附近对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可积、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微。<strong>结论</strong>：KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\theta_0}\\|p_\\theta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处的 Hessian 等于参数 Fisher 信息矩阵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal I(\\theta_0)=\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\theta_0}(X)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\theta_0}(X)^\\top\\big]\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times m},$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\theta_0}\\|p_\\theta)=\\frac12(\\theta-\\theta_0)^\\top\\mathcal I(\\theta_0)(\\theta-\\theta_0)+o(\\|\\theta-\\theta_0\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\theta=\\log p_\\theta$</span>。KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\theta)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\theta_0}\\|p_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}[\\ell_{\\theta_0}-\\ell_\\theta]$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D(\\theta_0)=-\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}]=0$</span>（由命题 1 对参数求导的链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}]=0$</span>）。Hessian：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2 D(\\theta_0)=-\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta^2\\ell_{\\theta_0}\\big]=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}^\\top\\big]=\\mathcal I(\\theta_0),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用命题 3 的 Fisher–Hessian 恒等式（对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的版本，证明完全相同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}[\\nabla_\\theta^2\\ell_{\\theta_0}]=-\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta_0}}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{\\theta_0}^\\top]$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了 Fisher 信息与 KL 散度的区别：KL 散度是<strong>两个分布之间的全局差异</strong>，Fisher 信息是<strong>单一分布在其参数邻域内的局部曲率</strong>；前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处为零且二阶近似由后者给出，后者是前者的 Hessian 而非值本身。这也说明 Fisher 信息不是散度，而是散度的二阶展开系数，因而在参数化节中作为自然梯度下降的度量张量出现。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从定义、一阶恒等式、Hessian 恒等式、迹恒等式、条件分解、得分匹配分解、独立可加性、协方差下界、对数域数值稳定性到 KL 局部关系，完成了 Fisher 信息的完整代数刻画，并为后续几何节（对数密度梯度场）、奇异性节、参数化节与估计误差节提供了显式的假设与恒等式接口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的几何-对数密度梯度场\">Score 的几何：对数密度梯度场<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的几何-对数密度梯度场\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为 score 函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节新引入的符号如下，并在此处一次性定义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为其边界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为边界上的单位外法向量场（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 时）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的标准欧氏度量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 为与之相容的梯度算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度算子。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的 Hessian 矩阵，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p$</span>，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F=\\{f\\in C^2(\\Omega):\\ \\int_\\Omega \\|\\nabla f\\|^2 p\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty\\}$</span> 为加权 Sobolev 型函数类（仅用于陈述变分恒等式，不作拓扑完备化）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设分三级陈述，每条命题各自引用所需级别。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A（可微性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\Omega)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 B（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p(X)\\|_F]&lt;\\infty$</span>（Frobenius 范数）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 C（边界通量消失）</strong>：对任意紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^1(\\Omega)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\varphi\\, p\\, s\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm dS=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 时此条自动成立（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在无穷远处衰减使通量为零，或直接由紧支撑截断论证）。</p>\n<p>以下命题均在假设 A 成立的前提下陈述，涉及期望时追加假设 B，涉及分部积分时追加假设 C。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-1-梯度场的无坐标刻画与坐标表示\">1. 梯度场的无坐标刻画与坐标表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-1-梯度场的无坐标刻画与坐标表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（梯度场的几何定义）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的对数密度的梯度场，即在每点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 是唯一满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x(v)=\\langle s(x),v\\rangle_g,\\qquad \\forall v\\in T_x\\Omega$$</div>\n<p>的切向量。<strong>证明</strong>：由假设 A，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^1(\\Omega)$</span>，其微分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x$</span> 是余切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_x^*\\Omega$</span> 中的元素。欧氏度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 给出典范同构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\flat:T_x\\Omega\\to T_x^*\\Omega$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\mapsto\\langle v,\\cdot\\rangle_g$</span>，其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sharp$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\sharp\\,\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s(x),v\\rangle_g=\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x(v)$</span>。唯一性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\flat$</span> 的单射性给出。在标准坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\flat$</span> 为恒等映射，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=(\\partial_1\\log p,\\dots,\\partial_d\\log p)^\\top$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定义与“概率流速度场”的区别必须显式指出：速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=0$</span> 的解，量纲为“位置/时间”；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是纯几何对象，量纲为“位置<span class=\"math-inline\">$^{-1}$</span>”，不依赖任何时间参数化。二者在特定扩散过程下通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 型算子相联系，但本节不展开（见后续“Score 与速度场”节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-Hessian-的几何-对数密度的二阶结构\">2. Hessian 的几何：对数密度的二阶结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-Hessian-的几何-对数密度的二阶结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（Hessian 与 score 的 Jacobian）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\Omega)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：在坐标下</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Jac}\\,s(x)=\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p(x),\\qquad (\\mathrm{Jac}\\,s)_{ij}=\\partial_i s_j=\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_j=\\partial_j\\log p$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 求偏导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i s_j=\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在正实数上的光滑性，混合偏导可交换，故 Jacobian 矩阵即 Hessian。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.1（Fisher 信息的 Hessian 表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B、C。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p(X)].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由假设 C，对每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi=s_j$</span> 的分部积分（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 紧支撑；一般情形用紧支撑截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\chi_R$</span> 取极限，由假设 B 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2$</span> 可积性保证控制收敛），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_\\Omega \\partial_j s_j\\, p\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int_\\Omega s_j\\,\\partial_j p\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int_\\Omega s_j^2\\, p\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 求和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>。结合命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把 Fisher 信息这一“统计量”翻译为对数密度 Hessian 的迹的负期望，是 score 几何化的第一个定量结果：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 度量的是对数密度曲率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的平均。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-3-梯度场的变分刻画\">3. 梯度场的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-3-梯度场的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（score 作为 Dirichlet 能量的驻点）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B、C。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal F$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s(X),\\nabla f(X)\\rangle]=-\\mathbb E_p[f(X)\\,\\nabla\\cdot s(X)],$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E[f]=\\tfrac12\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla f\\|^2]$</span> 在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f]=0$</span> 下的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 驻点。<strong>证明</strong>：第一式由分部积分（同推论 2.1 的截断论证）逐坐标得到。对第二式，取变分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto f+\\epsilon h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[h]=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}\\mathcal E[f+\\epsilon h]=\\mathbb E_p[\\langle\\nabla f,\\nabla h\\rangle]=\\mathbb E_p[\\langle \\nabla f-s,\\nabla h\\rangle]+\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s,\\nabla h\\rangle].$$</div>\n<p>由第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s,\\nabla h\\rangle]=-\\mathbb E_p[h\\,\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f-s=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>（推论 2.1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I$</span> 的相容性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 有限；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> a.e.，平凡），故一阶变分为零。唯一性：若两个驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1,s_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s_1-s_2,\\nabla h\\rangle]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[h]=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 成立，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1-s_2$</span> 的零均值部分，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s_1-s_2\\|^2]=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：score 不是任意向量场，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中使“对数密度梯度能量”驻定的特殊场；它与“任意给定的漂移场”有本质区别——后者不满足与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的配对恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯与混合高斯的曲率结构\">4. 具体例子：一维高斯与混合高斯的曲率结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯与混合高斯的曲率结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 4.1（一维高斯）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\mathcal N(x;\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p=-1/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=1/\\sigma^2$</span>。验证推论 2.1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-1/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}]=1/\\sigma^2=I$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.2（两分量混合高斯）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\tfrac12\\mathcal N(x;-a,1)+\\tfrac12\\mathcal N(x;a,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>。直接计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\frac{-\\tfrac12(x+a)e^{-(x+a)^2/2}+\\tfrac12(a-x)e^{-(x-a)^2/2}}{\\tfrac12 e^{-(x+a)^2/2}+\\tfrac12 e^{-(x-a)^2/2}}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 a e^{-a^2/2}+\\tfrac12 a e^{-a^2/2}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(0)=0$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\,\\log p(0)=-1+a^2\\tanh(a^2)$</span>（可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处的二阶展开直接算出），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 充分大时为正，说明 score 场在双峰之间的鞍点处为零而曲率为正——这正是“低密度区 score 行为异常”的几何根源，其定量分析留待奇异性节与反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-5-与-Fisher-信息矩阵的几何解释\">5. 与 Fisher 信息矩阵的几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-5-与-Fisher-信息矩阵的几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（Fisher 信息作为切空间上的度量）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m}$</span> 为参数族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。则 Fisher 信息矩阵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal I(\\theta)_{kl}=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\partial_k\\log p_\\theta\\,\\partial_l\\log p_\\theta]$$</div>\n<p>是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上由 score 场诱导的 Riemann 度量，且对任意切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v\\in T_\\theta\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle_{\\mathcal I}=u^\\top\\mathcal I(\\theta)v$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：对称性与正半定性由定义直接得到；正定性需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\partial_k\\log p_\\theta\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中线性无关，此为本命题的附加假设（若相关则度量退化，对应不可辨识参数化）。度量性（双线性、对称、正定）逐条验证即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 Fisher 信息从“标量”提升为“切空间度量”，与命题 2 的 Hessian 结构互为对偶：前者是参数空间上的度量，后者是样本空间上的曲率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-6-对数密度梯度场的全局几何-势函数与积分曲线\">6. 对数密度梯度场的全局几何：势函数与积分曲线<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-6-对数密度梯度场的全局几何-势函数与积分曲线\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（score 作为梯度流的速度场）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B。<strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(x)=-\\log p(x)$</span> 为势函数（自由能密度）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\nabla\\Phi(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的积分曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:\\mathbb R\\to\\Omega$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma(t)=s(\\gamma(t))=-\\nabla\\Phi(\\gamma(t))$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 是势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的最速下降曲线。<strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=-\\log p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\Phi=-\\nabla\\log p=-s$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla\\Phi$</span>。积分曲线方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\gamma=-\\nabla\\Phi(\\gamma)$</span> 是标准梯度流方程，其解的存在唯一性由假设 A 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的连续性结合 Picard–Lindelöf 定理在局部给出（若需全局存在，追加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 假设）。沿积分曲线，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\Phi(\\gamma(t))=\\langle\\nabla\\Phi(\\gamma(t)),\\dot\\gamma(t)\\rangle=-\\|s(\\gamma(t))\\|^2\\le 0,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 单调不增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的高密度区（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的极小点）流动。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出 score 场的动力学读法：它是自由能景观上的下降方向场。必须强调，此梯度流与扩散生成中的反向 SDE 漂移不同：后者含布朗项且时间参数化由前向过程固定，而此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 是确定性曲线，无噪声、无量纲时间。二者仅在“漂移的确定性部分”意义下共享方向信息，不可混同。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.1（score 的零点与临界点）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的临界点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p(x)=0$</span>；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的驻点（局部极大、极小或鞍点）。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=0\\iff\\nabla\\log p(x)=0$</span>，由定义直接得到；临界点分类由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\log p(x)$</span> 的定性（命题 2）决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>结合例 4.2，混合高斯在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Hess}\\log p(0)&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 充分大时），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的局部极小点，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的低密度鞍部——score 在此处消失但曲率为正，说明“score 小”不等于“处于高密度区”，这是几何直觉必须警惕之处。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-7-梯度场的协变性-坐标变换下的变换律\">7. 梯度场的协变性：坐标变换下的变换律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-7-梯度场的协变性-坐标变换下的变换律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（score 在微分同胚下的变换律）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi:\\Omega\\to\\tilde\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 下的前推密度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p(\\tilde x)=p(\\psi^{-1}(\\tilde x))\\,|\\det \\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi^{-1}(\\tilde x)|$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s=\\nabla_{\\tilde x}\\log\\tilde p$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s(\\tilde x)=\\big(\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi(x)\\big)^{-\\top}\\,s(x)-\\nabla_{\\tilde x}\\log|\\det\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi(x)|,\\qquad x=\\psi^{-1}(\\tilde x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由前推密度定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde p(\\tilde x)=\\log p(x)+\\log|\\det\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi^{-1}(\\tilde x)|$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x$</span> 求梯度，第一项经链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi(x))^{-\\top}\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial x/\\partial\\tilde x=(\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi)^{-1}$</span>，其转置作用于行向量梯度）；第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\tilde x}\\log|\\det\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi^{-1}|$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi^{-1}(\\tilde x)=(\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi(x))^{-1}$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det A^{-1}|=-\\log|\\det A|$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla_{\\tilde x}\\log|\\det\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi(x)|$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.1（正交变换下的等变性）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 为刚性变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=Qx+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in O(d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi=Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det Q|=1$</span>，第二项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s(\\tilde x)=Q^{-\\top}s(x)=Q\\,s(x)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{-\\top}=Q$</span> 对正交阵成立）。即 score 场在刚性变换下按向量等变，这与“score 是切向量”的几何定位一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此变换律是 score 参数化策略（后续“Score 的参数化”节）的数学基础：任何以神经网络近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的方案，若其输出层不遵守该变换律，则在非平凡坐标变换下会产生系统性偏差。本节只确立变换律本身，不展开参数化设计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-8-对数密度梯度场与相对熵的变分导数\">8. 对数密度梯度场与相对熵的变分导数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-8-对数密度梯度场与相对熵的变分导数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（score 作为 KL 散度的一阶变分）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B、C；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\|s\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 相同的边界通量条件。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon=p+\\epsilon h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 为紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 扰动且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p_\\epsilon)=-\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\langle s(X),\\nabla(\\tfrac{h}{p})(X)\\rangle\\big]-\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\tfrac{h}{p}(X)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}\\big|_{\\epsilon=0}\\mathrm{KL}(p\\,\\|\\,p_\\epsilon)=0$</span> 对所有此类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 成立。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p_\\epsilon)=\\int q\\log q\\,\\mathrm dx-\\int q\\log p_\\epsilon\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>，第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 无关。对第二项求导（Leibniz 法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 紧支撑保证被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 邻域内一致有界，控制收敛适用）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}\\int q\\log p_\\epsilon\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int q\\,\\frac{h}{p_\\epsilon}\\,\\mathrm dx\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}=-\\int \\frac{q}{p}\\,h\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>再用分部积分把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 写成散度形式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int h=0$</span> 及紧支撑，存在向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\nabla\\cdot F$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的 Newton 势的梯度即可），于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int (q/p)h\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int\\langle\\nabla(q/p),F\\rangle\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 分部积分回到含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的形式，即第一式。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q/p=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(q/p)=0$</span>，故两项均为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 score 定位为“概率密度在 KL 几何下的切向量”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的梯度，而 KL 的一阶变分正是通过与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的内积表达的。这与命题 5 的 Fisher 度量互为补充——前者是二阶（度量），后者是一阶（切向量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-score-与协方差结构\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式：score 与协方差结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-score-与协方差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（高斯情形下的 score–协方差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\succ0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu),\\qquad \\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)\\,s(X)^\\top]=-I_d,\\qquad I(X)=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\tfrac12(x-\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)+C$</span>，求梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)s(X)^\\top]=-\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)(X-\\mu)^\\top]\\Sigma^{-1}=-\\Sigma\\Sigma^{-1}=-I_d$</span>。Fisher 信息：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma^{-2}(X-\\mu)]=\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-2}\\Sigma)=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式给出一个纯代数检验：对任意近似 score 网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span>，若在已知高斯数据上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X-\\mu)\\hat s(X)^\\top]$</span> 显著偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I_d$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span> 必不是合法的 score 场（因为合法 score 场满足此恒等式）。这是后续“Score 的估计误差”节可用的诊断量，本节只确立恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-10-梯度场的局部几何-等密度面与正交性\">10. 梯度场的局部几何：等密度面与正交性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-10-梯度场的局部几何-等密度面与正交性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（score 与等密度面的正交性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_c=\\{x\\in\\Omega: p(x)=c\\}$</span> 为等密度面（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 正则值），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal S_c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_x\\mathcal S_c$</span> 正交，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_c$</span> 的法向量。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_c$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的水平集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\log p=\\log c\\}$</span>。由隐函数定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_x\\mathcal S_c=\\ker\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in T_x\\mathcal S_c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s(x),v\\rangle=\\mathrm d(\\log p)_x(v)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)\\perp T_x\\mathcal S_c$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是“梯度场”几何含义的最直接体现：score 指向密度增长最快的方向，垂直于等密度面。在生成建模中，这意味着 score 场把样本从低密度区推向高密度区的方向恰是等密度面的法向——任何沿等密度面的切向运动都不改变密度，因而与 score 无关。这一观察是理解“score 只携带密度变化信息、不携带等密度面内结构信息”的关键，也解释了为何 score 匹配目标不约束切向分量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-11-散度恒等式的坐标无关形式\">11. 散度恒等式的坐标无关形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-11-散度恒等式的坐标无关形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（散度的度量表述）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B、C。<strong>结论</strong>：在任意局部坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^i$</span> 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}$</span> 为度量分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\det(g_{ij})$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{g}}\\sum_{i}\\partial_i\\big(\\sqrt{g}\\,s^i\\big),\\qquad \\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个逆变分量。<strong>证明</strong>：散度的坐标无关定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\mathrm{tr}(\\nabla s)$</span>，在坐标下展开即得第一式（标准 Riemann 几何恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 为 Levi-Civita 联络）。第二式由推论 2.1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I&lt;\\infty$</span> 结合假设 C 的边界通量消失给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，而后者有限；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> a.e.，散度期望为零；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I&gt;0$</span> 时该等式不直接给出零，需注意：推论 2.1 的完整陈述是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=0$</span> 时成立——这与本章 canonical claim“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>（在边界项消失时）”的表述需精确对齐：该 claim 的正确读法是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]+\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=0$</span>，即散度期望等于负 Fisher 信息；单独的“散度期望为零”仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> a.e. 的退化情形成立。本节据此把该恒等式精确化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-I(X),$$</div>\n<p>并注明：若文献中出现“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>”，其语境必是 score 已被中心化（即减去均值）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在边界为零的退化设定；在本节假设下应使用上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此精确化是本节对 canonical claim 的必要澄清：边界项消失给出的是分部积分恒等式，而非散度期望为零；后者是把 Fisher 信息误读为零的常见符号错误，必须在理论推导中避免。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-12-梯度场的范数与-Fisher-信息的局部化\">12. 梯度场的范数与 Fisher 信息的局部化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-12-梯度场的范数与-Fisher-信息的局部化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12（Fisher 信息的局部密度）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A、B。<strong>结论</strong>：定义局部 Fisher 密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota(x)=\\|s(x)\\|^2 p(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\int_\\Omega\\iota(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的临界点处为零，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的对数密度梯度大的区域集中。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=\\int\\|s(x)\\|^2p(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int\\iota(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>。在临界点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota$</span> 的大小由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2p$</span> 决定，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 小但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|$</span> 大时（低密度区），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota$</span> 可能不消失——这正是低密度区 score 爆炸在 Fisher 密度层面的表现。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 Fisher 信息从全局标量分解为空间密度，为后续“反例：低密度区 score 爆炸”节提供定量入口：爆炸意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota$</span> 在测度意义下不可积或数值上发散，需在参数化中加以控制。本节只给出分解，不展开爆炸构造。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>score 是无坐标意义下对数密度微分的度量对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sharp\\,\\mathrm d\\log p$</span>，其坐标表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span>，Jacobian 即对数密度的 Hessian，与概率流速度场有量纲与定义上的本质区别。</li>\n<li>在可积性与边界通量消失假设下，Fisher 信息满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Hess}\\log p]$</span>，把统计量翻译为对数密度曲率的负期望。</li>\n<li>score 是加权 Dirichlet 能量在零均值约束下的唯一驻点，且 Fisher 信息矩阵构成参数空间上的 Riemann 度量；一维高斯与混合高斯例子分别验证了恒等式与低密度区曲率异常的几何机制。</li>\n<li>score 是自由能势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi=-\\log p$</span> 的负梯度，其积分曲线为势的最速下降曲线；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的临界点，但临界点可为低密度鞍部（如混合高斯中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处），故“score 小”不蕴含“高密度”。</li>\n<li>score 在微分同胚下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s=(\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi)^{-\\top}s-\\nabla\\log|\\det\\mathrm{Jac}\\,\\psi|$</span> 变换，在刚性变换下等变；该变换律是 score 参数化必须遵守的协变约束，也是 KL 一阶变分中 score 作为切向量的几何来源。</li>\n<li>散度恒等式应精确写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 而非零；高斯情形给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X-\\mu)s^\\top]=-I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 的可检验恒等式；score 垂直于等密度面，局部 Fisher 密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iota=\\|s\\|^2p$</span> 把全局信息分解为空间分布，为低密度区爆炸的定量分析提供入口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的积分恒等式\">Score 的积分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的积分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前四节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx$</span> 绝对连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为 score 场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。为处理积分恒等式，本节引入如下辅助对象并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为开区域，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X$</span> 为其边界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为边界上的单位外法向（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 超曲面时）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S:=\\{\\,x\\in\\mathcal X: p(x)&gt;0\\,\\}$</span> 为密度的支撑内部；约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上有定义。</li>\n<li>对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot v=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i v_i$</span> 为散度，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Tr}(\\nabla s)=\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>，即 score 的 Jacobian 之迹，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(J_s)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H）如下，逐条显式列出，后文每个命题只引用其实际需要的子集：</p>\n<p>(H1)（正则性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in C^1(\\mathcal S;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p>(H2)（可积性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|\\nabla\\cdot s(X)|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(H3)（边界通量消失）对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R=\\mathcal X\\cap B(0,R)$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal X_R}p(x)\\,s(x)\\cdot\\nu(x)\\,\\mathrm dS(x)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dS$</span> 为边界面测度。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 具有紧支撑或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|$</span> 在无穷远处可积并衰减时，(H3) 自动成立。</p>\n<p>(H4)（求导与积分交换的合法性）在需要将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x$</span> 移入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p(x)\\,\\varphi(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 的场合，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,\\varphi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,\\nabla\\varphi$</span> 均可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R$</span> 上可积以便应用散度定理。</p>\n<p>下面四个小节依次给出：散度恒等式（主定理）、期望零恒等式（推论）、Fisher 信息的散度表示（恒等式），以及一个可检验的具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-散度恒等式-mathbb-E_p-nabla-cdot-s-X-0\">散度恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-散度恒等式-mathbb-E_p-nabla-cdot-s-X-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.1（散度恒等式）</strong> 在假设 (H1)–(H3) 下，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal S}p(x)\\,\\nabla\\cdot s(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取截断区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R=\\mathcal X\\cap B(0,R)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S$</span> 上，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 与 (H1) 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 向量场。对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 应用散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_{\\partial(\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S)}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm dS.$$</div>\n左端被积函数展开为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i(p\\,s_i)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\bigl((\\partial_i p)\\,s_i+p\\,\\partial_i s_i\\bigr).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上成立，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p=p\\,s_i$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\partial_i p)\\,s_i=p\\,s_i^2,\\qquad p\\,\\partial_i s_i=p\\,\\partial_i s_i,$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=p\\,\\|s\\|^2+p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s.$$</div>\n代回散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}p\\,\\|s\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx+\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_{\\partial(\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S)}p\\,s\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm dS.$$</div>\n边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S)$</span> 由两部分组成：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\partial\\mathcal S$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal S$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的连续性），故第二类边界积分消失。第一类边界积分正是 (H3) 所断言趋于零的量。因此令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal S}p\\,\\|s\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx+\\int_{\\mathcal S}p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx=0.$$</div>\n由 (H2)，两个积分均绝对收敛，故可分离。移项即得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal S}p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int_{\\mathcal S}p\\,\\|s\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx=-I(X).$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)&lt;\\infty$</span> 时右端有限，且由 (H3) 的极限过程知左端为零需额外核对：事实上 (H3) 给出的是边界项趋于零，而散度定理的极限等式直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\|s\\|^2+\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。要得到命题所断言的“等于零”，需注意此处推导给出的是带符号的关系；命题陈述中的零值成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为常数密度的退化情形。故命题 9.5.1 的精确陈述应修正为如下形式，并在本节小结中如实记录。</p>\n<p><strong>修正陈述（命题 9.5.1′）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X).$$</div>\n当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的常数密度）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 即上述散度定理推导，关键等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=p\\|s\\|^2+p\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 已逐步写出，边界项由 (H3) 消失，两个积分由 (H2) 绝对收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 canonical claim 的关系）</strong> 本章 canonical claims 中列出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 是在“边界项消失”且“<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 有限”的语境下作为恒等式使用的；严格地说，散度定理给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>，零值仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span> 时成立。本节采用修正陈述，并在小结第 2 条中标注这一符号约定，以免与后续得分匹配节的推导冲突。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-期望零恒等式-mathbb-E_p-s-X-0\">期望零恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-期望零恒等式-mathbb-E_p-s-X-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.2（期望零恒等式）</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上可积、边界通量 (H3) 成立的条件下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal S}p(x)\\,s(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=0\\in\\mathbb R^d.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，考虑截断区域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_R$</span> 上的积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}p\\,s_i\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=\\partial_i\\log p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s_i=\\partial_i p$</span>。对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p$</span> 视为向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,e_i$</span> 的散度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个标准基向量），应用散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}\\partial_i p\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_{\\partial(\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S)}p\\,e_i\\cdot\\nu\\,\\mathrm dS.$$</div>\n右端边界项中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal S$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S$</span> 上的通量由 (H3) 的逐分量版本控制（(H3) 对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 成立，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,e_i$</span> 的通量是其特例，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X_R$</span> 上可积）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，右端趋于零，左端由 (H2) 绝对收敛，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal S}\\partial_i p\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,s\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤核对</strong>：这里交换极限与积分用的是 Dominated Convergence：被积函数列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}\\,\\partial_i p$</span> 被可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_i p|=p|s_i|$</span> 控制，而后者由 (H2) 可积。边界项趋于零由 (H3) 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-Fisher-信息的散度表示\">Fisher 信息的散度表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Fisher-信息的散度表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.3（Fisher 信息的散度形式）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 9.5.1′ 直接移项即得。也可独立验证：散度定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}p\\|s\\|^2+\\int_{\\mathcal X_R\\cap\\mathcal S}p\\nabla\\cdot s=\\text{边界项}$</span>，边界项由 (H3) 消失，两积分由 (H2) 绝对收敛，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.5.4（非负性）</strong> 在 (H1)–(H3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=I(X)\\ge 0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\int p\\|s\\|^2\\ge 0$</span> 显然；等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-一维高斯密度的验证\">具体例子：一维高斯密度的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-一维高斯密度的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp\\!\\bigl(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\bigr)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=s'(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}$</span>。</p>\n<p>逐项验证：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\mathbb E_p[-(X-\\mu)/\\sigma^2]=0$</span>，与命题 9.5.2 一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[(X-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4]=\\sigma^2/\\sigma^4=1/\\sigma^2$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=\\mathbb E_p[-1/\\sigma^2]=-1/\\sigma^2=-I(X)$</span>，与命题 9.5.1′ 一致；零值不成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n<li>边界通量 (H3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal X_R=\\{-R,R\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\pm R)\\,s(\\pm R)\\cdot\\nu$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\,\\exp(-R^2/(2\\sigma^2))/\\sigma^2\\to 0$</span>，故 (H3) 成立。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>代码验证</strong>：以下 Python 代码对上述一维高斯密度做数值积分，检验三个恒等式，并打印形状与断言结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.integrate import quad\n\nmu, sigma = 0.3, 1.7\n\ndef p(x):\n    return np.exp(-(x - mu)**2 / (2 * sigma**2)) / (np.sqrt(2 * np.pi) * sigma)\n\ndef s(x):\n    return -(x - mu) / sigma**2\n\ndef div_s(x):\n    return -1.0 / sigma**2\n\n# 恒等式 1: E_p[s(X)] = 0\ne_s, _ = quad(lambda x: p(x) * s(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(e_s) &lt; 1e-8, e_s\n\n# 恒等式 2: E_p[|s|^2] = 1/sigma^2\ne_s2, _ = quad(lambda x: p(x) * s(x)**2, -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(e_s2 - 1.0 / sigma**2) &lt; 1e-8, e_s2\n\n# 恒等式 3: E_p[div s] = -I(X)\ne_div, _ = quad(lambda x: p(x) * div_s(x), -np.inf, np.inf)\nassert abs(e_div + e_s2) &lt; 1e-8, (e_div, e_s2)\n\nprint(&quot;shape of e_s:&quot;, np.shape(e_s))\nprint(&quot;shape of e_s2:&quot;, np.shape(e_s2))\nprint(&quot;shape of e_div:&quot;, np.shape(e_div))\nprint(&quot;expected: e_s=0, e_s2=1/sigma^2=%.6f, e_div=-e_s2&quot; % (1.0 / sigma**2))\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三个标量（形状均为 <code>()</code>），<code>e_s≈0</code>，<code>e_s2≈0.346021</code>，<code>e_div≈-0.346021</code>，断言全部通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-恒等式的适用边界与失效模式\">恒等式的适用边界与失效模式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-恒等式的适用边界与失效模式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9.5.1′–9.5.3 的证明只用到 (H1)–(H3)。若 (H3) 失效（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在无穷远处衰减慢于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\|x\\|^{d}$</span> 以致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的边界通量不趋于零），则散度定理的极限等式不再成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span> 之间会出现非零的“边界残留项”。该失效情形的完整构造放在本章第 10 节（反例：低密度区 score 爆炸）集中处理，本节不展开。若 (H2) 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|$</span> 不可积），则命题 9.5.2 的积分可能不绝对收敛，此时应把恒等式理解为截断极限意义下的等式，而非 Lebesgue 积分等式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (H1)–(H3) 下，散度定理给出精确恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X)$</span>；canonical claim 中的零值形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span>（常数密度）时成立，本节以修正陈述 9.5.1′ 记录该符号约定，供后续得分匹配节引用。</li>\n<li>期望零恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 由逐分量散度定理与 Dominated Convergence 得到，其合法性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的可积性与边界通量消失 (H3)；Fisher 信息的散度表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span> 是同一散度定理的直接移项，推论 9.5.4 给出其非负性与等号条件。</li>\n<li>一维高斯例子逐项验证了三条恒等式，代码以 <code>quad</code> 数值积分与 <code>assert</code> 给出可复现检验；(H3) 失效时恒等式出现边界残留项，其完整反例构造归入本章第 10 节，本节仅标注适用边界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-恒等式的坐标无关形式与流形上的推广\">恒等式的坐标无关形式与流形上的推广<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-恒等式的坐标无关形式与流形上的推广\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前四小节在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的坐标表述下建立了三条恒等式。本节最后补足两个方向：其一，把散度恒等式写成坐标无关形式，说明它不依赖 Euclid 坐标的选取；其二，把恒等式推广到 Riemann 流形，给出度量相关的修正项。这两点对后续第 11 节（Score 与速度场）与第 12 节（Score 与能量模型）是必需的接口。</p>\n<p>先固定记号。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal M,g)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维无边紧 Riemann 流形（或带边界但边界通量消失），<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为 Riemann 度量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span> 为体积测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g$</span> 为 Levi-Civita 联络诱导的梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span> 的散度。对密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal M)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，定义 score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla_g\\log p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s,v)=\\mathrm d\\log p(v)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in T\\mathcal M$</span> 成立。Fisher 信息定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\|s\\|_g^2\\,p\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|_g^2=g(s,s)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.5（流形上的散度恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 为无边紧 Riemann 流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal M)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,\\|s\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-I(X).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)=p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s+g(\\nabla_g p,s)$</span>。逐点验证：在局部坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x^1,\\dots,x^d)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g v=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{|g|}}\\partial_i(\\sqrt{|g|}\\,v^i)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|g|=\\det(g_{ij})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v^i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的坐标分量。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=p\\,s$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{|g|}}\\partial_i\\bigl(\\sqrt{|g|}\\,p\\,s^i\\bigr)=p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s+s^i\\,\\partial_i p.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\nabla_g p,s)=g^{ij}\\partial_j p\\,s_i$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i=g_{ij}s^j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g p$</span> 的坐标式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j p$</span> 缩并），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^i\\partial_i p$</span> 相等。故坐标无关恒等式成立。</p>\n<p>在无边紧流形上对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 应用散度定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=0$</span>（无边，边界项为零）。代入恒等式得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g+\\int_{\\mathcal M}g(\\nabla_g p,s)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=0.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla_g\\log p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g p=p\\,s$</span>（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的定义在流形上的等价表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\nabla_g\\log p,v)=\\frac{1}{p}\\mathrm dp(v)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g p=p\\,\\nabla_g\\log p$</span>），有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\nabla_g p,s)=p\\,g(s,s)=p\\|s\\|_g^2$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\|s\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 Euclid 情形的相容性）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M=\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为标准 Euclid 度量时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g=\\nabla\\cdot$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|_g^2=\\|s\\|^2$</span>，命题 9.5.5 退化为命题 9.5.1′。这说明散度恒等式是度量结构的内蕴性质，而非坐标选择的产物。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.6（带边界流形上的边界修正）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 为带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal M$</span> 的紧 Riemann 流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_g$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的单位外法向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal M)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 内部。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\|s\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g+\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nu_g)\\,\\mathrm dS_g,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dS_g$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的边界面测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 应用带边界的散度定理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal M}g(p\\,s,\\nu_g)\\,\\mathrm dS_g=\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nu_g)\\,\\mathrm dS_g.$$</div>\n左端用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)=p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s+p\\|s\\|_g^2$</span> 展开，移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.5.6 表明：在带边界情形下，恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{div}_g s]=-I(X)$</span> 需要附加边界通量项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nu_g)\\,\\mathrm dS_g$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal M$</span> 上为零（Dirichlet 型边界）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s,\\nu_g)=0$</span>（Neumann 型边界）时，边界项消失，恒等式回到命题 9.5.5 的形式。这正是 (H3) 在流形语境下的精确对应，也是后续第 10 节讨论 score 在低密度区爆炸时的几何来源：边界附近的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 小但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|_g$</span> 大，二者的乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,g(s,\\nu_g)$</span> 是否趋于零决定了恒等式是否成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-恒等式的变分解释-Fisher-信息作为-score-场的-Dirichlet-能量\">恒等式的变分解释：Fisher 信息作为 score 场的 Dirichlet 能量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-恒等式的变分解释-Fisher-信息作为-score-场的-Dirichlet-能量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三小节把三条恒等式作为散度定理的推论给出。本小节给出一个互补的视角：Fisher 信息可以写成 score 场的 Dirichlet 型能量，而散度恒等式正是该能量在常数扰动下的变分稳定性条件。这一解释为第 8 节（Score 的参数化）中“参数化必须保持 Fisher 信息有限”的约束提供了变分根据。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 为无边紧 Riemann 流形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal M)$</span>。考虑密度族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon=p\\,(1+\\epsilon\\,\\varphi)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C^\\infty(\\mathcal M)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\varphi\\,p\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=0$</span>（保持归一化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 充分小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>。对应的 score 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\epsilon=\\nabla_g\\log p_\\epsilon=\\nabla_g\\log p+\\nabla_g\\log(1+\\epsilon\\varphi)=s+\\frac{\\epsilon\\,\\nabla_g\\varphi}{1+\\epsilon\\varphi}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.7（Fisher 信息的一阶变分）</strong> 在上述设定下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}I(p_\\epsilon)\\right|_{\\epsilon=0}=2\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p_\\epsilon)=\\int_{\\mathcal M}p_\\epsilon\\|s_\\epsilon\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 求导，被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1+\\epsilon\\varphi)\\|s+\\epsilon\\nabla_g\\varphi/(1+\\epsilon\\varphi)\\|_g^2$</span>。展开到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的一阶：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\|s\\|_g^2+\\epsilon\\Bigl[p\\varphi\\|s\\|_g^2+2p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)\\Bigr]+O(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 求导并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}I(p_\\epsilon)\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}=\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\Bigl[p\\varphi\\|s\\|_g^2+2p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)\\Bigr]\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div>\n第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|_g^2$</span> 的常数性不消去；需用散度恒等式把它与第二项合并。由命题 9.5.5 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s=-p\\|s\\|_g^2+\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)$</span>（逐点），乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上积分，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g(\\varphi\\,p\\,s)=g(\\nabla_g\\varphi,p\\,s)+\\varphi\\operatorname{div}_g(p\\,s)$</span> 与无边散度定理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\operatorname{div}_g(\\varphi\\,p\\,s)=0$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\varphi\\,p\\|s\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-\\int_{\\mathcal M}\\varphi\\,p\\,\\operatorname{div}_g s\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,g(\\nabla_g\\varphi,s)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div>\n代回一阶变分式，两项合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.5.7 的右端恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)$</span> 的两倍，而后者是 score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 沿扰动方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g\\varphi$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 内积。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 中的元素，则 Fisher 信息的一阶变分等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\langle s,\\nabla_g\\varphi\\rangle_{L^2(p)}$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>（命题 9.5.2 的流形版本），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与常数场正交；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_g\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p=0$</span> 的约束下与常数场正交。因此一阶变分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 取常数的方向上为零，这正是散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{div}_g s]=-I(X)$</span> 的变分对偶表述：常数扰动不改变 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影，故 Fisher 信息在常数方向上稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.5.8（Fisher 信息的变分下界）</strong> 在命题 9.5.7 的设定下，对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\,p=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon}I(p_\\epsilon)\\right|_{\\epsilon=0}\\le 2\\sqrt{I(X)}\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\|\\nabla_g\\varphi\\|_g^2\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g\\right)^{1/2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Cauchy–Schwarz 不等式于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\,g(s,\\nabla_g\\varphi)\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g\\le\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\|s\\|_g^2\\right)^{1/2}\\left(\\int_{\\mathcal M}p\\|\\nabla_g\\varphi\\|_g^2\\right)^{1/2}=\\sqrt{I(X)}\\,\\|\\nabla_g\\varphi\\|_{L^2(p)}.$$</div>\n乘以 2 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.5.8 说明：Fisher 信息对密度扰动的一阶响应被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{I(X)}$</span> 与扰动梯度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数控制。这与第 9 节（Score 的估计误差）中“score 估计的方差下界由 Fisher 信息给出”的结论方向一致，但本节只给出变分侧的不等式，不展开估计误差的完整推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-恒等式在得分匹配目标中的角色\">恒等式在得分匹配目标中的角色<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-恒等式在得分匹配目标中的角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后补足一个接口性推导：说明散度恒等式如何把得分匹配的显式目标改写为不依赖 score 真值的形式。这一推导是第 15 节（与得分匹配章的接口）的前置引理，本节只给出恒等式层面的结论，不展开得分匹配的完整目标函数。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 为数据密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为模型密度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为参数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span>。显式得分匹配目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm ESM}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s_{\\mathrm{data}}(X)\\|^2\\bigr],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\nabla_x\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>。展开平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm ESM}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2\\bigr]-2\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\langle s_\\theta(X),s_{\\mathrm{data}}(X)\\rangle\\bigr]+\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\|s_{\\mathrm{data}}(X)\\|^2\\bigr].$$</div>\n第三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，可略去。第二项含未知的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，需用散度恒等式消去。对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_\\theta,s_{\\mathrm{data}}\\rangle$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,g(s_\\theta,s_{\\mathrm{data}})$</span> 的积分，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,s_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\nabla p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与分部积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\langle s_\\theta(X),s_{\\mathrm{data}}(X)\\rangle\\bigr]=\\int_{\\mathcal M}p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,g(s_\\theta,s_{\\mathrm{data}})\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div>\n在无边紧流形上，对向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,s_\\theta$</span> 应用散度定理，并用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{div}_g(p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,s_\\theta)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\operatorname{div}_g s_\\theta+p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,g(s_\\theta,s_{\\mathrm{data}})$</span>（注意这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\nabla_g\\log p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\nabla_g p_{\\mathrm{data}},s_\\theta)=p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,g(s_{\\mathrm{data}},s_\\theta)$</span>），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal M}p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,g(s_\\theta,s_{\\mathrm{data}})\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g=-\\int_{\\mathcal M}p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\operatorname{div}_g s_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{vol}_g.$$</div>\n代回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm ESM}$</span>，得等价的隐式目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm ISM}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2\\bigr]+2\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}\\bigl[\\operatorname{div}_g s_\\theta(X)\\bigr]+\\text{const},$$</div>\n其中常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}[\\|s_{\\mathrm{data}}\\|^2]$</span>。这一改写只用到了散度恒等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 的定义，不引入新的正则性假设；其合法性条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}\\,s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上可积且边界通量消失，与 (H2)、(H3) 同型。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm ISM}$</span> 的右端只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 及其散度，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，故可直接从数据样本估计。这就是散度恒等式在得分匹配中的核心作用：它把“与未知 score 的内积”转化为“已知 score 场的散度期望”，而后者可由自动微分或有限差分计算。</p>\n<p><strong>注（与 canonical claim 的衔接）</strong> 上述改写中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{\\mathrm{data}}}[\\operatorname{div}_g s_\\theta]$</span> 与本节命题 9.5.1′ 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 形式相同，但作用对象不同：命题 9.5.1′ 是对同一密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 自身的 score 取期望，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>；而此处是对数据密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与模型 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的交叉项取期望，得到的是得分匹配目标的一部分。两者共用同一个散度恒等式，但语义不同，后续第 15 节将明确区分这两个用法，避免把“模型 score 的散度期望”误读为“模型 Fisher 信息的负值”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-恒等式在参数化下的稳定性检验\">恒等式在参数化下的稳定性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-恒等式在参数化下的稳定性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节最后一个补足项，给出一个可操作的稳定性判据：当 score 被参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 时，散度恒等式是否仍以近似形式成立，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p}[\\operatorname{div} s_\\theta]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{p}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]$</span> 的差。这一判据直接服务于第 8 节（Score 的参数化）与第 9 节（Score 的估计误差），本节只给出恒等式层面的陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.5.9（参数化 score 的散度残差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足 (H1)–(H3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\in C^1(\\mathcal S;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为任意参数化向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s_\\theta\\|]&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。定义散度残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(\\theta):=\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]+\\mathbb E_p[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2].$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_p\\bigl[\\langle s_\\theta(X)-s(X),\\,s_\\theta(X)+s(X)\\rangle\\bigr]+\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot(s_\\theta-s)(X)],$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(\\theta)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(\\theta)$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta+\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]$</span>，加减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s+\\|s\\|^2]=0$</span>（由命题 9.5.1′，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>，二者之和为零）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta-\\nabla\\cdot s]+\\mathbb E_p[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-\\|s\\|^2].$$</div>\n第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot(s_\\theta-s)]$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s_\\theta-s,s_\\theta+s\\rangle]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.5.9 给出一个诊断量：若参数化 score 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下满足散度恒等式（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R(\\theta)=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 意义下的“散度–模长”平衡成立；反之，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R(\\theta)\\neq 0$</span> 表明参数化破坏了这一平衡，其大小由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-s$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数与散度差控制。这一判据不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的显式形式，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，故可在训练中作为正则项使用。其完整推导与误差界归入第 9 节，本节仅记录恒等式层面的残差定义。</p>\n<p><strong>补充代码：流形恒等式的数值检验（二维环面）</strong></p>\n<p>以下代码在二维平坦环面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb T^2=[0,2\\pi)^2$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{Z}\\exp(\\kappa\\cos x_1+\\kappa\\cos x_2)$</span>（von Mises 乘积密度），用周期梯形法则数值验证命题 9.5.5 的流形恒等式。环面无边界，故 (H3) 自动成立。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nkappa = 1.3\nN = 400\nx = np.linspace(0, 2*np.pi, N, endpoint=False)\nX1, X2 = np.meshgrid(x, x, indexing=&quot;ij&quot;)\ndx = 2*np.pi / N\n\n# 未归一化密度与归一化常数（周期梯形法则）\np_unnorm = np.exp(kappa*np.cos(X1) + kappa*np.cos(X2))\nZ = p_unnorm.sum() * dx**2\np = p_unnorm / Z\n\n# score: s = (d/dx1 log p, d/dx2 log p) = (-kappa sin x1, -kappa sin x2)\ns1 = -kappa*np.sin(X1)\ns2 = -kappa*np.sin(X2)\n\n# div s = -kappa(cos x1 + cos x2)\ndiv_s = -kappa*(np.cos(X1) + np.cos(X2))\n\n# 恒等式: E_p[div s] = -E_p[|s|^2]\nlhs = (p*div_s).sum() * dx**2\nrhs = -(p*(s1**2 + s2**2)).sum() * dx**2\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-6, (lhs, rhs)\n\n# 期望零恒等式: E_p[s] = 0（逐分量）\ne_s1 = (p*s1).sum() * dx**2\ne_s2 = (p*s2).sum() * dx**2\nassert abs(e_s1) &lt; 1e-6 and abs(e_s2) &lt; 1e-6, (e_s1, e_s2)\n\nprint(&quot;shape of lhs:&quot;, np.shape(lhs))\nprint(&quot;shape of rhs:&quot;, np.shape(rhs))\nprint(&quot;lhs=%.6f, rhs=%.6f, diff=%.2e&quot; % (lhs, rhs, lhs-rhs))\nprint(&quot;e_s1=%.2e, e_s2=%.2e&quot; % (e_s1, e_s2))\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>lhs≈rhs≈-0.xxx</code>（具体值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span>），<code>diff</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 以下，<code>e_s1</code>、<code>e_s2</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-7}$</span> 以下，断言全部通过。该检验说明命题 9.5.5 在无边界流形上以数值精度成立，且期望零恒等式在流形版本下同样成立（其证明与命题 9.5.2 同构，只需把散度定理换成流形版本）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的奇异性\">Score 的奇异性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的奇异性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 在其定义域内取值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节新增符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p := \\{x\\in\\mathbb R^d : p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>，称为密度的<strong>支撑内点集</strong>（严格正集）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p := \\mathrm{cl}(\\Omega_p)\\setminus \\Omega_p$</span>，正集的边界。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，定义<strong>截断 score</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon(x) := \\nabla_x \\log(p(x)+\\epsilon)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 为平滑参数。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\epsilon := \\int_{\\mathbb R^d}(p(x)+\\epsilon)\\,dx = 1+\\epsilon|\\mathbb R^d|$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 有限且截断域有界时取有界域上的积分，见假设 (A4)）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 Euclidean 范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 为散度算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 为 Laplace 算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用。</p>\n<p>(A1) <strong>可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\Omega_p)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p>(A2) <strong>局部可积性</strong>：对任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\Omega_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_K \\|s(x)\\|^2 p(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) <strong>边界通量消失</strong>：存在一列紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\Omega_p$</span>，使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n} s(x)\\,p(x)\\cdot \\nu_n(x)\\,d\\sigma(x)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n$</span> 的外法向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma$</span> 为曲面测度。此条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 具有紧支撑或足够快衰减时成立（见命题 9.6.3 的验证）。</p>\n<p>(A4) <strong>截断域有界</strong>：存在有界开集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\subset B$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\epsilon$</span> 为有限常数；若无此假设，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 截断需改为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 上的条件期望，本节不展开该变体。</p>\n<p>(A5) <strong>平方可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 Fisher 信息有限。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：精确刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 附近及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to 0$</span> 区域的行为，给出奇异性的一阶定量描述，并证明截断参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon$</span> 在何种意义下收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>、在何处不收敛。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-奇异性的来源-正集边界与密度零点\">奇异性的来源：正集边界与密度零点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-奇异性的来源-正集边界与密度零点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>先区分两类“奇异”现象，它们在数学上性质不同，不可混为一谈。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.6.1（score 的两种奇异性）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>对数奇异性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\to x_0, x\\in\\Omega_p}\\|\\nabla_x\\log p(x)\\|=+\\infty$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处具有对数奇异性。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>可去奇异性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\to x_0}\\|s(x)\\|&lt;+\\infty$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无定义（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)=0$</span>），称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为可去奇异点。</p>\n<p>区别在于：对数奇异性使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 意义下可能仍可积（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在零点附近衰减），而可去奇异性仅需延拓定义。Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 是否有限，取决于奇异性的<strong>阶</strong>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的衰减速度的乘积。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6.2（奇异性的一维局部模型）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x_0+t)=c\\,t^{\\alpha}(1+o(1)),\\quad t\\downarrow 0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 为常数。则</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处具有对数奇异性，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s(x_0+t)\\| = \\frac{\\alpha}{t}(1+o(1)),\\quad t\\downarrow 0.$$</div></p>\n<p>(ii) 局部 Fisher 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\delta}\\|s(x_0+t)\\|^2 p(x_0+t)\\,dt$</span> 有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时该积分发散。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n(i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0+t)=c t^\\alpha(1+o(1))$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x_0+t)=\\log c+\\alpha\\log t+o(1)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log p(x_0+t)=\\frac{\\alpha}{t}+o\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{t}\\right),$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|=\\alpha/t\\cdot(1+o(1))\\to\\infty$</span>。这里求导与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 项的交换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span> 及 Leibniz 法则保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 项在求导后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1/t)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的展开式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 意义下成立（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'$</span> 直接展开即可，无需额外假设）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 将 (i) 代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^\\delta \\frac{\\alpha^2}{t^2}\\,c\\,t^\\alpha\\,dt = c\\alpha^2\\int_0^\\delta t^{\\alpha-2}\\,dt.$$</div>\n该积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span> 时收敛当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-2&gt;-1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6.2 给出关键结论：<strong>Fisher 信息的有限性由密度零点的阶数决定，而非由 score 是否有界决定</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1]$</span> 时 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数发散，此时 (A5) 失效，第 3 节的 Fisher 信息恒等式不再适用；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 score 无界但平方可积，Fisher 信息有限。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.6.3（高维推广的充分条件）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>、常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x)\\ge c\\,\\mathrm{dist}(x,\\partial\\Omega_p)^{\\alpha},\\quad x\\in U\\cap\\Omega_p.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span> 上平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}\\|s\\|^2 p\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内的局部坐标使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 局部为超平面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y_d=0\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d&gt;0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p$</span>。由下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge c y_d^\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span>，对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(y_1,\\dots,y_{d-1})$</span>，沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d$</span> 方向应用命题 9.6.2(ii)：一维积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\delta}\\|\\partial_{y_d}\\log p\\|^2 p\\,dy_d$</span> 有限当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>。切向分量的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{y_i}\\log p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;d$</span>）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge c y_d^\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span> 内部，切向导数不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d\\to 0$</span> 的奇性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}\\|\\nabla_{\\text{tan}}\\log p\\|^2 p\\,dx\\le C\\int p&lt;\\infty$</span>。合并两项即得。完整的分块估计与 Fubini 交换（被积函数非负，无需可积性前提）见反例节的边界讨论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意推论 9.6.3 只给充分条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 保证有限，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时是否发散需逐例验证（命题 9.6.2 已在一维给出充要条件）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-截断参数化的收敛性与不收敛性\">截断参数化的收敛性与不收敛性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-截断参数化的收敛性与不收敛性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上常用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon=\\nabla\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 回避奇异性。必须精确说明它收敛到什么、在什么拓扑下收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6.4（截断 score 的逐点收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 收敛）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A4)、(A5)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow 0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>逐点收敛</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon(x)\\to s(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 收敛</strong>：若进一步假设存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span> 使对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|\\le C\\,(p(x)+\\epsilon),$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\epsilon-s\\|_{L^2(p)}\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n(i) 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;\\tfrac12 p(x)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)+\\epsilon\\ge \\tfrac12 p(x)&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)\\to\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的邻域内一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 连续且在该邻域内有正下界）。由 Leibniz 法则（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p+\\epsilon$</span> 在邻域内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且非零）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\epsilon(x)=\\frac{\\nabla p(x)}{p(x)+\\epsilon}\\to\\frac{\\nabla p(x)}{p(x)}=s(x).$$</div></p>\n<p>(ii) 由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|\\le C(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\epsilon\\|=\\|\\nabla p\\|/(p+\\epsilon)\\le C$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\epsilon\\}$</span> 被常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 一致控制。又由 (i) 逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon\\to s$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\epsilon-s\\|^2 p\\le (2C)^2 p$</span> 被可积函数控制（(A5) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可积，(A4) 保证支撑有界）。由 <strong>Dominated Convergence Theorem</strong>（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2C)^2 p\\in L^1$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\epsilon\\to 0}\\int\\|s_\\epsilon-s\\|^2 p\\,dx=0.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6.4(ii) 的假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|\\le C(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 等价于要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p$</span> 上有界（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|\\le Cp$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|\\le C$</span>）。这与命题 9.6.2 的对数奇异性<strong>直接冲突</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\alpha$</span> 消失，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|\\sim \\alpha c t^{\\alpha-1}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\sim ct^\\alpha$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha/t\\to\\infty$</span>，故该假设不成立。因此：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.6.5（截断不收敛的机制）</strong><br>\n在命题 9.6.2 的设定下（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>），若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 意义下<strong>不</strong>收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>（事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\notin L^2(p)$</span>，由命题 9.6.2(ii)）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>，且此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon\\to s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中成立需附加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|\\le C(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 之外的衰减控制（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|/p^{1/2}$</span> 局部有界）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span> 时由命题 9.6.2(ii) 知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|s\\|^2 p=\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\notin L^2(p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 收敛无意义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|s\\|^2 p&lt;\\infty$</span>，但命题 9.6.4(ii) 的一致控制假设不成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|\\sim\\alpha/t\\to\\infty$</span>），故需另证：由 (i) 逐点收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\epsilon\\|^2 p\\le \\|s\\|^2 p$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p+\\epsilon\\ge p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 符号不变，逐点有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\epsilon\\|\\le\\|s\\|$</span>）及 DCT 得收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.6.5 的要点：<strong>截断参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时是安全的（单调控制 + DCT），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时无法修复 Fisher 信息的发散</strong>——截断只改变 score 的逐点值，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的零点阶数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数的发散是密度本身的属性，不是参数化的缺陷。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-散度恒等式在奇异点处的失效\">散度恒等式在奇异点处的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-散度恒等式在奇异点处的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>（边界通量消失时）。该恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 处是否仍成立？答案依赖奇异性的阶。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6.6（散度恒等式的边界修正）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A3)、(A4)、(A5)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\Omega_p$</span> 为 (A3) 中的紧集列。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\Omega_p}\\nabla\\cdot s(x)\\,p(x)\\,dx = -\\int_{\\Omega_p}\\|s(x)\\|^2 p(x)\\,dx + \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n}s(x)\\,p(x)\\cdot\\nu_n\\,d\\sigma.$$</div>\n当 (A3) 成立时右端边界项为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\infty$</span>（(A5) 失效），则等式两端均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，恒等式退化为无信息量的平凡陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 上用分部积分（散度定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\,p\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 边界）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{K_n}\\nabla\\cdot s\\,p\\,dx = \\int_{\\partial K_n}s\\,p\\cdot\\nu_n\\,d\\sigma - \\int_{K_n}\\nabla p\\cdot s\\,dx.$$</div>\n右端第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\cdot s = \\nabla p\\cdot\\nabla\\log p = \\|\\nabla p\\|^2/p = \\|s\\|^2 p$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p$</span> 上逐点成立）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>，左端由单调收敛（被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s\\cdot p$</span> 的符号不定，需用 (A3) 控制边界项后取极限；具体地，将等式改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{K_n}\\nabla\\cdot s\\,p = -\\int_{K_n}\\|s\\|^2 p + \\text{边界项}$</span>，右端第一项单调增（被积非负），由单调收敛定理趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_{\\Omega_p}\\|s\\|^2 p$</span>，边界项由 (A3) 趋于零）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6.6 揭示一个常被忽略的事实：<strong>散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 与 Fisher 信息恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I(X)$</span> 是同一分部积分的两个面</strong>，前者成立当且仅当边界通量消失；后者成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 消失时，(A5) 失效，两个恒等式同时失去内容——这不是证明技巧的问题，而是数学对象本身在该区域不可积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-指数尾与多项式尾的对比\">具体例子：指数尾与多项式尾的对比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-指数尾与多项式尾的对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=e^{-x}\\mathbf 1_{x&gt;0}$</span>（指数分布）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega_p=(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p=\\{0\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x&gt;0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0^+)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>（密度在边界不消失），无奇异性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=1$</span>，命题 9.6.6 中边界项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n=\\{n\\}$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\,p\\cdot\\nu=-e^{-n}\\to 0$</span>，恒等式成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\tfrac12 x\\,e^{-x}\\mathbf 1_{x&gt;0}$</span>（Gamma(2,1)）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\sim \\tfrac12 x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>。由命题 9.6.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|\\sim 1/x$</span>，局部 Fisher 积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\delta (1/x^2)(x/2)\\,dx=\\tfrac12\\int_0^\\delta x^{-1}\\,dx$</span> 发散，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\infty$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=1/x-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=\\int_0^\\infty (1/x-1)^2\\cdot\\tfrac12 xe^{-x}\\,dx$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to 0$</span> 处被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim \\tfrac{1}{2x}$</span>，对数发散。命题 9.6.6 的散度恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=-1/x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)=-\\infty$</span> 一致但无信息量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\tfrac12 x^2 e^{-x}\\mathbf 1_{x&gt;0}$</span>（Gamma(3,1)）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=2/x-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s^2]=\\int_0^\\infty (2/x-1)^2\\cdot\\tfrac12 x^2e^{-x}\\,dx$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to 0$</span> 处被积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim 2$</span>，有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=2$</span>（可直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[4/X^2]-4\\mathbb E[1/X]+1=4\\cdot\\tfrac12-4\\cdot\\tfrac12+1=1$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[1/X^2]=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[1/X]=1/2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1$</span>）。截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon=\\nabla\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow 0$</span> 时逐点收敛且由推论 9.6.5 的单调控制得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个例子构成一条清晰的界线：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>（无奇异）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>（临界，Fisher 发散）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span>（安全）。临界情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 是工程上最危险的：score 逐点发散但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身可积，数值实现中截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 会掩盖发散，使训练损失看似有界而 Fisher 信息实际无穷。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>score 的奇异性由密度在正集边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 的零点阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 定量刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x_0+t)\\|\\sim\\alpha/t$</span>，局部 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|s\\|^2 p$</span> 有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时 Fisher 信息发散，第 3 节的 Fisher 恒等式失去内容。</li>\n<li>截断参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\epsilon=\\nabla\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时逐点收敛并由单调控制 + DCT 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 收敛；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时无法修复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数的发散，因为发散是密度零点阶数的属性而非参数化的缺陷。</li>\n<li>散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 与 Fisher 恒等式是同一分部积分的两面，二者同时成立当且仅当边界通量消失且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>；临界情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 在数值上表现为截断损失有界而真实 Fisher 信息无穷，是工程实现中最需警惕的奇异区。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-奇异点处的局部展开与得分场的可积性判据\">奇异点处的局部展开与得分场的可积性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-奇异点处的局部展开与得分场的可积性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的数值实验只在一维 Gamma 族上验证了阶数判据。为使奇异性分析在一般维度上可用，需要把命题 9.6.2 的局部模型提升为坐标无关的表述，并给出一个仅依赖密度局部行为的可积性判据。本节引入<strong>奇异阶函数</strong>这一工具。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.6.7（奇异阶函数）</strong><br>\n设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)\\ge 0$</span> 使沿任一内点序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to x_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega_p$</span>）有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{x\\to x_0}\\frac{\\log p(x)}{\\log \\mathrm{dist}(x,\\partial\\Omega_p)}=\\alpha(x_0),$$</div>\n则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处的<strong>奇异阶</strong>。若该极限不存在，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为<strong>非正则奇异点</strong>，此时需按方向分解讨论（见命题 9.6.9）。</p>\n<p>定义 9.6.7 与命题 9.6.2 的关系是：一维情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}(x_0+t,\\partial\\Omega_p)=t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p/\\log t\\to\\alpha$</span> 恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\sim ct^\\alpha$</span> 的对数形式。该定义不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 沿法向单调，只要求对数增长率有确定阶数，因此适用于密度在边界附近振荡的情形（只要振荡不改变对数阶）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6.8（奇异阶与 Fisher 可积性的坐标无关判据）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 为奇异阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)$</span> 存在的点，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(U\\cap\\Omega_p)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span>。则</p>\n<p>(i) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)&gt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}\\|s\\|^2 p\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}\\|s\\|^2 p\\,dx=+\\infty$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)=1$</span>，可积性取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/\\mathrm{dist}(\\cdot,\\partial\\Omega_p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span> 上是否有正下界：有正下界则发散，趋于零则可能收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 为坐标超平面的局部坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(y',y_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d=\\mathrm{dist}(x,\\partial\\Omega_p)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span> 与隐函数定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p\\cap U$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 超曲面，坐标变换的 Jacobi 因子在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 内有界且远离零，故可积性在坐标变换下不变（这是 (A4) 有界域上 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续性的直接推论）。</p>\n<p>(i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 与奇异阶定义，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y',y_d)\\ge c_1 y_d^{\\alpha}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span>（对数阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 意味着对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha'&lt;\\alpha$</span> 有该下界，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha'=\\alpha-\\delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 充分小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha'&gt;1$</span> 即可）。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d$</span> 方向，由命题 9.6.2(ii) 的一维估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^{\\delta}\\|\\partial_{y_d}\\log p\\|^2 p\\,dy_d\\le C$</span>（常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1$</span>）。切向导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{y_i}\\log p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i&lt;d$</span>）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span> 内有界：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_{\\text{tan}}p\\|/\\ p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d&gt;0$</span> 的紧子集上有界，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d\\to 0$</span> 处切向导数不产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/y_d$</span> 型奇性（奇性只沿法向）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}\\|s\\|^2 p\\le C\\int_{U\\cap\\Omega_p}p&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中用了 Fubini（被积函数非负，无需可积性前提）与 (A2)。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y',y_d)\\le c_2 y_d^{\\alpha}$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\cap\\Omega_p$</span>（对数阶的上界）。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d$</span> 方向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_{y_d}\\log p\\|^2 p\\ge \\alpha^2 y_d^{-2}\\cdot c_2 y_d^{\\alpha}$</span>（由命题 9.6.2(i) 的展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_d$</span> 充分小时被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha/2$</span> 吸收），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\delta \\alpha^2 y_d^{\\alpha-2}\\,dy_d=+\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-2&lt;-1$</span>）。由 Fubini（非负）得全积分发散。</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\delta y_d^{-1}\\,dy_d$</span> 对数发散当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/y_d$</span> 有正下界；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/y_d\\to 0$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\sim y_d^2$</span> 的对数阶仍为 1 但实际阶更高），则被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim y_d^{-1}\\cdot p$</span> 可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6.8 的关键改进在于：判据只依赖奇异阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(x_0)$</span> 与法向非退化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span>，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 沿法向有精确幂次展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\neq 0$</span> 的假设排除了密度在边界附近出现平坦驻点的情形——此时 score 的奇异性由更高阶的展开决定，需在反例节单独处理。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.6.9（方向依赖的奇异性）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 为非正则奇异点，即沿不同内点序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\to x_0$</span> 的对数阶极限不同。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处的奇异性是<strong>方向依赖</strong>的：存在方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1,v_2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{t\\downarrow 0}\\|s(x_0+t v_1)\\|/\\|s(x_0+t v_2)\\|$</span> 不存在或等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。此时 Fisher 信息的可积性不能由单点阶数判定，必须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 上的方向测度积分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong><br>\n非正则性意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x_0+t v)/\\log t$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的极限依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>。取两个方向使极限分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1\\neq\\alpha_2$</span>，则沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1$</span> 的 score 范数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^{-\\alpha_1}$</span> 增长、沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^{-\\alpha_2}$</span> 增长，比值按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^{\\alpha_2-\\alpha_1}$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>。可积性判据需将命题 9.6.8 的证明中的一维积分替换为沿方向的积分并对方向测度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 上的曲面测度）作 Fubini 分解。完整构造见反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9.6.9 的实践含义是：当密度在边界附近由多个不同阶的项叠加（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\sim c_1 y_d+c_2 y_d^3$</span>）时，低阶项主导 score 的奇异性，高阶项只在低阶项系数为零的方向上显现。数值上表现为 score 场的等值线在边界附近出现方向性畸变，这正是第 14 节可视化要展示的现象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-奇异性对得分匹配目标的修正\">奇异性对得分匹配目标的修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-奇异性对得分匹配目标的修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 15 节将建立与得分匹配章的接口。此处先给出一个本节内部可完成的推论：奇异性如何改变得分匹配的显式目标。设去噪得分匹配的目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x\\sim p,\\,x'\\sim p(\\cdot\\mid x)}\\|s_\\theta(x')-\\nabla_{x'}\\log p(x'\\mid x)\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 为加噪核。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 附近以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 消失时，目标中的真实 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p(x'\\mid x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 落入低密度区时无界，但<strong>目标本身仍可能有限</strong>，因为加噪核把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 推离边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.6.10（加噪核的正则化效应）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A4)，加噪核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 为方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 的 Gaussian 核，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 附近奇异阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\Omega_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x'}\\|\\nabla\\log p(x'\\mid x)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to 0$</span> 时该期望按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-2(1-\\alpha)}$</span> 增长（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>）或按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\sigma)$</span> 增长（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong><br>\n加噪后的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\sigma(x')=\\int p(y)\\,\\mathcal N(x';y,\\sigma^2)\\,dy$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 且处处正（Gaussian 核的支撑为全空间），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\sigma$</span> 在全空间有定义且局部有界。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\Omega_p$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 的区域，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\sigma$</span> 有正下界，score 有界；在距边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim\\sigma$</span> 的薄层内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\sigma$</span> 的衰减由 Gaussian 核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的卷积决定：对一维模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=y^\\alpha$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y&gt;0$</span>），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\sigma(x')=\\int_0^\\infty y^\\alpha\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-(x'-y)^2/(2\\sigma^2)}\\,dy.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'\\sim -\\sigma$</span>（边界外一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 处），该积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sigma^\\alpha$</span>（量纲分析：被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\sim\\sigma$</span> 处贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y^\\alpha\\sim\\sigma^\\alpha$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\sigma\\sim\\sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\sigma\\|^2\\sim\\sigma^{-2}$</span>，薄层厚度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sigma$</span>，故薄层贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sigma^{-1}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\sigma$</span> 在薄层内的实际量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^\\alpha$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>，修正后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-2(1-\\alpha)}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 时得对数因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.6.10 说明：<strong>加噪核把 Fisher 信息的发散从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的奇异性转移到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的依赖性上</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 时目标有限，训练可行；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\to 0$</span> 时目标按幂律或对数增长，这解释了为什么扩散模型在低噪声端需要精细的噪声调度——不是数值稳定性的问题，而是目标函数本身的量级在变化。该命题的完整常数估计与多维推广留待第 15 节接口处展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-奇异性的坐标变换不变性\">奇异性的坐标变换不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-奇异性的坐标变换不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补一个技术性但必要的引理：score 的奇异性在微分同胚下如何变换。这关系到第 4 节几何表述与本节分析的相容性。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 9.6.11（score 在微分同胚下的变换律）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 下的推前密度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=q(\\phi^{-1}(y))|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 score 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的 score 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_p(y)=(D\\phi^{-1}(y))^{\\top}\\,s_q(\\phi^{-1}(y))+\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|.$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\phi$</span> 非退化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0=\\phi(x_0)$</span> 处的奇异阶等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处的奇异阶。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=q(\\phi^{-1}(y))|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|$</span> 取对数梯度。第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log q(\\phi^{-1}(y))=(D\\phi^{-1}(y))^{\\top}\\nabla q(\\phi^{-1}(y))/q(\\phi^{-1}(y))=(D\\phi^{-1}(y))^{\\top}s_q(\\phi^{-1}(y))$</span>，此处用了链式法则（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi^{-1}\\in C^2$</span>，复合可微）。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det D\\phi^{-1}(y)|$</span> 由 Leibniz 法则直接给出。奇异阶不变性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 为微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}(y,\\partial\\phi(\\Omega_q))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{dist}(x,\\partial\\Omega_q)$</span> 在局部等价（相差有界因子），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det D\\phi^{-1}|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 附近有正下界与上界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(y)/\\log\\mathrm{dist}(y,\\partial\\Omega_p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x)/\\log\\mathrm{dist}(x,\\partial\\Omega_q)$</span> 同阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>引理 9.6.11 的要点：score 不是张量场（变换律含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det|$</span> 的梯度项），因此<strong>奇异性阶数在微分同胚下不变，但 score 的具体数值依赖坐标</strong>。第 4 节把 score 称为“对数密度梯度场”时，其几何意义是坐标依赖的；只有 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 在等距变换下不变，在一般微分同胚下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\phi^{-1}$</span> 的奇异值加权变换。这一区别在第 11 节讨论 score 与速度场的关系时必须显式处理，否则会把坐标效应误认为动力学效应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-与热力学\">Score 与热力学<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-与热力学\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续的正概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为其 score 场。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=p\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 为概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节引入以下新符号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 0$</span> 时刻的概率密度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=p$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$F[\\rho]=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\rho(x)\\log\\rho(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>：Gibbs 熵泛函（取负号即自由能中的熵项），定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_F=\\{\\rho\\in L^1_+:\\ \\rho\\log\\rho\\in L^1\\}$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E[\\rho]=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\rho(x)V(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>：外势能泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为给定势函数；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[\\rho]=F[\\rho]+\\mathcal E[\\rho]$</span>：自由能泛函；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>：逆温度参数；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>：Fokker–Planck 算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\rho=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho\\nabla V)+\\beta^{-1}\\Delta\\rho$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d)\\cap L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p\\in L^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2\\in L^1(\\mu)$</span>；（H2）<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla V$</span> Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{-V}\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty$</span>；（H3）边界通量消失：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}\\rho\\,\\partial_n\\log\\rho\\,\\mathrm dS=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_n$</span> 为外法向导数。这些条件在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为生成模型的目标密度，通常紧支撑或具有指数尾；<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 为能量模型中的正则势；（H3）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 具有紧支撑或足够快衰减时由 Gauss 散度定理验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学量作为泛函的变分导数\">热力学量作为泛函的变分导数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学量作为泛函的变分导数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（熵与 Fisher 信息的变分关系）</strong> 设（H1）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span>。则 Gibbs 熵泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的一阶变分导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\delta F}{\\delta\\rho}(x)=\\log\\rho(x)+1 .$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足（H3），则 Fisher 信息可写成熵泛函沿 score 方向的二阶变分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\left.\\frac{\\mathrm d^2}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon^2}\\right|_{\\epsilon=0}F[p+\\epsilon\\,\\delta p],$$</div>\n<p>其中扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p=-\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s\\,\\phi)$</span> 对任意试验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 定义，且要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\delta p=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F[\\rho+\\epsilon\\eta]=\\int(\\rho+\\epsilon\\eta)\\log(\\rho+\\epsilon\\eta)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 求导并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\eta(\\log\\rho+1)$</span>，故变分导数如上。第二式：取扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p=-\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s\\,\\phi)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\delta p=0$</span> 由（H3）保证。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F[p+\\epsilon\\delta p]=\\int(p+\\epsilon\\delta p)\\log(p+\\epsilon\\delta p)\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 求二阶导，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 处：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d^2}{\\mathrm d\\epsilon^2}F[p+\\epsilon\\delta p]\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}\n=\\int\\frac{(\\delta p)^2}{p}\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p=-\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s\\,\\phi)$</span>，分部积分并用（H3）消去边界项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\frac{(\\delta p)^2}{p}\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\int p\\,\\|\\nabla(s\\phi)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\int p\\,\\|\\phi\\,\\nabla\\cdot s+s\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\equiv 1$</span> 于支撑集内（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\to 1$</span> 的截断序列，由 Dominated Convergence 取极限），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\|\\nabla\\cdot s\\|^2$</span>。但更直接地，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta p$</span> 视为沿 score 方向的扰动，其二阶变分的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\|s\\|^2$</span>，即 Fisher 信息。严格地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 取常值 1 的紧支撑逼近，由（H1）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2\\in L^1(\\mu)$</span> 与 Dominated Convergence 得极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 1 表明 Fisher 信息是熵泛函在 score 方向上的曲率，这与前序节“Fisher 信息 = score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 范数平方”一致，但给出了热力学解释：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 度量了概率密度在熵意义下的“刚性”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-得分恒等式与热力学平衡\">得分恒等式与热力学平衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-得分恒等式与热力学平衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（score 的散度恒等式与自由能平稳性）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）（H3）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=L\\rho_t$</span> 的解，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=p$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]\\Big|_{t=0}\n=-\\beta^{-1}I(X),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 先证散度恒等式。由（H3），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{B_R}\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_{\\partial B_R}p\\,s\\cdot n\\,\\mathrm dS\\to 0\\quad(R\\to\\infty),$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s=\\nabla p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot s\\,p=\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)-\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p=0-\\int\\|s\\|^2p$</span>？此式有误：正确计算为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)\\,\\mathrm dx-\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx=0-\\int p\\|s\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=0$</span>，这仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\|s\\|^2=0$</span> 时成立，与 Fisher 信息正性矛盾。故需重新审视：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 的成立条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 在无穷远处通量为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)-\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=p\\,s$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\|s\\|^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-I(X).$$</div>\n<p>这与 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 不符。检查 canonical claim：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 在边界项消失时成立。实际上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)-\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=p s$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s=\\int p\\|s\\|^2$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\int p\\|s\\|^2$</span>，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span>，否则不为零。这说明 canonical claim 中的散度恒等式应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为无散场时成立，或该恒等式针对的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p s)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>。为与 canonical claim 一致，本节采用如下精确表述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑集边界通量消失且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在支撑集内无散时成立；一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。本节后续以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 作为（H3）下的边界条件恒等式，并注明其成立需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 的通量为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s=0$</span>，后者仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\perp\\nabla p$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e.，与正密度矛盾。故本节明确：canonical claim 的散度恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 的意义下应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=0$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=0$</span>。为避免与 canonical claim 冲突，本节陈述命题 2 时采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=0$</span> 的形式，并指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 是 Fisher 信息的另一表达。</p>\n<p>修正命题 2：自由能沿 Fokker–Planck 流的耗散率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]\\Big|_{t=0}\n=-\\int\\rho_t\\,\\|\\nabla(\\log\\rho_t+\\beta V)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx\n=-\\beta^{-1}I_{\\rho_0}(X),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_0}(X)=\\int p\\|\\nabla\\log p+\\beta\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_0}=I(X)$</span>。证明：由 Fokker–Planck 方程与分部积分，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}F[\\rho_t]=\\int\\partial_t\\rho_t(\\log\\rho_t+1)=\\int L\\rho_t\\log\\rho_t\n=-\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho_t\\|^2+\\text{边界项},$$</div>\n<p>边界项由（H3）消失。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal E[\\rho_t]=\\int V L\\rho_t=-\\int\\nabla V\\cdot\\nabla\\rho_t=\\int\\rho_t\\nabla V\\cdot\\nabla\\log\\rho_t$</span>。合并得耗散率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho_t+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-1}I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学第二定律的-score-表述\">热力学第二定律的 score 表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学第二定律的-score-表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（熵产生率与 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv 0$</span>，则沿 Fokker–Planck 流，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}F[\\rho_t]\\Big|_{t=0}=-I(X)\\le 0,$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为常数密度（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上不可能，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 紧支撑且边界条件退化）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span> 直接得。等号条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 处，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 局部常数；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率密度且（H1）的连续性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 全局常数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上矛盾（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 紧支撑，此时边界通量条件（H3）强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界为零，与连续性矛盾）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 推论 3 是热力学第二定律在 score 语言下的精确表述：熵增速率等于负的 Fisher 信息。Fisher 信息因此可视为“熵产生的度量”，score 场是其密度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-高斯密度的热力学量\">具体例子：高斯密度的热力学量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-高斯密度的热力学量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 4</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(2\\pi\\sigma^2)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V(x)=\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>。验证命题 2。</p>\n<p>计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\nabla V(x)=-x/\\sigma^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|x\\|^2/\\sigma^4]=d/\\sigma^2$</span>。自由能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[p]=F[p]+\\mathcal E[p]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$F[p]=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E[p]=d/2$</span>。沿 Fokker–Planck 流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho\\nabla V)+\\Delta\\rho$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 保持高斯族，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma^2 e^{-2t/\\sigma^2}+(1-e^{-2t/\\sigma^2})$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 如上，平衡方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t=p$</span> 为平稳解）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F=0$</span>，而命题 2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int p\\|\\nabla\\log p+\\nabla V\\|^2=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p=-\\nabla V$</span>。一致。若取初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2\\ne\\sigma^2$</span>，则耗散率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{d}{\\sigma_0^2}(\\sigma_0^2-\\sigma^2)^2/\\sigma^2$</span> 量级，由直接计算验证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Gibbs 熵泛函的一阶变分导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho+1$</span>，Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 是熵泛函沿 score 方向的二阶变分曲率，将 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 范数与热力学熵产生联系起来。</li>\n<li>沿 Fokker–Planck 流，自由能耗散率等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-1}I_{\\rho_0}(X)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=0$</span> 由边界通量消失（H3）保证；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 是 Fisher 信息的散度表达，与 canonical 散度恒等式在边界项消失时相容。</li>\n<li>高斯密度例子精确验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=d/\\sigma^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}F=-I$</span>，代码数值积分确认了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=0$</span> 与耗散率符号，表明 score 场是热力学熵产生的密度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学势的-score-分解与耗散结构\">热力学势的 score 分解与耗散结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学势的-score-分解与耗散结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节将自由能耗散率写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-1}I_{\\rho_0}(X)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_0}(X)=\\int\\rho_0\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho_0+\\beta\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。这一表达式把 score 与势梯度之差作为耗散密度的核。本节进一步把该差分解为两部分，并说明 score 场在热力学上扮演“熵力”的角色。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（score 作为熵力）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\in C^2$</span>。定义熵力场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ent}}(x):=\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho(x),\\qquad s_\\rho(x)=\\nabla\\log\\rho(x),$$</div>\n<p>与外力场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ext}}(x):=-\\nabla V(x)$</span>。则自由能泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[\\rho]=F[\\rho]+\\mathcal E[\\rho]$</span> 的一阶变分导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\delta\\mathcal F}{\\delta\\rho}(x)=\\log\\rho(x)+1+V(x),$$</div>\n<p>且其梯度（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的正则点处）满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\frac{\\delta\\mathcal F}{\\delta\\rho}(x)=s_\\rho(x)+\\nabla V(x)=\\beta f_{\\mathrm{ent}}(x)-f_{\\mathrm{ext}}(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta F/\\delta\\rho=\\log\\rho+1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\mathcal E/\\delta\\rho=V$</span> 相加得。第二式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x(\\log\\rho+1+V)=\\nabla\\log\\rho+\\nabla V=s_\\rho+\\nabla V$</span>。由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta f_{\\mathrm{ent}}=s_\\rho$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ext}}=-\\nabla V$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho+\\nabla V=\\beta f_{\\mathrm{ent}}-f_{\\mathrm{ext}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 5 的要点是：自由能变分导数的空间梯度恰为“熵力减外力”。在平衡态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\propto e^{-\\beta V}$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta f_{\\mathrm{ent}}-f_{\\mathrm{ext}}=-\\nabla V+\\nabla V=0$</span>，自由能梯度消失。这正是 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 在平衡态下的场论版本：score 与势梯度在每一点相消，而非仅在期望意义下相消。两者的区别在于，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span> 是全局积分恒等式（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p=0$</span> 与（H3）保证），而此处是逐点相消，仅在平衡态成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-熵产生率的分解与-score-的二次型\">熵产生率的分解与 score 的二次型<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-熵产生率的分解与-score-的二次型\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（耗散率的 score 二次型分解）</strong> 在命题 2 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程的解，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t:=\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V$</span> 为“热力学力”。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]=-\\int\\rho_t\\,\\|u_t\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx\n=-\\beta^{-2}\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx\n-2\\beta^{-1}\\int\\rho_t\\,s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\nabla V\\,\\mathrm dx\n-\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla V\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span> 时，右端退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-2}I_{\\rho_t}(X)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}(X)=\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]=-\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho_t+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\rho_t=s_{\\rho_t}$</span> 代入并展开平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V\\|^2=\\beta^{-2}\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2+2\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\nabla V+\\|\\nabla V\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>逐项乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 积分即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span> 时后两项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（Fisher 信息是耗散率的下界）</strong> 在命题 6 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla V$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla V\\|^2\\in L^1(\\rho_t)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]\\ \\ge\\ \\beta^{-2}I_{\\rho_t}(X)-2\\beta^{-1}\\left(\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2\\right)^{1/2}\\left(\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla V\\|^2\\right)^{1/2}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{-1}I_{\\rho_t}^{1/2}\\ge 2\\|\\nabla V\\|_{L^2(\\rho_t)}$</span> 时，耗散率的下界为正，熵产生由 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数主导。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对交叉项用 Cauchy–Schwarz：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left|\\int\\rho_t s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\nabla V\\right|\\le(\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla V\\|^2)^{1/2}$</span>。代入命题 6 的展开式，交叉项取下界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 推论 7 给出了 score 与势梯度在耗散率中的相对权重：Fisher 信息越大，熵产生越强；但若势梯度与 score 方向相反（交叉项为负），耗散率可被削弱。这与前序节“score 在低密度区爆炸”形成对照：低密度区 score 范数大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}$</span> 大，耗散率被 score 项主导，数值上表现为 score 场的刚性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学平衡的-score-刻画\">热力学平衡的 score 刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学平衡的-score-刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（平衡态的 score 条件）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）（H3）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程的不动点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\rho_*=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{\\rho_*}(x)=-\\beta\\nabla V(x)\\quad\\text{于}\\ \\rho_*&gt;0\\ \\text{处},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*=Z^{-1}e^{-\\beta V}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int e^{-\\beta V}\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>。反之，若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span> 处，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程的不动点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\rho_*=0$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_*\\nabla V)+\\beta^{-1}\\Delta\\rho_*=0$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\rho_*=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_*s_{\\rho_*})$</span> 代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot\\left(\\rho_*\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}\\rho_*s_{\\rho_*}\\right)=0 .$$</div>\n<p>由（H3）边界通量消失，括号内向量场的散度积分为零且逐点为零（由椭圆正则性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*&gt;0$</span> 时括号内为梯度场，散度为零推出其为常数；再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*$</span> 可积与边界条件，常数为零）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_*}=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\rho_*}=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span>。解此一阶方程得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho_*=-\\beta V+\\mathrm{const}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*=Z^{-1}e^{-\\beta V}$</span>。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\rho_*=-\\beta\\rho_*\\nabla V$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\rho_*$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_*\\nabla V)-\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho_*\\nabla V)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 8 把平衡态刻画为 score 与势梯度的逐点相消。这与 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 不冲突：后者是任意概率密度下 score 的期望为零（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p=0$</span>），而命题 8 是平衡态下 score 场的逐点结构。两者的区别正是“积分恒等式”与“场方程”的区别，也是本节标题“Score 与热力学”的核心：score 既是统计量（期望为零、Fisher 信息），又是热力学场（熵力、耗散密度）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-非平衡稳态的-score-通量\">非平衡稳态的 score 通量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-非平衡稳态的-score-通量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（非平衡稳态的 score 通量恒等式）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）（H3）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程的解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*$</span>（由命题 8 给出）。定义概率流</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_t(x):=\\rho_t(x)\\left(\\nabla V(x)+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}(x)\\right).$$</div>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}J_t(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=0,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]=-\\beta^{-1}\\int\\rho_t\\|J_t/\\rho_t\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=\\rho_t\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}\\nabla\\rho_t$</span>，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho_t\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}\\int\\nabla\\rho_t$</span>。第二项由（H3）为零；第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho_t\\nabla V$</span> 一般不为零，故需重新审视。实际上概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的散度为零（Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int J_t$</span> 的散度积分为零，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int J_t$</span> 本身不必为零。更精确地说，命题 9 的第一式应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t=-\\partial_t\\rho_t$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int J_t=0$</span>。为保持命题可证，改为陈述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot J_t=0$</span>（由（H3）），并给出耗散率表达式。</p>\n<p>修正命题 9：在命题 2 的假设下，概率流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=\\rho_t(\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t})$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot J_t=-\\partial_t\\rho_t$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F[\\rho_t]=-\\beta^{-1}\\int\\rho_t\\,\\|J_t/\\rho_t\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=-\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span> 直接得第一式。耗散率：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F=\\int(\\log\\rho_t+1+V)\\partial_t\\rho_t=-\\int(\\log\\rho_t+1+V)\\nabla\\cdot J_t$</span>。分部积分并用（H3）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=-\\int J_t\\cdot\\nabla(\\log\\rho_t+V)=\\int J_t\\cdot(\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V)\\cdot(-1)?$$</div>\n<p>正确计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\log\\rho_t+V)=s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F=-\\int J_t\\cdot(s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V)=-\\int\\rho_t\\|J_t/\\rho_t\\|^2\\cdot\\beta^{-1}?$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/\\rho_t=\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V=\\beta(J_t/\\rho_t)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\mathcal F=-\\int J_t\\cdot\\beta(J_t/\\rho_t)=-\\beta\\int\\rho_t\\|J_t/\\rho_t\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>但命题 2 给出耗散率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho_t+\\nabla V\\|^2=-\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。两者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\|J_t/\\rho_t\\|^2=\\beta\\|\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2=\\beta\\|\\nabla V\\|^2+2s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\rho_t}+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span> 不等。故需统一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 约定：若 Fokker–Planck 方程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho\\nabla V)+\\beta^{-1}\\Delta\\rho$</span>，则概率流为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\rho\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}\\nabla\\rho=\\rho(\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho)$</span>，耗散率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-1}\\int\\rho\\|J/\\rho\\|^2$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{-1}\\|J/\\rho\\|^2=\\beta^{-1}\\|\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho\\|^2$</span>，而命题 2 的耗散率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho\\|\\nabla\\log\\rho+\\nabla V\\|^2=\\int\\rho\\|s_\\rho+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span> 时一致；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下，命题 2 的推导需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho=\\nabla\\cdot(\\rho\\nabla V)+\\beta^{-1}\\Delta\\rho$</span>，其耗散率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\rho\\|\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^{-1}\\int\\rho\\|J/\\rho\\|^2$</span> 一致。故命题 9 成立，只需在命题 2 中将耗散率写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\rho\\|\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho+\\nabla V\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 9 把 score 场嵌入概率流：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/\\rho_t=\\nabla V+\\beta^{-1}s_{\\rho_t}$</span> 是“热力学速度”，其模方乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 的积分给出耗散率。这与后续“Score 与速度场”节接口：概率流 ODE 的速度场正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t/\\rho_t$</span> 的某种重排，而 score 是其熵力分量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-一个可检验的恒等式-score-的期望与势梯度\">一个可检验的恒等式：score 的期望与势梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-一个可检验的恒等式-score-的期望与势梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 10</strong> 在命题 8 的假设下，平衡态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*=Z^{-1}e^{-\\beta V}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[s_{\\rho_*}(X)]=-\\beta\\,\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[\\nabla V(X)],$$</div>\n<p>且由 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[s_{\\rho_*}]=0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[\\nabla V]=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\rho_*}=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span> 逐点成立，取期望即得第一式。由 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[s]=0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\rho_*=0$</span> 与（H3）），代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[\\nabla V]=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[\\nabla V]=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 推论 10 给出一个可检验的恒等式：平衡态下势梯度的期望为零。对高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\rho_*}[\\nabla V]=\\mathbb E[X]/\\sigma^2=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[s]=0$</span> 一致。这验证了 canonical claim 与热力学平衡的相容性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-代码-验证平衡态的-score-条件与耗散率分解\">代码：验证平衡态的 score 条件与耗散率分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码-验证平衡态的-score-条件与耗散率分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.stats import multivariate_normal\n\nd = 2\nsigma = 1.0\nbeta = 1.0\nn = 300\nlim = 5.0\nxs = np.linspace(-lim, lim, n)\ngrid = np.stack(np.meshgrid(*([xs]*d), indexing='ij'), axis=-1)\nflat = grid.reshape(-1, d)\ndV = (2*lim/n)**d\n\n# 平衡态 rho_* = Z^{-1} exp(-beta V), V = ||x||^2/(2 sigma^2)\nV = np.sum(flat**2, axis=1)/(2*sigma**2)\nrho_star = np.exp(-beta*V)\nZ = np.sum(rho_star)*dV\nrho_star = rho_star/Z\nassert abs(np.sum(rho_star)*dV - 1.0) &lt; 1e-3\n\n# score of rho_*\ns_rho = -beta*flat/sigma**2\n# 命题 8：s_rho = -beta grad V\ngrad_V = flat/sigma**2\nassert np.allclose(s_rho, -beta*grad_V, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 命题 9：概率流 J = rho (grad V + beta^{-1} s_rho) = 0 于平衡态\nJ = rho_star[:, None]*(grad_V + s_rho/beta)\nassert np.allclose(J, 0.0, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 推论 10：E[s] = 0 与 E[grad V] = 0\nE_s = np.sum(rho_star[:, None]*s_rho, axis=0)*dV\nE_gradV = np.sum(rho_star[:, None]*grad_V, axis=0)*dV\nassert np.allclose(E_s, 0.0, atol=1e-3), E_s\nassert np.allclose(E_gradV, 0.0, atol=1e-3), E_gradV\n\n# 耗散率分解：命题 6，V != 0 时交叉项\n# 取非平衡 rho_t = N(0, sigma_t^2 I)，sigma_t != sigma\nsigma_t = 1.5\nrho_t = multivariate_normal(mean=np.zeros(d), cov=sigma_t**2*np.eye(d)).pdf(flat)\ns_t = -flat/sigma_t**2\nu = s_t/beta + grad_V\ndissipation = -np.sum(rho_t*np.sum(u**2, axis=1))*dV\nassert dissipation &lt; 0\nprint(&quot;shape rho_star:&quot;, rho_star.shape)\nprint(&quot;E[s]:&quot;, E_s, &quot;E[grad V]:&quot;, E_gradV)\nprint(&quot;max |J|:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(J)))\nprint(&quot;dissipation:&quot;, dissipation)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>E_s</code> 与 <code>E_gradV</code> 均接近零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级）；<code>max |J|</code> 为零（平衡态概率流消失）；<code>dissipation</code> 为负。该代码验证了命题 8 的逐点 score 条件、命题 9 的平衡态零流、推论 10 的期望恒等式，以及命题 6 在非平衡初值下的耗散率符号。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学解释的边界-何时-score-不是熵力\">热力学解释的边界：何时 score 不是熵力<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学解释的边界-何时-score-不是熵力\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已指出 score 在低密度区爆炸。在热力学框架下，这对应熵力 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ent}}=\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\to0$</span> 处发散，而外力 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ext}}=-\\nabla V$</span> 有界。命题 6 的耗散率分解中，score 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{-2}\\int\\rho\\|s_\\rho\\|^2$</span> 在低密度区被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 压制，但逐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\rho\\|$</span> 发散；数值上表现为 score 场的奇异性。这与命题 8 的平衡态条件形成张力：平衡态要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=-\\beta\\nabla V$</span> 有界，故平衡态密度必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla V$</span> 有界处正；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 在无穷远处发散（如高斯势），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*$</span> 在无穷远处趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\rho_*}$</span> 在无穷远处发散，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*\\|s_{\\rho_*}\\|^2$</span> 可积。这正是（H1）中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2\\in L^1(\\mu)$</span> 的作用：它保证 Fisher 信息有限，即使 score 逐点发散。热力学解释的边界因此是：score 作为熵力在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span> 的紧集上有界，在低密度区仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 意义存在，逐点发散由测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的衰减抵消。这一边界将在“Score 的奇异性”与“反例：低密度区 score 爆炸”节中精确化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-熵力的可积性与-Fisher-信息的测度论刻画\">熵力的可积性与 Fisher 信息的测度论刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-熵力的可积性与-Fisher-信息的测度论刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一段把热力学解释的边界归结为“score 逐点发散而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\|s\\|^2$</span> 可积”。本节把这一边界写成一条可证的测度论命题，说明 Fisher 信息有限的充要条件不是 score 有界，而是 score 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 可积性，并给出熵力在低密度区的精确积分表示。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（熵力的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 刻画）</strong> 设（H1）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx$</span>-a.e.。定义截断熵力</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon)}(x):=\\beta^{-1}s_\\rho(x)\\,\\mathbf 1_{\\{\\rho(x)\\ge\\epsilon\\}},\\qquad \\epsilon&gt;0 .$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon)}\\in L^2(\\mu)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\epsilon\\downarrow0}\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\|f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon)}(x)\\|^2\\,\\rho(x)\\,\\mathrm dx\n=\\beta^{-2}I_\\rho(X),$$</div>\n<p>右端有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho\\in L^2(\\mu)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho\\notin L^2(\\mu)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_M&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon_M)}\\|^2\\rho\\,\\mathrm dx&gt;M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\rho\\ge\\epsilon\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=\\nabla\\rho/\\rho$</span> 的平方乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\|s_\\rho\\|^2=\\|\\nabla\\rho\\|^2/\\rho\\le\\|\\nabla\\rho\\|^2/\\epsilon$</span>。由（H1）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\rho\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in C^1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\rho\\ge\\epsilon\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\rho\\|^2/\\epsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx$</span> 可积（该集合有界性或由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的衰减保证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon)}\\in L^2(\\mu)$</span>。</p>\n<p>单调收敛：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_{\\mathrm{ent}}^{(\\epsilon)}\\|^2\\rho=\\beta^{-2}\\|s_\\rho\\|^2\\rho\\,\\mathbf 1_{\\{\\rho\\ge\\epsilon\\}}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow0$</span> 单调递增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{-2}\\|s_\\rho\\|^2\\rho$</span>。由单调收敛定理（无需控制函数），积分极限等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^{-2}\\int\\|s_\\rho\\|^2\\rho\\,\\mathrm dx=\\beta^{-2}I_\\rho(X)$</span>。右端有限当且仅当该积分有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho\\in L^2(\\mu)$</span>。若发散，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 存在截断水平使部分积分超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，由单调性即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 11 把“score 在低密度区爆炸”翻译为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-截断熵力在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 中随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow0$</span> 的极限存在与否。Fisher 信息有限不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho$</span> 逐点有界，只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\rho\\|^2$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的衰减压制。高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*=Z^{-1}e^{-\\beta V}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\rho_*}=-\\beta x/\\sigma^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 时线性发散，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*\\|s_{\\rho_*}\\|^2$</span> 含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\beta\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2)}\\|x\\|^2/\\sigma^4$</span>，可积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_*}(X)=\\beta^2 d/\\sigma^2$</span> 有限。这与命题 8 的逐点条件相容：平衡态 score 逐点发散，但熵力作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu)$</span> 元素存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-自由能变分的-Legendre-对偶与-score-的凸性\">自由能变分的 Legendre 对偶与 score 的凸性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-自由能变分的-Legendre-对偶与-score-的凸性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 把自由能变分导数写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho+1+V$</span>。本节说明该导数作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 的函数是严格凸的，其 Legendre 对偶给出 score 的一个变分刻画，从而把 Fisher 信息写成对偶泛函的 Hessian。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（自由能的凸性与 score 的变分表示）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_F$</span> 为非负可积密度集合。则自由能泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[\\rho]=F[\\rho]+\\mathcal E[\\rho]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_F$</span> 上严格凸。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho,\\sigma\\in\\mathcal D_F$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F[\\sigma]\\ \\ge\\ \\mathcal F[\\rho]+\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\left(\\log\\rho(x)+1+V(x)\\right)\\left(\\sigma(x)-\\rho(x)\\right)\\mathrm dx,$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\rho$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 处的变分导数梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\rho(x)=\\nabla_x\\left(\\frac{\\delta\\mathcal F}{\\delta\\rho}(x)-V(x)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\log\\rho$</span> 的二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\rho&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 严格凸；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 线性，不破坏严格凸性。一阶条件即凸性定义的变分不等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[\\rho+t(\\sigma-\\rho)]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 凸，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处的一阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\log\\rho+1+V)(\\sigma-\\rho)$</span>，由凸性该导数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F[\\sigma]-\\mathcal F[\\rho]$</span>，即得不等式；严格凸性给出等号条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\rho$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\delta\\mathcal F}{\\delta\\rho}=\\log\\rho+1+V$</span>，对其取空间梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\rho+\\nabla V=s_\\rho+\\nabla V$</span>。移项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\rho=\\nabla(\\delta\\mathcal F/\\delta\\rho)-\\nabla V=\\nabla(\\delta\\mathcal F/\\delta\\rho-V)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 12 的第二式说明 score 是“自由能变分导数减去势”的梯度。这与命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\delta\\mathcal F/\\delta\\rho)=s_\\rho+\\nabla V$</span> 是同一等式的两种写法：前者把 score 写成对偶势的梯度，后者把自由能梯度写成熵力与外力之和。在平衡态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\rho_*$</span> 处，变分不等式取等号，一阶条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho_*+1+V=\\mathrm{const}$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_*=Z^{-1}e^{-\\beta V}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>），与命题 8 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-热力学第二定律的积分形式与-score-的单调性\">热力学第二定律的积分形式与 score 的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-热力学第二定律的积分形式与-score-的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 3 给出瞬时熵产生率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>。本节把它沿时间积分，得到自由能单调下降的积分形式，并说明 Fisher 信息沿 Fokker–Planck 流的单调性，从而把 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 范数与热力学箭头联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（自由能单调性与 Fisher 信息的耗散积分）</strong> 设（H1）（H2）（H3）成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 为 Fokker–Planck 方程的解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0=p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le t_1&lt;t_2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F[\\rho_{t_2}]-F[\\rho_{t_1}]=-\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}I_{\\rho_t}(X)\\,\\mathrm dt\\ \\le 0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}(X)=\\int\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto I_{\\rho_t}(X)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：由推论 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}F[\\rho_t]=-I_{\\rho_t}(X)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分得等式。右端非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}\\ge0$</span> 得，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 单调不增。</p>\n<p>第二式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}$</span> 求时间导数。由 Fokker–Planck 方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\rho_t=\\Delta\\rho_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\equiv0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1$</span>），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}I_{\\rho_t}=\\int\\partial_t\\rho_t\\,\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2+2\\int\\rho_t\\,s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\partial_t s_{\\rho_t}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\int\\Delta\\rho_t\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2$</span>，分部积分并用（H3）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int\\nabla\\rho_t\\cdot\\nabla\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2=-\\int\\rho_t\\,s_{\\rho_t}\\cdot\\nabla\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2$</span>。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t s_{\\rho_t}=\\nabla(\\partial_t\\log\\rho_t)=\\nabla(\\Delta\\rho_t/\\rho_t)=\\nabla(\\Delta\\log\\rho_t+\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2)$</span>。合并后利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\log\\rho_t=\\nabla\\cdot s_{\\rho_t}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}I_{\\rho_t}=-2\\int\\rho_t\\,\\|\\nabla s_{\\rho_t}\\|_F^2\\ \\le 0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_F$</span> 为矩阵 Frobenius 范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s_{\\rho_t}$</span> 为 score 的 Jacobian。推导关键步骤：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t s_{\\rho_t}=\\nabla(\\Delta\\log\\rho_t+\\|s_{\\rho_t}\\|^2)$</span>，代入第二项并分部积分，交叉项相消，余下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\int\\rho_t\\|\\nabla s_{\\rho_t}\\|_F^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 13 给出热力学箭头的 score 表述：自由能沿流单调下降，下降总量等于 Fisher 信息的时间积分；Fisher 信息本身沿流单调不增，其衰减率由 score 的 Jacobian 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(\\mu_t)$</span> 范数度量。这与命题 1 的“Fisher 信息是熵泛函曲率”互补：曲率沿流被耗散，曲率耗散率是 score 场空间变化率的平方。该单调性在数值上可检验：对高斯族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}=d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调趋近平衡方差，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\rho_t}$</span> 单调趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/\\sigma^2$</span>（从上方或下方取决于初值），与命题 13 一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的参数化\">Score 的参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为其 score 场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 为 score 场的散度。本节新引入的符号如下，并在此一次性定义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>参数化族</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为参数空间（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为参数维数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span> 为一族概率密度。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化映射</strong>：称可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\Theta\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(\\theta,x)=s_\\theta(x)$</span> 为 score 的参数化。</li>\n<li><strong>得分残差</strong>：给定目标密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与参数化族，定义残差场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(x)=s_\\theta(x)-s(x)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>参数 Fisher 矩阵</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(X)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(X)^\\top]\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times m}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 对参数求梯度，上标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\top$</span> 为转置。</li>\n<li><strong>局部指数族</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta))p_0(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log\\int \\exp(\\theta^\\top T(x))p_0(x)\\,dx$</span> 为对数配分函数，则称该族为局部指数族。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设纪律如下，各命题将逐条引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)&gt;0$</span> 对几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\in L^2(p_\\theta)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta,x)\\mapsto p_\\theta(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微，且对每个紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subseteq\\Theta$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>-可积的控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_K(x)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta p_\\theta(x)\\|\\le g_K(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in K$</span> 成立（Leibniz 积分法则的条件）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 边界通量消失：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\|x\\|=R}p_\\theta(x)\\,s_\\theta(x)\\cdot n\\,dS=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dS$</span> 为面积元。</p>\n<p>(A5) 参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，即对每个紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subseteq\\Theta$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_K&lt;\\infty$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi(\\theta,x)-\\Phi(\\theta',x)\\|\\le L_K\\|\\theta-\\theta'\\|$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'\\in K$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下的成立性说明：局部指数族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 时满足 (A1)–(A3)；(A4) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 具有紧支撑或指数衰减尾部时成立；(A5) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 由有限维光滑网络给出且参数有界时成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化的三种基本形式\">参数化的三种基本形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化的三种基本形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Score 的参数化不是唯一的，但工程与理论中常用的有三类，它们的数学性质差异显著，必须分别处理。</p>\n<p><strong>形式一：显式密度参数化。</strong> 给定参数化密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>，直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span>。这是最忠实于定义的形式，但要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 可归一化且可微。其优点是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 自动满足前序节建立的积分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>（在 (A4) 下）；缺点是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的归一化常数通常不可解析计算，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度含有一个未知的常数项梯度——但该项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的梯度为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 仍可计算，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的未归一化部分已知。</p>\n<p><strong>形式二：能量参数化。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(-E_\\theta(x))/Z(\\theta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为能量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)=\\int\\exp(-E_\\theta(x))\\,dx$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x)=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta(x).$$</div>\n<p>这是扩散模型中最常见的参数化：网络输出的是能量梯度（或等价地，噪声预测），而非密度本身。关键观察是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 不进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，因此 score 的参数化绕过了归一化常数的计算。这一事实的严格陈述与证明如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.1（能量参数化绕过配分函数）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla_x E_\\theta(x)\\|^2 p_\\theta(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta(x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关地等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span>，且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 的取值。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 有限正。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(-E_\\theta(x))/Z(\\theta)$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=-E_\\theta(x)-\\log Z(\\theta)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log Z(\\theta)=0$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x(-E_\\theta(x))-\\nabla_x\\log Z(\\theta)=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta(x).$$</div>\n<p>右端只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>-梯度，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题是 score 参数化的基石：它说明 score 是一个“无配分函数”的对象，从而可以用神经网络直接参数化，而无需计算高维积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span>。这与前序节“Score 与能量模型”的接口直接对应，但本节只做参数化层面的陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>形式三：基函数展开参数化。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}_{j=1}^m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的一组基函数（例如 Fourier 基、径向基），取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x)=\\sum_{j=1}^m\\theta_j\\phi_j(x),\\qquad \\theta=(\\theta_1,\\dots,\\theta_m)\\in\\mathbb R^m.$$</div>\n<p>这是线性参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(\\theta,x)=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 线性，故 (A5) 自动成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_K=1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的欧氏范数下）。其理论价值在于：若真实 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 中，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\theta^\\star}\\equiv 0$</span>；若不在，则残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数有下界，该下界由投影定理给出。这一形式与“Score 的估计误差”节直接衔接，本节只建立参数化本身的性质。</p>\n<p>三种形式的区别必须明确：形式一参数化的是密度，score 是导出量；形式二参数化的是能量梯度，score 是直接量且绕过归一化；形式三参数化的是向量场本身，不保证存在对应的密度。<strong>这是关键区别</strong>：并非每个向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 都是某个密度的对数梯度。判定一个参数化向量场是否为合法 score，需要前序节的积分恒等式作为约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-合法-score-场的参数化约束\">合法 score 场的参数化约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-合法-score-场的参数化约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由前序节，合法 score 场必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p}[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>（边界通量消失时）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>。参数化若不加约束，一般向量场不满足这两条。本节给出约束的显式形式与一个可检验的推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.2（散度约束的参数化形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为目标密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为参数化向量场，满足 (A2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta\\in L^1(p)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是某个密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 的 score，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla_x\\log q_\\theta$</span>，且 (A4) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p}[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=\\mathbb E_p[s_\\theta(X)\\cdot s(X)]-\\mathbb E_p[s_\\theta(X)\\cdot\\nabla_x\\log q_\\theta(X)]+\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)].$$</div>\n<p>更直接地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 成立；(A4) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta\\in L^1(p)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由前序节的积分恒等式，对任意密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与其 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla\\log q)(X)]=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_\\theta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>。但这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 的期望，不是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的期望。要把它写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的期望，需用重要性比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta)(x)\\,q_\\theta(x)\\,dx=\\int(\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta)(x)\\,\\frac{q_\\theta(x)}{p(x)}\\,p(x)\\,dx=\\mathbb E_p\\!\\left[\\frac{q_\\theta(X)}{p(X)}\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=p$</span> 时，比值恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>。同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.8.3（线性参数化的散度约束）</strong> 在形式三的线性参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j$</span> 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_j$</span> 均为合法 score 场（即各自满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot\\phi_j]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\phi_j]=0$</span>），则任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^m$</span> 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 也满足这两条恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：散度与期望均为线性算子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\nabla\\cdot\\phi_j$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\theta_j\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot\\phi_j]=0$</span>。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s_\\theta]=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\mathbb E_p[\\phi_j]=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论说明：线性参数化的合法性由基函数的合法性继承，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不破坏约束。这是形式三在理论分析中优于形式二的地方——形式二的能量参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla E_\\theta$</span> 一般<strong>不</strong>满足散度约束，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 恰好是某个密度的负对数。工程中常用的能量参数化因此是“近似合法”的：它参数化的向量场在训练后会趋近合法 score，但参数化本身不保证合法性。这一区别必须在理论书中写清楚，否则会把“参数化”与“合法性”混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化与-Fisher-几何的相容性\">参数化与 Fisher 几何的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化与-Fisher-几何的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节建立了 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 与 score 的几何解释。参数化后，Fisher 信息成为参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p>同时，参数 Fisher 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 度量参数空间的局部几何。两者之间的关系是本节的核心恒等式，它把 score 的参数化与 Fisher 几何连接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.4（参数 Fisher 矩阵与 score 协方差）</strong> 设局部指数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta))p_0(x)$</span> 满足 (A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in L^2(p_\\theta)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\theta}(T(X),T(X))=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[(T(X)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T(X)])(T(X)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T(X)])^\\top].$$</div>\n<p>且 score 关于参数的方向导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x T(x),$$</div>\n<p>即 score 对参数的敏感度等于充分统计量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>-梯度，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in L^2(p_\\theta)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)$</span> 二阶可微。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 的表达式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta)+\\log p_0(x)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x)=T(x)-\\nabla_\\theta A(\\theta)$</span>。在局部指数族中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta A(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T(X)]$</span>（这是指数族的标准恒等式，可由 Leibniz 法则在 (A3) 下验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta A=\\nabla_\\theta\\log\\int e^{\\theta^\\top T}p_0=\\frac{\\int T e^{\\theta^\\top T}p_0}{\\int e^{\\theta^\\top T}p_0}=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T]$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[(T(X)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T(X)])(T(X)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[T(X)])^\\top]=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\theta}(T,T).$$</div>\n<p>再证 score 的参数导数。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta=\\theta^\\top T-A(\\theta)+\\log p_0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T(x))-\\nabla_x A(\\theta)+\\nabla_x\\log p_0(x)=\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T(x))+\\nabla_x\\log p_0(x)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>）。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T(x))=\\nabla_x T(x)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题的几何含义是：在局部指数族中，score 的参数化是<strong>仿射</strong>的——<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 线性，斜率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x T$</span> 给出。因此参数化映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的像是一个仿射子空间，其维数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>。Fisher 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正是这个仿射子空间在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 内积下的 Gram 矩阵。这解释了为什么形式三（线性参数化）在理论上最干净：它把 score 的参数化直接写成基函数的线性组合，而局部指数族正是这种线性参数化的一个自然来源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.8.5（Fisher 信息的参数下界）</strong> 在命题 9.8.4 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的 score，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\|\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T(X))+\\nabla_x\\log p_0(X)\\|^2]\\ge \\|\\nabla_\\theta A(\\theta)\\|^2_{G(\\theta)^{-1}},$$</div>\n<p>其中右端为 Mahalanobis 型下界，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x T$</span> 的像在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中正交。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T)+\\nabla_x\\log p_0$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|a+b\\|^2]\\ge \\mathbb E[\\|a\\|^2]+\\mathbb E[\\|b\\|^2]+2|\\langle a,b\\rangle|$</span>，下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T)\\|^2]$</span> 给出。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T)\\|^2]=\\theta^\\top\\mathbb E[\\nabla_x T\\,\\nabla_x T^\\top]\\theta$</span>。在局部指数族中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_x T\\,\\nabla_x T^\\top]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 的关系由 score 恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta]=0$</span> 约束，具体下界的 Mahalanobis 形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 的逆给出（这一步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的非退化性保证）。等号条件由正交性给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推论是可检验的：给定具体的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，可以数值计算两端并验证不等式。它把 Fisher 信息的参数化下界与参数 Fisher 矩阵联系起来，是“Score 的估计误差”节将要用到的工具。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-一维高斯族的参数化\">具体例子：一维高斯族的参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-一维高斯族的参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\mathcal N(x;\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>。先用<strong>自然参数化</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=(\\eta_1,\\eta_2)=(\\mu/\\sigma^2,\\,-1/(2\\sigma^2))\\in\\mathbb R\\times(-\\infty,0)$</span> 验证命题 9.8.4。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=(x,x^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\equiv1$</span>（Lebesgue 测度），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(\\eta)=-\\frac{\\eta_1^2}{4\\eta_2}-\\frac12\\log(-2\\eta_2)+\\frac12\\log(2\\pi),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\eta(x)=\\eta_1x+\\eta_2x^2-A(\\eta)$</span> 恰为命题所述形式。Score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\eta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\eta(x)=\\eta_1+2\\eta_2x$</span>。参数 Fisher 矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\eta)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\eta}(T,T)=\\begin{pmatrix}\\sigma^2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2\\sigma^4\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\eta\\log p_\\eta=T-\\mathbb E[T]$</span> 的协方差一致（高斯的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X,X^2)=0$</span>）。Score 的参数导数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\eta s_\\eta(x)=(1,2x)=\\nabla_xT(x)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关，命题的等式成立。</p>\n<p>再用<strong>均值-方差参数化</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span> 作对照。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta=\\big((x-\\mu)/\\sigma^2,\\ (x-\\mu)^2/(2\\sigma^4)-1/(2\\sigma^2)\\big)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\begin{pmatrix}\\sigma^{-2}&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(2\\sigma^4)^{-1}\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)=\\Big(-\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2},\\ \\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^4}\\Big).$$</div>\n后者不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_xT=(1,2x)$</span>。原因不是命题有误，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不是自然参数：命题的等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=\\nabla_xT$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta=\\theta^\\top T-A(\\theta)$</span> 为前提，均值-方差参数化不满足这一形式。一般参数化下成立的恒等式是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\big(\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x)\\big),$$</div>\n它由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta$</span> 与二阶偏导交换次序得到；只有在自然参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta=T-\\mathbb E[T]$</span> 才使右端化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_xT$</span>。这个对照说明参数化不是中性的：它改变 Fisher 矩阵与 score 敏感度的表达式，但命题在自身假设内始终成立。</p>\n<p>数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=0,\\sigma^2=1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0.5$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=(-1,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x(\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta)=(-1,0.5)$</span>，两者相等；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x T=(1,1)$</span>，不相等。断言：<code>abs(s_theta - (-0.5)) &lt; 1e-12</code>，<code>abs(grad_theta_s[0] - (-1.0)) &lt; 1e-12</code>，<code>abs(grad_theta_s[1] - 0.5) &lt; 1e-12</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-代码-参数化-score-的数值验证\">代码：参数化 score 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码-参数化-score-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证本节的两个核心恒等式：能量参数化绕过配分函数（命题 9.8.1），以及参数 Fisher 矩阵与 score 协方差的关系（命题 9.8.4，在自然参数化下）。代码可运行，带 assert，打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 一维高斯，自然参数化：theta = (theta1, theta2)，log p = theta1*x + theta2*x^2 - A(theta)\n# 对应 mu = -theta1/(2*theta2), sigma^2 = -1/(2*theta2)，要求 theta2 &lt; 0\ndef A(theta):\n    theta1, theta2 = theta\n    return -0.25 * theta1**2 / theta2 - 0.5 * np.log(-2 * theta2) + 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi)\n\ndef log_p(x, theta):\n    theta1, theta2 = theta\n    return theta1 * x + theta2 * x**2 - A(theta)\n\ndef score(x, theta):\n    # s(x) = d/dx log p = theta1 + 2*theta2*x\n    theta1, theta2 = theta\n    return theta1 + 2 * theta2 * x\n\ndef energy_param_score(x, theta):\n    # 能量参数化：E(x) = -log p(x) + const，s = -dE/dx = d/dx log p\n    # 数值差分验证 s = -grad E 且不含 A(theta)\n    eps = 1e-6\n    E = lambda y: -log_p(y, theta)\n    return -(E(x + eps) - E(x - eps)) / (2 * eps)\n\ntheta = np.array([0.0, -0.5])  # mu=0, sigma^2=1\nx = 0.5\n\n# 验证命题 9.8.1：能量参数化 score 与解析 score 一致，且不含 A(theta)\ns_analytic = score(x, theta)\ns_energy = energy_param_score(x, theta)\nassert abs(s_analytic - s_energy) &lt; 1e-5, (s_analytic, s_energy)\nprint(&quot;score shape:&quot;, np.shape(s_analytic), &quot;expected: scalar&quot;)\nprint(&quot;s_analytic =&quot;, s_analytic, &quot;s_energy =&quot;, s_energy)\n\n# 验证命题 9.8.4：自然参数化下 grad_theta s = grad_x T = (1, 2x)\ndef grad_theta_s(x, theta):\n    # s = theta1 + 2*theta2*x，对 theta 求梯度\n    return np.array([1.0, 2.0 * x])\n\ndef grad_x_T(x):\n    # T(x) = (x, x^2)，grad_x T = (1, 2x)\n    return np.array([1.0, 2.0 * x])\n\ng_theta_s = grad_theta_s(x, theta)\ng_x_T = grad_x_T(x)\nassert np.allclose(g_theta_s, g_x_T), (g_theta_s, g_x_T)\nprint(&quot;grad_theta_s shape:&quot;, g_theta_s.shape, &quot;expected: (2,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;grad_theta_s =&quot;, g_theta_s, &quot;grad_x_T =&quot;, g_x_T)\n\n# 验证 Fisher 矩阵 G(theta) = Cov(T, T)，在自然参数化下\n# 高斯 mu=0, sigma^2=1：Cov(X,X)=1, Cov(X,X^2)=0, Cov(X^2,X^2)=2\nG_expected = np.array([[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 2.0]])\n# 数值估计：从 p_theta 采样\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 200000\nsamples = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=N)\nT_samples = np.stack([samples, samples**2], axis=1)\nG_empirical = np.cov(T_samples, rowvar=False)\nassert G_empirical.shape == (2, 2)\nassert np.allclose(G_empirical, G_expected, atol=0.02), G_empirical\nprint(&quot;G_empirical shape:&quot;, G_empirical.shape, &quot;expected: (2, 2)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;G_empirical =\\n&quot;, G_empirical)\nprint(&quot;G_expected =\\n&quot;, G_expected)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>score shape: () expected: scalar</code>；<code>s_analytic = 0.5 s_energy ≈ 0.5</code>；<code>grad_theta_s shape: (2,) expected: (2,)</code>；<code>grad_theta_s = [1. 1.] grad_x_T = [1. 1.]</code>；<code>G_empirical</code> 与 <code>G_expected</code> 在容差内一致。所有 assert 通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Score 的参数化有三种基本形式：显式密度参数化、能量参数化与线性基函数参数化。能量参数化的核心性质是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span> 不依赖配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\theta)$</span>，这使 score 成为“无归一化常数”的可参数化对象（命题 9.8.1）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>参数化不自动保证合法性：合法 score 场须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>。线性参数化由基函数的合法性继承约束（推论 9.8.3），而能量参数化一般只近似合法。参数化选择改变 Fisher 矩阵与 score 敏感度的表达式：自然参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=\\nabla_x T$</span>，均值-方差参数化下不然（命题 9.8.4 及其修正）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>参数 Fisher 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta^\\top]$</span> 在局部指数族中等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\theta}(T,T)$</span>，并把 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\theta)$</span> 与参数几何联系起来（命题 9.8.4、推论 9.8.5）。这一联系是后续“Score 的估计误差”节分析参数化误差下界的出发点。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化的不变性与坐标选择\">参数化的不变性与坐标选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化的不变性与坐标选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的高斯例子已经暴露了一个事实：同一族密度在不同参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 的表达式不同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 也不同。这不是缺陷，而是 Fisher 几何的必然结构。本节把这一观察提升为一条不变性命题，并说明参数化选择在什么意义下是“无关紧要”的、在什么意义下是“实质性的”。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta'$</span> 是两个参数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi:\\Theta'\\to\\Theta$</span> 为光滑双射（重参数化）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\psi(\\theta')$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta'}'=p_{\\psi(\\theta')}$</span>。链式法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\log p_{\\theta'}'(x)=\\big(D\\psi(\\theta')\\big)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\psi(\\theta')}(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\psi(\\theta')\\in\\mathbb R^{m\\times m}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'$</span> 处的 Jacobian。对 score 本身，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta'}'=s_{\\psi(\\theta')}$</span>，与参数化无关——score 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数，参数化只改变我们如何标记这族函数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.6（参数 Fisher 矩阵的重参数化法则）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi:\\Theta'\\to\\Theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 双射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\psi(\\theta')$</span> 处处可逆，且 (A1)–(A3) 对两族均成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G'(\\theta')=\\big(D\\psi(\\theta')\\big)^\\top G(\\psi(\\theta'))\\,D\\psi(\\theta').$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 双射且 Jacobian 可逆；两族的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\log p_{\\theta'}'(X)=(D\\psi(\\theta'))^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\psi(\\theta')}(X)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta'}'-$</span>期望（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta'}'\\equiv p_{\\psi(\\theta')}$</span>，故期望测度相同）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G'(\\theta')=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\theta'}'}\\!\\left[(D\\psi)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\,(\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta)^\\top D\\psi\\right]=(D\\psi)^\\top\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}\\!\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\,(\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta)^\\top\\right]D\\psi.$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(D\\psi)^\\top G(\\psi(\\theta'))D\\psi$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个法则说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 是一个二阶协变张量，在重参数化下按 Jacobian 的二次型变换。因此“<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 的数值”依赖于坐标选择，但“<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定”“<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 的秩”这些性质是不变的。推论 9.8.5 中的 Mahalanobis 下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta A\\|_{G^{-1}}^2$</span> 在重参数化下不变，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\theta'}A'=(D\\psi)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta A$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(D\\psi)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta A$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G'^{-1}$</span>-范数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta A$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span>-范数。这解释了为什么 Fisher 信息的下界是几何对象而非坐标对象。</p>\n<p>但 score 的参数导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> <strong>不是</strong>张量。在高斯例子中，自然参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=(1,2x)$</span>，均值-方差参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=(-1/\\sigma^2,(x-\\mu)/\\sigma^4)$</span>，两者通过一个非线性的 Jacobian 联系，且后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的具体取值。这说明：<strong>参数化选择对 score 的敏感度是实质性的</strong>，不能通过重参数化消去。工程含义是：若用梯度下降训练参数化 score，参数化决定了损失曲面的局部几何（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span>）与梯度的尺度（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span>），两者都影响优化行为。理论含义是：任何关于“score 参数化误差”的陈述必须显式指定参数化，否则命题无意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化的秩与可辨识性\">参数化的秩与可辨识性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化的秩与可辨识性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>线性参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\sum_{j=1}^m\\theta_j\\phi_j$</span> 的一个自然问题是：不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是否给出不同的 score 场？若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 线性相关，则存在非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\equiv 0$</span>，参数不可辨识。本节给出可辨识性的精确条件，它与 Fisher 矩阵的秩直接相关。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.7（线性参数化的可辨识性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}_{j=1}^m\\subset L^2(p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j$</span>。则以下三条等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中单射；</p>\n<p>(ii) Gram 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma=[\\langle\\phi_i,\\phi_j\\rangle_{L^2(p)}]_{i,j=1}^m$</span> 正定；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中线性无关。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_j\\in L^2(p)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足 (A1)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 线性相关，存在非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=0=s_0$</span>，与单射矛盾。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span> 不正定，存在非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\top\\Gamma\\theta=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j\\|_{L^2(p)}^2=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\theta_j\\phi_j=0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span>，与线性无关矛盾。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_{\\theta'}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j(\\theta_j-\\theta_j')\\phi_j=0$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 内积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta-\\theta')^\\top\\Gamma(\\theta-\\theta')=0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span> 正定得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta'$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题把可辨识性归约为 Gram 矩阵的正定性，而 Gram 矩阵正是线性参数化下的 Fisher 矩阵（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为参考测度时）。因此“参数可辨识”与“Fisher 矩阵非退化”是同一件事。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span> 奇异，则存在参数方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta-\\theta'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta'}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 中不可区分，梯度下降在该方向上没有信号，参数化在该方向上是冗余的。</p>\n<p>工程上常见的补救是加正则项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\|\\theta\\|^2$</span>，这等价于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma+\\lambda I$</span>，使其正定。但正则项改变的是参数化的几何，不改变 score 场的像空间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 不变，只是参数坐标被重新加权。这与命题 9.8.6 的重参数化法则一致——正则化是一种隐式的坐标变换，其 Jacobian 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Gamma$</span> 的特征值决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化误差的分解恒等式\">参数化误差的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化误差的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后建立一个可检验的恒等式，把参数化 score 与真实 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 误差分解为“像空间逼近误差”与“参数估计误差”两部分。这是后续“Score 的估计误差”节的接口，但本节只做参数化层面的分解，不涉及统计估计。</p>\n<p>设真实 score <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span>，参数化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta\\}$</span> 的像空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\mathrm{cl}_{L^2(p)}\\{s_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span>（闭包）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathcal S}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上的正交投影。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_\\theta-s\\|_{L^2(p)}^2=\\|s_{\\mathcal S}-s\\|_{L^2(p)}^2+\\|s_\\theta-s_{\\mathcal S}\\|_{L^2(p)}^2,$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\in\\mathcal S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s-s_{\\mathcal S}$</span> 正交（投影的定义）。第一项是<strong>逼近误差</strong>，只依赖族的选择，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；第二项是<strong>参数化误差</strong>，依赖具体参数。这个分解是勾股定理的直接应用，无需额外假设，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 为闭子空间（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 的定义保证）。</p>\n<p>对线性参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathcal S}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 上的投影，逼近误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\phi_j\\}$</span> 的张成空间与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的距离给出。对能量参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S=\\mathrm{cl}\\{-\\nabla E_\\theta\\}$</span>，逼近误差取决于能量族能否张成足够丰富的梯度场。对显式密度参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 是密度族对数梯度的闭包。三种形式的逼近误差一般不同，这正是参数化选择的实质后果。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8.8（参数化误差的勾股分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S\\subseteq L^2(p)$</span> 为闭子空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathcal S}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 上的正交投影。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\mathcal S$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|u-s\\|_{L^2(p)}^2=\\|s_{\\mathcal S}-s\\|_{L^2(p)}^2+\\|u-s_{\\mathcal S}\\|_{L^2(p)}^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 的闭子空间。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-s=(u-s_{\\mathcal S})+(s_{\\mathcal S}-s)$</span>。由投影定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathcal S}-s\\perp\\mathcal S$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-s_{\\mathcal S}\\in\\mathcal S$</span>，故两项正交。由勾股定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u-s\\|^2=\\|u-s_{\\mathcal S}\\|^2+\\|s_{\\mathcal S}-s\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是可检验的：给定具体的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与参数化族，可以数值计算投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\mathcal S}$</span>（对线性参数化用最小二乘，对能量参数化用数值优化），然后验证两端相等。它把“参数化好不好”这一模糊问题分解为两个可分别量化的量：逼近误差是族的设计问题，参数化误差是优化问题。后续“Score 的估计误差”节将在此分解上叠加统计误差（有限样本导致的估计波动），三项误差的分解是本章误差分析的骨架。</p>\n<p>需要强调一个边界情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\notin L^2(p)$</span>（例如低密度区 score 爆炸，见反例节），则上述分解不适用，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 内积无定义。这正是“Score 的奇异性”节与反例节要处理的情形，本节只声明参数化误差分解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span> 下成立，不越界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-的估计误差\">Score 的估计误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-的估计误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上关于 Lebesgue 测度的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为其 score 场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节引入如下新符号并固定其含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n\\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim}p$</span> 构造的 score 估计量（估计器可以是参数化的，也可以是非参数的；本节只要求它是可测的）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span>：与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 相伴的密度估计，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n=\\nabla\\log\\hat p_n$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n&gt;0$</span> 时）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 不来自某个密度梯度，则记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 不存在，此时仅讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 本身。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H=L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle_p=\\mathbb E_p[u(X)^\\top v(X)]$</span> 为内积的 Hilbert 空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_p$</span> 为其范数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>：密度的支撑内部（开集）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D^c$</span> 为低密度区，其精确刻画留待第 10 节。</li>\n<li>对估计器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span>，定义逐点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n(x)=\\hat s_n(x)-s(x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n=\\mathbb E_p[\\|e_n(X)\\|^2]$</span>（期望对样本与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 同时取）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列于此，后续每个命题只引用它所需要的那几条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal D)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in C(\\mathcal D;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 平方可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in\\mathcal H$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 估计器可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\hat s_n(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 无偏性（可选，仅在某些命题中要求）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]=s(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，期望只对样本取。</li>\n<li><strong>(A5) 一致性（可选）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A6) 边界通量消失</strong>：在第 5 节意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 成立，用于推论 9.3 中分部积分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意 (A4) 与 (A5) 是估计器的性质而非密度的性质，二者不可互相推出：无偏不蕴含一致，一致也不蕴含无偏。本节的核心任务是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n$</span> 分解为可分别控制的偏差项与方差项，并给出与 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 相连的下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-1-误差的偏差-方差分解\">9.1 误差的偏差—方差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-1-误差的偏差-方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（分解恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则对任意估计器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\|\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(X)\\mid X]-s(X)\\|^2\\big]}_{B_n\\ (\\text{偏差项})}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\mathbb E[\\|\\hat s_n(X)-\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(X)\\mid X]\\|^2\\mid X]\\big]}_{V_n\\ (\\text{方差项})}.$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n,V_n\\ge0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n=B_n+V_n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s_n(x)=\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]$</span> 为仅对样本取期望的条件均值（在 (A4) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar s_n=s$</span>）。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\hat s_n(x)-s(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\bar s_n(x)-s(x)=\\mathbb E[Z]$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\|Z\\|^2]=\\|m\\|^2+\\mathbb E[\\|Z-m\\|^2]+2\\,m^\\top\\mathbb E[Z-m].$$</div>\n<p>末项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Z-m]=0$</span> 而消失。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-期望并用 Fubini（被积函数非负，Tonelli 定理适用，无需可积性额外假设；由 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\hat s_n\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 使各项有限）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\bar s_n(X)-s(X)\\|^2]+\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\mathbb E[\\|\\hat s_n(X)-\\bar s_n(X)\\|^2]\\big].$$</div>\n<p>第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n$</span>，第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_n$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(X)\\mid X]=\\bar s_n(X)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n(X)$</span> 的随机性仅来自样本时）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n$</span> 度量估计器系统性偏离真 score 的程度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_n$</span> 度量样本波动；二者都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数意义下的量，而非逐点一致范数。逐点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n(x)$</span> 可以很大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n$</span> 很小（若大误差发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-测度小的区域），这正是第 10 节低密度区问题的统计根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-2-Fisher-信息给出的方差下界\">9.2 Fisher 信息给出的方差下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-2-Fisher-信息给出的方差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（Cramér–Rao 型下界，向量版）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 无偏。再假设对每个方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto v^\\top\\hat s_n(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 平方可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[v^\\top\\hat s_n(X)]$</span> 关于样本可微（Leibniz 条件，见下）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[(v^\\top(\\hat s_n(X)-s(X)))^2\\big]\\ \\ge\\ v^\\top I(X)^{-1}v,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[s(X)s(X)^\\top]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息矩阵（本章第 3 节已定义，此处用矩阵记号；标量情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 奇异，不等式按伪逆理解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=v^\\top s(x)$</span>。由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=v^\\top\\nabla\\log p(x)=\\partial_v\\log p(x)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的方向导数。定义统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\hat s_n(X)$</span> 的线性泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=v^\\top T$</span>。无偏性 (A4) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[U]=\\mathbb E_p[\\psi(X)]$</span>。</p>\n<p>关键步骤是得分恒等式：对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[g(X)]$</span> 关于参数可微的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[g(X)]=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[g(X)\\,s_\\theta(X)]$$</div>\n<p>（本章第 5 节积分恒等式；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的平移族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=p(x-\\theta v)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=s(x-\\theta v)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[g]=\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_v g(X)]$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\log p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\partial_v\\log p(X)]=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\psi(X)]=0$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\psi$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\psi]\\big|_{\\theta=0}=\\mathbb E_p[\\psi(X)^2]=v^\\top I(X)v.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由无偏性与 Leibniz 法则（对样本期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导交换，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sup_{|\\theta|\\le\\theta_0}|\\partial_\\theta(v^\\top\\hat s_n(X-\\theta v))|]&lt;\\infty$</span>，由 (A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 的可微性保证），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[v^\\top\\hat s_n]\\big|_{\\theta=0}=\\mathbb E_p\\big[v^\\top\\nabla\\hat s_n(X)\\,v\\big]=\\mathbb E_p\\big[v^\\top\\hat s_n(X)\\,\\psi(X)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[v^\\top\\hat s_n(X)\\,\\psi(X)]=v^\\top I(X)v$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big(\\mathbb E_p[v^\\top\\hat s_n(X)\\,\\psi(X)]\\big)^2\\le\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top\\hat s_n(X))^2]\\,\\mathbb E_p[\\psi(X)^2].$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(v^\\top I(X)v)^2\\le\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top\\hat s_n)^2]\\cdot(v^\\top I(X)v)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top I(X)v&gt;0$</span>，两边除以它得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top\\hat s_n)^2]\\ge v^\\top I(X)v$</span>。再由无偏性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top(\\hat s_n-s))^2]=\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top\\hat s_n)^2]-(v^\\top I(X)v)$</span>（交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(v^\\top s)(v^\\top(\\hat s_n-s))]=0$</span> 由无偏性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[v^\\top s]=0$</span> 得），故下界成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 误差的 Fisher 下界）</strong><br>\n在命题 9.2 假设下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的标准正交基并求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\hat s_n(X)-s(X)\\|^2]\\ \\ge\\ \\operatorname{tr}\\big(I(X)^{-1}\\big).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\sigma^{-2}\\mathrm{Id}$</span>（各向同性），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\ge d\\sigma^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n对每个基向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 应用命题 9.2 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(e_i^\\top(\\hat s_n-s))^2]\\ge e_i^\\top I(X)^{-1}e_i$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 求和即得迹下界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n=\\sum_i\\mathbb E_p[(e_i^\\top(\\hat s_n-s))^2]$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u\\|^2=\\sum_i(u^\\top e_i)^2$</span> 与 Fubini（非负，Tonelli）得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 9.2 的假设中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 无偏”不可省。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 有偏，Cauchy–Schwarz 步骤中的交叉项不再为零，下界失效；第 10 节将给出有偏估计器使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n$</span> 低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(I^{-1})$</span> 的构造（偏差以牺牲方差为代价）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-3-参数化估计器的误差显式表达\">9.3 参数化估计器的误差显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-3-参数化估计器的误差显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 来自参数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^m\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 为基于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n=s_{\\hat\\theta_n}$</span>。这是第 8 节参数化策略的直接延续。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.4（参数化误差的分解）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 的邻域内一致成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\underbrace{\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2}_{\\text{模型误差}}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E\\big[\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2\\big]}_{\\text{估计误差}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star=\\arg\\min_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\|s_\\theta-s\\|_p^2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影（存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_p$</span> 下半连续保证；唯一性不要求）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n在 Hilbert 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 中，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star}-s$</span> 与子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star}:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span> 的切向在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处正交（一阶最优性条件）。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s=(s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star})+(s_{\\theta^\\star}-s)$</span>，展开范数平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s\\|_p^2=\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2+\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2+2\\langle s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p.$$</div>\n<p>交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n=\\theta^\\star$</span> 处为零；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span>，由一阶条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle \\partial_\\theta s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p=0$</span> 与 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p=O(\\|\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star\\|^2)$</span>（二阶项，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 的一致可积性控制）。对样本取期望并用 Fubini（各项非负或绝对可积，由假设保证），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2+\\mathbb E[\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2]+o(\\mathbb E[\\|\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star\\|^2]).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 一致相合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n\\to\\theta^\\star$</span> 依概率）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o$</span> 项可忽略，即得所述分解（严格等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n=\\theta^\\star$</span> 或线性化意义下成立；一般情形为渐近等式，此处标注为渐近而非精确恒等式，符合本节“可检验推论”的定位）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论 9.5（渐近正态下的误差率）</strong><br>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 渐近正态：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处 Jacobian <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\nabla_\\theta s_{\\theta^\\star}\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span> 列满秩，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$n\\,\\mathbb E[\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2]\\ \\to\\ \\operatorname{tr}(J^\\top J\\,\\Sigma),$$</div>\n<p>故估计误差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}$</span> 速率衰减，模型误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 衰减。这给出参数化 score 估计的总误差率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n=\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2+\\Theta(n^{-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由 Delta 方法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}=J(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star)+o_p(\\|\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star\\|)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2=(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star)^\\top J^\\top J(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star)+o_p(n^{-1})$</span>。取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\star)$</span> 的一致可积性（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 有限保证），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\mathbb E[\\cdot]\\to\\mathbb E[\\xi^\\top J^\\top J\\xi]=\\operatorname{tr}(J^\\top J\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-4-一个可验证的具体例子\">9.4 一个可验证的具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-4-一个可验证的具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[x^2/\\sigma^4]=1/\\sigma^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 9.6（无偏估计器的误差恰为 Fisher 下界）</strong><br>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n(x)=-x/\\hat\\sigma_n^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\sigma_n^2=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 有偏（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\hat\\sigma_n^2$</span> 的期望不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span>），但可计算其误差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\mathbb E_p\\Big[\\Big(\\frac{x}{\\hat\\sigma_n^2}-\\frac{x}{\\sigma^2}\\Big)^2\\Big]=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big(\\frac{\\sigma^2}{\\hat\\sigma_n^2}-1\\Big)^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\sigma_n^2/\\sigma^2\\sim\\chi^2_n/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\sigma^2/\\hat\\sigma_n^2-1)^2]=\\mathbb E[(\\chi^2_n/n)^{-2}]-2\\mathbb E[(\\chi^2_n/n)^{-1}]+1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n&gt;4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\chi^2_n/n)^{-1}]=n/(n-2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\chi^2_n/n)^{-2}]=n^2/((n-2)(n-4))$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\Big(\\frac{n^2}{(n-2)(n-4)}-\\frac{2n}{n-2}+1\\Big)=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\cdot\\frac{2n^2-4n}{(n-2)(n-4)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{n}\\ \\text{（化简后）}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\to1/\\sigma^2=I(X)^{-1}$</span>，与推论 9.3 的下界在极限处吻合；对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n&gt;1/\\sigma^2$</span>，偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n$</span> 与方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_n$</span> 均正。此例说明：Fisher 下界是渐近可达的，但有限样本下无偏估计器（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n=-x\\,\\mathbb E[1/\\hat\\sigma_n^2]$</span> 的精确形式）才能取到等号附近的误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-6-非参数估计器的误差结构-核密度-score-估计\">9.6 非参数估计器的误差结构：核密度 score 估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-6-非参数估计器的误差结构-核密度-score-估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>参数化估计器的误差由模型误差主导，非参数估计器则相反：模型误差可忽略，但方差项随维数恶化。本节把命题 9.1 的分解落到一个显式的非参数构造上，给出可直接计算的偏差—方差表达式，并说明为何 score 的非参数估计比密度本身的非参数估计更不稳定。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为核函数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int K=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|u\\|^2K(u)\\,du&lt;\\infty$</span>，带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span>。核密度估计为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1{nh^d}\\sum_{i=1}^nK\\!\\Big(\\frac{x-X_i}{h}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)&gt;0$</span> 处定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n(x)=\\nabla\\log\\hat p_n(x)=\\dfrac{\\nabla\\hat p_n(x)}{\\hat p_n(x)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.7（核 score 估计的偏差—方差展开）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)、(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal D)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D$</span> 上有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 具有紧支撑、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int uK(u)\\,du=0$</span>（一阶矩为零）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int uu^\\top K(u)\\,du=\\kappa_2\\mathrm{Id}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2&gt;0$</span> 为二阶矩常数），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$nh^{d+2}\\to\\infty$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal D$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]-s(x)=\\frac{h^2}{2}\\,\\kappa_2\\,\\mathbb E_{K}\\big[\\nabla^2\\log p(x)\\big]\\,\\text{的低阶项}+o(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，偏差的主项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_n(x):=\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]-s(x)=\\frac{h^2}{2}\\,\\kappa_2\\,\\Big(\\nabla\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\nabla^2\\log p(x)\\Big)+o(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>而方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat s_n(x))=\\frac{1}{nh^{d+2}}\\,\\frac{\\|K\\|_2^2\\,\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2}{p(x)}+o\\!\\Big(\\frac{1}{nh^{d+2}}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|K\\|_2^2=\\int K(u)^2du$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\nabla^2\\log p=\\Delta\\log p$</span> 为对数密度的 Laplacian。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_n=\\int_{\\mathcal D}\\big(\\|b_n(x)\\|^2+\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat s_n(x))\\big)p(x)\\,dx+o(h^4)+o\\!\\Big(\\frac{1}{nh^{d+2}}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong><br>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=(x-X_i)/h$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1{nh^d}\\sum_iK(Z_i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\hat p_n(x)=-\\frac1{nh^{d+1}}\\sum_i\\nabla K(Z_i)$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]=(K_h*p)(x)=p(x)+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\Delta p(x)+o(h^2),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\hat p_n(x)]=(\\nabla K_h*p)(x)=\\nabla p(x)+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\nabla\\Delta p(x)+o(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>两式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的一阶矩为零与二阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2\\mathrm{Id}$</span> 的 Taylor 展开得到（Leibniz 法则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 求导与积分交换，被积函数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 紧支撑控制）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]=\\frac{\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\hat p_n(x)]}{\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]}{\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]}\\ \\text{（此处需处理比值期望）}.$$</div>\n<p>关键步骤是比值展开：写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n=\\dfrac{\\nabla\\hat p_n}{\\hat p_n}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\nabla\\hat p_n(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=\\hat p_n(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar A=\\mathbb E[A]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar B=\\mathbb E[B]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{A}{B}=\\dfrac{\\bar A}{\\bar B}+\\dfrac{A-\\bar A}{\\bar B}-\\dfrac{\\bar A(B-\\bar B)}{\\bar B^2}+O(\\|(A-\\bar A,B-\\bar B)\\|^2/\\bar B^3)$</span>，取期望得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_n(x)]=\\frac{\\bar A}{\\bar B}-\\frac{\\operatorname{Cov}(A,B)}{\\bar B^2}+O\\!\\Big(\\frac{\\mathbb E[\\|A-\\bar A\\|^2]}{\\bar B^2}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar A=\\nabla p+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\nabla\\Delta p+o(h^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar B=p+\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\Delta p+o(h^2)$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\nabla p}{p}=s$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\nabla\\Delta p}{p}-\\dfrac{\\nabla p\\,\\Delta p}{p^2}=\\nabla\\Big(\\dfrac{\\Delta p}{p}\\Big)=\\nabla\\Delta\\log p$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\log p=\\dfrac{\\Delta p}{p}-\\dfrac{\\|\\nabla p\\|^2}{p^2}$</span>，此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\Delta p/p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\Delta\\log p$</span> 的关系整理），得偏差主项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n(x)=\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\nabla\\Delta\\log p(x)$</span>。协方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(A,B)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(nh^{d+2}))$</span> 阶，归入方差项。</p>\n<p>方差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat s_n(x))\\approx\\dfrac{\\operatorname{Var}(A)}{\\bar B^2}+\\dfrac{\\bar A^2\\operatorname{Var}(B)}{\\bar B^4}-\\dfrac{2\\bar A\\operatorname{Cov}(A,B)}{\\bar B^3}$</span>。由 i.i.d. 样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(A)=\\frac1{nh^{2d+2}}\\operatorname{Var}(\\nabla K(Z_1))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(\\nabla K(Z_1))\\to\\|K\\|_2^2\\,\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2p(x)$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 紧支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span> 连续），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(A)/\\bar B^2=\\dfrac{\\|K\\|_2^2\\|\\nabla\\log p\\|^2}{nh^{d+2}p(x)}+o(\\cdot)$</span>；其余两项为同阶或低阶。合并即得方差主项。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-期望并用 Fubini（各项非负，Tonelli）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n$</span> 的展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 9.1 的关系</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_n$</span> 即偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n$</span> 的被积函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(\\hat s_n)$</span> 即方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_n$</span> 的被积函数。命题 9.7 说明二者量级分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^4$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(nh^{d+2})$</span>，最优带宽由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^4\\sim1/(nh^{d+2})$</span> 平衡得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\asymp n^{-1/(d+6)}$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\asymp n^{-4/(d+6)}$</span>。维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 增大时速率急剧恶化，这是 score 非参数估计的固有困难，也是第 8 节参数化策略的动机。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-7-低密度区的误差放大-一个定量刻画\">9.7 低密度区的误差放大：一个定量刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-7-低密度区的误差放大-一个定量刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节将从反例角度讨论 score 在低密度区的爆炸；本节先在估计误差框架内给出其统计表现，以便与命题 9.7 的方差公式衔接。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.8（相对误差与密度的关系）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 为任一估计器，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 存在使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n=\\nabla\\log\\hat p_n$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s_n(x)-s(x)\\|=\\Big\\|\\nabla\\log\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)}{p(x)}\\Big\\|=\\frac{\\|\\nabla(\\hat p_n-p)(x)\\|}{\\hat p_n(x)}+\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|}{\\hat p_n(x)}\\Big|1-\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)}{p(x)}\\Big|\\ \\text{（三角不等式上界）}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 的相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon(x)=|\\hat p_n(x)/p(x)-1|$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s_n(x)-s(x)\\|\\ \\le\\ \\frac{\\|\\nabla(\\hat p_n-p)(x)\\|}{p(x)(1-\\epsilon(x))}+\\frac{\\|s(x)\\|\\,\\epsilon(x)}{1-\\epsilon(x)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n-s=\\nabla\\log\\hat p_n-\\nabla\\log p=\\nabla\\log(\\hat p_n/p)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n&gt;0$</span> 处展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log(\\hat p_n/p)=\\dfrac{\\nabla(\\hat p_n/p)}{\\hat p_n/p}=\\dfrac{\\nabla(\\hat p_n-p)}{p}\\cdot\\dfrac{p}{\\hat p_n}-\\dfrac{(\\hat p_n-p)\\nabla p}{p\\hat p_n}$</span>。取范数并用三角不等式，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n=p(1+\\epsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|=p\\|s\\|$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.9（低密度区的误差下界）</strong><br>\n在命题 9.8 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\to0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|$</span> 不趋于零（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 有界但密度趋于零，例如密度在边界处线性衰减），则任何满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)&gt;0$</span> 的估计器都有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s_n(x)-s(x)\\|\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|}{\\hat p_n(x)}\\Big|1-\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)}{p(x)}\\Big|\\ \\text{的下界由 }\\epsilon(x)\\text{ 控制},$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon(x)$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\to0$</span> 而消失时，误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(x)$</span> 发散。这解释了为何 score 估计在低密度区必须借助参数化（第 8 节）或对数域截断，而不能直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 取梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 9.8 的第二式，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\|s(x)\\|\\epsilon(x)}{1-\\epsilon(x)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon(x)$</span> 不消失时为正且不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 衰减；第一项含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(x)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\hat p_n-p)$</span> 的相对误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 缩小时发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：推论 9.9 是第 10 节反例的统计版本——反例节构造的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 本身的爆炸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|/p\\to\\infty$</span>），而本节刻画的是即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 有界、估计误差仍因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p$</span> 放大。两者机制不同但都指向同一结论：score 的估计不能在低密度区用密度比值直接计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-8-误差的可加性与投影分解的几何解释\">9.8 误差的可加性与投影分解的几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-8-误差的可加性与投影分解的几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后把命题 9.4 的分解放到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H=L^2(p;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 的几何语言中，说明模型误差与估计误差分别是到参数子空间的垂距与子空间内的波动，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 中正交。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10（正交分解）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M=\\{s_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}\\subset\\mathcal H$</span> 为参数子空间（不必线性），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s-s_{\\theta^\\star}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 的切空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\theta^\\star}\\mathcal M=\\mathrm{span}\\{\\partial_{\\theta_j}s_{\\theta^\\star}\\}_{j=1}^m$</span> 正交：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle s-s_{\\theta^\\star},\\partial_{\\theta_j}s_{\\theta^\\star}\\rangle_p=0,\\qquad j=1,\\dots,m.$$</div>\n<p>且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_\\theta-s\\|_p^2=\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2+\\|s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p^2+2\\langle s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p,$$</div>\n<p>交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span> 处为零，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n一阶最优性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\|s_\\theta-s\\|_p^2$</span>，故对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\theta_j}\\|s_\\theta-s\\|_p^2\\big|_{\\theta^\\star}=2\\langle\\partial_{\\theta_j}s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p=0$</span>（求导与积分交换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\partial_{\\theta_j}s_\\theta\\|^2]$</span> 在邻域一致有界保证，Leibniz 法则）。展开式由直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|(s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star})+(s_{\\theta^\\star}-s)\\|_p^2$</span> 得到；交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处由正交性为零，在邻域内由 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p=\\sum_j(\\theta_j-\\theta^\\star_j)\\langle\\partial_{\\theta_j}s_{\\theta^\\star},s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\rangle_p+O(\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|^2)=O(\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>几何解释</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 的垂距（模型误差），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\hat\\theta_n}-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|_p$</span> 是估计点在流形上的切向波动（估计误差）。命题 9.4 的误差分解正是这一正交分解在随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 上的期望版本；命题 9.5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}$</span> 速率则来自切向波动的二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(J^\\top J\\Sigma)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 是切空间的坐标表示。这给出本节误差分析的统一几何图像：score 估计的精度由“流形离真 score 多远”与“估计在流形上抖多厉害”两个正交分量决定，前者不随样本量改善，后者以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}$</span> 衰减。</p>\n<p>带宽选择把偏差与方差放在同一条曲线上。核得分估计的总误差可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{E}(h)=C_1h^4+\\frac{C_2}{nh^{d+2}},$$</div>\n第一项是核平滑的偏差平方，第二项是估计方差。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 求导并令其为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star=(C_2/(2C_1))^{1/(d+6)}n^{-1/(d+6)}$</span>，代回得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{E}(h^\\star)\\asymp n^{-4/(d+6)}$</span>。这条曲线说明：增大带宽降方差但升偏差，减小带宽反之；最优带宽随维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1/(d+6)}$</span> 放缓，故高维下即使取最优带宽，也需要指数级样本才能把误差压到固定水平。</p>\n<p>维数灾难在这里不是算法缺陷，而是核方法“分辨率—样本量”权衡的必然结果：要分辨尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的结构，就需要在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维空间中覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^{-d}$</span> 个体积元。参数化估计器用模型假设换掉了这一权衡，代价是模型误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 衰减；第 10 节的显式目标与第 11 节的加权目标都在这一权衡上做不同的取舍。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>score 估计误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 范数下严格分解为偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_n$</span> 与方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_n$</span>（命题 9.1），二者分别对应估计器的系统偏离与样本波动，且分解仅依赖 Fubini/Tonelli，不要求无偏性。</li>\n<li>无偏估计器的误差受 Fisher 信息矩阵的逆控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\ge\\operatorname{tr}(I(X)^{-1})$</span>（命题 9.2、推论 9.3），该下界由得分恒等式与 Cauchy–Schwarz 导出，是本章 Fisher 几何与统计估计的定量接口。</li>\n<li>参数化估计器的总误差为模型误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\theta^\\star}-s\\|_p^2$</span> 与估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(n^{-1})$</span> 之和（命题 9.4、推论 9.5），前者不随样本量衰减，后者由 Jacobian 与渐近协方差显式给出；例 9.6 在一维高斯情形验证了有限样本误差严格大于 Fisher 下界、且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 收敛到该下界。</li>\n<li>非参数核 score 估计的误差由命题 9.7 显式给出：偏差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{h^2}{2}\\kappa_2\\nabla\\Delta\\log p$</span>，方差主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|K\\|_2^2\\|\\nabla\\log p\\|^2/(nh^{d+2}p)$</span>，最优带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\asymp n^{-1/(d+6)}$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_n\\asymp n^{-4/(d+6)}$</span>，维数灾难由此定量化。</li>\n<li>低密度区的估计误差由命题 9.8 与推论 9.9 刻画：即使真 score 有界，只要密度估计的相对误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to0$</span> 消失，误差即以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p$</span> 放大；这与第 10 节的反例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 本身爆炸）是两种不同但同向的失效机制。</li>\n<li>命题 9.10 把参数化误差分解提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 中的正交分解：模型误差是到参数流形的垂距，估计误差是流形上的切向波动，二者正交；推论 9.11 在一维高斯族上给出可数值检验的正交性条件，与例 9.6 的有限样本计算一致。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-反例-低密度区-score-爆炸\">反例：低密度区 score 爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例-低密度区-score-爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 在其定义域内取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma(x)=p*\\varphi_\\sigma(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\sigma(x)=(2\\pi\\sigma^2)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2))$</span> 为标准高斯核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的高斯正则化密度，恒正且光滑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\sigma(x)=\\nabla_x\\log\\rho_\\sigma(x)$</span> 为正则化 score。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 的构造，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int_{\\mathbb R}p(x)\\,dx=1$</span> 为归一化常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 附近的行为由显式表达式给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}_{\\mathrm{loc}}$</span> 表示局部 Lipschitz；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_b^k$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 阶连续可微且有界的函数空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所有命题均先列假设。核心假设纪律：score 的存在要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于所论开集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 局部可微；Fisher 信息的有限性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span>；积分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 要求边界通量消失（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}p\\, s\\cdot n\\,dS=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑或工作区域）。本节的反例正是逐条拆掉这些假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例一-紧支撑密度边界处的-score-爆炸\">反例一：紧支撑密度边界处的 score 爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例一-紧支撑密度边界处的-score-爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.1（边界爆炸的定量下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 局部可微，并设存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x)=c\\,(x-0)^{\\alpha}+o\\big((x-0)^{\\alpha}\\big),\\qquad x\\downarrow 0 .$$</div>\n则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\downarrow 0$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\frac{\\alpha}{x}+o\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right),$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{x\\downarrow 0}|s(x)|=+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[s(X)^2]=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内正且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 局部可微；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的右邻域有上述幂律展开；（iii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>。注意此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处连续延拓为正——这正是爆炸的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由（ii），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,\\delta)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p(x)=\\log c+\\alpha\\log x+o(\\log x),$$</div>\n逐项求导（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 上光滑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\log x)$</span> 项按假设可微且其导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1/x)$</span> 控制，这里用到 Leibniz 法则对有限和的直接应用，无需交换极限与积分），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\frac{d}{dx}\\big(\\alpha\\log x\\big)+o\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=\\frac{\\alpha}{x}+o\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right).$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s(x)|\\to+\\infty$</span>。对 Fisher 信息，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,\\delta)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)\\ge\\int_0^\\varepsilon p(x)\\,s(x)^2\\,dx=\\int_0^\\varepsilon \\big(c x^{\\alpha}+o(x^{\\alpha})\\big)\\Big(\\frac{\\alpha^2}{x^2}+o(x^{-2})\\Big)dx .$$</div>\n被积函数的主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\alpha^2 x^{\\alpha-2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-2\\le -1$</span>，积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处发散（对数发散或幂发散）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-2&gt;-1$</span>，该积分收敛，但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的爆炸仍发生而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 可有限。故命题中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=+\\infty$</span>”需补条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le 1$</span>；一般地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的无界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 的有限性可以分离。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若把（ii）换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=c+o(1)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=o(1/x)$</span> 且有界，边界爆炸消失。这说明爆炸不是“支撑有边界”本身导致的，而是“密度在边界处趋于零的幂次”导致的。若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1([0,1])$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上有界，Fisher 信息有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例二-高斯正则化不能消除爆炸-只把它移到尺度-sigma-处\">反例二：高斯正则化不能消除爆炸，只把它移到尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 处<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例二-高斯正则化不能消除爆炸-只把它移到尺度-sigma-处\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.2（正则化 score 的峰值尺度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 如命题 9.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma=p*\\varphi_\\sigma$</span>。则对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\sigma$</span> 处处有界；但存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R}|s_\\sigma(x)|\\ge \\frac{C_\\sigma}{\\sigma}.$$</div>\n即正则化把爆炸从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 移到宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\sigma$</span> 的过渡层，峰值仍随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow 0$</span> 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 的（i）（ii）；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 固定；（iii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\sigma$</span> 为标准高斯核，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 且光滑（卷积与光滑核的可微性由 Leibniz 积分法则保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x \\rho_\\sigma(x)=\\int p(y)\\partial_x\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)dy$</span>，被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p\\|_{L^1}\\cdot\\sup|\\varphi_\\sigma'|$</span> 控制，Dominating Convergence 适用）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\equiv 0$</span> 得。有界性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma\\ge$</span>（正常数）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma$</span> 有界得。下界：考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,\\sigma)$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma(x)$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\sigma]$</span> 与其余部分。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\sigma]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)\\le c' y^{\\alpha}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_\\sigma(x)\\le \\int_0^\\sigma c' y^{\\alpha}\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)\\,dy+\\int_{\\sigma}^\\infty p(y)\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)\\,dy .$$</div>\n第一项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim\\sigma/2$</span> 时量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c'\\sigma^{\\alpha}\\cdot O(1)$</span>；第二项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{y\\ge\\sigma}\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)\\le \\varphi_\\sigma(\\sigma/2)$</span> 控制，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\sigma^2/(8\\sigma^2))=\\exp(-1/8)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_x\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)=-(x-y)\\sigma^{-2}\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in[0,\\sigma]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim\\sigma/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x-y|\\sim\\sigma$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_x\\varphi_\\sigma|\\sim\\sigma^{-1}\\varphi_\\sigma$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma(x)|\\ge c''\\sigma^{-1}\\int_0^\\sigma y^{\\alpha}\\varphi_\\sigma(x-y)\\,dy - O(\\exp(-1/8)) .$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 充分小使第一项主导，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma(x)|\\ge C_\\sigma/\\sigma$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma(x)\\le C'$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s_\\sigma(x)|=|\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma|/\\rho_\\sigma\\ge C_\\sigma/(\\sigma C')$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处有正下界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\sigma(0)\\ge c/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\rho_\\sigma(0)|=O(\\sigma)$</span>，峰值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow0$</span> 趋于零，正则化确实消除爆炸。可见爆炸的持续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 决定，与命题 9.10.1 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例三-积分恒等式在边界通量非零时失效\">反例三：积分恒等式在边界通量非零时失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例三-积分恒等式在边界通量非零时失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.3（边界项不为零的显式计算）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的均匀密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathbf 1_{[0,1]}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span> 作为分布意义下的配对不为零；具体地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty((0,1))$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^1 p(x)\\,s(x)\\,\\phi'(x)\\,dx=0,$$</div>\n而对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)\\ne 0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R} p(x)\\,s(x)\\,\\phi'(x)\\,dx=-\\phi(0)+\\phi(1)\\ne 0 .$$</div>\n故“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑边界处失效，失效量恰为边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(0)-\\phi(1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathbf 1_{[0,1]}$</span>；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 按分布意义理解（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界不可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在边界无经典定义）；（iii）测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的选择如命题所述。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\equiv1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\equiv0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\equiv0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty((0,1))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p s\\phi'=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R)$</span>，由分部积分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有界变差函数，Stieltjes 积分意义下分部积分合法），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R} p(x)\\,s(x)\\,\\phi'(x)\\,dx=\\int_{\\mathbb R}\\phi'(x)\\,d x\\cdot\\mathbf 1_{[0,1]}(x)=\\phi(1)-\\phi(0).$$</div>\n（这里把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s$</span> 视为测度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\equiv0$</span> 于内部，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在边界的形式导数贡献了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0-\\delta_1$</span> 型边界项；严格地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span> 作为分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\delta_0+\\delta_1$</span> 加上内部零测度部分。）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上的光滑紧支撑密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于支撑内部、在支撑边界以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 方式趋于零，则边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}p\\,s\\cdot n\\,dS$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{\\partial\\Omega}=0$</span>，边界项消失，恒等式恢复。这说明恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 的正确表述需要“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界为零（或边界通量消失）”这一条，缺它就是命题 9.10.3 的反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例四-score-的无偏估计在低密度区方差爆炸\">反例四：score 的无偏估计在低密度区方差爆炸<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例四-score-的无偏估计在低密度区方差爆炸\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.4（估计误差的定量下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 为基于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个 i.i.d. 样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n\\sim p$</span> 的任一估计量，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,\\delta)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\hat s_n(x)]=s(x)$</span>（逐点无偏）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,\\delta)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[(\\hat s_n(x)-s(x))^2\\big]\\ge \\frac{\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\hat s_n(x))}{1}\\ge \\frac{\\alpha^2}{n x^2}\\big(1+o(1)\\big),$$</div>\n其中下界来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)^2$</span> 的量级与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本的信息量；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\downarrow0$</span> 时该下界发散，且对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in(0,\\delta)}\\mathbb E_p[(\\hat s_n(x)-s(x))^2]=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n(x)$</span> 逐点无偏且二阶矩有限；（iii）样本独立同分布。此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 有界——有界估计量在低密度区必然有偏，这正是“无偏与低方差不可兼得”的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐点无偏给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(\\hat s_n-s)^2]=\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat s_n)$</span>。由命题 9.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\alpha/x+o(1/x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)^2=\\alpha^2/x^2(1+o(1))$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 的估计误差方差有下界，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)$</span> 本身的量级，任何逐点无偏估计量的方差至少与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)^2/n$</span> 同阶（这是把“估计一个量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/x$</span> 的参数”的方差下界按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 缩放的标准论证；严格下界需 Cramér–Rao 型条件，此处只主张量级）。于是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\downarrow0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)^2/n\\to+\\infty$</span>，方差下界发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若放弃逐点无偏、改用有界估计量（如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_n$</span> 截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-M,M]$</span>），则方差有界但偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\downarrow0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s(x)|$</span>，均方误差同样发散。这说明低密度区的 score 估计不存在“既无偏又低方差”的估计量；正确表述需要把误差度量改为相对误差或加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 误差，并在权重中显式出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 以抵消 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/x^2$</span> 的爆炸。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例五-参数化-score-在低密度区的相对误差放大\">反例五：参数化 score 在低密度区的相对误差放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例五-参数化-score-在低密度区的相对误差放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 8 节《Score 的参数化》已建立：工程上常把 score 参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为某归一化密度族。本节要指出，即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 意义下很好地逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，其 score 在低密度区仍可能以任意大的相对误差偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>。这构成“参数化不能修复低密度爆炸”的边界情形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 逼近不蕴含 score 逼近）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=c\\,x+o(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\downarrow0$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span>，存在密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>（关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>）使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p-q\\|_{L^1(\\mathbb R)}\\le\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\sup_{x\\in(0,\\delta)}\\frac{|\\nabla\\log q(x)-\\nabla\\log p(x)|}{|\\nabla\\log p(x)|}\\ge M .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q$</span> 局部可微；（iii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,M$</span> 任意给定。此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同支撑，也不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的“边界层扰动”。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,\\delta)$</span> 充分小，令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x)=p(x)\\big(1+a\\,\\psi_\\eta(x)\\big),\\qquad x\\in(0,\\delta),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta$</span> 为光滑截断函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta\\equiv1$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\eta/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta\\equiv0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\eta,\\delta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\psi_\\eta\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\psi_\\eta'|\\le C/\\eta$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in(-1/2,1/2)$</span> 为待定常数。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 外令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 的相应归一化版本（乘以常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q=\\int p(1+a\\psi_\\eta)$</span>），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 逼近。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\eta)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p-q\\|_{L^1}\\le |a|\\int_0^\\eta p(x)\\,dx+|Z_q-1|\\le |a|\\,c\\eta^2/2+O(|a|\\eta^2)\\le C|a|\\eta^2 .$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon/(C|a|)}$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_{L^1}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p>再验证 score 的相对误差。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\eta/2)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta\\equiv1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1+a)p/Z_q$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x)=\\nabla\\log p(x)+\\nabla\\log(1+a)-\\nabla\\log Z_q=\\nabla\\log p(x),$$</div>\n因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q$</span> 为常数。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\eta/2)$</span> 上相对误差为零——扰动在“纯平移”区域不改变 score。真正的偏差出现在过渡层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\eta/2,\\eta)$</span>：此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_\\eta'$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\eta$</span>。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x)=\\frac{\\nabla p(x)(1+a\\psi_\\eta)+a\\,p(x)\\psi_\\eta'(x)}{p(x)(1+a\\psi_\\eta)}=\\nabla\\log p(x)+\\frac{a\\,\\psi_\\eta'(x)}{1+a\\psi_\\eta(x)} .$$</div>\n由命题 9.10.1，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(\\eta/2,\\eta)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla\\log p(x)|=\\alpha/x+o(1/x)\\sim 1/x\\le 2/\\eta$</span>。而扰动项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a\\psi_\\eta'/(1+a\\psi_\\eta)|\\ge |a|C/\\eta/(1+|a|)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 充分大（但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1/2$</span>）使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|C/(1+|a|)\\ge M\\cdot 2$</span>，则在某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(\\eta/2,\\eta)$</span> 处\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{|\\nabla\\log q-\\nabla\\log p|}{|\\nabla\\log p|}\\ge\\frac{M\\cdot 2/\\eta}{2/\\eta}=M .$$</div>\n注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 已被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 条件固定为上界，故需同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon/(C|a|)}$</span> 与上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 条件；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 只进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|$</span> 的选择、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 只进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择，两者可独立满足。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 逼近换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 逼近（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_\\infty\\le\\varepsilon$</span>），则上述构造中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在过渡层的相对扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\psi_\\eta$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 范数直接控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|\\le\\varepsilon/\\|p\\|_\\infty$</span>，从而 score 的相对误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/\\eta)$</span> 控制，不能任意放大。这说明“<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 逼近”这一假设太弱：它允许密度在测度极小的区域发生剧烈相对变化，而 score 恰是相对变化率的梯度，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 不连续。正确表述需要把参数化误差度量改为加权 Sobolev 型范数，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p(x)\\,\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x)-\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|^2dx$</span>，即 Fisher 信息意义下的误差；这正是第 9 节《Score 的估计误差》所定义的度量，也是得分匹配章损失函数的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例六-score-爆炸与反向-SDE-漂移的数值刚性\">反例六：score 爆炸与反向 SDE 漂移的数值刚性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例六-score-爆炸与反向-SDE-漂移的数值刚性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节与后续《Score 与速度场》衔接，但只处理本节承诺的“爆炸”边界，不展开速度场。设反向 SDE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-s_t(x)$</span>（在标准方差保持 SDE 下，漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 项）。低密度区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 爆炸直接导致漂移的 Lipschitz 常数爆炸，从而使显式 Euler–Maruyama 格式的稳定性条件失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.6（漂移 Lipschitz 常数与步长的定量关系）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>），漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-s_t(x)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 上的局部 Lipschitz 常数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_t(\\delta)=\\sup_{x,y\\in(0,\\delta),\\,x\\ne y}\\frac{|f_t(x)-f_t(y)|}{|x-y|}$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\delta)\\ge C/\\delta^2$</span>。于是显式 Euler–Maruyama 格式的均方稳定性要求步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le 2/L_t(\\delta)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=O(\\delta^2)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\downarrow0$</span>（采样进入低密度区）时，所需步长趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t=-s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>；（iii）Euler–Maruyama 格式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{k+1}=X_k+h f_t(X_k)+\\sqrt{h}\\,\\xi_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_k$</span> 为标准高斯。此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t$</span> 全局 Lipschitz——这正是爆炸的后果。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 9.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=1/x+o(1/x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t(x)=-1/x+o(1/x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t'(x)=1/x^2+o(1/x^2)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in(0,\\delta)$</span>，由中值定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t\\in C^1$</span>，Leibniz 法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_t'$</span> 的表达式），存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in(x,y)$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{|f_t(x)-f_t(y)|}{|x-y|}=|f_t'(\\xi)|=\\frac{1}{\\xi^2}+o\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{\\xi^2}\\right)\\ge\\frac{C}{\\delta^2},$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\le\\delta$</span> 即得下界。Euler–Maruyama 的均方稳定性：对线性化方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX=f_t'(x_*)X\\,dt+\\sqrt{2}\\,dW$</span>，显式格式的乘子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+h f_t'(x_*)$</span>，均方稳定要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1+h f_t'(x_*)|\\le1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le 2/|f_t'(x_*)|$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_*\\in(0,\\delta)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_t'(x_*)|\\ge C/\\delta^2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le 2\\delta^2/C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若改用隐式 Euler–Maruyama（漂移项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{k+1}$</span>），则乘子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-h f_t'(x_*))$</span>，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 均稳定（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-h f_t'(x_*)&gt;0$</span>），步长约束消失。这说明爆炸导致的数值刚性是显式格式的属性，而非 SDE 本身的病态；正确表述需要把“score 爆炸”与“离散化格式选择”分开陈述，不能把前者当作后者失效的唯一原因。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在低密度区被高斯正则化（命题 9.10.2），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(\\delta)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\sigma/\\sigma^2$</span> 控制，步长约束变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=O(\\sigma^2)$</span>，与正则化尺度一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例七-score-爆炸下得分匹配损失的梯度消失与爆炸并存\">反例七：score 爆炸下得分匹配损失的梯度消失与爆炸并存<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例七-score-爆炸下得分匹配损失的梯度消失与爆炸并存\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节与《与得分匹配章的接口》衔接，但只给出本节所需的边界事实：在低密度区，得分匹配的显式损失（denoising score matching）对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度既可能消失又可能爆炸，取决于噪声尺度与数据尺度的比值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.7（DSM 梯度的双相行为）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\sigma=p*\\varphi_\\sigma$</span> 为其高斯正则化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为参数化 score，DSM 损失为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x\\sim p}\\mathbb E_{x'\\sim \\mathcal N(x,\\sigma^2)}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x')-\\nabla_{x'}\\log\\varphi_\\sigma(x'-x)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in(0,\\delta)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\gg x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x'}\\log\\varphi_\\sigma(x'-x)$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|x'-x\\|/\\sigma^2)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'\\sim x$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sigma)$</span>，梯度信号随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 增大而消失；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ll x$</span> 时该量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sigma)$</span> 但目标 score 本身为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/x)$</span>，二者失配导致梯度爆炸。定量地，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2&gt;0$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_1\\frac{x}{\\sigma^2}\\le\\big\\|\\mathbb E[\\nabla_{x'}\\log\\varphi_\\sigma(x'-x)\\mid x]\\big\\|\\le c_2\\frac{x}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{c_2}{\\sigma}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span>；（iii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 可微且其梯度有界（否则梯度爆炸来自参数化本身，不属于本节范围）。此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 同尺度——正是二者的比值决定双相行为。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x'}\\log\\varphi_\\sigma(x'-x)=-(x'-x)/\\sigma^2$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x'-x\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_{x'}\\log\\varphi_\\sigma(x'-x)\\mid x]=0,$$</div>\n即 DSM 目标的条件期望为零——这是 DSM 损失在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_\\sigma$</span> 处取零的机制。但损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x')$</span> 与目标的乘积，其量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x'-x\\|/\\sigma^2$</span> 的典型值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sigma^2=1/\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 处的量级共同决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\gg x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的高密度区（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 的典型偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x')$</span> 有界，梯度量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sigma)\\to0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ll x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x'$</span> 仍落在低密度区，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x')$</span> 需拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/x)$</span> 的目标，而噪声目标量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sigma)$</span>，二者失配使梯度量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/x\\cdot1/\\sigma)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow0$</span> 时爆炸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处有正下界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x')$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x'\\sim x$</span> 处有界，DSM 梯度量级恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sigma)$</span>，无双相行为；双相行为的根源仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 导致的 score 爆炸。正确表述需要把 DSM 损失改为噪声条件化（noise-conditional）形式，使噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 显式进入目标，从而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\ll x$</span> 时目标与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的量级匹配；这正是后续《与得分匹配章的接口》要展开的内容，本节只指出未条件化时的边界失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-反例八-score-爆炸使-Fisher-信息的经验估计不可用\">反例八：score 爆炸使 Fisher 信息的经验估计不可用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-反例八-score-爆炸使-Fisher-信息的经验估计不可用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 3 节定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>，第 9 节讨论了估计误差。本节补充一个边界事实：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=+\\infty$</span> 时，任何基于有限样本的经验 Fisher 信息估计量都依概率发散，且发散速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.10.8（经验 Fisher 信息的发散速率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\|\\hat s(X_i)\\|^2$</span> 为经验 Fisher 信息，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span> 为任一在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat s(x)|\\ge c/x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>）的估计量。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb P\\big(\\hat I_n\\ge M\\big)=1,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n$</span> 的发散速率满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n=\\Omega(n^{2/\\alpha-1})$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;2$</span> 时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n=\\Omega(\\log n)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 的下界依概率成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足命题 9.10.1 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1$</span>；（ii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\delta)$</span> 上满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat s(x)|\\ge c/x$</span>；（iii）<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_i$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim p$</span>。此处不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span> 无偏——下界只需逐点模的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat s(x)|\\ge c/x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s(X_i)\\|^2\\ge c^2/X_i^2$</span>。由命题 9.10.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=c'x^{\\alpha}+o(x^{\\alpha})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_i$</span> 落入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(X_i\\le\\varepsilon)=\\int_0^\\varepsilon p\\approx c'\\varepsilon^{\\alpha+1}/(\\alpha+1)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon=\\#\\{i:X_i\\le\\varepsilon\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathrm{Bin}(n,c'\\varepsilon^{\\alpha+1}/(\\alpha+1))$</span>。对落入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/X_i^2\\ge1/\\varepsilon^2$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat I_n\\ge\\frac{c^2}{n}\\sum_{i:X_i\\le\\varepsilon}\\frac{1}{X_i^2}\\ge\\frac{c^2}{n}\\cdot\\frac{N_\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon^2} .$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=n^{-1/(\\alpha+1)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[N_\\varepsilon]=n\\cdot c'\\varepsilon^{\\alpha+1}/(\\alpha+1)=c'/(\\alpha+1)$</span> 为常数，由大数定律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_\\varepsilon/n\\to c'/(\\alpha+1)$</span> 依概率，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat I_n\\ge\\frac{c^2 c'}{\\alpha+1}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon^2}=\\frac{c^2c'}{\\alpha+1}\\,n^{2/(\\alpha+1)} .$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(\\alpha+1)\\ge1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n$</span> 至少以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{2/(\\alpha+1)}$</span> 速率发散；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 时速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n$</span> 的定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 因子抵消后仍发散。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 充分大使下界超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\hat I_n\\ge M)\\to1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 有限（命题 9.10.1 的证明已指出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I_n$</span> 依大数定律收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>，不发散。这说明经验 Fisher 信息的发散是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\le1$</span> 的边界现象，与 score 的无界性（对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 成立）不同。正确表述需要把 Fisher 信息换成截断 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_\\delta(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\mathbf 1_{\\{p(X)\\ge\\delta\\}}]$</span>，它对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 有限，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\downarrow0$</span> 时单调收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）；这正是第 6 节《Score 的奇异性》所定义的截断策略的定量依据。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>低密度区 score 爆炸的根源是密度在边界或低密度处趋于零的幂次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\alpha/x+o(1/x)$</span>，与“支撑有边界”无必然联系；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0$</span> 时爆炸消失。</li>\n<li>高斯正则化把爆炸从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 移到尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的过渡层，峰值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge C_\\sigma/\\sigma$</span>，故正则化不消除奇异性，只改变其位置与尺度；Fisher 信息的有限性与 score 的无界性可以分离（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 有限而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 仍爆炸）。</li>\n<li>积分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 依赖边界通量消失；均匀密度在支撑边界给出显式非零边界项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(1)-\\phi(0)$</span>，这是该恒等式失效的最小反例。低密度区的 score 估计在逐点无偏下方差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(nx^2)$</span> 发散，正确表述需改用加权误差或相对误差。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-与速度场\">Score 与速度场<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-与速度场\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续），<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为 score 场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{T_t\\}_{t\\ge 0}$</span>：由速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)$</span> 生成的流映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}T_t(x)=v_t(T_t(x))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_0(x)=x$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)$</span>：在流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{T_t\\}$</span> 推送下的密度演化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_t$</span> 的推送测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T_t)_\\# p_0$</span> 的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=p$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x)$</span>：概率流 ODE 的速度场，定义为满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=0$</span> 的向量场。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{v}$</span>：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lie 导数算子，作用于标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_v f=\\langle v,\\nabla f\\rangle$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>：Laplace 算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f=\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla f$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设纪律如下，每条命题将显式引用。</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 处处成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in L^2(p)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p v)\\in L^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下平方可积。</p>\n<p>(A4) 边界通量消失：对任意测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,\\varphi\\, v)\\,dx=0$</span>（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot v\\,dx=-\\int p\\langle \\nabla\\varphi,v\\rangle\\,dx$</span> 在无穷远处无边界项）。</p>\n<p>(A5) 在需要交换求导与积分处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 被一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-可积函数控制（Leibniz 条件）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节的核心任务</strong>：把 score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 与概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 建立精确的数学关系，澄清“score 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的某种函数”这一常见混淆，并给出两者在连续性方程层面的恒等关系与在参数化层面的区别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-1-定义-速度场与-score-的范畴差异\">1. 定义：速度场与 score 的范畴差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-1-定义-速度场与-score-的范畴差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 9.11.1（概率流速度场）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的一族概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。若存在向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\int \\varphi\\, p_t\\,dx=\\int \\langle \\nabla\\varphi, v_t\\rangle\\, p_t\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的概率流速度场（probability-flow velocity）。等价的分布意义下形式为连续性方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义 9.11.2（Score 场）</strong> 对固定密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\nabla p(x)/p(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p>两者的范畴差异必须说清楚：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是<strong>单个密度</strong>的泛函（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 取对数再求梯度），是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维向量场但只依赖空间变量；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是<strong>密度族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t\\}$</span> 的泛函，依赖时间与空间，且由连续性方程<strong>唯一确定到相差一个无散度场</strong>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t u)=0$</span> 的意义下）。特别地，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 可被计算，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 一般<strong>不等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>；二者通过一个散度方程联系，见下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.3（速度场与 score 的连续性方程关系）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足连续性方程且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t\\in C^1$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int \\langle \\nabla\\varphi, v_t\\rangle\\, p_t\\,dx=-\\int \\varphi\\,\\langle s_t, v_t\\rangle\\, p_t\\,dx-\\int \\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot v_t\\, p_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\varphi v_t)\\,dx=0$</span>，展开得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int \\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)\\,dx+\\int p_t\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v_t\\rangle\\,dx+\\int p_t\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot v_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>由连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=-\\partial_t p_t$</span>，代入并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=p_t\\,\\partial_t\\log p_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 处），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int \\varphi\\, p_t\\,\\partial_t\\log p_t\\,dx=\\int p_t\\langle\\nabla\\varphi,v_t\\rangle\\,dx+\\int p_t\\varphi\\,\\nabla\\cdot v_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\varphi\\,p_t\\,dx$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导（Leibniz，条件 (A5)），并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=-p_t\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle-p_t\\nabla\\cdot v_t$</span>（由连续性方程与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=p_t\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle+p_t\\nabla\\cdot v_t$</span>），得到上式右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int \\varphi\\,p_t\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle\\,dx-\\int\\varphi\\,p_t\\nabla\\cdot v_t\\,dx$</span>。比较两式即得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的<strong>内积</strong>出现在密度演化的生成元中，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 本身不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>。常见的“score 等于速度”只在特定规范（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的某种缩放，或概率流 ODE 的特定漂移）下成立，且需要显式声明规范。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-2-概率流-ODE-的规范选择-score-作为速度场的一个解\">2. 概率流 ODE 的规范选择：score 作为速度场的一个解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-2-概率流-ODE-的规范选择-score-作为速度场的一个解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.4（score 速度场的存在性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (A1)–(A2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 存在、连续。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^{\\mathrm{PF}}(x):=-\\nabla\\log p_t(x)+\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{1}{2}s_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^{\\mathrm{PF}}$</span> 满足连续性方程当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t s_t)=0$</span> 在分布意义下成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t^{\\mathrm{PF}})=-\\frac12\\nabla\\cdot(p_t s_t)=-\\frac12\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla p_t)=-\\frac12\\Delta p_t$</span>。连续性方程要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\frac12\\Delta p_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足热方程。故一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 不满足此式，命题的“当且仅当”成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题揭示了一个关键事实：<strong>score 场本身一般不是概率流速度场</strong>；只有当密度演化恰好是热流（或经时间重参数化后等价于热流）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12 s_t$</span> 才给出一个合法的速度场。在一般扩散生成模型中，反向 SDE 的漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12 s_t$</span> 加上一个与噪声 schedule 相关的项，而概率流 ODE 的速度场是另一个对象（通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\frac12 s_t$</span> 仅在 variance-preserving 规范下成立，且需配合时间重参数化）。把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈是本节要明确禁止的错误。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-3-速度场的-score-分解与散度恒等式\">3. 速度场的 score 分解与散度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-3-速度场的-score-分解与散度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.5（速度场的 Helmholtz 型分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，任一概率流速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 可分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t=-\\tfrac12 s_t+u_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t u_t)=\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 在分布意义下成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中不必正交。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=v_t+\\frac12 s_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t u_t)=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)+\\frac12\\nabla\\cdot(p_t s_t)=-\\partial_t p_t+\\frac12\\Delta p_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的差异由一个“非热流部分” <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 承担，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 的散度由密度演化的非热流成分决定。当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\frac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 可取为零（在无散度意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.11.6（散度恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 为概率流速度场且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot v_t]$</span> 存在，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot v_t]=-\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle]-\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\log p_t].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 9.11.3 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\equiv 1$</span> 的极限形式（用 (A4) 的测试函数逼近），并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_t\\,\\partial_t\\log p_t\\,dx=\\frac{d}{dt}\\int p_t\\log p_t\\,dx$</span>（Leibniz，条件 (A5)），即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把速度场的散度期望、score 与速度的内积期望、以及密度族微分熵的变化率三者联系起来。它是 score 与速度场关系的<strong>可检验恒等式</strong>：给定数值计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>，三者应满足该等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯族\">4. 具体例子：一维高斯族<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯族\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 9.11.7</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-(x-\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>。取概率流速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)=\\dot\\mu_t+\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}(x-\\mu_t)$</span>（这是高斯族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 下的最优传输速度场）。验证命题 9.11.3 与推论 9.11.6。</p>\n<p>直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot v_t=\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle=-\\frac{x-\\mu_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left(\\dot\\mu_t+\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}(x-\\mu_t)\\right)$</span>。取期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[x-\\mu_t]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[(x-\\mu_t)^2]=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle]=-\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\log p_t]=\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma_t^2)\\right)=-\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}$</span>。代入推论 9.11.6：左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\left(-\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t\\right)-\\left(-\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t\\right)=\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span>。恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：在高斯族中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的差异体现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\mu_t$</span> 项（平移速度）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 项（尺度速度）上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 只捕捉尺度部分，平移部分由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 承担。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 是单个密度的泛函，概率流速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是密度族的泛函；二者通过连续性方程的内积项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle$</span> 与散度项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot v_t$</span> 联系，但一般不相等。</li>\n<li>命题 9.11.3 与推论 9.11.6 给出可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot v_t]=-\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle]-\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\log p_t]$</span>，其成立依赖边界通量消失 (A4) 与 Leibniz 条件 (A5)。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\frac12 s_t$</span> 仅在密度演化恰为热流时才是合法速度场；一般情形需引入非热流部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>，其散度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t-\\frac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 决定。把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混同是本节明确排除的错误。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-6-速度场在-score-下的-L-2-p-投影-最小范数规范\">6. 速度场在 score 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p)$</span> 投影：最小范数规范<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-6-速度场在-score-下的-L-2-p-投影-最小范数规范\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\tfrac12 s_t+u_t$</span> 并未规定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 的选取，因此速度场在给定密度族下并不唯一。本节需要一个<strong>规范固定</strong>：在所有满足连续性方程的速度场中，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 范数最小者。这一规范恰好把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的关系写成可解的投影问题。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 9.11.8（最小范数速度场）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V_t=\\{v\\in L^2(p_t;\\mathbb R^d):\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v)=-\\partial_t p_t\\ \\text{在分布意义下}\\}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V_t$</span> 非空，定义最小范数速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^\\star=\\arg\\min_{v\\in\\mathcal V_t}\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|v(X)\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.9（投影刻画）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V_t$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\in L^2(p_t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 存在唯一，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^2(p_t;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t w)=0$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle v_t^\\star,w\\rangle]=0$</span>。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的正交投影，且可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\psi_t,\\qquad \\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\psi_t)=-\\partial_t p_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_t$</span> 为加权 Poisson 方程的解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 的仿射子空间（差两个解得无散度场）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数严格凸，故最小值点存在唯一，且满足正交条件。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\psi_t+u$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 无散度；正交条件迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle\\nabla\\psi_t,u\\rangle]=0$</span> 对一切无散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 成立。由 (A4) 分部积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle\\nabla\\psi_t,u\\rangle]=-\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\psi_t\\nabla\\cdot u]$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t u$</span> 的散度为零时右端为零），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 意义下。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\psi_t$</span>，代入连续性方程得加权 Poisson 方程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：<strong>最小范数速度场是某个标量势的梯度</strong>，而 score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 也是梯度场。两者都是梯度场，但势函数不同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 的势 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_t$</span> 解加权 Poisson 方程，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的势是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span>。这给出二者关系的精确表述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.11.10（score 与最小范数速度场的势关系）</strong> 在命题 9.11.9 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\phi_t)$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t\\in C^2$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\phi_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 通过</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t))=-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t+\\partial_t p_t$$</div>\n<p>联系。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t=\\tfrac12\\log p_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\tfrac12 s_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\phi_t)$</span> 与连续性方程比较，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t(v_t^\\star-\\nabla\\phi_t))=0$</span>，由命题 9.11.9 的唯一性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\phi_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t$</span> 代入加权散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t))=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\phi_t)-\\tfrac12\\nabla\\cdot(p_t s_t)=\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 时右端为零，由加权 Poisson 方程的唯一性（在 (A4) 下）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t$</span> 为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\phi_t=\\tfrac12 s_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节的核心结论之一：<strong>score 场是最小范数速度场当且仅当密度演化是热流</strong>。在一般扩散模型中，最小范数速度场与 score 场相差一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 决定的势差，这个势差正是上一小节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 的梯度部分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-7-得分匹配视角下的速度场估计\">7. 得分匹配视角下的速度场估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-7-得分匹配视角下的速度场估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述关系对估计有直接后果。若以 score 为参数化目标（得分匹配），则速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 的估计需要额外处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span>；若以速度场为参数化目标（流匹配），则 score 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 反解，但反解需要解加权 Poisson 方程，代价高于直接估计 score。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.11（由速度场恢复 score 的误差界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat v_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 的估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat v_t-v_t^\\star\\|_{L^2(p_t)}\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。则 score 的估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t=2\\hat v_t$</span>（在热流规范下）满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}\\le 2\\varepsilon+2\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2(p_t)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 的势。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|\\hat s_t-2v_t^\\star\\|_{L^2}+\\|2v_t^\\star-s_t\\|_{L^2}\\le 2\\varepsilon+2\\|\\nabla\\phi_t-\\tfrac12 s_t\\|_{L^2}$</span>。由推论 9.11.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\phi_t-\\tfrac12 s_t=\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此界说明：<strong>用速度场估计 score 的误差由两部分组成</strong>——速度场本身的估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，以及规范偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|$</span>。后者在非热流演化下不为零，是“把速度当 score”产生系统性偏差的定量来源。这与命题 9.11.4 的定性结论一致，但给出了可计算的误差项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-8-时间重参数化下的不变性\">8. 时间重参数化下的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-8-时间重参数化下的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>扩散模型常对时间做重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\tau(t)$</span>，此时速度场与 score 的变换规则需明确，否则“score 等于速度”的等式会在重参数化下失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.12（时间重参数化下的变换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau(t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 严格单调，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(0)=0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau=p_{t(\\tau)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau=\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}v_{t(\\tau)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span> 的概率流速度场，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_\\tau=s_{t(\\tau)}$</span> 不变（score 只依赖密度，不依赖时间参数化）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 连续性方程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t+\\nabla\\cdot(p_t v_t)=0$</span>。换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\tilde p_\\tau=\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}\\partial_t p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\tilde p_\\tau+\\nabla\\cdot(\\tilde p_\\tau\\tilde v_\\tau)=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau=\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}v_t$</span>。score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log\\tilde p_\\tau=\\nabla\\log p_{t(\\tau)}=s_{t(\\tau)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清一个常见混淆：<strong>score 在时间重参数化下不变，速度场按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}$</span> 缩放</strong>。因此“<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\tfrac12 s_t$</span>”这一等式在重参数化后变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde v_\\tau=-\\tfrac12\\frac{dt}{d\\tau}\\tilde s_\\tau$</span>，系数不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12$</span>。把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混同的错误，往往源于忽略了这个缩放因子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-9-与得分匹配章的接口-两个参数化的选择准则\">9. 与得分匹配章的接口：两个参数化的选择准则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-9-与得分匹配章的接口-两个参数化的选择准则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节结论对后续得分匹配章的直接接口是：<strong>score 与速度场是两个不同的参数化对象，选择哪一个取决于密度族的结构与估计目标</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若密度族由已知的加噪过程（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=p_0*\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>）给出，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t\\Delta p_t$</span>，此时最小范数速度场与 score 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\tfrac12\\sigma_t\\dot\\sigma_t\\, s_t$</span>（在适当缩放下），score 参数化是自然的。</li>\n<li>若密度族由一般流（如连续归一化流）给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p_t$</span> 无固定比例，最小范数速度场与 score 的差异不可忽略，此时以速度场为参数化目标（流匹配）更自然，score 需通过加权 Poisson 方程反解。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一选择准则的数学依据是推论 9.11.10：<strong>score 参数化的合法性等价于密度演化是热流（在时间重参数化意义下）</strong>。超出此情形，score 与速度场的差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)$</span> 量化，不能通过重新参数化消除。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.13（热流判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，以下三条等价：(i) 存在时间重参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足热方程；(ii) 最小范数速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 共线，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=c(t)s_t$</span> 对某标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(t)$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 意义下。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：热流下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\tfrac12 s_t$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\tfrac12$</span>。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=c s_t$</span> 代入推论 9.11.10 的势关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\phi_t=c\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)=(c-\\tfrac12)s_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 下为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\tfrac12$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\neq 0$</span> 处）。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t=\\tfrac12\\log p_t$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\phi_t)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t=\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span>，即热方程。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此判据给出一个可操作的检验：给定数值计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>，检查二者是否共线；若否，则密度演化非热流，score 参数化需谨慎。这与本节开头的命题 9.11.4 形成闭环：命题 9.11.4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=-\\tfrac12 s_t$</span> 合法的充分必要条件（热流），命题 9.11.13 给出该条件在最小范数规范下的等价刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-10-小结性推导链\">10. 小结性推导链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-10-小结性推导链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节从定义出发，经命题 9.11.3（连续性方程关系）、命题 9.11.4（score 速度场的存在性）、命题 9.11.5（Helmholtz 分解）、推论 9.11.6（散度恒等式）、命题 9.11.9（最小范数投影）、推论 9.11.10（势关系）、命题 9.11.11（误差界）、命题 9.11.12（时间重参数化）、命题 9.11.13（热流判据），构成一条完整的推导链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\phi_t\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t))=\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t.$$</div>\n<p>链的左端是 score 的定义，右端是密度演化的非热流成分；中间的加权 Poisson 方程是二者转换的精确桥梁。当且仅当右端为零时，score 与最小范数速度场重合（至多差一个常数因子），此时得分匹配与流匹配在参数化层面等价。超出此情形，二者是不同对象，必须分别处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-11-速度场在-score-下的正交分解的显式构造\">11. 速度场在 score 下的正交分解的显式构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-11-速度场在-score-下的正交分解的显式构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出了最小范数速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\phi_t$</span> 的存在性与唯一性，但未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 的显式构造。为使推论 9.11.10 的势关系可计算，本节给出加权 Poisson 方程的解的显式积分表示，并由此把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的差异写成可直接求值的散度项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.14（加权 Poisson 方程的显式解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t\\in L^2(p_t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\partial_t p_t\\,dx=0$</span>（质量守恒）。则加权 Poisson 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\psi_t)=-\\partial_t p_t$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上存在解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_t\\in H^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(p_t)$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int p_t\\langle\\nabla\\psi_t,\\nabla\\varphi\\rangle\\,dx=\\int\\varphi\\,\\partial_t p_t\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A4)，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\varphi\\nabla\\psi_t)\\,dx=0$</span>，展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\varphi\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\psi_t)\\,dx=-\\int p_t\\langle\\nabla\\psi_t,\\nabla\\varphi\\rangle\\,dx$</span>。代入方程即得弱形式。存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 正性与 (A2) 给出的加权 Dirichlet 形式的强制性（在商去常数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^1(p_t)$</span> 上），Lax–Milgram 给出唯一弱解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 的计算归结为求解一个加权椭圆方程，其弱形式只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t$</span>，无需显式计算 score。这给出一个重要的<strong>数值策略</strong>：当密度族由采样或数值积分给出时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 可通过解加权 Poisson 方程得到，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 需通过对数密度的数值梯度得到；两者在数值上的稳定性不同（前者是椭圆问题，后者是微分问题），这是后续代码节要处理的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.11.15（势差满足的方程）</strong> 在命题 9.11.14 的条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 的势，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t))=\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t\\nabla\\phi_t)=-\\partial_t p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_t s_t)=\\Delta p_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t s_t=\\nabla p_t$</span>），两式相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把命题 9.11.13 的判据 (iii) 转化为一个<strong>加权椭圆方程的解是否为零</strong>的问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)=0$</span> 当且仅当右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 在加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}(p_t)$</span> 意义下为零。这比直接检查共线性更易于数值实现：只需计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t p_t-\\tfrac12\\Delta p_t$</span> 的加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{-1}$</span> 范数，若其小于阈值，则 score 参数化合法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-12-速度场与-score-的内积恒等式的独立性检验\">12. 速度场与 score 的内积恒等式的独立性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-12-速度场与-score-的内积恒等式的独立性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 9.11.6 给出的散度恒等式涉及三个量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot v_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t\\rangle]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\log p_t]$</span>。这三者中任意两个可独立测量，第三个由恒等式确定。本节给出一个<strong>独立性检验</strong>：在最小范数规范下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t^\\star\\rangle]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot v_t^\\star]$</span> 的关系由势差决定，而非由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star$</span> 本身决定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.16（最小范数规范下的内积恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 与命题 9.11.14 的条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\nabla\\phi_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t^\\star\\rangle]=\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\rangle]+\\tfrac12\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\phi_t=\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)+\\tfrac12 s_t$</span>，取与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的内积并取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 期望，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2]=\\tfrac12 I_{p_t}(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把内积分解为两部分：<strong>Fisher 信息的一半</strong>加上<strong>势差与 score 的内积</strong>。当密度演化为热流时势差为零，内积恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 I_{p_t}(X)$</span>，与命题 9.11.4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star=\\tfrac12 s_t$</span> 一致。当势差非零时，内积偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 I_{p_t}(X)$</span>，偏离量正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\rangle]$</span>。这给出一个可检验的判据：若数值计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t^\\star\\rangle]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 I_{p_t}(X)$</span> 之差超过估计误差，则密度演化非热流，score 参数化需引入修正项。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.11.17（Fisher 信息的速度场下界）</strong> 在命题 9.11.16 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,v_t^\\star\\rangle]\\ge\\tfrac12 I_{p_t}(X)-\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2(p_t)}\\cdot\\|s_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\langle s_t,\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\rangle]\\ge-\\|s_t\\|_{L^2}\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2}$</span>，代入命题 9.11.16 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此下界说明：<strong>势差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 范数是 score 与速度场内积偏离 Fisher 信息半值的定量上界</strong>。这与命题 9.11.11 的误差界形式一致，但作用于内积而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离，二者从不同角度刻画同一偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-13-具体例子-非热流演化下的势差计算\">13. 具体例子：非热流演化下的势差计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-13-具体例子-非热流演化下的势差计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 9.11.18</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 均随时间变化（非热流）。由例 9.11.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t^\\star(x)=\\dot\\mu_t+\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}(x-\\mu_t)$</span>，其势为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x)=\\dot\\mu_t(x-\\mu_t)+\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{2\\sigma_t}(x-\\mu_t)^2$</span>（至多差常数）。计算势差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p>直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\log p_t(x)=-\\tfrac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)-\\frac{(x-\\mu_t)^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 s_t(x)=-\\frac{x-\\mu_t}{2\\sigma_t^2}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)=\\dot\\mu_t+\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}(x-\\mu_t)+\\frac{x-\\mu_t}{2\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n<p>其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 范数平方为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2(p_t)}^2=\\dot\\mu_t^2+\\left(\\frac{\\dot\\sigma_t}{\\sigma_t}+\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\right)^2\\sigma_t^2.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\mu_t=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t=-1/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 时势差为零，此即热流条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t^2=1/2$</span> 的时间重参数化）。一般情形下势差非零，且其范数由平移速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\mu_t$</span> 与尺度速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 相对热流值的偏离共同决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例把命题 9.11.13 的判据 (iii) 写成显式表达式，并说明：<strong>平移速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\mu_t$</span> 直接进入势差</strong>，即使尺度演化恰好是热流，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\mu_t\\neq 0$</span>，score 与最小范数速度场就不重合。这是“把速度当 score”在高斯族中最简单的失效模式，也是命题 9.11.4 中“当且仅当热流”的具体体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-14-代码-势差范数与-Fisher-信息半值的数值比较\">14. 代码：势差范数与 Fisher 信息半值的数值比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-14-代码-势差范数与-Fisher-信息半值的数值比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在一维高斯族上数值计算命题 9.11.16 的两端，并验证推论 9.11.17 的下界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef gaussian_setup(mu, sigma, dmu, dsigma):\n    nodes, weights = np.polynomial.hermite_e.hermegauss(80)\n    x = mu + sigma * nodes\n    w = weights / np.sqrt(2 * np.pi)\n    s = -(x - mu) / sigma**2\n    v = dmu + (dsigma / sigma) * (x - mu)\n    grad_phi_minus_half_logp = dmu + (dsigma / sigma + 1/(2*sigma**2)) * (x - mu)\n    return x, w, s, v, grad_phi_minus_half_logp\n\n# 非热流参数\nmu, sigma, dmu, dsigma = 0.3, 1.2, -0.5, 0.4\nx, w, s, v, g = gaussian_setup(mu, sigma, dmu, dsigma)\n\nlhs = np.sum(w * s * v)\nfisher_half = 0.5 * np.sum(w * s**2)\ncross = np.sum(w * s * g)\nassert abs(lhs - (cross + fisher_half)) &lt; 1e-10\nprint(&quot;E[&lt;s,v&gt;] =&quot;, lhs, &quot; cross + I/2 =&quot;, cross + fisher_half, &quot; 命题 9.11.16 成立&quot;)\n\nnorm_g = np.sqrt(np.sum(w * g**2))\nnorm_s = np.sqrt(np.sum(w * s**2))\nlower = fisher_half - norm_g * norm_s\nassert lhs &gt;= lower - 1e-10\nprint(&quot;下界 =&quot;, lower, &quot; 实际值 =&quot;, lhs, &quot; 推论 9.11.17 成立&quot;)\n\n# 热流参数：dsigma/sigma = -1/(2 sigma^2), dmu = 0\nmu_h, sigma_h, dmu_h = 0.3, 1.2, 0.0\ndsigma_h = -sigma_h / (2 * sigma_h**2)\nxh, wh, sh, vh, gh = gaussian_setup(mu_h, sigma_h, dmu_h, dsigma_h)\nassert np.max(np.abs(gh)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(np.sum(wh * sh * vh) - 0.5 * np.sum(wh * sh**2)) &lt; 1e-10\nprint(&quot;热流规范下势差为零，E[&lt;s,v&gt;] = I/2，符合命题 9.11.13&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>E[&lt;s,v&gt;] = ... cross + I/2 = ... 命题 9.11.16 成立</code>，<code>下界 = ... 实际值 = ... 推论 9.11.17 成立</code>，<code>热流规范下势差为零，E[&lt;s,v&gt;] = I/2，符合命题 9.11.13</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-15-与得分匹配章接口的定量版本\">15. 与得分匹配章接口的定量版本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-15-与得分匹配章接口的定量版本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9.11.13 给出定性的热流判据，命题 9.11.16 与推论 9.11.17 给出定量的偏差刻画。本节最后把二者合并为一个<strong>可操作的参数化选择准则</strong>，供得分匹配章直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.11.19（参数化选择的定量准则）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 与命题 9.11.14 的条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s=\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}$</span> 为 score 估计误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_v=\\|\\hat v_t-v_t^\\star\\|_{L^2(p_t)}$</span> 为速度场估计误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2(p_t)}$</span> 为势差范数。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat s_t-2\\hat v_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}\\le 2\\varepsilon_v+\\varepsilon_s+2\\delta_t.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\delta_t\\le\\varepsilon_s+\\varepsilon_v$</span>，则以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\hat v_t$</span> 作为 score 估计的额外误差不超过已有估计误差之和；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\delta_t\\gg\\varepsilon_s+\\varepsilon_v$</span>，则速度场参数化不能替代 score 参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由三角不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s_t-2\\hat v_t\\|_{L^2}\\le\\|\\hat s_t-s_t\\|_{L^2}+\\|s_t-2v_t^\\star\\|_{L^2}+2\\|v_t^\\star-\\hat v_t\\|_{L^2}$</span>。由推论 9.11.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t-2v_t^\\star\\|_{L^2}=2\\|\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)\\|_{L^2}=2\\delta_t$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把“score 与速度场是否可互换”从定性判据转化为<strong>三个可测量之比</strong>：势差范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 与两个估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_s,\\varepsilon_v$</span> 的比较。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 远小于估计误差时，二者在数值上不可区分，参数化选择不影响结果；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 远大于估计误差时，二者是不同对象，必须分别参数化。这与命题 9.11.13 的等价条件一致，但给出了有限样本下的实用判据。</p>\n<p>至此，本节从定义（9.11.1、9.11.2）出发，经连续性方程关系（9.11.3）、score 速度场存在性（9.11.4）、Helmholtz 分解（9.11.5）、散度恒等式（9.11.6）、最小范数投影（9.11.9）、势关系（9.11.10）、误差界（9.11.11）、时间重参数化（9.11.12）、热流判据（9.11.13）、显式解（9.11.14、9.11.15）、内积恒等式（9.11.16、9.11.17）、具体例子（9.11.18）与定量准则（9.11.19），完成了 score 与速度场关系的完整刻画。核心结论可浓缩为一句话：<strong>score 是最小范数速度场当且仅当密度演化是热流；一般情形下二者的差异由势差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(\\phi_t-\\tfrac12\\log p_t)$</span> 精确量化，该势差满足加权 Poisson 方程，其范数给出参数化互换的误差上界。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-Score-与能量模型\">Score 与能量模型<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-Score-与能量模型\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为 score 场。本节引入能量模型所需的附加符号并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$E:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，能量函数，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且下方有界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}e^{-E(x)}\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>，配分函数，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;Z&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(x)=Z^{-1}e^{-E(x)}$</span>，Gibbs 密度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;0$</span>，逆温度参数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta E$</span> 为缩放能量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_\\beta(x)=\\beta E(x)+\\log Z_\\beta$</span>，缩放自由能密度，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\beta=\\int e^{-\\beta E}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{\\beta}(x)=\\beta E(x)$</span>，缩放哈密顿量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节核心恒等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_E(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_E(x)=-\\nabla_x E(x).$$</div>\n<p>一般情形下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 由能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\propto e^{-E}$</span> 生成，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>。本节要证明：在适当正则性下，score 场恰为负能量梯度；Fisher 信息等于能量梯度的二阶矩；score 的散度恒等式对应能量 Laplacian 的期望为零；并讨论能量参数化与 score 参数化的等价性与不等价性。</p>\n<p>假设清单（本节所有命题共用，逐条在命题中引用）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\in C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E&gt;0$</span> 处处成立。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla E\\|^2p_E\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla^2 E\\|\\,p_E\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 边界通量消失</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_E(x)\\nabla E(x)\\cdot n\\,\\mathrm dS=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\nabla\\cdot(p_E\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 矩条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\|x\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，用于 Fubini 与 Leibniz 交换。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下面逐项完成证明义务。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-定义-能量模型与-score-的对应\">定义：能量模型与 score 的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-定义-能量模型与-score-的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 12.1（能量模型）</strong> 称概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 属于能量模型类，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足 (A1)–(A2)，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x)=\\frac{e^{-E(x)}}{Z},\\qquad Z=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}e^{-E(y)}\\,\\mathrm dy.$$</div>\n<p>此时称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的能量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为配分函数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.2（score 等于负能量梯度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=-\\nabla_x E(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=\\log Z^{-1}-E(x)$</span> 逐分量求偏导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x_i}\\log p(x)=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x_i}\\bigl(-\\log Z-E(x)\\bigr)=-\\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial x_i}(x).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，故其梯度为零。逐分量合并即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：score 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的对数梯度，属于概率密度的内蕴几何量，与参数化无关；能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的一种表示，仅在能量模型类内与 score 一一对应（相差常数不影响梯度）。速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 是概率流 ODE 的漂移，与 score 通过连续性方程联系，但二者不是同一个对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t$</span> 依赖时间与流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 只依赖瞬时密度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-主定理-Fisher-信息与能量梯度的二阶矩\">主定理：Fisher 信息与能量梯度的二阶矩<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-主定理-Fisher-信息与能量梯度的二阶矩\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 12.3（能量模型的 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)=\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\bigr]=\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|\\nabla E(X)\\|^2\\bigr].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|^2=\\|\\nabla E(x)\\|^2$</span> 逐点成立。由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla E\\|^2p_E&lt;\\infty$</span>，该期望存在且有限。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\bigr]=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\|\\nabla E(x)\\|^2p_E(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|\\nabla E(X)\\|^2\\bigr].$$</div>\n<p>此即 Fisher 信息（本章第 3 节已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.4（score 的散度恒等式在能量模型下的形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)\\bigr]=-\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\Delta E(X)\\bigr]=0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i^2$</span> 为 Laplacian。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\Delta E$</span> 逐点成立。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Delta E(x)\\,p_E(x)\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，直接计算散度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(p_E\\nabla E)=p_E\\,\\Delta E+\\nabla p_E\\cdot\\nabla E=p_E\\,\\Delta E-p_E\\|\\nabla E\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p_E\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>（边界通量消失）。对左式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上积分并用 Fubini（(A2) 保证可积）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int p_E\\Delta E\\,\\mathrm dx-\\int p_E\\|\\nabla E\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_E\\Delta E\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int p_E\\|\\nabla E\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx=I(X)$</span>。代回即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。但本章第 5 节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span>（边界项消失时），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=0$</span> 与 (A2) 矛盾？此处核对如下：第 5 节的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 与本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 并不矛盾，因为第 5 节的恒等式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p s)\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ps=-p\\nabla E$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p\\nabla E)$</span>，其积分为零正是 (A3)。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\nabla E)+\\int\\nabla p\\cdot s$</span>。直接计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\int p\\Delta E$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\nabla E)=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\Delta E=\\int p\\|\\nabla E\\|^2$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。这与第 5 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 表面冲突，实则第 5 节的恒等式是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为任意 score 场、且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=0$</span> 的条件下成立的；对能量模型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=-\\nabla\\cdot(p\\nabla E)$</span>，其积分为零由 (A3) 保证，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 应成立。矛盾出在符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=p\\nabla\\cdot s+\\nabla p\\cdot s=p\\nabla\\cdot s+p\\|s\\|^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\int p\\|s\\|^2=-I(X)$</span>。第 5 节的恒等式实为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 在边界项消失时的形式，而非零。本节以 (A3) 显式验证该边界项，结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>，与 Fisher 信息一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：上述推导中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p\\nabla E)=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=0$</span> 是同一件事（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>），二者一致给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。本节不重复第 5 节的证明，只验证能量模型下 (A3) 足以使边界项消失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-具体例子-高斯能量模型\">具体例子：高斯能量模型<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-具体例子-高斯能量模型\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 12.5（各向同性高斯）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)=\\frac12\\|x\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=(2\\pi)^{d/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。验证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=-\\nabla E(x)=-x,\\qquad I(X)=\\mathbb E[\\|X\\|^2]=d.$$</div>\n<p>散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=-d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-d=-I(X)$</span>，与推论 12.4 一致。边界通量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_E\\nabla E\\cdot n\\,\\mathrm dS=\\int_{\\partial B_R}p_E R\\,\\mathrm dS\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span>，高斯尾部指数衰减），(A3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>例 12.6（缩放能量）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\beta=\\beta E$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\beta\\propto e^{-\\beta E}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\beta=-\\beta\\nabla E$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_\\beta(X)=\\beta^2\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\|\\nabla E\\|^2]$</span>。这说明 Fisher 信息随逆温度二次增长，是 score 参数化中温度缩放的理论依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量参数化与-score-参数化的等价性\">能量参数化与 score 参数化的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量参数化与-score-参数化的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.7（能量参数化的 score 恢复）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 为参数化能量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^m$</span>，满足 (A1)–(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto E_\\theta(x)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x)=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta(x),$$</div>\n<p>且 score 的参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta\\}$</span> 与能量参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{E_\\theta\\}$</span> 在梯度意义下等价：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta-E_{\\theta'}$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_{\\theta'}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 12.2 逐点成立。第二式：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta-E_{\\theta'}=c$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x(E_\\theta-E_{\\theta'})=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-s_{\\theta'}=0$</span>。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_{\\theta'}$</span> 处处成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(E_\\theta-E_{\\theta'})=0$</span>，在连通区域上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta-E_{\\theta'}$</span> 为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.8（能量参数化的不可识别性）</strong> 能量参数化存在平移自由度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta+c$</span> 给出同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与同一 score。因此以 score 为目标训练能量模型时，配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta$</span> 的估计不必精确到常数，只需精确到梯度；这是能量模型训练中“对比散度”类方法的数学根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型下的-score-奇异性\">能量模型下的 score 奇异性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型下的-score-奇异性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.9（低密度区 score 爆炸的能量刻画）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\to\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(x)\\to0$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s(x)\\|=\\|\\nabla E(x)\\|\\to\\infty$$</div>\n<p>沿任何使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 的序列。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在无穷远处超二次增长，则 score 范数在尾部无界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E=Z^{-1}e^{-E}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\to+\\infty$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|=\\|\\nabla E\\|$</span> 由命题 12.2。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 超二次，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E\\|$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\to\\infty$</span> 无界（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\|x\\|^4$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E\\|=4\\|x\\|^3$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：能量模型的 score 奇异性完全由能量梯度的增长控制，与第 10 节的反例节衔接——低密度区 score 爆炸在能量模型下等价于能量梯度爆炸。参数化策略（第 8 节）应约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E\\|$</span> 的增长，例如采用 Lipschitz 能量或谱归一化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-代码-能量模型-score-的数值验证\">代码：能量模型 score 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码-能量模型-score-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 高斯能量模型 E(x) = 0.5 * ||x||^2, d=3\nd = 3\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nX = rng.standard_normal((10000, d))  # 样本来自 N(0, I_d)\n\ndef energy(x):\n    return 0.5 * np.sum(x**2, axis=1)\n\ndef score_energy(x):\n    return -x  # s = -grad E\n\nS = score_energy(X)\nassert S.shape == (10000, d)\n# Fisher 信息: E[||s||^2] 应约等于 d\nfisher_est = np.mean(np.sum(S**2, axis=1))\nassert abs(fisher_est - d) &lt; 0.2, fisher_est\n# 散度: div s = -d, 期望为 -d\ndiv_s = -d * np.ones(10000)\nassert abs(np.mean(div_s) + d) &lt; 1e-12\n# score 均值应约等于 0\nmean_s = np.mean(S, axis=0)\nassert np.all(np.abs(mean_s) &lt; 0.05), mean_s\nprint(&quot;S shape:&quot;, S.shape)\nprint(&quot;Fisher estimate:&quot;, fisher_est, &quot;expected:&quot;, d)\nprint(&quot;mean score:&quot;, mean_s)\nprint(&quot;mean div s:&quot;, np.mean(div_s), &quot;expected:&quot;, -d)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>S shape: (10000, 3)</code>，Fisher 估计接近 3，score 均值接近 0，散度均值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-3$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型下的得分恒等式-分部积分与-Fisher-信息的变分刻画\">能量模型下的得分恒等式：分部积分与 Fisher 信息的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型下的得分恒等式-分部积分与-Fisher-信息的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。本节进一步把 Fisher 信息写成能量泛函的变分形式，这是能量模型训练中正则项的理论来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.10（Fisher 信息的变分表示）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|f\\|^2p_E&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla f\\|^2p_E&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(p_E f\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx=0$</span>（边界通量消失）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|s(X)\\|^2\\bigr]=\\sup_{f}\\ \\frac{\\bigl(\\mathbb E_{p_E}[f(X)\\,\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]\\bigr)^2}{\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\|\\nabla f(X)\\|^2]},$$</div>\n<p>上确界在使分母非零的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 上取，且极值函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\propto \\log p_E$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\propto -E$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>。对任意满足条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，分部积分给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[f\\,\\nabla\\cdot s]=\\int f\\,p_E\\,\\nabla\\cdot(-\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int f\\,p_E\\,\\Delta E\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p_E f\\nabla E)=f\\,p_E\\Delta E+p_E\\nabla f\\cdot\\nabla E$</span>，在边界项消失下积分为零，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,p_E\\,\\Delta E\\,\\mathrm dx=-\\int p_E\\,\\nabla f\\cdot\\nabla E\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int p_E\\,\\nabla f\\cdot s\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[f\\,\\nabla\\cdot s]=\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\nabla f(X)\\cdot s(X)].$$</div>\n<p>由 Cauchy–Schwarz 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl(\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\nabla f\\cdot s]\\bigr)^2\\le \\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\|\\nabla f\\|^2]\\,\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\|s\\|^2].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-E$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p_E+\\text{const}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=s$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|s\\|^2]^2$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，比值恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，达到上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 Fisher 信息是 score 场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_E)$</span> 中的范数平方，且可由能量函数本身作为极值函数达到。在能量模型训练中，若以 score 匹配为目标，则等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|s_\\theta-s\\|^2]$</span>，其下界由 Fisher 信息给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型与得分匹配目标的关系\">能量模型与得分匹配目标的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型与得分匹配目标的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.11（能量参数化下的得分匹配损失）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{data}}$</span> 为数据密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=Z_\\theta^{-1}e^{-E_\\theta}$</span> 为能量模型密度。定义得分匹配损失</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_{\\text{data}}}\\bigl[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s_{\\text{data}}(X)\\|^2\\bigr],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\text{data}}=\\nabla\\log p_{\\text{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla E_\\theta$</span>。则在 (A1)–(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立、且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\nabla E_\\theta(x)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L(\\theta)=-2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_{\\text{data}}}\\bigl[(\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla_x E_\\theta(X))^\\top\\bigl(s_\\theta(X)-s_{\\text{data}}(X)\\bigr)\\bigr].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐点对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-s_{\\text{data}}\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-s_{\\text{data}})$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=-\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span>。在 (A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span> 连续可微，故可用 Leibniz 法则交换期望与梯度（控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的可积上界，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧与 (A2) 保证）。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.12（能量梯度与 score 误差的线性化）</strong> 在命题 12.11 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_{\\text{data}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{data}}$</span> 支撑上几乎处处成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla E_\\theta=\\nabla E_{\\text{data}}$</span>，能量函数相差常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-s_{\\text{data}}\\|=0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{data}}$</span>-几乎处处。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla E_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\text{data}}=-\\nabla E_{\\text{data}}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla(E_\\theta-E_{\\text{data}})=0$</span>。在连通支撑上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta-E_{\\text{data}}$</span> 为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出能量模型可识别性的精确边界：score 匹配只能恢复能量到常数，不能恢复配分函数。这与推论 12.8 的不可识别性一致，但此处从损失函数角度给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型的-score-与热力学量的对应\">能量模型的 score 与热力学量的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型的-score-与热力学量的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 7 节已建立 score 与热力学的关系。本节在能量模型下把该关系写成显式形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.13（自由能梯度与 score）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义自由能 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F=-\\log Z$</span>。则对逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial \\beta}=\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[E(X)],\\qquad s_\\beta(x)=-\\beta\\nabla E(x),$$</div>\n<p>且 Fisher 信息满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I_\\beta(X)=\\beta^2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}\\bigl[\\|\\nabla E(X)\\|^2\\bigr]=\\beta^2\\,\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\beta}\\bigl(\\|\\nabla E(X)\\|\\bigr)+\\beta^2\\,\\|\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E(X)]\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F=-\\log Z_\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta F=-\\partial_\\beta\\log Z_\\beta=-\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[(-E)]=\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[E]$</span>，其中交换求导与积分由 (A2) 与 Leibniz 法则保证（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|E|e^{-\\beta E}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的紧区间上可积）。第二式由命题 12.2 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\beta\\propto e^{-\\beta E}$</span>。第三式由方差分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|Y\\|^2]=\\mathrm{Var}(\\|Y\\|)+\\|\\mathbb E[Y]\\|^2$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\nabla E$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 score 的 Fisher 信息分解为能量梯度的方差项与均值项。在能量模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E]$</span> 一般不为零（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\beta$</span> 关于原点对称），故 Fisher 信息包含均值贡献。这与第 3 节的一般恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span> 不冲突：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[s_\\beta]=-\\beta\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[s_\\beta]=0$</span> 恰给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E]=0$</span>，即能量梯度的均值在 Gibbs 密度下为零。这是能量模型的一个内蕴约束，可作为参数化时的诊断量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型的-score-参数化-加性分解与谱约束\">能量模型的 score 参数化：加性分解与谱约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型的-score-参数化-加性分解与谱约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 12.14（谱约束能量）</strong> 称能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-谱约束，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla^2 E(x)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}$</span> 为算子范数。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla E$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.15（谱约束下的 score 增长控制）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-谱约束且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(0)=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\nabla E(x)\\|\\le L\\|x\\|,\\qquad \\|s(x)\\|\\le L\\|x\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由微积分基本定理沿线段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto tx$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla E(x)-\\nabla E(0)=\\int_0^1\\nabla^2E(tx)\\,x\\,\\mathrm dt.$$</div>\n<p>取范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E(x)-\\nabla E(0)\\|\\le\\int_0^1\\|\\nabla^2E(tx)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\|x\\|\\,\\mathrm dt\\le L\\|x\\|$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla E(0)=0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(0)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在原点取极小，或直接假设），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E(x)\\|\\le L\\|x\\|$</span>。由命题 12.2 得 score 界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出参数化策略的数学依据：谱约束能量保证 score 在尾部至多线性增长，从而避免命题 12.9 中的超二次爆炸。在工程上，这对应于对能量网络施加 Lipschitz 约束（谱归一化或梯度惩罚），使 score 场在低密度区保持可控。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.16（谱约束下的 Fisher 信息上界）</strong> 在命题 12.15 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\|X\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X)\\le L^2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\|X\\|^2\\bigr].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.15，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|^2\\le L^2\\|x\\|^2$</span> 逐点成立。取期望并用 (A4) 的矩条件即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此上界说明 Fisher 信息随谱常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 二次增长，与例 12.6 的温度缩放一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 扮演了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的角色。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型与得分匹配章的接口-数学侧\">能量模型与得分匹配章的接口（数学侧）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型与得分匹配章的接口-数学侧\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开得分匹配章的内容，只给出接口所需的数学对象。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t\\}_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 为前向扩散过程诱导的密度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 属于能量模型类，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=Z_t^{-1}e^{-E_t}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=-\\nabla E_t$</span>，且得分匹配目标</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta)=\\int_0^T\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\bigl[\\|s_\\theta(x,t)-s_t(x)\\|^2\\bigr]\\,\\mathrm dt$$</div>\n<p>在能量参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla E_\\theta$</span> 下化为对能量梯度的匹配。此处只需注意：能量模型类对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的封闭性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_t$</span> 的正则性 (A1)–(A2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时趋于数据密度（可能为奇异测度），则能量模型类在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处不封闭，接口需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 上定义。这一致性条件是得分匹配章与本节衔接的精确边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型的-score-加性分解与条件-score\">能量模型的 score 加性分解与条件 score<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型的-score-加性分解与条件-score\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>能量模型的一个结构性优点是 score 在变量分组下具有加性分解，这为高维参数化与条件生成提供了精确的数学接口。本节给出该分解及其在条件能量模型下的形式。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 12.17（加性分解能量）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(u,v)\\in\\mathbb R^{d_u}\\times\\mathbb R^{d_v}$</span>。称能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 关于分组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 可加分解，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_u:\\mathbb R^{d_u}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_v:\\mathbb R^{d_v}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 与耦合项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}:\\mathbb R^{d_u}\\times\\mathbb R^{d_v}\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E(u,v)=E_u(u)+E_v(v)+E_{uv}(u,v),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_u,E_v,E_{uv}$</span> 均满足 (A1)。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}\\equiv0$</span> 时称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 完全可加。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.18（score 的加性分解）</strong> 在定义 12.17 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 满足 (A1)–(A2)，则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(u,v)=\\bigl(-\\nabla_u E_u(u)-\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v),\\ -\\nabla_v E_v(v)-\\nabla_v E_{uv}(u,v)\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}\\equiv0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(u,v)=(-\\nabla E_u(u),-\\nabla E_v(v))$</span>，即 score 的两个分块互不耦合，联合密度为乘积密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E=p_{E_u}\\otimes p_{E_v}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(u,v)=E_u(u)+E_v(v)+E_{uv}(u,v)$</span> 分别对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u E=\\nabla E_u(u)+\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_v E=\\nabla E_v(v)+\\nabla_v E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>。合并即得第一式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}\\equiv0$</span>，交叉项消失，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=Z_uZ_v$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(u,v)=Z_u^{-1}e^{-E_u(u)}\\cdot Z_v^{-1}e^{-E_v(v)}$</span>，为乘积密度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：能量模型的 score 耦合完全由交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}$</span> 的混合偏导控制，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial^2 E_{uv}/\\partial u_i\\partial v_j$</span>。在联合生成中，若希望两个变量块的 score 独立，则必须强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 可分离；否则 score 的交叉分量非零，联合分布不可分解为边缘之积。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.19（条件 score 与能量）</strong> 在定义 12.17 的设定下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的条件密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{E}(u\\mid v)=\\frac{e^{-E_u(u)-E_{uv}(u,v)}}{\\int e^{-E_u(u')-E_{uv}(u',v)}\\,\\mathrm du'},$$</div>\n<p>其条件 score 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{u\\mid v}(u)=-\\nabla_u E_u(u)-\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(u,v)=Z^{-1}e^{-E(u,v)}$</span>，条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(u\\mid v)=p_E(u,v)/p_E(v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E(v)=\\int p_E(u,v)\\,\\mathrm du$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的分解，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{-1}e^{-E_u(u)-E_v(v)-E_{uv}(u,v)}$</span>，分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 积分后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-E_v(v)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z^{-1}$</span> 相消，得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_E(u\\mid v)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_E(u\\mid v)=-\\log Z_{u\\mid v}(v)-E_u(u)-E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{u\\mid v}(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u\\log p_E(u\\mid v)=-\\nabla E_u(u)-\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出条件生成中 score 的精确表达式：条件 score 等于无条件能量梯度加上耦合项的条件梯度。它把联合能量模型的训练目标分解为边缘能量与耦合能量两部分，是联合生成章节（第二部后续）与本节衔接的数学接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型的-score-与得分恒等式的逐点形式\">能量模型的 score 与得分恒等式的逐点形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型的-score-与得分恒等式的逐点形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题给出的是期望意义下的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_E}[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。本节补充一个逐点恒等式，它在数值诊断中可直接检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.20（逐点散度—Hessian 恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=-\\operatorname{tr}\\bigl(\\nabla^2 E(x)\\bigr)=-\\Delta E(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 矩阵的迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 E$</span> 为能量 Hessian。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_i(x)=-\\partial_i E(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i s_i=-\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i^2 E=-\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2 E)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.21（Hessian 迹的期望与 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_E}\\bigl[\\operatorname{tr}\\bigl(\\nabla^2 E(X)\\bigr)\\bigr]=I(X).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.20，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E[\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2 E)]$</span>。由推论 12.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。两式相消即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把 Fisher 信息写成能量 Hessian 迹的期望，提供了一个不依赖 score 显式表达式的诊断量：在能量模型训练中，可直接对能量网络求二阶导数的迹并取样本平均，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla E\\|^2]$</span> 比较，二者应在数值误差内相等。若不等，则说明边界通量未消失或数值积分有偏。</p>\n<p><strong>例 12.22（高斯能量的 Hessian 迹）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)=\\frac12 x^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\succ0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 E=\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2 E)=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2 E)]=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E[\\|\\Sigma^{-1}X\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}\\Sigma\\Sigma^{-1})=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，与推论 12.21 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型的-score-参数化-加性分解的工程含义\">能量模型的 score 参数化：加性分解的工程含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型的-score-参数化-加性分解的工程含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 12.17 的加性分解不仅是数学结构，也直接对应能量网络的参数化设计。设能量网络写作</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_\\theta(u,v)=E_{\\theta_u}(u)+E_{\\theta_v}(v)+E_{\\theta_{uv}}(u,v),$$</div>\n<p>三部分分别由独立参数块 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_u,\\theta_v,\\theta_{uv}$</span> 控制。则由命题 12.18，score 网络可写作三个子网络的梯度之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(u,v)=\\bigl(-\\nabla E_{\\theta_u}(u)-\\nabla_u E_{\\theta_{uv}}(u,v),\\ -\\nabla E_{\\theta_v}(v)-\\nabla_v E_{\\theta_{uv}}(u,v)\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>这一分解的数学后果是：score 的交叉分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial s_u/\\partial v$</span> 仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{uv}$</span> 决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_u,\\theta_v$</span> 无关。因此，若数据中两个变量块条件独立，则最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_{uv}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{\\theta_{uv}}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 可分离（其混合偏导为零），此时 score 交叉分量为零。这给出一个可检验的判据：训练完成后，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial s_u/\\partial v\\|$</span> 在数据支撑上一致地小，则联合分布近似可分解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.23（交叉 score 的混合偏导刻画）</strong> 在定义 12.17 与 (A1) 下，score 的交叉 Jacobian 分块为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial s_u}{\\partial v}(u,v)=-\\nabla_{v}\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v),\\qquad \\frac{\\partial s_v}{\\partial u}(u,v)=-\\nabla_{u}\\nabla_v E_{uv}(u,v).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 12.18，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_u(u,v)=-\\nabla_u E_u(u)-\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 求梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_u E_u(u)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial s_u/\\partial v=-\\nabla_v\\nabla_u E_{uv}(u,v)$</span>。第二式对称。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 score 的交叉耦合完全由耦合能量的混合二阶偏导刻画，且由 Clairaut 定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_{uv}\\in C^2$</span>）两交叉分块互为转置：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial s_u/\\partial v=(\\partial s_v/\\partial u)^\\top$</span>。这一对称性是能量模型 score 场的结构约束，可作为参数化时的正则项：若参数化破坏了该对称性，则对应的 score 场不可能来自任何能量函数，即不属于能量模型类。这为“score 参数化是否可积”提供了一个精确判据——可积性等价于 score 的 Jacobian 对称。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.24（score 可积性的 Jacobian 判据）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in C^1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为某能量模型的 score（即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i s_j=\\partial_j s_i$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_j=-\\partial_j E$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i s_j=-\\partial_i\\partial_j E$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2$</span> 与 Clairaut 定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\partial_j E=\\partial_j\\partial_i E$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i s_j=\\partial_j s_i$</span>。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i s_j=\\partial_j s_i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega=\\sum_j s_j\\,\\mathrm dx_j$</span> 闭，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>（单连通）上恰当，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dE=-\\omega$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=-\\nabla E$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节与参数化节（第 8 节）的精确接口：score 参数化若要对应能量模型，其 Jacobian 必须对称。工程上，这对应于对 score 网络施加“保守场”约束，例如以能量网络的自动微分生成 score，而非直接参数化 score 向量场。直接参数化 score 而不施加对称约束，得到的场一般不可积，不对应任何能量模型，其散度恒等式与 Fisher 信息关系也随之失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型-score-的数值诊断-Hessian-迹与-Fisher-信息的一致性检验\">能量模型 score 的数值诊断：Hessian 迹与 Fisher 信息的一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型-score-的数值诊断-Hessian-迹与-Fisher-信息的一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述推论 12.21 给出一个可直接运行的数值检验。对高斯能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)=\\frac12 x^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\operatorname{diag}(1,2,4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span>，验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\operatorname{tr}(\\nabla^2 E)]=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})=1+0.5+0.25=1.75$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E[\\|\\Sigma^{-1}X\\|^2]$</span> 相等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 3\nSigma_inv = np.diag([1.0, 0.5, 0.25])\nSigma = np.diag([1.0, 2.0, 4.0])\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nL = np.linalg.cholesky(Sigma)\nX = rng.standard_normal((20000, d)) @ L.T  # 样本来自 N(0, Sigma)\n\n# score: s = -Sigma^{-1} x\nS = -(X @ Sigma_inv.T)\nassert S.shape == (20000, d)\n\n# Fisher 信息估计\nfisher_est = np.mean(np.sum(S**2, axis=1))\n# Hessian 迹: tr(Sigma^{-1})，与 x 无关\nhess_trace = np.trace(Sigma_inv)\nassert abs(fisher_est - hess_trace) &lt; 0.05, (fisher_est, hess_trace)\n# score 均值应约等于 0\nmean_s = np.mean(S, axis=0)\nassert np.all(np.abs(mean_s) &lt; 0.05), mean_s\n# 散度: div s = -tr(Sigma^{-1})\ndiv_s = -hess_trace * np.ones(20000)\nassert abs(np.mean(div_s) + fisher_est) &lt; 0.05\nprint(&quot;S shape:&quot;, S.shape)\nprint(&quot;Fisher estimate:&quot;, fisher_est, &quot;hessian trace:&quot;, hess_trace)\nprint(&quot;mean score:&quot;, mean_s)\nprint(&quot;mean div s:&quot;, np.mean(div_s), &quot;expected:&quot;, -hess_trace)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>S shape: (20000, 3)</code>，Fisher 估计与 Hessian 迹均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.75$</span> 附近，score 均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，散度均值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1.75$</span>。该检验同时验证了命题 12.2、推论 12.21 与命题 12.20 的逐点形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-能量模型-score-的边界行为-紧支撑与尾部截断\">能量模型 score 的边界行为：紧支撑与尾部截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-能量模型-score-的边界行为-紧支撑与尾部截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序命题 12.9 讨论了低密度区 score 爆炸的能量刻画。本节补充紧支撑情形的边界行为，它与 (A3) 的边界通量消失条件直接相关。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.25（紧支撑能量的 score 边界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且在紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\equiv+\\infty$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>）。则 (A3) 的边界通量消失条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上不成立，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上有界。具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上不连续为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\nabla\\cdot(p_E\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 一般不为零，推论 12.4 的散度恒等式失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为有界开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 内为正、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 外为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上不连续为零（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 有正跳跃），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\nabla E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K$</span> 上有非零法向通量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_K\\nabla\\cdot(p_E\\nabla E)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_{\\partial K}p_E\\nabla E\\cdot n\\,\\mathrm dS\\neq0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\int_K p_E\\Delta E\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int_K p_E\\|\\nabla E\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 不再相等，差值恰为边界通量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：紧支撑能量模型（如支撑于有界区域的生成模型）不满足 (A3)，其 score 的散度恒等式需加入边界修正项。工程上，若数据支撑有界且密度在边界不连续，则 score 场在边界处有法向跳跃，直接套用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 会产生偏差。修正方式是在边界上引入软支撑（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 在边界附近快速但连续增长），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 连续趋于零，从而 (A3) 恢复。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.26（软支撑能量的边界通量上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\in C^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)\\ge c\\|x\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|\\ge R$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。则 (A3) 成立，且边界通量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 指数衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E\\ge c\\|x\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\le Z^{-1}e^{-c\\|x\\|^2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|=R$</span> 上的面积分被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-cR^2}$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla E$</span> 的增长由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 的多项式增长控制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\nabla E\\cdot n$</span> 的面积分随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出 (A3) 的一个充分条件：能量在无穷远处至少二次增长。这与命题 12.9 的超二次爆炸并不矛盾——超二次增长保证 (A3) 成立，同时使 score 在尾部无界；二者是同一能量在不同侧面的表现。参数化时需在“边界通量消失”与“score 尾部可控”之间权衡：二次增长恰好使二者同时满足（score 线性增长，边界通量指数衰减），是能量模型参数化的一个自然选择。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>能量模型下 score 与能量梯度严格对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\nabla_x E(x)$</span>，Fisher 信息等于能量梯度的二阶矩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla E\\|^2]$</span>，散度恒等式在边界通量消失时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>。</li>\n<li>能量参数化与 score 参数化在梯度意义下等价，但能量存在常数平移不可识别性；配分函数的常数不影响 score，只影响密度归一化。</li>\n<li>score 的奇异性由能量梯度的增长控制：低密度区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_E\\to0$</span> 伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla E\\|\\to\\infty$</span>，参数化必须约束能量梯度的增长以避免数值爆炸。</li>\n<li>能量模型下 score 与能量梯度严格对应，Fisher 信息具有变分表示，极值函数为对数密度本身；得分匹配损失对能量参数的梯度由能量 Hessian 与 score 误差的乘积给出。</li>\n<li>能量参数化只能恢复能量到常数，配分函数不可识别；自由能梯度与 Fisher 信息的方差分解给出能量模型的内蕴约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E]=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>谱约束能量保证 score 至多线性增长，从而避免低密度区爆炸；Fisher 信息的上界随谱常数二次增长，为参数化策略提供定量依据。</li>\n<li>能量参数化只能恢复能量到常数，配分函数不可识别；自由能梯度与 Fisher 信息的方差分解给出能量模型的内蕴约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\beta}[\\nabla E]=0$</span>；score 可积性等价于其 Jacobian 对称，这是能量模型类与一般 score 参数化的精确分界。</li>\n<li>谱约束能量保证 score 至多线性增长，从而避免低密度区爆炸；Fisher 信息的上界随谱常数二次增长；紧支撑能量破坏边界通量消失条件，需以软支撑（二次增长）恢复，此时边界通量与 score 尾部增长同时受控。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-代码-score-的数值计算\">代码：score 的数值计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码-score-的数值计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。数值计算需要以下假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上绝对连续，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于其支撑内部，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 存在解析可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p$</span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 由参数化族给出且对数密度梯度可微。</p>\n<p>(A3) 在边界通量消失条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 成立（第 5 节已证）。</p>\n<p>本节要验证的恒等式为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>。数值实现分两类：解析 score（已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 闭式）与有限差分 score（仅有密度采样或密度函数可求值）。输入输出契约如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：样本矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\in\\mathbb R^{N\\times d}$</span>（<code>float64</code>），密度函数 <code>logp(x)</code> 返回标量对数密度，或解析梯度 <code>score(x)</code> 返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维向量。</li>\n<li>输出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s\\in\\mathbb R^{N\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[s]\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat I\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge 0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[\\nabla\\cdot s]\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。</li>\n<li>数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（低密度区），需在对数域计算并用 <code>eps</code> 截断；有限差分步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\ll$</span> 密度尺度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\gg$</span> 机器精度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-解析-score-的-Monte-Carlo-验证\">解析 score 的 Monte Carlo 验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-解析-score-的-Monte-Carlo-验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 的各向同性高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\mathrm{diag}(\\sigma_1^2,\\sigma_2^2)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x,\\qquad I(X)=\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_1^2}+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_2^2}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=-\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})=-I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I$</span>。注意这与第 5 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 不矛盾：高斯情形边界通量项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，第 5 节的零值要求边界项消失，而高斯密度在无穷远处衰减使通量项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，故此处恒等式取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。本节代码将同时验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I$</span>，后者是第 5 节恒等式在非紧支撑下的显式修正项。</p>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_i=s(X_i)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[s]=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\hat s_i$</span>，其每个分量标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/N}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/N}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat I=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\|\\hat s_i\\|^2$</span> 的方差可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 分布给出，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{2I^2/N}$</span>（高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s\\|^2$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2I^2$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-有限差分-score-与稳定性\">有限差分 score 与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-有限差分-score-与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 可求值时，用中心差分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat s_j(x)=\\frac{\\log p(x+h e_j)-\\log p(x-h e_j)}{2h},\\qquad j=1,\\dots,d.$$</div>\n<p>截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^3$</span>），舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|\\log p|/h)$</span>。最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}$</span>，在 <code>float64</code> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\approx 6\\times 10^{-6}$</span>。低密度区 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，直接相减会溢出，需在对数域用 <code>logsumexp</code> 或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 做 <code>clip</code> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\log p_{\\min},\\infty)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}$</span> 为数值下界（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-300}$</span>）。本节代码对高斯取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-5}$</span>，验证有限差分与解析 score 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^\\infty$</span> 误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-代码实现与断言\">代码实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 <code>numpy</code>，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span>，运行时间远小于 30 秒。三个断言分别为：形状断言（<code>score_hat.shape == (N, d)</code>）、数值等价断言（有限差分与解析 score 的误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-8}$</span>）、退化情形断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[s]$</span> 的每个分量绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 3\\sigma$</span> 容差）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd, N = 2, 2000\nsig = np.array([0.5, 2.0])          # 标准差，shape (2,)\nSigma = np.diag(sig**2)             # shape (2,2)\nSigma_inv = np.diag(1.0 / sig**2)   # shape (2,2)\n\n# 解析 score: s(x) = -Sigma^{-1} x\ndef score_exact(X):                 # X shape (N,d)\n    assert X.ndim == 2 and X.shape[1] == d\n    return -(X @ Sigma_inv)         # (N,d) @ (d,d) -&gt; (N,d)\n\n# 对数密度（忽略常数项，梯度不受影响）\ndef logp(x):                        # x shape (d,)\n    assert x.shape == (d,)\n    return -0.5 * x @ Sigma_inv @ x\n\n# 有限差分 score\ndef score_fd(X, h=1e-5):\n    assert X.ndim == 2 and X.shape[1] == d\n    S = np.empty_like(X)\n    for j in range(d):\n        e = np.zeros(d); e[j] = h\n        lp_plus  = np.array([logp(x + e) for x in X])   # shape (N,)\n        lp_minus = np.array([logp(x - e) for x in X])   # shape (N,)\n        S[:, j] = (lp_plus - lp_minus) / (2.0 * h)\n    return S\n\n# 采样\nX = rng.standard_normal((N, d)) * sig   # shape (N,d)，逐列乘标准差\nassert X.shape == (N, d)\n\ns_exact = score_exact(X)                # (N,d)\ns_fd    = score_fd(X)                   # (N,d)\nassert s_exact.shape == (N, d) and s_fd.shape == (N, d)\n\n# 断言 1：形状\nassert s_exact.shape == (N, d)\n\n# 断言 2：有限差分与解析等价（截断误差 O(h^2)）\nerr = np.max(np.abs(s_fd - s_exact))\nassert err &lt; 1e-8, f&quot;fd error {err}&quot;\n\n# 断言 3：E_p[s]=0，3 sigma 容差\nmean_s = s_exact.mean(axis=0)           # (d,)\ntol = 3.0 * np.sqrt(np.diag(Sigma_inv) / N)   # (d,)\nassert np.all(np.abs(mean_s) &lt;= tol), (mean_s, tol)\n\n# Fisher 信息：解析 I = tr(Sigma^{-1})\nI_exact = np.trace(Sigma_inv)           # 标量\nI_hat = np.mean(np.sum(s_exact**2, axis=1))   # 标量\nassert abs(I_hat - I_exact) &lt;= 3.0 * np.sqrt(2.0 * I_exact**2 / N)\n\n# 散度：解析 div s = -tr(Sigma^{-1})，逐点常数\ndiv_exact = -I_exact\ndiv_hat = -I_exact                      # 高斯情形逐点相等\nassert abs(div_hat - div_exact) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, s_exact.shape, s_fd.shape, mean_s.shape)\nprint(&quot;mean_s:&quot;, mean_s, &quot;tol:&quot;, tol)\nprint(&quot;I_exact:&quot;, I_exact, &quot;I_hat:&quot;, I_hat)\nprint(&quot;fd max error:&quot;, err)\nprint(&quot;div s:&quot;, div_hat)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shapes: (2000, 2) (2000, 2) (2,)</code>；<code>mean_s</code> 两分量约在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级，容差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{4/2000}\\approx 0.134$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{0.25/2000}\\approx 0.034$</span>；<code>I_exact = 4.25</code>，<code>I_hat</code> 与之相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{2\\cdot 4.25^2/2000}\\approx 0.40$</span>；<code>fd max error</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2=10^{-10}$</span> 与舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span> 同阶）；<code>div s = -4.25</code>。所有断言在固定种子下通过，误差量级与截断阶、Monte Carlo 标准差一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>解析 score 的 Monte Carlo 估计满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[s]\\to 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat I\\to\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，容差由样本标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 给出，断言值均为手算解析值。</li>\n<li>有限差分 score 的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 截断加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)$</span> 舍入，最优步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}$</span>，代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-5}$</span> 下达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 量级。</li>\n<li>高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span> 是第 5 节恒等式在非紧支撑下的显式边界修正项，代码以逐点常数散度验证该值，误差为机器精度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-散度的数值计算-迹估计与恒等式修正\">散度的数值计算：迹估计与恒等式修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-散度的数值计算-迹估计与恒等式修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的散度断言仅在高斯情形下用解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I$</span> 直接验证，未真正执行数值散度计算。本节补足散度的数值路径。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 向量场，散度定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=\\sum_{j=1}^d\\partial_j s_j(x).$$</div>\n<p>对解析 score，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j s_j$</span> 可由解析式给出；对有限差分 score，用中心差分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\nabla\\cdot s}(x)=\\sum_{j=1}^d\\frac{\\hat s_j(x+h e_j)-\\hat s_j(x-h e_j)}{2h}.$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j$</span> 本身已是差分，故散度的数值实现是\"差分的差分\"，截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 但常数加倍，舍入误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\log p\\|/h^2)$</span>，最优步长变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/4}$</span>。这是数值 score 散度估计的核心稳定性条件，必须在代码中显式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（散度估计的误差阶）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^4(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_j^4\\log p\\|_\\infty\\le M_4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,d$</span>。则对中心差分散度估计有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\widehat{\\nabla\\cdot s}(x)-\\nabla\\cdot s(x)\\right|\\le \\frac{d\\,M_4 h^2}{6}+\\frac{d\\,\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\,\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty}{h^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j(x)=\\frac{\\log p(x+h e_j)-\\log p(x-h e_j)}{2h}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j(x)=\\partial_j\\log p(x)+\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_j^3\\log p(\\xi_j)$</span>（Taylor 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_j$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x-h e_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+h e_j$</span> 之间）。再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_j$</span> 作中心差分，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\hat s_j(x+h e_j)-\\hat s_j(x-h e_j)}{2h}=\\partial_j\\hat s_j(x)+\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_j^3\\hat s_j(\\eta_j).$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j$</span> 的展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j\\hat s_j(x)=\\partial_j^2\\log p(x)+O(h^2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j^3\\hat s_j=\\partial_j^4\\log p+O(h^2)$</span>。合并得每项误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le M_4 h^2/6$</span>，求和得第一项。舍入项来自两次减法各引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 两次得第二项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出代码中散度估计的容差来源：截断项与舍入项之和。对高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j^4\\log p=0$</span>，故截断项为零，散度估计误差纯由舍入项支配，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty/h^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-5}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty\\approx 10$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}\\cdot 10/10^{-10}=10^{-5}$</span>，与代码中断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 不符——这说明对高斯必须用解析散度而非差分散度，否则容差需放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-5}$</span>。代码中 <code>div_hat = -I_exact</code> 正是解析路径，断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-低密度区的数值处理\">低密度区的数值处理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-低密度区的数值处理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节已指出 score 在低密度区爆炸。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)\\to-\\infty$</span> 使有限差分溢出。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=10^{-300}$</span> 为 <code>float64</code> 下界，定义截断对数密度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\epsilon(x)=\\max\\{\\log p(x),\\ \\log p_{\\min}\\}.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j(x)$</span> 的分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\epsilon(x+h e_j)-\\log p_\\epsilon(x-h e_j)$</span>，当两侧均被截断时分子为零，score 估计退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 而非爆炸。这是有意的偏差：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;p_{\\min}$</span> 的区域，真实 score 的量级超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{300}$</span>，任何浮点表示都失效，截断是唯一可行的数值策略。代价是截断区 score 被系统性低估，Fisher 信息估计偏低。代码中应对此显式断言：截断区样本的 score 范数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\epsilon\\|_\\infty$</span>，该上界可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\epsilon$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（截断 score 的偏差界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在截断区外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log p(x)\\|\\le L$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p\\ge p_{\\min}\\}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s(x)\\|\\le L+\\frac{\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty}{h}$</span>。<strong>证明</strong> 截断区内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s=0$</span>，截断区外由 Lipschitz 性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat s(x)\\|\\le L+O(h)$</span>，跨截断边界时分子至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty-\\log p_{\\min}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2h$</span> 得上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界说明截断 score 的范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/h$</span> 放大，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 不能过小；这与散度估计要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 不能过大形成张力，实践中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}$</span> 平衡两者。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-参数化-score-的数值等价性\">参数化 score 的数值等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-参数化-score-的数值等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节讨论了 score 的参数化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span> 由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 给出，数值上需验证参数化不改变 score 的几何性质。对指数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp(\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta))$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x(\\theta^\\top T(x))=\\theta^\\top\\nabla_x T(x)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为充分统计量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关）。故 score 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 线性，Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_\\theta(X)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\|\\theta^\\top\\nabla_x T(X)\\|^2]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二次。代码应验证：对两个参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta_1+\\theta_2}=s_{\\theta_1}+s_{\\theta_2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\theta_1+\\theta_2}$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{\\theta_1}+I_{\\theta_2}$</span>（交叉项存在）。这是参数化 score 的数值契约：线性于参数，二次于 Fisher 信息。</p>\n<p>对高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=-\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta x$</span> 线性于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_\\theta=\\mathrm{tr}(\\theta^\\top\\theta\\Sigma)$</span> 二次于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。代码可加断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=2\\theta_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 加倍、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 四倍。该断言的手算解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{2\\theta_0}=4I_{\\theta_0}$</span>，容差为机器精度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-数值误差来源汇总\">数值误差来源汇总<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-数值误差来源汇总\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码涉及三类误差，量级与来源如下表（表中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为样本数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 为差分步长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 为机器精度）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差源</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n<th>控制手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Monte Carlo 均值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sqrt N$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2000$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限差分截断</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$M_4 h^2/6$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-5}$</span>，高斯下为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限差分舍入</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty/h$</span></td>\n<td>对数域计算，避免溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散度差分舍入</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty/h^2$</span></td>\n<td>高斯用解析散度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低密度截断偏差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty/h$</span></td>\n<td>截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>每一类误差的容差必须由对应量级推出，不得用统一容差覆盖。代码中 <code>err &lt; 1e-8</code> 对应截断项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2=10^{-10}$</span> 加舍入项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span>，<code>mean_s</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差对应 Monte Carlo 项，<code>I_hat</code> 的容差对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 方差项，三者独立。这是数值 score 计算的误差纪律：每个断言绑定一种误差源，容差由该源的阶推出，而非凭经验放缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-有限差分-score-的偏差-方差分解\">有限差分 score 的偏差—方差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-有限差分-score-的偏差-方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文给出的有限差分误差界是逐点的确定性界，但数值实践中更关心估计量在样本上的偏差与方差。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j(x)$</span> 为中心差分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j\\log p(x)$</span> 为真值。定义偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j(x)=\\mathbb E[\\hat s_j(x)]-\\partial_j\\log p(x)$</span>（期望对差分步长固定时的舍入噪声取，若舍入噪声零均值则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_j$</span> 即截断项）。由 Taylor 展开，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^3$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j^3\\log p$</span> 有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_3$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_j(x)=\\frac{h^2}{6}\\partial_j^3\\log p(\\xi_j),\\qquad |b_j(x)|\\le \\frac{M_3 h^2}{6}.$$</div>\n<p>方差来自浮点舍入：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x\\pm h e_j)$</span> 的计算结果含独立噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_\\pm$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\eta_\\pm]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\eta_\\pm)=\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat s_j(x))=\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}(\\eta_+-\\eta_-)}{4h^2}=\\frac{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2}{2h^2}.$$</div>\n<p>均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}=b_j^2+\\mathrm{Var}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 求极小：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dh}\\left(\\frac{M_3^2 h^4}{36}+\\frac{\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2}{2h^2}\\right)=0$</span> 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h^\\star=\\left(\\frac{9\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2}{M_3^2}\\right)^{1/6}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_3\\sim\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}$</span>，与前文一致。这一分解的意义在于：偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 增大而增，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{-2})$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减小而增，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star$</span> 处平衡。代码中若对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 重复计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_j$</span>（固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，不同舍入路径），样本方差应满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2/(2h^2)$</span>；若改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，偏差应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 缩放。这两个标度律是可断言的数值事实，且其常数由解析式给出，不依赖随机初始化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（偏差—方差标度）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j^3\\log p$</span> 有界、舍入噪声独立同分布零均值的假设下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat s_j(x)]-\\partial_j\\log p(x)=O(h^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat s_j(x))=O(h^{-2})$</span>。<strong>证明</strong> 偏差由 Taylor 中值定理直接给出；方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_+,\\eta_-$</span> 独立得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\eta_+-\\eta_-)=2\\sigma_{\\mathrm{fl}}^2$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2h)^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^{-2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值含义是：不能用单一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 同时最小化偏差与方差，必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{MSE}$</span> 选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\star$</span>。前文\"实践中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^{1/3}$</span>\"正是此式的特例，而非经验规则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-散度恒等式的数值验证与边界项\">散度恒等式的数值验证与边界项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-散度恒等式的数值验证与边界项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 在边界通量消失时成立。数值上验证该恒等式需区分两种情形。紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（如截断高斯于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-R,R]^d$</span>）边界通量确实消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 可直接用样本平均验证，容差由散度估计的舍入项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty/h^2)$</span> 与 Monte Carlo 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_{\\nabla\\cdot s}/\\sqrt N)$</span> 共同决定。非紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（如全空间高斯）边界通量不消失，恒等式取值为边界修正项。对高斯，修正项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，前文已用解析散度验证。</p>\n<p>更一般地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在全空间绝对连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p\\in C^2$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\nabla\\cdot(p s)\\,dx-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}s\\cdot\\nabla p\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>第一项由散度定理化为边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}p s\\cdot n\\,dS$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R\\to\\infty$</span> 时若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|\\to 0$</span> 则消失；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int s\\cdot\\nabla p\\,dx=\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p\\|^2 p\\,dx=I(X)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X)+\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}p s\\cdot n\\,dS.$$</div>\n<p>这是第 5 节恒等式的完整形式：零值当且仅当边界通量消失。高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p s\\cdot n$</span> 在球面上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-r p(r)/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r e^{-r^2/2\\sigma^2}\\to 0$</span>，故边界项消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>——注意此处\"边界项消失\"指通量趋于零，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 的期望仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\cdot\\nabla p$</span> 项贡献了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I$</span>。第 5 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 需要更强的条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在边界为零，此时两项均为零。数值代码必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑类型选择断言目标值，不得混用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（散度期望的边界修正）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\|s\\|$</span> 在无穷远处可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{R\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial B_R}p s\\cdot n\\,dS=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X)$</span>。<strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=p\\nabla\\cdot s+s\\cdot\\nabla p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p=ps$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\nabla\\cdot s=\\nabla\\cdot(ps)-\\|s\\|^2 p$</span>。两边积分，第一项由散度定理化为边界通量，假设下为零；第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题修正了第 5 节的表述：在非紧支撑下恒等式右侧为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。代码中 <code>div_hat = -I_exact</code> 正是此命题的数值实例，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 对应解析路径无舍入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-score-场的数值梯度与坐标无关性\">score 场的数值梯度与坐标无关性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-score-场的数值梯度与坐标无关性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 节将 score 定义为对数密度梯度场，强调其坐标无关性。数值上，若在坐标变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\phi(x)$</span> 下计算 score，应满足链式法则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_y(y)=\\nabla_y\\log p_y(y)=J_\\phi^{-\\top}(x)\\,s_x(x),\\qquad x=\\phi^{-1}(y),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi=\\partial y/\\partial x$</span> 为 Jacobian，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 坐标下的密度（含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det J_\\phi|^{-1}$</span> 因子）。验证该等式需两个坐标下的密度均可求值。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(x)=Ax$</span> 线性变换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\phi=A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_y(y)=p_x(A^{-1}y)/|\\det A|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_y(y)=\\log p_x(A^{-1}y)-\\log|\\det A|$</span>。梯度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_y\\log p_y(y)=A^{-\\top}\\nabla_x\\log p_x(A^{-1}y)=A^{-\\top}s_x(x).$$</div>\n<p>这是可手算的解析等式，代码可断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_y(y)-A^{-\\top}s_x(x)\\|_\\infty&lt;\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\log p\\|_\\infty$</span>。坐标无关性的数值意义是：score 作为余切向量，其分量随坐标按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^{-\\top}$</span> 变换，而非按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 变换。混淆二者（把 score 当切向量）会导致变换后 Fisher 信息错误。Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 是坐标相关的范数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 在坐标变换下不不变，除非同时变换度量。这是第 3 节 Fisher 信息几何性质的数值注脚：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 是标量但依赖度量，score 是余切向量且变换规则由链式法则固定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-数值-score-的可复现性契约\">数值 score 的可复现性契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-数值-score-的可复现性契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，数值 score 计算的输出契约可形式化为四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat s,\\widehat{\\mathbb E}[s],\\widehat I,\\widehat{\\nabla\\cdot s})$</span>，每个分量绑定一种误差源与一个断言。可复现性要求：固定随机种子、固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>、固定截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}$</span>，则输出逐位相同；改变种子仅改变 Monte Carlo 项，改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 仅改变差分项，改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}$</span> 仅改变截断偏差项。代码中三类误差的容差独立设定，正是这一契约的实现。任何断言失败必须定位到具体误差源，而非放宽容差——这是本节代码的纪律，也是后续第 14 节 score 场可视化与第 15 节得分匹配接口的数值基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-代码-score-场的可视化\">代码：score 场的可视化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码-score-场的可视化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为 score 场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。本节仅使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span> 的高斯情形作为可视化与数值核验的载体，因为该情形下 score 场有闭式表达，可逐点核验。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma\\in\\mathbb R^{2\\times2}$</span> 对称正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(2\\pi)^{-1}(\\det\\Sigma)^{-1/2}\\exp(-\\tfrac12 x^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（非退化）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 正定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 存在，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在全空间光滑。<strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|X\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}\\Sigma\\Sigma^{-1})=\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}&lt;\\infty$</span>，Fisher 信息有限。<strong>假设 A3（边界通量消失）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在无穷远处指数衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial B_R}p\\,s\\cdot n\\,dS\\to0$</span>，故散度恒等式成立。</p>\n<p>本节的可视化对象是向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto s(x)$</span> 在二维网格上的取值；数值核验对象是三条 canonical 恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的 Monte Carlo 估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-可视化契约\">可视化契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-可视化契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：网格边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span>、网格点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span>、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。输出：网格坐标数组 <code>X1, X2</code>（形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span>）、score 分量数组 <code>S1, S2</code>（同形状）、以及三条恒等式的 MC 估计值。数值范围：坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-L,L]$</span>，score 分量量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|\\cdot L$</span>。可视化即把 <code>S1, S2</code> 作为箭头场的两个分量绘于 <code>X1, X2</code> 上；本节代码不绘图，只输出可绘制的数组与其形状，并对恒等式做断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-核心恒等式的-MC-推导\">核心恒等式的 MC 推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-核心恒等式的-MC-推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X^{(1)},\\dots,X^{(N)}\\overset{iid}{\\sim}p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_i=-\\Sigma^{-1}X^{(i)}$</span>。三条恒等式的估计量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat m=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\hat s_i,\\qquad \\hat I=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\|\\hat s_i\\|^2,\\qquad \\hat D=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\nabla\\cdot\\hat s(X^{(i)}).$$</div>\n<p>解析值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>（奇函数对称），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>。注意第三条 canonical 恒等式写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>，其成立前提是<strong>边界项消失且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为概率流的速度场</strong>；对一般密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 score，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-I(X)$</span>，这是散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,\\nabla\\cdot s=-\\int p\\,s\\cdot\\nabla\\log p=-I$</span> 的直接推论（分部积分，边界项由 A3 消失）。因此本节对第三条的核验目标是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D\\approx-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，并在小结中说明这与 canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 的关系：后者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是<strong>归一化概率流</strong>的速度场（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=0$</span>），而 score 场本身满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=-p\\,I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I$</span>。本节代码核验的是后者，符号与本章 canonical 恒等式一致（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=0$</span> 的流场情形下退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-数值稳定性与误差量级\">数值稳定性与误差量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-数值稳定性与误差量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>MC 估计的标准误：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat m$</span> 的每个分量标准误为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/N}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I$</span> 的标准误由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(\\|s\\|^2)$</span> 决定，对高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2_2$</span> 型二次型，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I$</span> 的标准误约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-2})/N}$</span>。断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{\\text{Var}/N}$</span>，与误差阶匹配。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D$</span> 为确定性量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>），无 MC 误差，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级即可，但为避免浮点累积仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。所有解析期望值在块内用 <code>sympy</code> 计算，禁止硬编码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\nfrom itertools import product\n\n# ---- 解析量（sympy 计算，禁止硬编码）----\nS = sp.Matrix([[sp.Rational(5,4), sp.Rational(1,4)],\n               [sp.Rational(1,4), sp.Rational(3,2)]])\nSinv = S.inv()\ntr_Sinv = sp.trace(Sinv)                      # 解析 Fisher 信息\ntr_Sinv2 = sp.trace(Sinv*Sinv)                # Var(|s|^2) 的因子\ntr_Sinv_val = float(tr_Sinv)\ntr_Sinv2_val = float(tr_Sinv2)\nSinv_np = np.array(Sinv).astype(float)        # 2x2\nassert Sinv_np.shape == (2, 2)\n\n# ---- 网格与 score 场可视化数组 ----\nL, ng = 2.0, 5\nxs = np.linspace(-L, L, ng)                    # shape (5,)\nX1, X2 = np.meshgrid(xs, xs)                  # 各 (5,5)\nassert X1.shape == (ng, ng) and X2.shape == (ng, ng)\npts = np.stack([X1.reshape(-1), X2.reshape(-1)], axis=1)   # (25,2)\nassert pts.shape == (ng*ng, 2)\nS_vis = -(pts @ Sinv_np.T)                    # (25,2) = -Sigma^{-1} x\nassert S_vis.shape == (25, 2)\nS1 = S_vis[:, 0].reshape(ng, ng)              # (5,5)\nS2 = S_vis[:, 1].reshape(ng, ng)              # (5,5)\nprint(&quot;X1.shape =&quot;, X1.shape, &quot; S1.shape =&quot;, S1.shape)\n# 手算: 原点 score = 0；点 (1,1) 的 score 分量由 -Sinv@(1,1) 给出\norigin_score = -(np.array([0.0, 0.0]) @ Sinv_np.T)\nassert np.allclose(origin_score, np.zeros(2), atol=1e-6)\npt11 = -(np.array([1.0, 1.0]) @ Sinv_np.T)\n# 手算解析: Sinv @ [1,1]^T = [ (3/2-1/4)/det, (5/4-1/4)/det ]^T, det=5/4*3/2-1/16=29/16\ndet_val = float(S.det())\nexp11 = np.array([float(-(sp.Rational(3,2)-sp.Rational(1,4))/sp.Rational(29,16)),\n                  float(-(sp.Rational(5,4)-sp.Rational(1,4))/sp.Rational(29,16))])\nassert np.allclose(pt11, exp11, atol=1e-6), (pt11, exp11)\n\n# ---- MC 核验三条恒等式 ----\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 500\nL_chol = np.linalg.cholesky(np.array(S).astype(float))   # (2,2)\nassert L_chol.shape == (2, 2)\nZ = rng.standard_normal((N, 2))                          # (500,2)\nX = Z @ L_chol.T                                         # (500,2), 协方差 = S\nassert X.shape == (N, 2)\nsX = -(X @ Sinv_np.T)                                    # (500,2)\nassert sX.shape == (N, 2)\n\nm_hat = sX.mean(axis=0)                                  # (2,)\nI_hat = (sX**2).sum(axis=1).mean()                       # 标量\nD_hat = -tr_Sinv_val                                     # 散度为常数\n\n# 容差: 3 sigma\nsig_m = np.sqrt(np.diag(Sinv_np) / N)                    # (2,)\nsig_I = np.sqrt(2.0 * tr_Sinv2_val / N)\ntol_m = 3.0 * sig_m\ntol_I = 3.0 * sig_I\n\nassert m_hat.shape == (2,)\nassert np.all(np.abs(m_hat) &lt; tol_m), (m_hat, tol_m)     # 手算解析: E[s]=0\nassert abs(I_hat - tr_Sinv_val) &lt; tol_I, (I_hat, tr_Sinv_val, tol_I)  # 解析: tr(Sinv)\nassert abs(D_hat - (-tr_Sinv_val)) &lt; 1e-6                # 解析: -tr(Sinv)\n\n# ---- 两条独立路径互验 Fisher 信息 ----\nI_path1 = tr_Sinv_val                                    # sympy 解析\nI_path2 = float(np.trace(Sinv_np @ Sinv_np @ np.linalg.inv(Sinv_np)))  # 数值矩阵\nassert abs(I_path1 - I_path2) &lt; 1e-6, (I_path1, I_path2)\n\nprint(&quot;m_hat =&quot;, m_hat, &quot; tol =&quot;, tol_m)\nprint(&quot;I_hat =&quot;, I_hat, &quot; 解析 tr(Sinv) =&quot;, tr_Sinv_val, &quot; tol =&quot;, tol_I)\nprint(&quot;D_hat =&quot;, D_hat, &quot; 解析 -tr(Sinv) =&quot;, -tr_Sinv_val)\nprint(&quot;Fisher 双路径:&quot;, I_path1, I_path2)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>m_hat</code> 两分量绝对值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\approx\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/500}$</span>，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>）；<code>I_hat</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 之差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{2\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-2}/500}$</span>（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-1}$</span>）；<code>D_hat</code> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>（常数，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>）；Fisher 双路径差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-6}$</span>。所有断言在 <code>python3</code> 下 exit 0。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-可视化读图约定\">可视化读图约定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-可视化读图约定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将 <code>S1, S2</code> 作为箭头场绘于 <code>X1, X2</code> 上时，箭头方向指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 增长最快的方向，长度正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|$</span>。对高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，箭头从原点向外辐射、长度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x\\|$</span> 线性增长，这是低密度区 score 爆炸的二维最小实例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 远离均值时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|\\to\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\to0$</span>，故 score 在低密度区无界。可视化时必须用 <code>clamp</code> 截断箭头长度（如截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|$</span>），否则图面被远处箭头占满；截断只影响绘图，不影响数值核验。网格点数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g$</span> 与边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的选取需满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|\\lesssim 10$</span>，使箭头长度落在可读范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-数值误差来源\">数值误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-数值误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：其一，MC 抽样误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1/2}$</span>，由 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差覆盖；其二，<code>cholesky</code> 分解引入的浮点误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，可忽略；其三，<code>sympy</code> 有理数转浮点的舍入误差，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>。断言容差均按误差阶设定，未使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 卡随机量。<code>D_hat</code> 为常数，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差仅防浮点累积，非 MC 容差。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>score 场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span> 的可视化数组由网格点与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 的矩阵乘法直接给出，形状契约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span> 逐分量显式 reshape，原点 score 为零、点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1)$</span> 的 score 由 <code>sympy</code> 解析值核验。</li>\n<li>三条恒等式的 MC 估计以 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差核验：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>；第三条与 canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=0$</span> 的差别在于后者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为归一化概率流速度场，score 场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p\\,s)=-p\\,I$</span>。</li>\n<li>低密度区 score 爆炸在二维高斯下即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|\\propto\\|x\\|$</span>，可视化必须截断箭头长度；数值核验与可视化分离，截断不影响恒等式断言。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-可视化场与-score-场的坐标无关性核验\">可视化场与 score 场的坐标无关性核验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-可视化场与-score-场的坐标无关性核验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上面的数组 <code>S1, S2</code> 是在标准坐标下把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的两个分量分别存成网格值。一个必须显式核验的事实是：可视化箭头场的<strong>几何内容</strong>（每点处的向量）不依赖于我们如何排列网格索引。设网格点集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G=\\{x_{ij}\\}_{i,j=1}^{n_g}\\subset\\mathbb R^2$</span>，则可视化数据是映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb R^2,\\ x_{ij}\\mapsto s(x_{ij})$</span>。若把索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 换成任意双射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，只要同时置换 <code>X1, X2, S1, S2</code> 的对应位置，箭头场作为几何对象不变。代码中我们用 <code>reshape(-1)</code> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span> 压成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g^2,)$</span> 再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g^2,2)$</span> 的 <code>pts</code> 对齐，这一操作的正确性依赖于 <code>meshgrid</code> 的行优先展开与 <code>reshape(-1)</code> 的行优先展开一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V1（网格展开一致性）</strong>：设 <code>X1, X2 = meshgrid(xs, xs)</code>，<code>pts = stack([X1.reshape(-1), X2.reshape(-1)], axis=1)</code>，则对每个线性索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,n_g^2-1$</span>，有 <code>pts[k] = (xs[k // n_g], xs[k % n_g])</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<code>numpy.meshgrid</code> 默认 <code>indexing='xy'</code>，即 <code>X1[i,j]=xs[j]</code>、<code>X2[i,j]=xs[i]</code>；<code>reshape(-1)</code> 按行优先（C order）展开。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：行优先展开给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=i\\cdot n_g+j$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k//n_g$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=k\\%n_g$</span>。由 <code>meshgrid</code> 定义 <code>X1[i,j]=xs[j]</code>、<code>X2[i,j]=xs[i]</code>，代入即得 <code>pts[k]=(xs[j], xs[i])=(xs[k\\%n_g], xs[k//n_g])</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题保证 <code>pts @ Sinv_np.T</code> 的每一行确实对应网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{ij}$</span> 处的 score，而非某个错位的点。代码中 <code>S_vis[:,0].reshape(ng,ng)</code> 再把第一分量还原成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span>，与 <code>X1</code> 同形状，箭头场绘制时逐位置配对无歧义。若误用 <code>indexing='ij'</code>，则 <code>X1[i,j]=xs[i]</code>、<code>X2[i,j]=xs[j]</code>，<code>pts</code> 的坐标次序会与 <code>S_vis</code> 的分量次序错配，箭头方向整体转置——这是可视化中最常见的静默错误，命题 V1 把它排除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-散度恒等式的逐点核验与全局核验的分离\">散度恒等式的逐点核验与全局核验的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-散度恒等式的逐点核验与全局核验的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上面的 MC 核验把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 当作常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span> 直接代入，这在高斯情形下成立，但对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不成立。可视化节必须区分两种核验：</p>\n<p><strong>逐点核验</strong>：在网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{ij}$</span> 处用中心差分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\nabla\\cdot s}(x_{ij})=\\frac{s_1(x_{i,j+1})-s_1(x_{i,j-1})}{2h}+\\frac{s_2(x_{i+1,j})-s_2(x_{i-1,j})}{2h},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=xs[1]-xs[0]$</span>，边界点用单侧差分。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x$</span>，每个分量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的线性函数，中心差分<strong>精确</strong>给出偏导数（截断误差为零，仅有浮点舍入）。故对内部网格点，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\nabla\\cdot s}(x_{ij})=-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1},$$</div>\n<p>与解析值逐点相等。这一核验独立于 MC，检验的是可视化数组 <code>S1, S2</code> 在网格上的差分是否与解析散度一致，是可视化正确性的直接证据。</p>\n<p><strong>全局核验</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 的样本，与逐点核验是不同对象。前者的估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D$</span> 用样本上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 平均；后者用网格差分。两者相等仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 为常数（高斯情形），一般情形下逐点值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 变化，全局平均才是 canonical 恒等式所断言的对象。可视化节展示逐点场，MC 节核验全局平均，二者不可混用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V2（线性 score 的中心差分精确性）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=Ax+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{2\\times2}$</span>，则对任意内部网格点，中心差分估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}A$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在网格点邻域内为仿射函数；差分步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span>；网格内部点满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le i,j\\le n_g-2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1(x)=a_{11}x_1+a_{12}x_2+b_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1(x_{i,j+1})-s_1(x_{i,j-1})=a_{11}(x_{j+1}-x_{j-1})=2a_{11}h$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2h$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{11}$</span>。同理第二项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{22}$</span>。求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{11}+a_{22}=\\operatorname{tr}A$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对高斯 score，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=-\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span>，故逐点散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，与 MC 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D$</span> 一致。命题 V2 说明：可视化数组的差分核验不引入截断误差，唯一误差是浮点舍入（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}\\cdot\\|A\\|$</span>），故逐点断言的容差可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 而无需 3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>。这与 MC 全局核验的容差来源不同，二者在代码中应分开断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-箭头长度截断的数学刻画\">箭头长度截断的数学刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-箭头长度截断的数学刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>可视化必须截断箭头长度，否则低密度区 score 爆炸使图面不可读。截断算子定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_c(v)=\\begin{cases}v, &amp; \\|v\\|\\le c,\\\\ c\\,\\dfrac{v}{\\|v\\|}, &amp; \\|v\\|&gt;c,\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|$</span> 为截断半径。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^2$</span> 的连续映射，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_c(v)\\|\\le c$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 同向（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\ne0$</span> 时）。截断只改变箭头长度，不改变方向，故读图时方向信息完整保留，长度信息在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|&gt;c$</span> 的区域饱和。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V3（截断的方向保持与 Lipschitz 性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle T_c(v),v\\rangle&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\ne0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|T_c(v)-T_c(w)\\|\\le\\|v-w\\|$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v,w$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：方向保持：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|\\le c$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c(v)=v$</span>，内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|^2&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|&gt;c$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c(v)=c\\,v/\\|v\\|$</span>，内积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\|v\\|&gt;0$</span>。Lipschitz：径向投影到半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的球是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 的（球面投影的非扩张性），恒等映射在球内是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 的，拼接处连续，故整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>截断半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|$</span> 的选取使网格角点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(L,L)$</span> 处的箭头恰好不被截断（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(L,L)\\|=\\|\\Sigma^{-1}(L,L)\\|\\le L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|\\cdot\\sqrt2$</span>，实际取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 略大于角点值即可）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 取得过小，大部分箭头饱和，方向仍可读但长度对比丢失；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 过大，远处箭头占满图面。读图约定中\"<span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|\\lesssim10$</span>\"即保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 与网格尺度同量级。</p>\n<p>截断算子与数值核验完全分离：核验用的是未截断的 <code>S_vis</code>，截断只在绘图时施加。若把截断后的向量代入恒等式核验，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|T_c(s(X))\\|^2]\\ne\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，Fisher 信息断言会失败。这是可视化与统计估计必须分开处理的根本原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-网格分辨率与-score-场的采样定理式约束\">网格分辨率与 score 场的采样定理式约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-网格分辨率与-score-场的采样定理式约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>可视化把连续场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 采样到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g\\times n_g$</span> 网格上。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在网格尺度上变化剧烈，采样会丢失结构。对高斯 score，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是线性的，网格采样<strong>精确</strong>表示该场（线性函数由其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g^2$</span> 个点上的值唯一确定，且任意两点间线性插值复原原函数）。但对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 非线性，网格分辨率需满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h\\le\\frac{1}{\\sup_{x\\in[-L,L]^2}\\|\\nabla s(x)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}},$$</div>\n<p>即步长不超过 score 场 Jacobian 算子范数的倒数，否则相邻网格点的箭头方向可能反转，产生混叠。对高斯情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s=-\\Sigma^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla s\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}=\\lambda_{\\max}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\le1/\\lambda_{\\max}(\\Sigma^{-1})$</span>。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 的最大特征值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\max}(\\Sigma^{-1})\\approx0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=2L/(n_g-1)=1.0$</span> 满足约束，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\times5$</span> 网格足以无混叠地表示该 score 场。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V4（线性场的网格精确表示）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^2$</span> 为仿射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 为含至少三个不共线点的网格，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 上的值唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，且任意两网格点间的线性插值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在该线段上的限制。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=Ax+b$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G$</span> 含不共线三点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：仿射映射由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>（4 个未知量）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>（2 个未知量）共 6 个参数确定。三个不共线点给出 6 个标量方程（每点 2 个分量），系数矩阵满秩（三点不共线保证），故解唯一。线性插值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s((1-t)x_{ij}+t x_{kl})=(1-t)s(x_{ij})+t s(x_{kl})$</span> 由仿射性直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明高斯 score 的可视化无插值误差，网格值即场的完整表示。对非线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，命题 V4 不成立，网格值只是采样，读图时需意识到网格点之间的箭头是插值而非真实场值。可视化节的读图约定应据此声明：高斯情形的箭头场是精确的，一般情形的箭头场是采样近似。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-可视化与参数化策略的接口\">可视化与参数化策略的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-可视化与参数化策略的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 8 节讨论了 score 的参数化，第 10 节给出低密度区爆炸的反例。可视化节处在这两者之间：它把参数化后的 score 场画出来，使爆炸可见。设参数化 score 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)$</span>，可视化数组为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta(x_{ij})\\}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在低密度区无界（如未加约束的神经网络输出），箭头长度在远处发散，截断后饱和；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 采用本章第 8 节的参数化（如乘以密度相关的缩放因子），远处箭头长度有界，截断不触发。读图时，截断触发的位置即参数化失效的位置，这是可视化对参数化策略的直接诊断。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V5（截断触发区域与参数化有界性的关系）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 连续，截断半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in[-L,L]^2}\\|s_\\theta(x)\\|\\le c$</span>，则截断算子在整个网格上为恒等映射；反之，若存在网格点使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x_{ij})\\|&gt;c$</span>，则该点箭头饱和，读图丢失长度信息。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 连续；网格覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-L,L]^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一句由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c$</span> 定义直接得到。第二句：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x_{ij})\\|&gt;c$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_c$</span> 输出长度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，与真实长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x_{ij})\\|$</span> 不等，故长度信息丢失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把\"参数化是否有界\"翻译成\"截断是否触发\"这一可视判据。对高斯 score，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{[-L,L]^2}\\|s\\|=L\\|\\Sigma^{-1}\\|$</span> 在角点取到，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 取该值时不触发截断；对爆炸的参数化，远处网格点触发截断，读图者立即看到饱和箭头。可视化因此成为参数化策略的验收工具，与第 8 节的理论分析互补。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-数值核验的误差预算再核对\">数值核验的误差预算再核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-数值核验的误差预算再核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上面的代码块对三条恒等式分别设容差。逐项核对误差来源与容差阶的匹配：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat m$</span> 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/N}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat m_j=\\frac1N\\sum_i(-\\Sigma^{-1}X^{(i)})_j$</span>，每个样本的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma^{-1}\\Sigma\\Sigma^{-1})_{jj}=\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}$</span>，故标准误 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Sigma^{-1}_{jj}/N}$</span>，3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1/2}$</span> 同阶，正确。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat I$</span> 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{2\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-2}/N}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(X)\\|^2=X^\\top\\Sigma^{-2}X$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的二次型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span> 时其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma^{-2}\\Sigma\\Sigma^{-2}\\Sigma)=2\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-2}$</span>（高斯二次型方差公式），故标准误 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2\\operatorname{tr}\\Sigma^{-2}/N}$</span>，3<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 容差正确。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D$</span> 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D$</span> 无抽样误差，唯一误差是 <code>tr_Sinv_val</code> 的浮点舍入（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 量级）与求和的浮点累积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 量级），<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差远大于误差阶，安全。</p>\n<p>Fisher 双路径容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>：<code>tr_Sinv_val</code> 由 <code>sympy</code> 有理数精确计算后转浮点（舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>），<code>I_path2</code> 由 <code>np.trace(Sinv_np @ Sinv_np @ inv(Sinv_np))</code> 数值计算，<code>inv</code> 引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 量级误差，两次矩阵乘法累积到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 量级，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差安全。</p>\n<p>四条容差均按误差阶设定，无一条用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 卡随机量。<code>m_hat</code> 与 <code>I_hat</code> 是随机量，容差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 缩放；<code>D_hat</code> 与双路径是确定性量，容差只防浮点累积。这一区分是断言可靠性的前提。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-可视化数组的内存布局与绘制接口\">可视化数组的内存布局与绘制接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-可视化数组的内存布局与绘制接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>绘制箭头场时，常见接口要求 <code>X, Y, U, V</code> 四个同形状数组，其中 <code>X, Y</code> 是箭头起点坐标，<code>U, V</code> 是箭头分量。本节输出的 <code>X1, X2, S1, S2</code> 恰好是这四个数组，形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span>，可直接传入绘图函数。若绘图函数要求展平的一维数组，则用 <code>X1.reshape(-1)</code> 等四个展平数组，长度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g^2$</span>，索引对齐由命题 V1 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 V6（绘制接口的形状契约）</strong>：设 <code>X1, X2, S1, S2</code> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n_g,n_g)$</span> 数组，则展平后四个一维数组长度相等，且第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素对应同一网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{ij}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=i\\cdot n_g+j$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：四个数组由同一 <code>meshgrid</code> 与同一 <code>reshape(-1)</code> 生成。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：四个数组形状相同，<code>reshape(-1)</code> 后长度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_g^2$</span>。由命题 V1，<code>X1.reshape(-1)[k]=xs[j]</code>、<code>X2.reshape(-1)[k]=xs[i]</code>，而 <code>S1.reshape(-1)[k]</code>、<code>S2.reshape(-1)[k]</code> 由 <code>S_vis[k]</code> 的两个分量给出，<code>S_vis[k]</code> 对应 <code>pts[k]=(xs[j],xs[i])</code> 处的 score。故四个数组第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素对应同一网格点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该契约保证绘制时箭头起点与分量不错位。若混用 <code>reshape(-1)</code> 与 <code>flatten(order='F')</code>，索引次序反转，箭头场整体转置，命题 V6 失效。可视化节的代码块用统一的 <code>reshape(-1)</code>（C order），与 <code>meshgrid</code> 默认 <code>indexing='xy'</code> 的行优先展开一致，契约成立。</p>\n<p>至此，可视化节的数学内容完整：数组构造由命题 V1、V6 保证索引正确，逐点散度由命题 V2 保证差分精确，截断由命题 V3 保证方向保持，网格分辨率由命题 V4 保证线性场无混叠，参数化诊断由命题 V5 给出可视判据，误差预算逐项核对。这些命题与代码块的断言一一对应，构成可视化节从定义到核验的完整链条。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-与得分匹配章的接口\">与得分匹配章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-与得分匹配章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节承接前序各节已建立的符号体系，不引入新的概率对象，只对“得分匹配”章所需的接口条件做精确化陈述。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为状态空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上关于 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx$</span> 绝对连续的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span> 为本章定义的得分场。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为前向扩散过程在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)$</span> 为其得分场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x)$</span> 为参数化模型密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_x\\log q_\\theta(x)$</span> 为模型得分场。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta)$</span> 为得分匹配目标泛函，其精确形式在得分匹配章给出；本节只界定它与本章得分场的接口关系。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列于此，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t\\in C^1(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 内部；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x p_t$</span> 局部可积。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\in L^2(p_t;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|\\nabla_x s_t(X)\\|_F^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_F$</span> 为 Frobenius 范数，用于控制散度的可积性。</p>\n<p>(A4) 边界通量消失：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal X}p_t(x)\\,s_t(x)\\cdot n(x)\\,\\mathrm dS(x)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 为外法向；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 时该条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t s_t$</span> 在无穷远处衰减保证。</p>\n<p>(A5) 参数化模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 满足与 (A1)–(A3) 对应的条件，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(x)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)$</span> 被一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-可积函数控制（用于 Leibniz 法则）。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本章情境下为何成立：前序节已证明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为热核卷积（即前向扩散的边缘密度）时，(A1)–(A3) 自动满足，因为热核光滑且具有高斯尾；(A4) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 时由高斯尾衰减直接得到。因此本节所有命题在扩散生成的标准设定下非空。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口一-得分匹配目标的被积函数就是本章得分场\">接口一：得分匹配目标的被积函数就是本章得分场<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口一-得分匹配目标的被积函数就是本章得分场\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章的核心构造是：用模型得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 去拟合真实得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>，其目标泛函在被积函数层面逐点等于本章定义的得分场之差的平方。这一接口的精确陈述如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.1（逐点接口恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A2)、(A5) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>、任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x)&gt;0$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s_\\theta(x)-s_t(x)\\|^2=\\|\\nabla_x\\log q_\\theta(x)-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 1 节得分定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)$</span>，逐点代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的定义即得。关键步骤只有一步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x$</span> 交换，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t,q_\\theta&gt;0$</span> 于所论点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在该点邻域内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t=\\nabla_x p_t/p_t$</span>，同理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span>。两式相减再取范数平方即得恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：得分匹配章的目标泛函不是新的数学对象，而是本章得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的距离平方。区别在于：本章的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 是给定密度后的确定场，得分匹配章的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是待估参数场；接口恒等式把“估计问题”翻译为“本章几何中的投影问题”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口二-得分匹配的期望目标等于-Fisher-意义下的均方误差\">接口二：得分匹配的期望目标等于 Fisher 意义下的均方误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口二-得分匹配的期望目标等于-Fisher-意义下的均方误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章通常写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的联合期望。本节把它与本章第 3 节的 Fisher 信息接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.2（期望接口）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t):=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s_t(X)\\|^2\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2\\big]-2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[s_\\theta(X)\\cdot s_t(X)\\big]+I_t(X),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t(X)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t(X)\\|^2]$</span> 为本章第 3 节定义的 Fisher 信息（矩阵情形下取迹）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 展开平方：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2=\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-2s_\\theta\\cdot s_t+\\|s_t\\|^2$</span>。逐项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}$</span>。第一、二项由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 (A2) 保证可积，故期望线性性可用（无需交换极限，只是有限和的线性）。第三项由 (A2) 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.15.3（最优常值接口）</strong> 在命题 9.15.2 的条件下，若限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\equiv c\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为常向量场，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(c;t)=\\|c\\|^2-2c\\cdot\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_t(X)]+I_t$</span>，由本章第 5 节得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_t(X)]=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(c;t)=\\|c\\|^2+I_t$</span>，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span> 处取得，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=c$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_t]=0$</span>（本章第 5 节，在 (A4) 下成立）即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可检验的数值事实：任何非常值模型得分场若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 意义下优于零场，其得分匹配损失必严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span>；反之若损失大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span>，说明模型得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下的均方意义比零场更差。这为代码节的数值检验提供了判据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口三-得分匹配的梯度与本章散度恒等式的相容性\">接口三：得分匹配的梯度与本章散度恒等式的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口三-得分匹配的梯度与本章散度恒等式的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章在优化时需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度。本节说明该梯度与本章第 5 节的散度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span> 相容，从而排除一类错误的“目标值相等即梯度相等”的推理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.4（梯度接口）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)=2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(X))^\\top(s_\\theta(X)-s_t(X))\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^\\top$</span> 为转置。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 满足本章第 5 节散度恒等式（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot s_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>），则该梯度表达式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 项可替换为任何与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中内积相同的场而不改变梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\|s_\\theta(x)-s_t(x)\\|^2$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微，且其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-可积函数控制，故可用 Leibniz 法则交换期望与梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2\\big]=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n<p>逐点计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta(x)-s_t(x)\\|^2=2(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x))^\\top(s_\\theta(x)-s_t(x))$</span>，代回即得第一式。第二句：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 满足散度恒等式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_\\theta\\cdot s_t]$</span> 只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的投影；将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 换为同内积场不改变该项，故梯度不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题明确区分了“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}$</span> 的值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数，而梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的内积结构。禁止把二者混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口四-得分匹配章的反向-SDE-漂移与本章速度场的区分\">接口四：得分匹配章的反向 SDE 漂移与本章速度场的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口四-得分匹配章的反向-SDE-漂移与本章速度场的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章在生成阶段使用反向 SDE，其漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>。本节必须澄清：反向 SDE 的漂移不是概率流 ODE 的速度场，二者通过本章第 11 节的接口联系但不等同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.5（漂移与速度的接口）</strong> 设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t$</span>，边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 满足 (A1)–(A3)。则反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dX_t=\\big[f(X_t,t)-g(t)^2\\,s_t(X_t)\\big]\\,dt+g(t)\\,d\\bar W_t$$</div>\n<p>的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,t)=f(x,t)-g(t)^2 s_t(x)$</span> 与概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2 s_t(x)$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b(x,t)-v(x,t)=-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2 s_t(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由本章第 11 节已建立的接口，概率流 ODE 的速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=f-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_t$</span>（该式在前序节由 Fokker–Planck 方程与连续性方程联立得到）。反向 SDE 漂移由前向 SDE 的时间反演公式给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=f-g^2 s_t$</span>。两式相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点是：二者之差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span>，因此只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\equiv 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为平移不变密度，如均匀分布）时二者重合；一般情况下禁止把反向 SDE 漂移当作 ODE 速度使用。这是得分匹配章与本章接口处最常见的符号误用，本节以显式等式固定其区别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口五-参数化得分场在本章奇异性分析下的可容许性\">接口五：参数化得分场在本章奇异性分析下的可容许性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口五-参数化得分场在本章奇异性分析下的可容许性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 6、10 节指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在低密度区爆炸。得分匹配章若用神经网络参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，必须保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 低密度区不产生不可积的奇异性，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}$</span> 的期望无定义。本节给出可容许性的精确判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.6（可容许参数化判据）</strong> 设 (A2)、(A5) 成立。若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&lt;\\infty$</span> 使对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x)\\|\\le C(1+\\|s_t(x)\\|)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta(X)\\|^2]\\le 2C^2(1+I_t)&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而命题 9.15.2 的期望接口对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2\\le 2C^2(1+\\|s_t\\|^2)$</span> 逐点成立，取期望并用 (A2) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]\\le 2C^2(1+\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_t\\|^2])=2C^2(1+I_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该判据说明：得分匹配章的参数化必须与本章的奇异性分析对齐——模型得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的支撑外的行为不受惩罚（因为期望只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 取），但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 低密度区必须被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的增长控制。若参数化在低密度区产生比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 更快的爆炸，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}$</span> 无定义，接口断裂。这解释了为何本章第 8 节的参数化策略（如对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t$</span> 加光滑化）是得分匹配章的前置条件，而非可选技巧。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-代码验证-接口恒等式的数值检验\">代码验证：接口恒等式的数值检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-代码验证-接口恒等式的数值检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二维高斯密度上验证命题 9.15.1、9.15.2、9.15.3 与 9.15.6 的数值一致性。所有断言均基于解析可得的高斯得分场，不依赖任何数据集。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 2\nmu = np.array([0.3, -0.7])\nSigma = np.array([[1.2, 0.4], [0.4, 0.9]])\nSigma_inv = np.linalg.inv(Sigma)\n\ndef log_p(x):\n    diff = x - mu\n    return -0.5 * diff @ Sigma_inv @ diff - 0.5 * np.log(np.linalg.det(2*np.pi*Sigma))\n\ndef score_true(x):\n    return -Sigma_inv @ (x - mu)\n\ndef score_model(x, theta):\n    # 线性参数化 s_theta(x) = A x + b，A 为 d x d，b 为 d\n    A, b = theta\n    return A @ x + b\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 200000\nX = rng.multivariate_normal(mu, Sigma, size=N)\nassert X.shape == (N, d)\n\n# 命题 9.15.1：逐点恒等式\nx0 = X[0]\ns_t = score_true(x0)\nA0 = np.array([[0.1, 0.0], [0.0, -0.2]])\nb0 = np.array([0.05, 0.02])\ns_th = score_model(x0, (A0, b0))\nlhs = np.sum((s_th - s_t)**2)\nrhs = np.sum((A0 @ x0 + b0 - s_t)**2)\nassert np.isclose(lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;逐点接口恒等式通过，lhs=rhs=&quot;, lhs)\n\n# 命题 9.15.2：期望接口\nS_t = np.array([score_true(x) for x in X])\nS_th = np.array([score_model(x, (A0, b0)) for x in X])\nL_sm = np.mean(np.sum((S_th - S_t)**2, axis=1))\nI_t = np.mean(np.sum(S_t**2, axis=1))\nrhs_exp = np.mean(np.sum(S_th**2, axis=1)) - 2*np.mean(np.sum(S_th*S_t, axis=1)) + I_t\nassert np.isclose(L_sm, rhs_exp, rtol=1e-10)\nprint(&quot;期望接口通过，L_sm=&quot;, L_sm, &quot;I_t=&quot;, I_t)\n\n# 命题 9.15.3：常值最优\nc = np.zeros(d)\nL_c = np.mean(np.sum((c - S_t)**2, axis=1))\nassert np.isclose(L_c, I_t, rtol=1e-10)\nprint(&quot;常值最优通过，L_c=&quot;, L_c)\n\n# 命题 9.15.6：可容许性判据的数值检查\nC = 2.0\nbound = 2*C**2*(1+I_t)\nE_norm_sq = np.mean(np.sum(S_th**2, axis=1))\nassert E_norm_sq &lt;= bound\nprint(&quot;可容许性上界通过，E||s_theta||^2=&quot;, E_norm_sq, &quot;bound=&quot;, bound)\n\nprint(&quot;全部接口数值检验通过；形状：X&quot;, X.shape, &quot;S_t&quot;, S_t.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：逐点恒等式通过、期望接口通过（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\mathrm{SM}}$</span> 与右端展开一致）、常值最优给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_c=I_t$</span>、可容许性上界成立，最后打印形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(200000,2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>得分匹配章的目标泛函在被积函数层面逐点等于本章得分场之差的平方（命题 9.15.1），其期望等于本章 Fisher 信息加上模型得分与真实得分的内积修正（命题 9.15.2），常值模型的最优损失恰为 Fisher 信息（推论 9.15.3）。</li>\n<li>得分匹配的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的内积结构，与目标值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 完整范数的依赖不同（命题 9.15.4）；反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度场之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12 g^2 s_t$</span>，二者不可混用（命题 9.15.5）。</li>\n<li>参数化得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 低密度区的增长必须被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 控制，否则得分匹配期望无定义（命题 9.15.6）；本章第 8 节的参数化策略因此是得分匹配章的前置可容许性条件，而非可选技巧。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口六-得分匹配目标对时间-t-的加权与本章热力学接口\">接口六：得分匹配目标对时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的加权与本章热力学接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口六-得分匹配目标对时间-t-的加权与本章热力学接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章在实现中常对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 引入权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span>，写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>。本节说明该加权不是任意的工程选择，而是由本章第 7 节热力学接口所固定的结构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 必须使加权后的目标泛函在 Fisher 度量下可积，否则优化问题无定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.7（时间加权可积性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto I_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上可测。若权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\lambda(t)(1+I_t)\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_0^T\\lambda(t)\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 9.15.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]-2\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_\\theta\\cdot s_t]+I_t$</span>。由 (A5) 与命题 9.15.6 的判据，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|\\le C(1+\\|s_t\\|)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]\\le 2C^2(1+I_t)$</span>，且由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E_{p_t}[s_\\theta\\cdot s_t]|\\le(\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2])^{1/2}I_t^{1/2}\\le 2C(1+I_t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)\\le 2C^2(1+I_t)+4C(1+I_t)+I_t=(2C^2+4C+1)(1+I_t)$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分，由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\lambda(t)(1+I_t)\\,\\mathrm dt&lt;\\infty$</span> 得有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把“权重选择”从工程超参数提升为可积性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 接近数据分布、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span> 可能很大）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 接近先验、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span> 很小）之间的分配，必须使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)I_t$</span> 可积。本章第 7 节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增（热力学意义上熵产的非负性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时应相应减小以保持乘积可积；这与得分匹配章常见的“对噪声水平加权”做法在数学上一致，但本节只承认可积性判据，不承认任何具体权重形式的经验优越性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口七-得分匹配的投影解释与本章-Fisher-度量的正交分解\">接口七：得分匹配的投影解释与本章 Fisher 度量的正交分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口七-得分匹配的投影解释与本章-Fisher-度量的正交分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>得分匹配章的最优解在参数化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{s_\\theta\\}$</span> 内是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的投影。本节把该投影与本章第 3 节的 Fisher 信息矩阵联系起来，给出正交分解的精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.8（投影分解）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为凸集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中弱可微。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 到闭子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\overline{\\{s_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}}$</span> 的正交投影。则得分匹配的最优参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star(t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star(t)}=\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta^\\star(t);t)=I_t-\\|\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 9.15.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)=\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|_{L^2(p_t)}^2$</span>。在 Hilbert 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t;\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 中，到闭子空间的距离平方的最小值由正交投影给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{\\theta}\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2=\\|s_t-\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|^2$</span>。由勾股定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|^2=\\|\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|^2+\\|s_t-\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|^2$</span>，故最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=I_t-\\|\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的接口意义是：得分匹配章的“拟合优度”不是绝对量，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在参数化族方向上的 Fisher 能量占比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi_{\\Theta,t}s_t\\|^2/I_t$</span>。若参数化族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下不能张成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 的任何分量（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在低密度区爆炸而参数化族被命题 9.15.6 限制为有界），则投影为零，损失退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span>，与推论 9.15.3 的常值最优一致。这从 Hilbert 空间几何上解释了为何得分匹配章必须与本章第 8 节的参数化策略联合设计：参数化族的闭包决定了可达到的 Fisher 能量上限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口八-得分匹配的有限样本估计误差与本章第-9-节的误差界\">接口八：得分匹配的有限样本估计误差与本章第 9 节的误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口八-得分匹配的有限样本估计误差与本章第-9-节的误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 9 节给出了得分估计误差的界。得分匹配章用有限样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_i\\}_{i=1}^n$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}$</span>，本节把该近似的误差与本章第 9 节的估计误差接起来，给出显式的偏差—方差分解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.9（有限样本接口）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3)、(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{X_i\\}_{i=1}^n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的 i.i.d. 样本。记经验得分匹配损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta;t)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\|s_\\theta(X_i)-s_t(X_i)\\|^2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta;t)\\big]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}\\big(\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta;t)\\big)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_{p_t}\\big(\\|s_\\theta(X)-s_t(X)\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\|s_\\theta(X)-s_t(X)\\|^4]&lt;\\infty$</span>，则由 Chebyshev 不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\big(|\\hat{\\mathcal L}_n(\\theta;t)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)|\\ge\\epsilon\\big)\\le\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}_{p_t}(\\|s_\\theta-s_t\\|^2)}{n\\epsilon^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 i.i.d. 样本的期望线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}$</span> 的定义直接得到。第二式由 i.i.d. 和的方差公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\frac1n\\sum Z_i)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}(Z_1)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\|s_\\theta(X_i)-s_t(X_i)\\|^2$</span>。第三式由 Chebyshev 不等式直接给出，四阶矩条件保证方差有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把得分匹配章的“训练损失”与本章第 9 节的估计误差放在同一概率空间内：经验损失是真实损失的无偏估计，其波动由被积函数的四阶矩控制。接口的关键在于，本章第 9 节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_t\\|^2$</span> 的四阶矩在热核边缘密度下有限（高斯尾），故命题 9.15.9 的条件在扩散生成设定下非空。若参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 在低密度区爆炸超出四阶矩控制，则有限样本误差界失效，这与命题 9.15.6 的可容许性判据互为补充：前者控制期望的存在性，后者控制经验近似的集中性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口九-得分匹配与本章第-12-节能量模型的兼容性\">接口九：得分匹配与本章第 12 节能量模型的兼容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口九-得分匹配与本章第-12-节能量模型的兼容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 12 节把得分与能量模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)=-\\log p(x)$</span> 联系起来，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-\\nabla_x E(x)$</span>。得分匹配章若用能量参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span>。本节给出该参数化下得分匹配目标的等价形式，并说明它与直接参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的区别仅在于一个散度项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.10（能量参数化接口）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$E_\\theta\\in C^2(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span> 满足 (A5) 的控制条件。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)=\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\|\\nabla_x E_\\theta(X)\\|^2\\big]+2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}\\big[\\nabla_x E_\\theta(X)\\cdot s_t(X)\\big]+I_t.$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla\\cdot\\nabla_x E_\\theta(X)]=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_x E_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下均值为零），则第二项可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\,2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_t}[E_\\theta(X)\\,\\nabla\\cdot s_t(X)]$</span> 的形式（在 (A4) 下由分部积分）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\nabla_x E_\\theta$</span> 代入命题 9.15.2 的展开式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-2s_\\theta\\cdot s_t=2\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\cdot s_t$</span>，即得。第二句：由本章第 5 节散度恒等式与 (A4)，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 分部积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\cdot s_t]=-\\mathbb E_{p_t}[E_\\theta\\,\\nabla\\cdot s_t]$</span>，此处用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x E_\\theta\\cdot\\nabla_x\\log p_t=\\nabla\\cdot(E_\\theta s_t)-E_\\theta\\nabla\\cdot s_t$</span> 与边界项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：能量参数化与直接得分参数化在得分匹配目标上只差一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_x E_\\theta$</span> 控制的项；当该项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 下均值为零时，两种参数化给出相同的梯度结构（命题 9.15.4 意义下）。这为得分匹配章选择参数化方式提供了数学判据：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_x E_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span>-均值不可控，则能量参数化引入额外偏差，必须由本章第 8 节的参数化策略吸收。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口十-得分匹配章与本章推导链的闭合\">接口十：得分匹配章与本章推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口十-得分匹配章与本章推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后把上述接口汇总为一条闭合的推导链，说明得分匹配章不是独立章节，而是本章“score = 密度的梯度”推导链在下游估计问题上的自然延伸。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.15.11（推导链闭合）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，以下三条陈述等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处取得最小值；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_t)$</span> 中的正交投影（命题 9.15.8）；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_t}[(s_{\\theta^\\star}-s_t)\\cdot s_\\theta]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 成立（即得分匹配的一阶条件）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span>(ii)：由命题 9.15.8，最小值点即投影点。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：投影的刻画是残差与子空间正交，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_t-s_{\\theta^\\star},s_\\theta\\rangle_{L^2(p_t)}=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，取负号即 (iii)。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：由命题 9.15.2 的展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta;t)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta^\\star;t)=\\|s_\\theta-s_{\\theta^\\star}\\|^2\\ge0$</span>，其中交叉项由 (iii) 消去。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题闭合了本节与得分匹配章的接口：得分匹配章的一阶条件 (iii) 正是本章得分场在 Fisher 度量下的正交性条件，二者是同一数学事实的两种表述。本章第 16 节“score = 密度的梯度”推导链在此处向下游延伸为“得分匹配 = 得分场在 Fisher 度量下的投影”，接口无断裂。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-接口十一-具体例子-一维高斯下的全部接口数值验证\">接口十一：具体例子——一维高斯下的全部接口数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-接口十一-具体例子-一维高斯下的全部接口数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把上述抽象接口落到可手算的例子，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(x)=-(x-\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t=1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（本章第 3 节一维情形）。取参数化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=a(x-\\mu_t)+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(a,b)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 9.15.12</strong> 计算得分匹配最优参数与投影能量占比。</p>\n<p>由命题 9.15.8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{x-\\mu_t,1\\}$</span> 上的投影为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 本身（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 属于该二维子空间），故最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=-1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b^\\star=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta^\\star;t)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Pi s_t\\|^2=I_t$</span>。若限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=0$</span> 只优化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(a;t)=\\mathbb E[(a(X-\\mu_t)+ (X-\\mu_t)/\\sigma_t^2)^2]=\\sigma_t^2(a+1/\\sigma_t^2)^2$</span>，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=-1/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；若进一步限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(0;t)=I_t$</span>，与推论 9.15.3 一致。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=-2$</span>，直接代入验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(-2;t)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{SM}}(0;t)=2$</span>。</p>\n<p>该例验证了命题 9.15.8 的投影公式、推论 9.15.3 的常值最优、以及命题 9.15.11 的一阶条件：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^\\star=-2$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(s_{\\theta^\\star}-s_t)\\cdot s_\\theta]=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=x-\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=1$</span> 均成立。例子同时说明接口的一个边界：当参数化族恰好包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t$</span> 时，投影能量占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，得分匹配损失为零；当参数化族被命题 9.15.6 限制为有界（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a|\\le1$</span>）时，投影能量占比严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，损失严格大于零，这正是低密度区奇异性对得分匹配章施加的硬约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df09--h-本章推导链-score-密度的梯度\">本章推导链：score = 密度的梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-本章推导链-score-密度的梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率对象。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B,\\lambda)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 为 Lebesgue 测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p:\\mathbb R^d\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 为概率密度，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 0$</span> 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=1$</span>。记密度正集\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal D_p=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^d: p(x)&gt;0\\},$$</div>\n并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 为开集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\mathcal D_p)$</span> 可为零（允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在零测集上取零）。Score 场定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal D_p,$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上不定义或按约定取任意可测延拓（本节所有积分均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上取，零测集上的取值不影响结论）。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设分三级列出，每条命题只引用它实际需要的级别。</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 可微性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1(\\mathcal D_p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 可积性.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\|s(x)\\|^2p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|\\,\\lambda(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 边界通量消失.</strong> 存在一列紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\mathcal D_p$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 紧、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\subset K_{n+1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigcup_n K_n=\\mathcal D_p$</span>），使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 具 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n$</span>，外法向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu_n$</span> 存在，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n}p(x)\\,\\langle s(x),\\nu_n(x)\\rangle\\,d\\sigma_n(x)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial K_n$</span> 上的曲面测度。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 具紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^1$</span> 时，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 逼近支撑集即自动满足 (H3)；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在无穷远处以足够快的速度衰减（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le C\\|x\\|^{-(d+\\varepsilon)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p\\|$</span> 同阶衰减）时，(H3) 亦成立。</p>\n<p>以下命题中，凡涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p$</span> 的陈述默认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-1-score-即密度的梯度之比\">命题 16.1（score 即密度的梯度之比）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-1-score-即密度的梯度之比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal D_p$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\frac{\\nabla p(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上可微，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与每个坐标方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span>），链式法则给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_i\\log p(x)=\\frac{\\partial_i p(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 的等式写成向量形式即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla p(x)/p(x)$</span>。这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，故分母合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别.</strong> 命题 16.1 说的是：score 不是“密度的梯度”本身，而是“密度的梯度除以密度”，即对数密度的梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 相差一个逐点标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(x)$</span>；这一因子正是低密度区 score 爆炸的代数根源（见第 10 节的反例）。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上的向量场，其定义不依赖任何参数化；参数化只在第 8 节与第 9 节中出现，本节不涉及。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-2-得分恒等式-零均值\">命题 16.2（得分恒等式：零均值）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-2-得分恒等式-零均值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|\\,\\lambda(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 的每个分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上 Lebesgue 可积。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\frac{\\partial_i p(x)}{p(x)}\\,p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\partial_i p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的比值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处不定义，但该集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>-零测，积分不受影响；这里用到“零测集上被积函数的任意取值不改变积分”这一 Lebesgue 积分的基本性质，无需交换极限。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s_i(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\partial_i p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx).$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p=\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且 (H3) 成立，则由散度定理（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span>）与 (H3) 的极限，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\partial_i p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{K_n}\\partial_i p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n}p(x)\\,\\nu_{n,i}(x)\\,d\\sigma_n(x)=0.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p\\neq\\mathbb R^d$</span>，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 的边界上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 为开集且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在补集上为零），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\mathcal D_p$</span> 应用散度定理时边界项含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{\\partial K_n}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span> 充分接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 边界时该因子趋于零，仍由 (H3) 得零。逐分量成立即得向量等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 16.2 的证明中，关键步骤是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\,s=\\nabla p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上几乎处处成立”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 可积”，前者由命题 16.1 给出，后者由 (H2) 给出。若仅有 (H1) 而无 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]$</span> 可能不存在（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为柯西密度时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-2x/(1+x^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[|s(X)|]=\\infty$</span>），此时命题 16.2 的陈述无意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-3-Fisher-信息恒等式\">命题 16.3（Fisher 信息恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-3-Fisher-信息恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]$</span>（本章第 3 节定义的 Fisher 信息），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\nabla\\log p(X)\\|^2]=I(X),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (H2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)&lt;\\infty$</span>。由命题 16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x)\\|^2=\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|^2/p(x)^2$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|^2}{p(x)^2}\\,p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x)\\|^2}{p(x)}\\,\\lambda(dx).$$</div>\n右端即本章第 3 节所定义的 Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span> 的积分表达式。这里没有交换极限：等式是逐点恒等式在可积函数上的直接积分，且由 (H2) 保证积分有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.4（散度恒等式）.</strong> 在 (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i(\\partial_i p(x)/p(x))$</span>。逐项计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_i\\left(\\frac{\\partial_i p}{p}\\right)=\\frac{\\partial_i^2 p}{p}-\\frac{(\\partial_i p)^2}{p^2},$$</div>\n故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=\\frac{\\Delta p(x)}{p(x)}-\\|s(x)\\|^2.$$</div>\n两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\Delta p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx)-\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\|s(x)\\|^2p(x)\\,\\lambda(dx).$$</div>\n第一项由 (H2)（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 可积）与 (H3)（边界通量消失）经散度定理两次应用得零：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{K_n}\\Delta p=\\int_{\\partial K_n}\\langle\\nabla p,\\nu_n\\rangle\\,d\\sigma_n$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla p,\\nu_n\\rangle=p\\langle s,\\nu_n\\rangle$</span>，由 (H3) 极限为零。第二项由命题 16.3 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>。但这里出现了一个表面上的矛盾：若第一项为零、第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X)\\neq 0$</span>。问题出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p$</span> 的可积性并未被 (H2) 保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p$</span> 可能不可积，此时“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\Delta p=0$</span>”不成立，散度定理的极限步骤需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p\\in L^1$</span>。因此推论 16.4 的正确假设应加强为</p>\n<p><strong>(H2')</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p\\in L^1(\\mathcal D_p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}|\\Delta p(x)|\\,\\lambda(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>在 (H1)、(H2')、(H3) 下，上述计算合法，且由散度定理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\Delta p=0$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0-I(X)=-I(X).$$</div>\n这与本章 canonical claim 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>（在边界项消失时）”的形式不一致。核对 canonical claim 的原始表述：该恒等式在文献中通常写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>，其成立的前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 被视为<strong>参数化得分场</strong>并对<strong>参数</strong>求散度，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的期望因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=\\nabla p\\cdot s+p\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(p s)=\\Delta p$</span> 的符号约定不同而相消。本节严格按本章第 5 节已建立的积分恒等式书写：该节给出的恒等式是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2],$$</div>\n其证明正是上面的计算，且该式与命题 16.3 自洽。因此本节不重复第 5 节的推导，只把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>”作为<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|^2$</span> 的符号约定下</strong>的简写形式指出其适用边界：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 取本章定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>；canonical claim 中的零式对应的是将散度作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p s$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot(p s)/p]=\\mathbb E_p[\\Delta p/p]$</span> 在适当加权下为零）的等价写法。本节以命题 16.3 与上述计算为准，不另立符号。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-5-一维具体例子\">命题 16.5（一维具体例子）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-5-一维具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\exp(-x^2/2)$</span>（标准正态密度）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac{x^2}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dx}\\log p(x)=-x$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=\\int_{\\mathbb R}(-x)\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-x^2/2}\\,dx=0$$</div>\n（被积函数为奇函数且绝对可积）。又\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)^2]=\\int_{\\mathbb R}x^2\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-x^2/2}\\,dx=1,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=1$</span>。最后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s'(x)=-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s'(X)]=-1=-I(X)$</span>，与上一段计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>检验.</strong> 本例中 (H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3) 全部成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[x^2]=1&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p=p''=(x^2-1)p$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|p''|&lt;\\infty$</span>，且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n=[-n,n]$</span> 时边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\pm n)s(\\pm n)(\\pm 1)=\\mp n p(n)\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-推导链的闭合\">推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节把“score = 密度的梯度”这一标题承诺拆成四步可验证的等式，构成一条闭合链：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>代数步</strong>（命题 16.1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla p/p$</span>，这是逐点恒等式，只需 (H1)。</li>\n<li><strong>零均值步</strong>（命题 16.2）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s]=0$</span>，需要 (H1)、(H2) 与 (H3) 的边界通量消失；其本质是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p=0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>二阶矩步</strong>（命题 16.3）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=I(X)$</span>，需要 (H2) 保证有限；这是 Fisher 信息的积分表示。</li>\n<li><strong>散度步</strong>（推论 16.4 及其修正）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span>，需要 (H2') 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p$</span> 可积；符号约定下与 canonical claim 的零式相容。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每一步的假设都被显式列出，且在第 10 节的反例中将被逐一检验其必要性：去掉 (H2) 会使命题 16.2 的期望不存在；去掉 (H3) 会使边界项非零；去掉 (H2') 会使散度步的散度定理失效。本节不展开这些反例，只指出接口。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Score 的代数定义是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\nabla p(x)/p(x)$</span>，它是逐点恒等式，仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在正集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>；与“密度的梯度”相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p$</span>，该因子是低密度区爆炸的根源。</li>\n<li>在可积性与边界通量消失假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=I(X)$</span> 成立，前者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla p=0$</span> 经散度定理与 (H3) 得到，后者是 Fisher 信息的积分表示。</li>\n<li>散度恒等式在本章符号约定下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-I(X)$</span>，其合法推导需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p\\in L^1$</span>；canonical claim 中的零式对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ps$</span> 的散度写法，两者在符号约定下相容，本节以命题 16.3 与显式计算为准。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-6-散度恒等式的无坐标表述与符号约定\">命题 16.6（散度恒等式的无坐标表述与符号约定）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-6-散度恒等式的无坐标表述与符号约定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2')、(H3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 为本章定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_p=p\\,\\lambda$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布测度。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathcal D_p\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi p\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(\\phi p)\\in L^1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot\\phi(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s(X),\\phi(X)\\rangle]+\\frac{1}{\\mu_p(\\mathcal D_p)}\\int_{\\partial\\mathcal D_p}\\langle\\phi,\\nu\\rangle p\\,d\\sigma,$$</div>\n在 (H3) 下边界项为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot\\phi(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s(X),\\phi(X)\\rangle]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=s$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-I(X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由乘积法则，逐点有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\cdot(\\phi p)=p\\,\\nabla\\cdot\\phi+\\langle\\nabla p,\\phi\\rangle=p\\,\\nabla\\cdot\\phi+p\\,\\langle s,\\phi\\rangle,$$</div>\n最后一步用命题 16.1。两边在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 积分，左端由假设可积。对左端应用散度定理于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n\\uparrow\\mathcal D_p$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}\\nabla\\cdot(\\phi p)\\,\\lambda(dx)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_{\\partial K_n}\\langle\\phi,\\nu_n\\rangle p\\,d\\sigma_n.$$</div>\n由 (H3) 的推广形式（将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\partial K_n}\\langle\\phi,\\nu_n\\rangle p\\,d\\sigma_n\\to 0$</span>，这在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 有界且 (H3) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\langle\\phi,\\nu_n\\rangle|\\le\\|\\phi\\|_\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\langle s,\\nu_n\\rangle$</span> 的控制得到）知右端为零。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}p\\,\\nabla\\cdot\\phi\\,\\lambda(dx)+\\int_{\\mathcal D_p}p\\,\\langle s,\\phi\\rangle\\,\\lambda(dx),$$</div>\n移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot\\phi]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s,\\phi\\rangle]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=s$</span>，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-I(X)$</span>，由命题 16.3 有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与 canonical claim 的接口.</strong> 本章 canonical claim 写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=0$</span>。命题 16.6 表明：若把散度算子作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p s$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=p\\nabla\\cdot s+p\\langle s,s\\rangle$</span>，在 (H3) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-I(X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\nabla\\cdot(ps)=0$</span> 是同一恒等式的两种写法，相差的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 项。canonical claim 的零式在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ps$</span>”的约定下成立；在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>”的约定下则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span>。本节两种写法都写出，避免符号歧义，且不改变命题 16.3 的结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-7-链式法则下的-score-变换\">命题 16.7（链式法则下的 score 变换）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-7-链式法则下的-score-变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal D_p\\to\\mathcal D_q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_q=T(\\mathcal D_p)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=T(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_T(x)=\\partial T(x)/\\partial x\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为 Jacobi 矩阵。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=T(x)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}s_p(x)-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det J_T(x)|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(J_T\\big)^{-\\top}$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_T^{-1}$</span> 的转置，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y$</span> 表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求梯度（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=T^{-1}(y)$</span> 处取值）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由变量替换公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)=p(x)/|\\det J_T(x)|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=T^{-1}(y)$</span>。取对数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(y)=\\log p(x)-\\log|\\det J_T(x)|.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=\\log|\\det J_T(x)|$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求梯度，两项都用链式法则。第一项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_y\\log p(T^{-1}(y))=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}s_p(x).$$</div>\n第二项：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y g(T^{-1}(y))=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}\\nabla_x g(x)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det J_T(x)|=-\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}\\nabla_x g(x).$$</div>\n合并即得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}\\big(s_p(x)-\\nabla_x\\log|\\det J_T(x)|\\big)\n=\\big(J_T(x)\\big)^{-\\top}s_p(x)-\\nabla_y\\log|\\det J_T(x)|.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span>\n<strong>推论 16.8（仿射变换的特例）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=Ax+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 可逆。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_T=A$</span> 为常矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det J_T|=0$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_q(y)=A^{-\\top}s_p\\big(A^{-1}(y-b)\\big).$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=\\sigma x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&gt;0$</span> 标量），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2 I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=y/\\sigma^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-\\top}s_p(A^{-1}y)=\\sigma^{-1}\\cdot(-\\sigma^{-1}y)=-y/\\sigma^2$</span>。符号为负，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=\\nabla_y\\log q(y)=-y/\\sigma^2$</span> 一致。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p(x)=-x$</span> 由命题 16.5 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 仿射情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_T=A$</span> 为常矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det J_T$</span> 为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log|\\det J_T|=0$</span>。代入命题 16.7 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=A^{-\\top}s_p(A^{-1}(y-b))$</span>。标量情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\sigma I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-\\top}=\\sigma^{-1}I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p(A^{-1}y)=-A^{-1}y=-y/\\sigma$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=\\sigma^{-1}\\cdot(-y/\\sigma)=-y/\\sigma^2$</span>。另一方面直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)=(2\\pi\\sigma^2)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|y\\|^2/(2\\sigma^2))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_y\\log q(y)=-y/\\sigma^2$</span>，两者相符。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-9-score-的积分恒等式-与-Fisher-信息的关系\">命题 16.9（score 的积分恒等式：与 Fisher 信息的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-9-score-的积分恒等式-与-Fisher-信息的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal D_p\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f p\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f\\cdot p\\in L^1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot(fp)\\in L^1$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s(X),\\nabla f(X)\\rangle]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot(\\nabla f)(X)]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\Delta f(X)],$$</div>\n在边界项消失时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 在命题 16.6 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\nabla f$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s,\\phi\\rangle=\\langle s,\\nabla f\\rangle$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot\\phi=\\Delta f$</span>。命题 16.6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\Delta f]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s,\\nabla f\\rangle]$</span>，移项即得。边界项由 (H3) 的推广（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\nabla f$</span> 有界或增长受控）消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.10（分部积分形式）.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f=\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>，命题 16.9 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)],$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span>，与命题 16.6 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=s$</span> 的结论一致。这构成命题 16.3 与命题 16.6 的相互印证：Fisher 信息既可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span>，也可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>，两者在 (H1)、(H2')、(H3) 下相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f=\\nabla\\log p=s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f=\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>。代入命题 16.9 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>。左端由命题 16.3 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-11-高维具体例子-各向同性高斯\">命题 16.11（高维具体例子：各向同性高斯）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-11-高维具体例子-各向同性高斯\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(2\\pi)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[s(X)]=0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac{\\|x\\|^2}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p(x)=-x$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=-x$</span>。零均值：每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[-X_i]=0$</span> 由对称性。二阶矩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|X\\|^2]=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\mathbb E_p[X_i^2]=d$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=d$</span>。散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot s(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^d\\partial_i(-x_i)=-d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s(X)]=-d=-I(X)$</span>，与命题 16.6 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>检验.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3) 均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|X\\|^2]=d&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta p=(\\|x\\|^2-d)p$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|\\Delta p|&lt;\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|X\\|^2]=d$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2p=d$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_n=\\{\\|x\\|\\le n\\}$</span> 时边界通量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\|x\\|=n}p\\langle s,\\nu\\rangle\\,d\\sigma=-n\\int_{\\|x\\|=n}p\\,d\\sigma\\to 0$</span>（高斯尾部指数衰减）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-12-score-的梯度与-Hessian-的关系\">命题 16.12（score 的梯度与 Hessian 的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-12-score-的梯度与-Hessian-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1) 加强为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal D_p)$</span>，且 (H2') 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_p(x)=\\nabla_x^2\\log p(x)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为对数密度的 Hessian。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x s(x)=H_p(x),\\qquad \\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{tr}H_p(X)].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla\\log p$</span>，逐坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j s_i=\\partial_j\\partial_i\\log p=H_{p,ij}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s=H_p$</span>。取迹：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}H_p=\\nabla\\cdot s$</span>。由推论 16.10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{tr}H_p]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 16.12 把 Fisher 信息写成对数密度 Hessian 的迹的负期望，这是本章第 3 节 Fisher 信息的等价表述之一。它同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_p$</span>，故 score 场的局部行为由对数密度的二阶结构决定；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_p$</span> 负定的区域（对数密度凹），score 场是耗散的，这与第 11 节速度场的稳定性分析接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-推导链的闭合-补足\">推导链的闭合（补足）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-推导链的闭合-补足\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面四步构成主链，命题 16.6–16.12 补足了三个方向：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>无坐标表述</strong>（命题 16.6）：把散度恒等式写成对任意测试向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的分部积分形式，从而把 canonical claim 的零式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span> 式统一为同一恒等式的两种写法，消除符号歧义。</li>\n<li><strong>变换协变性</strong>（命题 16.7、推论 16.8）：score 在微分同胚下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_T^{-\\top}$</span> 协变并附加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J_T|$</span> 的梯度项；仿射特例给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_q(y)=A^{-\\top}s_p(A^{-1}(y-b))$</span>，并用一维标量情形验证符号。</li>\n<li><strong>二阶结构</strong>（命题 16.9–16.12）：score 与 Fisher 信息通过分部积分互相表达，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s=H_p$</span> 把 score 的局部几何与对数密度的 Hessian 联系起来，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\operatorname{tr}H_p]$</span> 给出 Fisher 信息的第三种写法。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>至此，“score = 密度的梯度”这条链在代数、期望、散度、变换、二阶五个层面闭合，每一步的假设（(H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3)）都被显式引用，且在第 10 节的反例中将逐一检验其必要性。本节不展开反例，只指出接口：去掉 (H2) 使命题 16.2 的期望不存在；去掉 (H3) 使边界项非零、命题 16.6 的分部积分失效；去掉 (H2') 使散度定理的极限步骤不合法、命题 16.9 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta f$</span> 不可积；去掉 (H1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性使命题 16.1 的链式法则不成立。这些边界情形均归第 10 节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-13-score-场的旋度恒等式\">命题 16.13（score 场的旋度恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-13-score-场的旋度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1) 加强为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in C^2(\\mathcal D_p)$</span>，且 (H2') 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s(x)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j s_i$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal D_p$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_j s_i(x)-\\partial_i s_j(x)=0,\\qquad i,j=1,\\dots,d,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s(x)$</span> 对称，等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\times s(x)=0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=3$</span> 时旋度为零；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 下为反对称部分为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 16.12，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j s_i=\\partial_j\\partial_i\\log p$</span>。由 (H1) 加强的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 性，混合偏导可交换（Clairaut–Schwarz 定理），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j\\partial_i\\log p=\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_j s_i=\\partial_i s_j$</span>。逐对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 成立即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s$</span> 对称。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别.</strong> 命题 16.13 说明 score 场是<strong>梯度场</strong>而非一般向量场：它的 Jacobi 矩阵对称，因而是某个标量势（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span>）的 Hessian。这一性质在生成动力学中有直接后果：score 场不能有非零的环流分量，故以 score 为漂移的反向 SDE 的确定性部分（概率流 ODE 的速度场）在无扩散极限下沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的梯度流演化。若把 score 与一个任意的、旋度非零的速度场混为一谈，就会违反命题 16.13；这正是禁止事项 4 所强调的“不得把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈”的数学根据之一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-14-score-场的积分表示-与势函数的关系\">命题 16.14（score 场的积分表示：与势函数的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-14-score-场的积分表示-与势函数的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 道路连通。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 固定参考点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal D_p$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal D_p$</span> 与任意连接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:[0,1]\\to\\mathcal D_p$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p(x)-\\log p(x_0)=\\int_0^1\\langle s(\\gamma(t)),\\dot\\gamma(t)\\rangle\\,dt.$$</div>\n右端与路径选取无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\log p(\\gamma(t))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log p(\\gamma(t))=\\langle\\nabla\\log p(\\gamma(t)),\\dot\\gamma(t)\\rangle=\\langle s(\\gamma(t)),\\dot\\gamma(t)\\rangle.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 积分，由微积分基本定理得左端。路径无关性由命题 16.13：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s$</span> 对称保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的线积分在单连通区域上路径无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 道路连通但未必单连通，此时路径无关性需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 单连通，或等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的旋度为零且区域无“洞”。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span> 单连通时，命题 16.13 给出闭路积分为零，故路径无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.15（score 决定密度至多差一个常数）.</strong> 在命题 16.14 的假设下，若两个密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p\\cap\\mathcal D_q$</span> 上有相同的 score 场，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 在该交集上为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p=s_q$</span> 于交集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in U$</span>，取连接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma\\subset U$</span>，由命题 16.14 分别对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)-\\log p(x_0)=\\log q(x)-\\log q(x_0)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)(x)=\\log(p/q)(x_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 推论 16.15 是 score 作为“密度梯度场”的完备性陈述：score 场在相差一个归一化常数的意义下唯一确定密度。这与本章第 15 节“与得分匹配章的接口”直接相关——得分匹配的目标是估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，而由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 只差一个常数，该常数由归一化条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p=1$</span> 确定。本节不展开得分匹配的估计理论，只指出这条代数链的终点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-16-score-场在零密度边界附近的下界\">命题 16.16（score 场在零密度边界附近的下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-16-score-场在零密度边界附近的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_p$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast\\in\\partial\\mathcal D_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n\\in\\mathcal D_p$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n\\to x^\\ast$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_n)\\to 0^+$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p(x^\\ast)\\neq 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界处以非零梯度趋于零），则沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s(x_n)\\|=\\frac{\\|\\nabla p(x_n)\\|}{p(x_n)}\\to+\\infty.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s(x_n)\\|=\\|\\nabla p(x_n)\\|/p(x_n)$</span>。由 (H1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p(x_n)\\to\\nabla p(x^\\ast)\\neq 0$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla p(x_n)\\|\\to\\|\\nabla p(x^\\ast)\\|&gt;0$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_n)\\to 0^+$</span>。正数除以趋于零的正数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与第 10 节的接口.</strong> 命题 16.16 是第 10 节反例的代数骨架：它说明 score 在低密度区的爆炸不是数值伪影，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p/p$</span> 的解析后果。爆炸的速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p$</span> 在边界处的非零性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to 0$</span> 的速度共同决定；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla p(x^\\ast)=0$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在边界处以二次方式趋于零），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s\\|$</span> 可能保持有界，这给出第 8 节参数化策略中“在低密度区对 score 做重参数化或截断”的动机。本节只给出下界陈述，完整的反例构造归第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-17-score-场与-Fisher-信息的变分刻画\">命题 16.17（score 场与 Fisher 信息的变分刻画）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-17-score-场与-Fisher-信息的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F=\\{f:\\mathcal D_p\\to\\mathbb R^d: f\\in C^1,\\ \\mathbb E_p[\\|f(X)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty,\\ \\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot f(X)]\\text{ 存在}\\}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal F$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)-f(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]+\\mathbb E_p[\\|f(X)\\|^2]-2\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s(X),f(X)\\rangle],$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=s$</span> 是泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-f\\|^2]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 上的唯一极小点（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-几乎处处相等的意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 展开平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|s-f\\|^2=\\|s\\|^2+\\|f\\|^2-2\\langle s,f\\rangle,$$</div>\n逐点成立，取期望得第一式（三项均可积由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 的定义与 (H2) 保证）。极小性：由命题 16.9 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=f$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s,f\\rangle]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot f]$</span>，代入第一式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-f\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]+\\mathbb E_p[\\|f\\|^2]+2\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot f].$$</div>\n右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的依赖为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|f\\|^2]+2\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot f]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=s$</span>，由命题 16.6 该量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)-2I(X)=-I(X)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-s\\|^2]=0$</span>，达到下界零。唯一性：若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-f\\|^2]=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=f$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-几乎处处，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下几乎处处相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 16.17 把 score 刻画为 Fisher 信息泛函的极小点，这是本章第 3 节 Fisher 信息与第 9 节估计误差之间的桥梁：任何估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s$</span> 的误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|\\hat s-s\\|^2]$</span> 以零为下界，且下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 本身达到。本节不展开估计误差的收敛速率，只指出该变分刻画与命题 16.3 的相容性：极小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s-s\\|^2]=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]$</span> 是同一泛函在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=s$</span> 两点的取值之差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-18-score-场在乘积密度下的可加性\">命题 16.18（score 场在乘积密度下的可加性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-18-score-场在乘积密度下的可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=d_1+d_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=(x_1,x_2)\\in\\mathbb R^{d_1}\\times\\mathbb R^{d_2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=p_1(x_1)p_2(x_2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 分别满足 (H1)、(H2)、(H3) 于各自空间。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_1(x_1)=\\nabla_{x_1}\\log p_1(x_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_2(x_2)=\\nabla_{x_2}\\log p_2(x_2)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s(x)=\\big(s_1(x_1),\\,s_2(x_2)\\big)\\in\\mathbb R^{d_1}\\times\\mathbb R^{d_2},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X)=I(X_1)+I(X_2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\sim p_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2\\sim p_2$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=\\log p_1(x_1)+\\log p_2(x_2)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度，前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_1$</span> 个分量只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span>、后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2$</span> 个分量只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(x)=(s_1(x_1),s_2(x_2))$</span>。二阶矩：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s(X)\\|^2]=\\mathbb E_{p_1}[\\|s_1(X_1)\\|^2]+\\mathbb E_{p_2}[\\|s_2(X_2)\\|^2]=I(X_1)+I(X_2),$$</div>\n交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\langle s_1(X_1),s_2(X_2)\\rangle]=\\langle\\mathbb E_{p_1}[s_1],\\mathbb E_{p_2}[s_2]\\rangle=0$</span> 由命题 16.2 分别作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 16.18 说明 score 场在独立乘积下按坐标块可加，Fisher 信息亦按块可加。这与第 12 节能量模型的分解接口：若能量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E(x)=E_1(x_1)+E_2(x_2)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\propto e^{-E}$</span> 为乘积密度，score 为各块 score 的直和。该可加性是高维 score 参数化中“分块建模”的代数依据，本节只给出恒等式，不展开参数化设计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-命题-16-19-score-场沿概率流-ODE-的演化\">命题 16.19（score 场沿概率流 ODE 的演化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-命题-16-19-score-场沿概率流-ODE-的演化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设.</strong> (H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为概率流 ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot x_t=v_t(x_t),\\qquad v_t(x)=-\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-s_t(x)$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span> 上的解所诱导的密度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=p$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同级的正则性假设。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述.</strong> 沿该 ODE 的轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_t(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log p_t(x_t)=\\partial_t\\log p_t(x_t)-\\|s_t(x_t)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log p_t(x_t)=\\partial_t\\log p_t(x_t)+\\langle\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x_t),\\dot x_t\\rangle.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x_t=v_t(x_t)=-s_t(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t=s_t$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log p_t(x_t)=\\partial_t\\log p_t(x_t)-\\langle s_t(x_t),s_t(x_t)\\rangle=\\partial_t\\log p_t(x_t)-\\|s_t(x_t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 命题 16.19 是 score 场与第 11 节速度场之间的精确接口：概率流 ODE 的速度场恰为负 score，故沿轨迹的对数密度变化率含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\|s_t\\|^2$</span> 项，该项非正，说明 score 场在概率流 ODE 中起耗散作用。这与命题 16.12 的注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_p$</span> 负定时 score 场耗散）一致，但此处是沿轨迹的全局陈述而非逐点 Hessian 陈述。本节只给出该恒等式，不展开概率流 ODE 的存在唯一性（归第 11 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df09--h-推导链的最终闭合\">推导链的最终闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df09--h-推导链的最终闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节共给出 19 条命题与推论，覆盖五个层面并补足三条辅助链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代数层</strong>（16.1、16.5、16.11）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\nabla p/p$</span> 的逐点恒等式与两个具体例子。</li>\n<li><strong>期望层</strong>（16.2、16.3、16.4）：零均值与 Fisher 信息的积分表示。</li>\n<li><strong>散度层</strong>（16.6、16.9、16.10）：分部积分形式、canonical claim 零式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I(X)$</span> 式的统一、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\|s\\|^2]=-\\mathbb E_p[\\nabla\\cdot s]$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>变换层</strong>（16.7、16.8）：微分同胚下的协变性与仿射特例的符号验证。</li>\n<li><strong>二阶层</strong>（16.12、16.13、16.14、16.15、16.17）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla s=H_p$</span>、旋度为零、线积分表示、score 决定密度至多差常数、Fisher 信息的变分刻画。</li>\n<li><strong>辅助层</strong>（16.16、16.18、16.19）：低密度区爆炸的下界、乘积密度的可加性、概率流 ODE 沿轨迹的对数密度演化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每一层的关键等式都逐步写出，假设 (H1)、(H2)、(H2')、(H3) 被逐条引用；凡涉及交换积分与极限之处，均指明所用定理（散度定理、微积分基本定理、Clairaut–Schwarz、控制收敛的隐含使用）并验证其条件。本节不展开反例（归第 10 节）、不展开参数化设计（归第 8 节）、不展开估计误差的收敛速率（归第 9 节）、不展开概率流 ODE 的存在唯一性（归第 11 节），只把“score = 密度的梯度”这条链在代数、期望、散度、变换、二阶五个层面闭合，并给出与相邻各节的精确接口。</p>", "cjk": 59814, "missing": []};
